window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4401,"title":"Chapter 4401 Courting Death","paragraphs":["The two great elites fought from east to west, from left to right, and the remaining power rolled out, killing anyone it touched.","How were they supposed to pass?","But in truth, there was not a single Golden Generation here. In fact, there was not even a Silver Generation here, nor any ordinary Imperial Son here. What did this mean?","The prodigies had all thought of a way to pass.","Thus, they would definitely be able to pass. It was just that no one had found the key point.","At this time, everyone could not help but sigh ruefully. Because there had been people who had walked the Imperial Path through the various generations of the various great Imperial Clans. Thus, they had practically complete records of the Imperial Pat. If they advanced through referring to these records, what need was there for them to worry? How could it not save them effort?","In the first place, they were naturally talented, strong, and had a strong background. Now that they had grasped so much information, the starting point was practically everyone's finishing line. How could others compare?","Everyone was racking their brains, studying how to grasp the key point.","However, there were only more and more people, yet not a single person passed through.","It was as if this was a dividing line. A true prodigy could pass through with practically no effort, but the others were all mediocre, and could not do anything about it at all.","\"I have an idea!\" Suddenly, a young man stepped out. He was dressed in a light green tight fitting suit, filled with heroic spirit.","\"What idea?\" This caused a great many people to feel excited.","It was rare for someone to think of a way to pass through, and he was actually willing to share it with others. This was really a very kind person.","\"Come, everyone, come here,\" the man in the green tight-fitting outfit called out to everyone, gathering everyone in the vicinity.","Actually, Ling Han could already tell that there was something off, but he also wanted to hear what kind of grand idea this person would have, so he followed them over.","All of a sudden, everyone was gathered around the man in green tight-fitting clothes. There was really no way to see him through the crowds.","None of them dared to breathe too loudly, fearing that their words would drown out this person's voice, causing them to miss out on the key words. They were also afraid that they would accidentally say the wrong thing, and anger the other party, and cause him to be unwilling to reveal the \"idea\".","The man in green pressed his hands down, and said, \"Everyone, please sit down first, and cross your legs.\"","Everyone did as they were told, but it was inevitable that there would be doubts in their hearts. I am only listening to your suggestion; is there any need to do this?","\"All right, now everyone calm down,\" the young man continued.","\"Have you felt your heart become ethereal?\"","\"M-hm, everyone, focus your attention on observing.\"","One second, three seconds, ten seconds.","Someone rioted, and stood up in anger, \"This is the method that you speak of?\"","\"That's right!\" The man in green nodded, his face filled with pride, \"As the saying goes, one person is less intelligent, and the more people there are, the greater the intelligence. Now that everyone is sitting together, whatever discoveries you have can be shared. We will definitely be able to resolve this dilemma in front of us!\"","\"How about it? Is this method good?\"","When they heard his words, those who had initially been restraining their tempers could no longer bear it. F***, are you playing around with us?","How could there be such a despicable person?","All of a sudden, everyone stood up, rolling up their sleeves, their eyes shining with viciousness.","Ling Han couldn't help but laugh in spite of himself. How could this guy be so suicidal?","\"Hit him!\" Someone shouted, and then everyone rushed forwards, beginning to punch and kick him.","There were too many people, and the space was too small, so it was inevitable that there would be accidental injuries in this battle. Instantly, the situation became chaotic. They were no longer targeting the man in green, but rather attacking randomly, causing a chaotic battle.","\"Phew, that was really close. Thankfully, I managed to escape quickly. Otherwise,I would be in deep trouble.\" The man in green had squeezed out of the crowd at some point in time, and appeared beside Ling Han, as he said this, patting his chest.","Ling Han was astonished. This person was quite slippery, being able to escape even after being surrounded by so many people.","\"Brother, I see a black light on your face. I'm afraid it's a sign of great misfortune.\" This green-clad man stared at Ling Han for a while, and began to seek death again.","Ling Han smiled calmly, \"Expert, how should I address you?\"","The man immediately revealed a proud expression, and gave Ling Han a thumbs up, \"Amongst so many people, you have the best eyesight, and know that I am an elite! Cough, cough, my surname is Jing, and my name is Haoran.\"","\"It's fun to tease people, right?\" Ling Han asked calmly.","\"Brother, your words are wrong. How could I possibly be that kind of person?\" Jing Haoran's expression was filled with grievance, \"I am a warm-hearted person, and take joy in helping others. When others are happy, I am happy...\"","Blah, blah, blah. It was as if he had opened his voice box, and had absolutely no intention of stopping.","Ling Han smiled, and called out loudly, \"That guy is here!\"","With this shout, he used the Six Characters Bright King Curse.","Instantly, the chaotic battles stopped, and they all turned to look at Jing Haoran.","Jing Haoran couldn't help but grit his teeth. He smiled bitterly at Ling Han, and said, \"Brother, there is no animosity between us in the past, and there is no animosity between us in recent days. Why do you have to harm me like this?\"","\"When a passerby sees injustice, he draws his saber to help. Moreover, helping others is the foundation of happiness...\" Ling Han also began to speak non-stop.","Wasn't it just making up nonsense? It wasn't like he didn't know how to do it himself.","Jing Haoran was dumbfounded with shock. He was already skilled in blabbing nonsense, but he had not thought that this guy he had encountered was actually not the slightest bit inferior.","\"Fight!\"","Everyone roared loudly, and rushed over again, continuing to gang up on Jing Haoran.","This time, Jing Haoran did not stay where he was. Instead, he broke into a run and fled.","One ran, and the others chased. They ran from the east side of the plaza to the west side, and then charged back and forth, making for a very lively scene.","Ling Han saw very clearly that there was no fear on Jing Haoran's face. Instead, there was a smile on his face, and it was clear that he was enjoying himself.","This was a b*tch!","He thought to himself, appraisal complete.","Without wasting any more time, Ling Han focused his attention on the plaza. The two great beings were still fighting, as if they would never stop.","Was this a formation?","Ling Han analyzed. As a grandmaster of formations, he was naturally sensitive in this area.","After a long while, he nodded. This was indeed a formation, but it was impossible for future generations to lay out such a formation.","That was because this was a natural formation.","However, this wasn't the main point. There was no need to decipher this formation, because the main point was the footwork of the clay figure and fiery figure.","In Ling Han's eyes, everyone in the surroundings had disappeared. In fact, even the clay figure and fiery figure had disappeared, leaving behind only the aftermath of their battle that was sweeping over the plaza.","There was a safe path!","Ling Han immediately thought. However, this safe passage was constantly changing, requiring him to step on a special rhythm, and this rhythm was the footwork of the clay figure and the fiery figure.","It was definitely not a simple imitation, but rather one yin and one yang, one positive and one negative, which needed to be coordinated.","After a while, Ling Han stood up, and descended towards the plaza.","\"Yi, another person has stepped in.\"","\"Sigh, he's seeking death.\"","\"There will always be people who think that they are very lucky, and in the end? Only when they lose their lives would they know regret.\"","A great many people were playing the opposite tune, thinking that Ling Han was merely going to his death.","However, Ling Han clasped his hands behind his back, his feet light, yet it was as if he were taking a leisurely stroll. Very easily, he had already crossed half the distance.","Instantly, these people all gaped, feeling their faces flush hotly."]},{"number":4402,"title":"Chapter 4402 Wait","paragraphs":["Ling Han stepped on a special beat. Hu, hu, hu! It was clear that the fiery figure and clay figure were fighting right next to him, but the strong winds merely swept past on either side of him, and did not touch him in the slightest.","It was as if a special force had dispersed the force of the wind.","This was the power of formations.","\"Damn it!\" Wenren Liangping cursed as he arrived before Ling Han. He glared at Ling Han and stomped his foot in anger.","Because he had ingested that special toad, he still had a period of weakness. Previously, he had gone into hiding to survive this period of weakness. Once his condition had recovered to his peak, he would immediately rush over.","Who would have thought that he would still be a step too slow? He could only watch helplessly as Ling Han walked further and further away.","He wasn't stupid. There were so many people here, yet none of them dared to take one step into the plaza. It was clear that this was a minefield, and touching it would be extremely dangerous.","If he had arrived earlier, Ling Han definitely wouldn't have had the time to think about how to pass. It would be equivalent to being trapped here, and it would be very easy for him to kill him.","Damn it, he was just a little bit away.","He hurriedly composed himself, and began to observe and study how he could pass.","On the other side, it was unknown when Jing Haoran had run out of the crowd, but none of those people had reacted yet, and were still fighting a battle royale. It was unknown who had been taken as a scapegoat, and he was wailing in pain.","\"Interesting, he passed so quickly?\" he muttered. \"I can't play anymore, I have to hurry.\"","Ahead of them, Ling Han soon passed through the plaza. The narrow terrain once again became wide.","He stopped, turned around, and looked unerringly at Wenren Liangping.","Coincidentally, Wenren Liangping also looked at him sharply.","Ling Han smiled faintly, withdrew his gaze, and began to walk forwards.","When he advanced into the Ninth Change, he would come back to kill this guy.","There was no one in the vast plains. Ling Han ran to his heart's content, while using Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. His speed was incredibly fast.","Though he did not think that being the first person to pass through the Imperial Path would affect his ascension into Emperor Tier, since he was already here, he naturally had to compete.","Moreover, there were still opportunities here, so it must be that if one was fast, he would have them, but if he was slow, he would not.","His speed was extremely fast, and a pair of fiery red wings sprouted from his back. With a flap of his wings, he had left the journey of several hundred kilometers behind him.","It could not be helped. There were strange Regulations in effect here, which greatly decreased his speed.","However, even if he was slow, others would definitely not be fast either. This was fair.","Yi?","Ling Han suddenly stopped, because a masked person had appeared in front of him.","Masked people were very common. Usually, as long as they did not want others to know their identity, they would cover their faces. However, this masked person had a voluptuous figure. Where she should be round, she would be erect, and where she should be large, she was voluptuous. Ling Han recognized her with a single glance.","Wasn't this the crazy woman who had seen his naked body?","Feng Miaoling also swept her gaze over at the right time, revealing a cold smirk, \"As expected, you are behind me!\"","She had been chasing madly all this while, but as she chased, she became suspicious.","Was Ling Han really that fast?","She was only slightly slower than Ling Han, but when she had previously obtained the Immortality Leaf, her luck was off the charts. The moment she arrived, a leaf just happened to fall, so it could be said that she had not wasted any time.","But even so, she still did not find Ling Han at the plaza.","It should be known that she had also spent two hours to decipher the mystery of their movements.","No matter how awesome Ling Han was, there was no way he could surpass her by so much without any delay at all.","Thus, it finally dawned on her that Ling Han was most likely behind her.","Thus, she waited here for a very, very long time, but she had guessed correctly, so she waited until Ling Han arrived.","\"Crazy woman, you've seen me naked, and I still haven't asked you for compensation yet. Yet, you're still haunting me?\" Ling Han shouted.","Feng Miaoling almost threw up blood in her fury. You are really too shameless, aren't you?","\"Die!\" She couldn't be bothered to waste words, and immediately charged over.","Ling Han gritted his teeth, and hurriedly dodged.","This woman wasn't a weakling like Wenren Liangping. Not only was she at the Sect Master-level, but she was also a Golden Generation!","Too strong!","Boom, a great river surged behind her. The river waters were turbulent, and occasionally, a wave would surge over, its might shocking the heavens.","Ling Han didn't dare to face it head-on at all. He simply used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight to dodge. Flames surged, and this could be considered a counterattack.","Since Feng Miaoling was standing guard here, she had naturally made arrangements. She had set up restrictions in the surroundings, locking Ling Han within, restricting Ling Han's range of movement.","Ling Han responded calmly. He still had the Saint Tool in his possession, so it was not impossible for him to break out of this siege.","\"Yi, this big brother, I was right, wasn't I!\" Jing Haoran's voice suddenly rang out, \"I was just saying. Your face is dark, so there must be an ominous sign!\"","It was unknown when this guy had suddenly appeared nearby.","Ling Han couldn't help but grimace, feeling like he was about to go crazy.","'Should you be proud of yourself at this moment?'","Why hadn't you been beaten to death just now?","Ling Han ignored him, and Feng Miaoling naturally paid him no heed either. She just targeted Ling Han and attacked him madly.","\"Brother, did you peek at this beauty bathing, or did you run naked in front of her?\" Jing Haoran asked very suicidally.","When these words reached Feng Miaoling's ears, she naturally exploded in fury.","Weng, a figure walked out of her body. She too had a graceful figure, but her pretty face was completely blurred, and could not be seen clearly at all.","Spiritual body.","This spiritual body immediately charged towards Jing Haoran. With a single strike, the power of Sect Master surged, shaking the heavens and earth.","Ling Han also felt a headache coming on. Just how had this guy managed to live until now?","See, this was called courting death.","Ling Han also felt a headache coming on. Just how had this guy managed to live until now?","Logically speaking, with how toxic his mouth was, and how much he loved to seek death, he should have died a long time ago.","However, after Feng Miaoling split out a spiritual body, her own battle prowess decreased slightly, causing the pressure on Ling Han to decrease slightly.","—In the Spiritual Transformation Tier, every spiritual body would have the same battle prowess as the original, but could not be stacked. Thus, even if they were split apart, it would not affect the battle prowess of the spiritual body. But in the Sect Master Tier, it was different. The battle prowess of the spiritual body and the original could be stacked, and when they fused together, they would be the strongest, and once they separated, this would correspondingly weaken the battle prowess of the original.","However, Feng Miaoling was not just a little bit stronger than Ling Han. Thus, even if she lacked a spiritual body, and her battle prowess was slightly weaker, Ling Han was still under a mountain of pressure.","\"Hey, hey, hey. Beautiful lady, there is no animosity between you and me, so why did you hit me?\" Jing Haoran shouted loudly, \"I didn't peep on you bathing, so why do you have to do this?\"","With such a toxic mouth, there was no need to pity his death.","Feng Miaoling was naturally even more furious. The spiritual body's attacks were like a flood.","Don't say, with how much Jing Haoran liked to seek death, his abilities were really not weak. Otherwise, he would have long since died.","His movement technique was extremely agile. Although he was stumbling here and there, and looked extremely disheveled, he still managed to save his life under the battle prowess of a Sect Master.","Feng Miaoling was stunned.","What was going on here?","First, there was Ling Han, and then there was this person with a bad mouth. They were obviously both Spirit Transformation Tier, so how could their abilities be so freakish?"]},{"number":4403,"title":"Chapter 4403 Psychedelic Forest","paragraphs":["Ling Han was also very surprised. He only knew that Jing Haoran was very good at courting death, but he had not thought that the latter's strength would actually be so impressive as well.","However, no matter how freakish they were, there was no way they could match a Sect Master-level Golden Generation.","Ling Han took out his staff. After a large portion of his spiritual power had been extracted, he suddenly exploded with the might of a Pseudo Sect Master, and blasted towards an empty space.","If this attack had been directed at Feng Miaoling, it would have been too easy for her to deal with it. She only had to wave her hand lightly, and she would have been able to disperse this attack. After all, she was a Sect Master, so how difficult would it be to disperse an attack from a Pseudo Sect Master?","However, the restriction that she had set up was different. How could it possibly have too high a defense?","With a single strike, this restriction was immediately shattered.","Ling Han let out a battle cry, and instantly broke through the siege.","He activated his Phoenix Wings Divine Flight and rapidly travelled a far distance.","Feng Miaoling gave chase, but in terms of movement technique, Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was definitely the most kickass Imperial Technique. Even if there was a disadvantage of a major tier, she was still unable to catch up, and could only maintain a distance of neither advancing nor retreating.","However, the flat plains soon ended, and a forest appeared ahead of them. Ling Han dived in, and soon disappeared from her field of vision.","Feng Miaoling stopped in her tracks, and roared furiously at the sky, filled with resentment.","Ling Han had actually managed to escape again!","She turned around angrily. Since Ling Han had fled, she would make an example of the other guy who had a cheap mouth and was seeking death.","...","After Ling Han circled around the forest for a while, he stopped.","In the end, he managed to throw off that crazy woman.","Ling Han gritted his teeth. Previously, he had even sworn that he would spank that woman's behind, but now? He was being chased and hunted again.","\"How humiliating!\"","\"I don't know how Jing Haoran is doing, but he's still alive and well even though he's been doing this all this while. He must have ultimate techniques to save his life. Otherwise, he would have died long ago.\"","\"No need to worry about him.\"","Ling Han shook his head, reorganized himself, and continued onwards.","Actually, there was nothing to be embarrassed about. Wasn't it very normal that a Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator would be no match for a Minor Advanced Tiercultivator?","Very quickly, he walked out of the forest area.","\"Yi?\"","At the end of the forest was a cliff. Wrapped in clouds and mists, he couldn't see the end at all, but there were rainbow bridges on the cliff that led to who knew where.","Counting, there were a total of 99 rainbow bridges.","\"In other words, I have to make a choice here?\"","Ling Han didn't feel conflicted. He simply chose a rainbow bridge based on his instincts, and then stepped on it.","He had obtained the True Dragon of Fortune, and when faced with choice, it was as if there was a mysterious power taking effect, allowing him to make the most beneficial choice.","The rainbow bridge was very long, and Ling Han was already sprinting at full speed. However, it was as if this bridge could reach the depths of the universe, and he couldn't see its end.","After a whole five days, a cliff finally appeared ahead of him.","He had finally reached the end.","Ling Han stepped onto the cliff, and with a sweep of his gaze, he saw that this cliff was only connected to this rainbow bridge.","As expected, every rainbow bridge should lead to a different place.","Ling Han didn't stop, and he continued to advance.","Crossing this mountain, there was another stretch of forest, but this forest seemed to have been artificially planted. One area by another, they were separated, like multiple squares.","Among them, a large tree was clearly much taller. There were no other trees beside it, and it was so tall that it seemed as if it could pierce into the heavens.","With Ling Han's vision, he could clearly see that there were green fruits growing on this large tree. They weren't big, and looked like the eyes of dragons.","Celestial fruits?","Ling Han's heart throbbed wildly. However, he was not the only one who had chosen this path. In that forest, there were a great many people traversing, as if they were searching for that great tree, but they were like headless flies, completely unable to approach that great tree.","Was this a labyrinth?","Ling Han did not act rashly. He first observed, but from here, the forest was divided in an orderly manner. After entering, one only had to take a few turns, and they would be able to reach the great tree. There was no difficulty at all.","After watching for a while, he shook his head. Looks like he would not be able to see much here. He had to go in and experience it himself.","He took a step, and entered into the forest.","Yi!","He shockingly discovered that his surroundings had immediately changed. They were clearly still large trees, but the situation was completely different from what he had previously seen.","He closed his eyes, not wanting to be confused by what he saw.","However, this was useless. His divine sense swept over, and it was no different from what his eyes could capture.","No wonder there were so many people wandering around here. Even their vision and divine sense had been confused, so the difficulty level was naturally higher.","Ling Han stretched out a hand and pressed it on a large tree. Instantly, a rough feeling assaulted him.","In his memories, this great tree should not exist, but he had seen it, and he had even touched it.","Could it be that this was not an illusion?","Ling Han delivered a palm strike, and instantly, the power rebounded, causing his figure to sway, and take a few steps back.","Yi, that was strange.","If this was only an illusion, then as long as he firmed his resolve and walked according to his memories, he would naturally be able to penetrate through the illusion and reach his target.","But if it was so simple, those who had entered earlier should have long since found that great tree, and plucked the celestial fruits.","—Those who had stepped onto the Celestial Path, if they did not even have this little bit of memory, that would really be too trashy.","Thus, it was not as simple as that.","Then how should he find this great tree?","Ling Han strolled around. Since he didn't have a clue at the moment, he decided to take a walk first.","After walking for a while, he had more or less circled around this forest.","After all, this forest was not very big, and Ling Han was very fast, so it naturally wouldn't take too much time to tour around.","Where was the exit?","Ling Han shockingly discovered that he had not discovered the large tree, but similarly, he had not discovered the exit either. In fact, the entrance had disappeared as well.","Interesting.","He revealed a smile. Then let's contend.","He walked around again, and discovered that what he saw, sensed, and touched were all different again.","This was still a forest, but it had become a completely different forest.","Hehe, there were really a lot of changes.","Ling Han walked again, and again, and again. Every time he walked, the forest would undergo corresponding changes. By the seventeenth time, he was already somewhat confident. At this moment, two young people walked towards him.","—There was a relative age limit for entering into this space. Thus, no matter what cultivation level one was at, even if they were 5000 or 8000 years old, they would definitely still belong to the category of young people.","However, these two people in front of him were only in the Spiritual Transformation Tier.","Ling Han was unconcerned, and strode forwards.","The two of them naturally saw Ling Han as well, and the two sides soon passed each other.","\"We've been cooped up here all these days, so we're bored. Should we mess with him?\" one of them asked in a low voice.","\"Forget it, the less trouble there is, the better,\" another person said.","\"All right.\" The first person nodded, \"Hehe, consider this brat lucky.\"","Though these words were spoken softly, Ling Han's hearing was astonishing, so he naturally could hear them clearly. He was displeased, and suddenly stopped.","\"Wait!\""]},{"number":4404,"title":"Chapter 4404 Conflict","paragraphs":["\"What is it?\" The young man who had suggested the beating also turned around, and looked towards Ling Han. He was dressed in purple robes, his expression filled with pride.","\"You guys said you wanted to beat me up?\" Ling Han asked smilingly.","In the past few days, he had been hunted down by Feng Miaoling and Wenren Liangping, one after another. Although he had come out of it unscathed, how could he not feel angry?","\"Yi, you actually heard it?\" The young man in purple was a little surprised. He deliberately lowered his voice, but it didn't matter. So what if he heard it?","\"So what?\" he asked, a hint of disdain in his expression.","Ling Han spread his hands and said, \"Just in time. My mood hasn't been too good these past few days, so I can give you a beating to soothe my emotions.\"","\"Ha, hahaha!\" The young man in purple laughed loudly. This was really too hilarious.","\"What an ignorant guy!\" He withdrew his smile, his tone cold.","The other person, who was dressed in green robes, couldn't help but look impatient, and said, \"You should be glad that we don't want to waste time on you. But you insist on asking for your own suffering. Heh, now even I think that you are really asking for a beating.\"","\"Don't waste your breath on him, beat him up!\" The young man in purple strode out, bearing down on Ling Han.","Ling Han crossed his arms behind his back, as if he didn't take the other party seriously at all.","\"Where do you get such confidence from?\" The young man in purple looked furious. This guy actually dared to look down on him like this.","Beat him, beat him to death!","He suddenly sped up, and delivered a palm strike at Ling Han.","His companion did not help, but rather watched coldly from the sidelines. That was because he believed in his companion's strength. One person was enough to suppress Ling Han.","Pa, a figure flew past at the speed of lightning, and crashed heavily into the large tree behind them.","However, the tree didn't break, and this person fell back heavily, forming the Chinese character for 'big'.","The smile on the green-robed young man's face suddenly disappeared, because the person who had been sent flying was not Ling Han, but rather his companion.","How was this possible?","To say nothing of how Ling Han could possibly win, even if his companion had met someone that was his match, he shouldn't have been insta-killed.","\"Come, it's your turn.\" Ling Han waved at the young man in green.","The young man immediately revealed an awkward smile, and hurriedly waved his hand, \"Friend, we would not have known each other without a fight. Just now, we were rash. Please forgive us, brother.\"","\"Aiya!\"","He screamed in pain, because Ling Han had already thrown a punch at him, holding him down and giving him a good beating.","After beating him to his heart's content, Ling Han finally stopped, and said with a smile, \"I was rash, so please forgive me.\"","Now, he was finally feeling refreshed.","This was also because he only wanted to vent his anger. Otherwise, with a punch, the other party would be smashed into mush.","The green-robed young man was about to cry. Since you know that you are rash, why didn't you control yourself? Why did you only say it after beating him? Wasn't that deliberately insulting him?","But what could he say?","Hadn't he had enough of being beaten up just now? Did he want to go through it again?","Ling Han waved a hand dismissively, and strode off.","After Ling Han left, the green-robed young man hurriedly went to help his companion up. He shook him hard a few times, waking his companion up.","Fortunately, Ling Han didn't use too much force.","\"Ow, ow, ow!\" The moment the young man in purple awoke, he immediately cried out in pain, feeling as if every single bone in his body had been broken.","\"Come, let's immediately go find Young Master Zhu.\"","His face was filled with fury. This was too despicable. He actually dared to hit even him. Didn't he know that he had to see who was the Master before he hit his dog?","The green-robed young man nodded as well. He too had been beaten to his heart's content, so how could he be willing to accept this?","However, Ling Han was in a good mood. He walked left and right, and after a long time, when he took a step, that forest was already behind him.","He walked out.","\"The exit is easy to find, but that great tree.\" Ling Han turned his head, and that great tree once again appeared clearly in his field of vision. It was clearly much taller, like a crane standing out from a flock of chickens.","\"Let's search again.\"","Ling Han did not leave. Instead, he entered into the forest again, and continued to search for that great tree.","He walked over and over again, and also captured the changes in the forest over and over again, looking for patterns in it, and found the passageway that led to the large tree in the middle.","This time, it was difficult. After a whole month, Ling Han finally found that pattern amidst the myriad of changes.","He immediately sped up, heading towards his target.","His speed was extremely fast, but he was not heading directly for that great tree. Instead, he was continuously taking a roundabout route, because this was the only path that could lead to the great tree.","More haste, less speed, and if he wanted to reach his target, he could only circle around and walk further away.","Half a day later, he revealed a smile. As long as he passed through the bushes ahead of him, he would be able to reach the large tree.","Celestial fruits, here I come.","Ling Han was slightly expectant. He had only managed to come here after so much difficulty, so the celestial fruits that he would obtain must be incredibly valuable.","Was the Ninth Change already close at hand?","'Hmm?'","He was startled, and footsteps were heard from behind him. There were a total of... three people!","Ling Han suddenly turned around, and right at this moment, three people also crawled out of the bushes.","When they saw Ling Han, the three of them looked surprised. They had not thought that someone would actually beat them to it. But after an instant, two of them immediately showed expressions of mixed joy and fury.","Why?","It was very simple. These two people were the main in green and the man in purple, whon Ling Han had previously thrashed to his heart's content.","However, they were bothfollowing behind a white-robed young man at this moment, their hands hanging by their sides, appearing to be extraordinarily respectful.","\"Young Master, it was him!\" The purple-robed young man pointed at Ling Han and said, \"He was the one who hit us.\"","The young man in green nodded continuously.","Ling Han was astonished. This world was far too small, wasn't it? He had actually come across these two people again?","Furthermore, it was clear that they had not just randomly walked here. Instead, just like him, they had come for that great tree.","The white-robed young man looked at Ling Han, and revealed an expression of arrogance. He said calmly, \"Break your own arms, then get lost!\"","\"Hurry up and thank Young Master for his kindness!\" the purple-robed young man immediately shouted at Ling Han.","\"That's right. It's rare for Young Master to be so generous!\" the young man in green said.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"Breaking your own arms is far too difficult. Why don't you guys perform for me first?\"","\"Hehe, your mouth is really quite quick.\" The white-robed young man shook his head, \"However, this has also laid a path to death for yourself.\"","Hearing these words, both the young man in green and the young man in purple looked pleased.","If Young Master was angered, then Ling Han would definitely die.","They were naturally aware of the abilities of their Young Master.","—The Dao Child of the Azure Splendor Holy Land, Luo Huatang, a dignified Sect Master!","Ling Han smiled faintly, but did not speak.","\"Hmph, how stubborn.\" Luo Huatang merely moved his feet, and instantly appeared in front of Ling Han. He stretched out a finger, and pressed it down on Ling Han's forehead.","Golden light filled the skies with this tap of his finger.","Pu, with a tap of his finger, blood sprayed out.","Yet Luo Huatang frowned, and immediately shook his head. His eyes were clear, but there was no trace of blood that he could see.","Illusion."]},{"number":4405,"title":"Chapter 4405 Obtaining the fruit","paragraphs":["Ling Han didn't linger in battle. No matter how freakish he was, he was only at the Eighth Change. He was still not qualified to match a Sect Master.","Thus, after he shot out the black light of illusion, his figure immediately retreated, heading towards that great tree.","He would harvest the fruits and leave.","Xiu, he broke through the last thicket, and instantly, a towering tree appeared ahead of him. It was indescribably tall, and as wide as a small mountain.","He was clearly still close to three hundred meters away from that great tree, but the tree trunk blotted out the sun, completely enshrouding him.","Ling Han's eyes swept over the surroundings, and saw a green fruit on the ground.","Fallen from the tree?","It should be.","He leaped out, and with a stretch of his hand, he had already grabbed that fruit.","At this time, Luo Huatang also charged over. When his eyes caught sight of Ling Han, he immediately let out a battle cry and charged towards him.","Ling Han leaped up, and headed towards the large tree.","This tree was extraordinarily large, and there was an extremely large space for movement on it. Furthermore, he could also take advantage of the opening to harvest fruits.","—Picking fruits was the way to go. When he advanced into Sect Master-level, no, as long as he was Ninth Change, he would be able to truly match Luo Huatang, or even defeat him.","Luo Huatang naturally wouldn't let him off the hook. He immediately soared into the sky as well. He definitely couldn't allow Ling Han to escape, and he definitely couldn't allow Ling Han to pluck the celestial fruits.","\"Wu!\"","\"Er!\"","The two of them groaned at the same time, and instantly fell down from the skies.","What was going on?","After leaping to a certain height, the pressure became like a heavy hammer that blasted towards Ling Han and Luo Huatang, forcibly smashing them into the ground.","Though their cultivation levels were different, they were both throwing up blood, which was extremely uncomfortable.","The higher one's cultivation level, the greater the power of the attack.","Xiu, xiu! At this moment, the young man in green and the young man in purple also leaped in, and took advantage of the opening to make a move, charging towards Ling Han.","\"Even if a tiger has fallen from grace, it is not up to you guys to bully it!\" Ling Han smirked coldly, and the barrage of murderous aura shot out.","The two of them immediately rolled their eyes, and directly collapsed onto the ground, dead.","Their minds had been obliterated, so how could they not die?","No matter how many spiritual bodies you had, it was useless. Under such an impact, every spiritual body would be blasted apart, so how could they possibly escape with their lives?","\"Damn it!\" Luo Huatang said coldly. Though he did not care about the life or death of these two attendants, to kill these two people in front of him, wasn't that a heavy slap to his face?","Thus, his killing intent blazed.","Ling Han circled around the large tree. By now, he already knew that the large tree could not be climbed. If the power blasted him a few more times, his body would definitely explode from the impact.","Similarly, Luo Huatang did not dare to leap too high, so he could only circle around the tree trunk in pursuit of Ling Han.","As Ling Han ran, he continued to check if there were any more fruits that had fallen from the ground. He was really lucky. He saw another fruit, which he took into his pocket.","\"Put down the celestial fruits!\" Luo Huatang roared furiously from behind.","Since they couldn't climb the tree, they naturally couldn't harvest the fruits on it either. They could only wait for the fruits to fall off by themselves.","In his eyes, the fruits that Ling Han had picked up should all belong to him.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and circled around the large tree, waiting for another fruit to drop.","This trip took three days, but Ling Han was disappointed. Not a single fruit fell.","He raised his head, and saw that there were about a dozen fruits growing between the branches, but they were all greenish white in colour, and the fruits that fell were completely green in colour.","With how long celestial fruits took to ripen, he would probably have to wait several tens of thousands of years, or even longer in fact, before the fruits on the trees ripened and fell.","Forget it then.","Ling Han changed his course and headed out of the forest.","\"You won't be able to escape!\" Luo Huatang forced out through gritted teeth. His two subordinates had been killed, which was a humiliation to him, and the celestial fruits had also been picked up by Ling Han. He had every reason to capture Ling Han.","Ling Han laughed loudly, \"If I wanted to flee, how could you possibly stop me? Furthermore, you should be thankful that I am only fleeing now, and have no intention of killing you. Otherwise, if I wanted to kill you, no one would be able to stop me!\"","He let out a battle cry and used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. As the flames danced, he quickly pulled out the distance between himself and Luo Huatang.","What!","Luo Huatang was stunned. He was a Sect Master, but in terms of speed, he was actually left so far behind by Ling Han?","He chased a few more steps, but this forest was heavily twisted. If he fell slightly behind, he would have completely lost Ling Han.","He stopped in his tracks, a twisted expression on his face.","\"I will definitely not spare you!\" he forced out through gritted teeth.","...","After Ling Han exited the forest, he directly found a secluded place and began to study the two green fruits.","\"I don't recognize these fruits,\" he said with a shake of his head. \"However, I can sense an astonishing amount of energy from within, so it should be extremely nutritious.\"","\"Forget about it. I really need strength now!\"","\"Eat!\"","He picked up a fruit and began to eat.","This was far from being as delicious as the Extreme Fire Earth Spiritual Fruit, but it wasn't too bad either. Ling Han quickly ate one, and after some thought, he didn't eat two in a row, fearing that the medicinal effects would be too terrifying. If it did not nourish him but rather damaged him, wouldn't extreme joy turn into sorrow?","Very soon, the medicinal effects took effect, boiling inside his body, and circulating in every vein.","He channelled the Imperial Scroll and refined the medicinal effects, pushing the Body Art and mystical power to improve at the same time.","In his mind, the eighth spiritual body was rapidly strengthening.","Two days later, the medicinal effects were completely exhausted.","There was still about half the distance to the peak stage of Eighth Change. Ling Han took out the remaining green fruit, washed it with clear water, and began to gnaw on it again.","This time, he was naturally familiar with it. Another two days later, the medicinal effects were exhausted again, and he was still a sliver away from the end of Eighth Change.","\"I was just a little bit away.\"","\"Although it's only a sliver, without the help of external power, I have to cultivate for at least another two to three months.\"","\"Sigh, now that my cultivation level is so high, it's extraordinarily difficult to improve even the slightest bit.\"","Ling Han collected his distracting thoughts and walked forward.","That was the truth. What could he do even if he lamented?","Thus, he still did whatever he needed to do. If he could obtain natural treasures in this period of time, he would be able to break through to Ninth Change. If he couldn't, then he would only have to wait two to three months, at most.","After leaving the forest and walking for a few more days, a large city appeared ahead of him.","Yi, there was actually a city on the Imperial Path?","Ling Han was slightly surprised. There were actually living creatures here, and had even built a city in fact?","Let's go and take a look.","Ling Han strode toward the city gates.","Xiu, right at this moment, a strong gust of wind surged behind him. Someone flashed past his head, and arrived at the city gates first.","Was there any need to rush things like this?","Ling Han thought to himself. This person was dressed in a green Battle Armor, and only his head was revealed. He was handsome and filled with heroic spirit.","\"Halt.\" There were guards at the city gates, and they immediately stretched out a hand to stop him.","\"Humph! A measly Foundation Building Tier cultivator dares to block me?\" The young man wearing the Battle Armor humphed coldly, appearing extremely proud. He ignored them and continued to charge inside.","He was a Spirit Transformation True Lord!","Unexpectedly, those guards actually moved aggressively, blasting towards the young man in Battle Armor.","This was an uncanny sight. The young man in the Battle Armor was actually sent flying!"]},{"number":4406,"title":"Chapter 4406 Strange City","paragraphs":["Even if Ling Han was freakish, and it was a common occurrence for him to go against an opponent with a higher cultivation level with himself having a lower cultivation level, for Foundation Building Tier to go up against Spirit Transformation Tier, and still not fall into a disadvantage, even he could only watch in dumbfounded shock.","However, these mere guards in front of him did it.","This... were they supreme prodigies?","Really, if these people advanced a few major tiers and reached the Spiritual Transformation Tier or the Sect Master Tier, then wouldn't they be able to easily suppress even the Great Emperor?","Obviously, this was impossible. Otherwise, history would have long since been rewritten.","The young man in the Battle Armor hadn't expected this either. His face was filled with shock. A measly four Foundation Building Tier cultivators working together was actually able to push him back?","He got to his feet, a hint of hesitation flashing across his face.","His opponents were too strange, and he could not make up his mind whether he should make a move or not.","Thankfully, the four guards had no intention of attacking, and merely stood guard at the doors.","Ling Han activated his eye technique and looked at the four guards. However, he only saw a cloud of murky light, which was very strange.","Ordinarily, what he would see should be the strength of blood and Qi, life and vitality, and definitely not this kind of murky light.","They... weren't humans?","It was very possible.","Ling Han nodded internally. If these weren't humans, then it could explain why they could defeat a stronger opponent with themselves being weaker. At least, the reason could be found.","\"Entering the city requires registration,\" a guard said. It was as if he were merely making clear that he had absolutely no intention of attacking the young man with the Battle Armor.","Ling Han walked over and registered his name. He could vaguely feel that his soul had also been marked. Then, he was allowed to enter into the city.","Behind him, the young man in Battle Armor also became well-behaved and registered his name.","This city was a little strange, so it was best to cooperate.","The city was very lively. There were stalls by the roadside, and there was an endless stream of passersby. It was a scene of prosperity.","However, when Ling Han used his eye technique to scan them, he discovered that these merchants and commoners in the city were also like those guards previously, displaying lumps of murky light.","However, without activating his eye technique, these people were really no different from ordinary people.","Ling Han went to ask around. What exactly was going on here?","There were many outsiders in the city, and in fact, there was no shortage of Imperial Sons among them.","Had Ling Han finally caught up to the group of people at the forefront?","No.","It was said that the Golden Generation had long since left, and some of the Silver Generation and ordinary Imperial Sons had also left, but why was there still Imperial Sons left behind?","Trapped here?","This would explain the purpose of this city's existence.","In this city, it was easy to enter and easy to leave. There was definitely no one stopping them. Previously, when the guards stopped people and insisted for them to register, it was really just to ensure that they registered.","However, after leaving the city, there would be a dark place ahead of them. The moment they entered there, whether it was vision or perception, they would be severely affected. They would be like headless flies inside.","Unless... a special kind of torch was lit, which would be able to chase away the darkness.","Where had this kind of torch come from?","It could only be obtained in this city. To be more precise, it was the Li Clan, from the City Lord Residence.","How was one supposed to obtain it? Should he buy it?","No, it was through battle.","Challenge the Li Clan, but one had to win with a disadvantage in cultivation level. The more levels one was disadvantaged, the longer the torch one obtained would be able to burn.","What was the use of this?","That was because that land of darkness did not only serve as a blockade. There were also a great many natural treasures inside. Thus, the longer the torch burned, the more various treasures could be found inside.","But the problem was, challenges could be repeated, but there was only one chance to get hold of the torch.","Thus, it was impossible to switch torches every time, roam around in the darkness and then come back out again and switch to another torch and look around again.","Thus, those who were determined to find natural treasures would all be very cautious. They definitely had to obtain their best battle merits, and only then would they redeem torches, thereby maximizing their gains.","The reason why some Imperial Sons had not left was because they were still tempering themselves, and wanted to challenge in their prime condition.","So that was the case.","Ling Han nodded, then showed a hint of excitement.","In the place of darkness, there were natural treasures, and in his present state, he only needed to obtain a Five Star celestial fruit, and he would probably be able to reach peak stage Eighth Change.","At that time, he would be able to push open the doors to the Ninth Change.","He headed to the city lord's residence.","This was very easy to find, and there were no strict guards in the city lord's residence, so anyone could easily enter.","Ling Han entered the city lord's residence in a flash. A guard approached and brought him to the training ground.","There were a great many outsiders here, and they were all seated around the training ground. And inside the training ground, there were presently two young people clashing.","One was an outsider, while the other was a native. One only had to use an eye technique to know that his whole body was covered in a murky light.","This outsider was a Dao Child who had the cultivation level of Spirit Transformation Tier Fourth Change. However, his battle prowess had reached Spirit Transformation Tier Sixth Change, and he fought intensely against his opponent.","After battling for half a day, the two of them finally ended in a tie.","This Dao Child redeemed a torch and left without stopping.","They didn't stop him, because everyone knew that the torch was connected to each person's soul. Only one's own spiritual power could make a torch burn.","Of course, they could also force him to lead the way.","However, he was a Dao Child, after all, and had powerful strength. There really weren't many people that could defeat him.","\"Next,\" the young man from the city lord's residence said.","At this moment, no one answered.","Since no one was going to fight, he would do it.","Ling Han leaped down and landed in the arena.","The young man from the city lord's residence swept an eye over him, \"Spirit Transformation Tier, Eighth Change.\"","This kind of cultivation level didn't astonish the masses. As long as one was a prodigy, they could basically form nine True Selves at the True Self Tier. Then, they would naturally be able to easily reach the Ninth Change.","Thus, Eighth Change and Ninth Change could only mean that one's cultivation level was high, but it had absolutely nothing to do with whether one was a prodigy or not.","Boom!","The young man immediately charged out, launching an attack at Ling Han.","He was also using the power of Eighth Change. One after another, spiritual bodies leaped out of his body, using his full strength.","Meanwhile, Ling Han casually parried. He was very interested in the natives here. What kind of existence were they?","Thus, he patiently exchanged blows with this young man.","\"Sigh, this is too weak, isn't it?\"","\"Even someone with the same cultivation level is struggling so much. Hehe, he actually still has the face to come out.\"","\"How laughable.\"","Everyone shook their heads, thinking that Ling Han's strength was really too weak. How could he have the nerve to make a move?","After battling for a long time, Ling Han was finally tired of watching. He threw a punch, defeating his opponent.","\"Spirit Transformation Tier Seventh Change,\" the young man said as he pointed at Ling Han.","Yi?","Ling Han shockingly discovered that one of his spiritual bodies had been sealed, and he couldn't unleash the slightest bit of power.","His cultivation level had been suppressed to Seventh Change.","Interesting.","This opponent was clearly not as strong as him, yet could easily suppress his cultivation level.","It was definitely not human.","Ling Han thought internally. An ordinary living being would definitely not be able to suppress his cultivation level so easily. At least, only a Venerate Tier would be able to do so."]},{"number":4407,"title":"Chapter 4407 Skill surpassing one’s cultivation level","paragraphs":["They battled again.","Everyone shockingly discovered that though Ling Han's cultivation level had been weakened, his strength had not decreased in the slightest. His battle prowess had actually maintained the same level as before.","This!","How was this possible?","His cultivation level had clearly been weakened by a minor level, yet his battle prowess hadn't decreased at all. This was simply unfathomable.","After battling for a while, Ling Han defeated his opponent again.","\"Spirit Transformation Tier Sixth Change.\" The young man from the city lord's residence pointed at Ling Han again, weakening Ling Han's cultivation level further.","F***!","Everyone was once again shocked, because Ling Han still managed to withstand it. In fact, he seemed to have gotten the upper hand even faster this time.","They were practically about to go crazy. Was this guy a monster?","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Ling Han was incredibly domineering. Within ten moves, he easily defeated his opponent.","\"Spirit Transformation Tier Fifth Change.\" The young man pointed again, and Ling Han's cultivation level was further weakened.","...","\"Spirit Transformation Tier, Fourth Change.\"","...","\"Spirit Transformation Tier Third Change.\"","...","Everyone's mouths were wide open, and they could no longer close them.","Heavens, they must have seen a monster.","It was clear that Ling Han's cultivation level had already been suppressed to Spirit Transformation Tier First Change. However, he was still able to exchange blows with an opponent at Spirit Transformation Tier Eighth Change. In fact, he even had the upper hand. Just what kind of freak was this?","In just a few moves, Ling Han defeated his opponent again.","\"Heavens, there are a whopping seven minor levels of cultivation level!\"","\"This is about the standard of Imperial Son.\"","\"Powerful, he is really too strong.\"","\"A wolf in sheep's clothing.\"","Everyone shook their heads, feeling that they had been deceived too terribly by Ling Han.","\"Spirit Transformation Tier Ninth Change,\" the person from the city lord's residence pointed at himself. His cultivation level suddenly increased by a notch.","First Change against Ninth Change.","However, this still couldn't change the course of the battle. Ling Han forcefully suppressed his opponent, and it wasn't long before he defeated his opponent again.","Everyone was already rendered completely speechless. Ninth Change against First Change, and Ling Han actually managed to win so easily. Just how freakish was this guy's strength?","\"Silver Generation's standard, right?\"","\"Or even Golden Generation!\"","Everyone was stunned. Could it be that this was an Imperial Son, and a Golden Generation at that?","This was possible, because the Imperial Clan was high and noble, especially the Golden Generation. How many people would have seen them under ordinary circumstances? It was very normal that they did not recognize them.","\"True Self Tier!\" The young man pointed at Ling Han. This time, he directly pushed Ling Han's cultivation level into True Self Tier. However, he also lowered his own cultivation level, cutting down to Spirit Transformation Tier First Change.","They battled again.","Peng!","It was only a single punch, and Ling Han had defeated him.","This... everyone felt their scalps go numb.","Previously, whether it was the Seventh Change fighting Eighth Change, or the First Change fighting the Ninth Change, no matter how great Ling Han's advantage was, it was still a battle at the same cultivation level, after all. They were both in the Spirit Transformation Tier.","However, this time was completely different.","A True Self Tier cultivator against a Spiritual Transformation Tier, and even if it was only the weakest Spiritual Transformation Tier cultivator, there was still a gap of a major tier between their cultivation levels. That kind of gap was completely crushing.","And what about Ling Han?","He had defeated his opponent with a single punch!","Could the Golden Generation achieve this? Impossible, they had never heard that the Golden Generation could be so freakish.","\"Spirit Transformation Tier Second Change,\" the young man from the city lord's residence continued to raise his cultivation level.","They battled again.","This time, Ling Han finally didn't defeat his opponent in an instant. Instead, he spent some effort, but it was still very easy.","A smile appeared on Ling Han's face. If he had still been at the True SelfTier Ten Forms, he definitely wouldn't have been able to defeat a Spirit Transformation Tier Second Change so easily. However, his soul had also reached perfection by now, so his battle prowess naturally rose to another level.","\"Spirit Transformation Tier Third Change.\"","This time, Ling Han still won. However, the number of exchanges between the two of them reached 300 moves, and it seemed to be slightly straining.","\"Spirit Transformation Tier, Fourth Change!\"","Even if Ling Han was freakish, he had really reached his limit this time. After several hundred moves, the two sides were still tied. You can't defeat me, and I can't suppress you either.","When the battle reached the five hundredth move, the young man from the city lord's residence took the initiative to stop.","\"After five hundred moves, you'll pass.\"","\"Do you still want to test out a higher difficulty level?\"","The young man asked.","Ling Han shook his head. He really didn't need to try again this time. He had reached his limit. If he fought against Spirit Transformation Tier Fifth Change, he would probably be defeated within 300 moves. He couldn't possibly last 500 moves.","—Unless he used the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, or the Saint Tool staff.","This obviously wasn't a good idea. If he used a Spirit Tool that surpassed his cultivation level, then Ling Han's strength would definitely increase as well.","Enough, this result was probably enough to crush all other competitors.","Ling Han took the torch and left in satisfaction.","And in the surroundings, everyone was looking at him as if they had seen a monster.","After leaving the city lord's residence, Ling Han immediately left. He wanted to go to the place of darkness to find natural treasures.","\"Stop right there!\" A loud shout rang out, and Luo Huatang suddenly charged over.","This pesky guy.","Ling Han did not linger in battle, and directly broke into a run and fled.","\"Don't even think of running.\" Luo Huatang gave chase.","One fled, while the other pursued. Very soon, they had exited the city, and at this time, another person had joined the group of pursuers.","Wenren Liangping.","He had also discovered Ling Han's presence, so he immediately set off in pursuit.","The two Sect Masters looked at each other, and saw the killing intent towards Ling Han in each other's eyes. Thus, they instantly formed a tacit understanding, and did not make a move on each other, thinking that the other was Ling Han's helper.","However, they also felt a sense of admiration. Ling Han was really capable of causing trouble. He had actually provoked another Sect Master elite.","Not long after, an absolute darkness appeared ahead of them.","The place of darkness.","\"We can't let him escape in!\"","\"En!\"","Luo Huatang and Wenren Liangping immediately reached a consensus. Once Ling Han fled in, it would be a pipe dream for them to find him again.","And every once in a while, Ling Han's strength would become slightly stronger, which was equivalent to having a saber placed on both their necks, filling them with a sense of urgency.","They definitely had to kill Ling Han as soon as possible.","They all used their respective techniques to stop Ling Han from charging into the darkness.","However, in front of the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight's absolute speed, what use would their techniques be?","The only thing they could do was watch helplessly as Ling Han rushed into the darkness.","The two of them came to an abrupt halt. Without torches, it was extremely normal to be trapped in darkness for eight to ten years. Those who were lucky had only managed to retreat by luck, and it was not impossible that they would be trapped inside forever.","\"Damn it!\" The two of them stomped their feet, a powerful anxiety rising up in their hearts.","\"Come, let's go back to redeem torches.\"","\"Even if I have to give up the opportunity, I have to find and kill this boy.\"","The two of them reached a consensus, and immediately turned around to redeem torches.","And in the land of darkness, Ling Han had already lit a torch with his Spiritual Power. As it burned fiercely, the darkness was instantly chased away by the flames. Within a radius of 1km, it was bright.","It should be known that Ling Han hadn't even been able to see half an inch away previously, and his divine sense had also detected complete darkness.","This was truly a mysterious place.","Ling Han raised the torch high, and began to search everywhere, searching for natural treasures."]},{"number":4408,"title":"Chapter 4408 Ninth Change","paragraphs":["A piece of cold falling metal.","A broken six-star Spirit Tool.","A meteor shard.","...","Ling Han soon had some gains, but he had yet to encounter Celestial medicines that could increase his cultivation level.","Thankfully, the torch he redeemed was definitely \"extremely large\". Even if his opponent's strength surpassed his by a major tier, or even surpassed his cultivation level by two major tiers, in terms of tier surpassing battle prowess, who could compare to him?","His Spiritual Power could clearly sense that this torch could burn for about three more hours.","If he passed through the land of darkness, he would need about ten minutes. Thus, Ling Han only needed to reserve ten minutes. Then, no matter where he went by then, he would still be able to successfully walk out.","He searched, searched, searched, searched, but the heavens seemed to be joking with him. He just could not find any Celestial medicine that could increase his cultivation level.","\"I've collected a pile of scrap metal, but where's the Celestial medicine?\"","Ling Han sighed in emotion. Of course, if these \"trash\" were taken outside, they would definitely be fought over by others. There was no lack of good stuff among them.","Five-star or six-star tool refinement materials, supplementary ingredients for alchemy, and so on. There was also a broken talisman. Ling Han had studied it before. After it was activated, it could blast out the might of a Sect Master. It could even reach the level of five-star talisman.","\"But, what I want is the Celestial medicine!\"","\"Yi?\"","He was startled, and saw that there was a carrot-shaped plant growing ahead of him.","Could ordinary carrots possibly grow here?","Ling Han couldn't help but feel overjoyed. He had finally found the Celestial medicine.","He hurriedly ran over, and carefully dug out this Celestial medicine, but was immediately disappointed.","It was true that this was Celestial medicine, but it was not used to increase one's cultivation level. Instead, it was used to strengthen one's vitality. If it was ingested by another, it would definitely be no problem for them to live another two to three hundred years.","This was a lifespan of two to three hundred years. This definitely could be considered a Great Herb, but for Ling Han, it was extremely useless.","\"Let's see if I can trade it for other Great Herbs and medicines in the future.\"","\"To those Venerate Tier elites, the significance of lifespan is greater than anything else. I should be able to trade it for something good.\"","Ling Han put away the Celestial medicine, suppressed his disappointment, and continued his search.","He picked up a lot of \"rubbish\" again, and time was also passing. There was only about half an hour left of the three-hour deadline.","\"F***, there are treasures everywhere, but there's nothing that can increase cultivation level?\" Ling Han gritted his teeth. He was really too unlucky, wasn't he?","Twenty-five minutes, twenty minutes, fifteen minutes.","Ling Han sighed, and planned to leave the land of darkness. If he continued to stay here, it was possible that he would be trapped here forever, and that would be a great loss for him.","\"It's fine. It will only take me another two or three months.\"","He consoled himself, and searched for another five minutes, then left.","As he walked, he suddenly saw a plant that was no more than three feet tall. A small treetop was spread open, and there were three fruits growing on it. They were divided into gold, silver, and red.","Celestial fruits!","Ling Han was delighted, and hurriedly turned around. He plucked the fruit, and without even having the time to examine it, immediately left.","Time was limited.","With two minutes left on the torch, Ling Han rushed out of the land of darkness.","He actually appeared at the edge of the beach, surrounded by trees with fat leaves. The sun shone brightly, and the temperature was pleasant.","Looking back, he was enveloped in darkness, blotting out the sky and covering the sun.","He walked forward and jumped onto a large tree. Then, he checked his gains.","These were celestial fruits that could increase one's cultivation!","A smile spread across Ling Han's face. Finally, the heavens had regained their benevolence and weren't toying with him.","He picked up the red fruit, threw it into his mouth, and began to eat.","The fruit was very small, about the size of a longan, so it could not be gnawed on at all. With a bite, the juice dispersed, and the sweet fragrance filled his mouth. It was very delicious.","But after a while, a heat took effect in Ling Han's body.","'Here it comes.'","Ling Han channelled the Imperial Scroll and pushed his cultivation level up. In his mind, the eighth spiritual body that was still a sliver away from reaching consummate level soon completed the final step.","It was perfect and flawless.","He could now attempt to break through to the Ninth Change.","In a single breath, Ling Han began to break through to Ninth Change.","From First Change to Ninth Change, there was actually no qualitative change. It was just that one after another, True Self after True Self would be molded into a spiritual body. Thus, there was indeed some increase in difficulty, mainly because the spiritual bodies repelled each other. However, the overall difficulty level was only so-so.","Ling Han soon entered into an optimal state, pushing his cultivation level towards a higher cultivation level.","A day later, he sensed a divine sense sweep over him.","It was Luo Huatang.","However, Ling Han was currently wearing the Void Beast hide, so this divine sense swept over him, not stopping on him.","A while later, another divine sense swept over.","Wenren Liangping.","However, his divine sense also swept past, and did not stop for a moment.","The two of them didn't give up so easily. Instead, they scanned back and forth a few more times before finally giving up and not appearing again.","Ling Han merely smirked internally. After he broke through, it would be his turn to seek out these two people for an accounting.","Another day later, the ninth spiritual body took form.","Ninth Change!","Ling Han stood up, and with a light wave of his hands, instantly, waves of power surged out like a tide.","A qualitative change. This time, it was an absolute qualitative change.","After reaching Ninth Change, he finally possessed power that could match Sect Master-level.","\"Sect Master Tier is divided into nine minor levels of cultivation level, one to nine stars respectively, just like Venerate Tier and Saint Tier.\"","\"My current battle prowess should be equivalent to a One Star Sect Master.\"","\"It's time to shock some people.\"","Ling Han strode forwards, heading towards the coast.","Weng, he released his divine sense, which was like the great seas and rivers, turbulent and boundless, without any concealment.","The reason why he was so open and aboveboard was because he hoped that the two of them would sense his presence, and then follow his tracks.","Xiu, xiu, two figures suddenly flew over, their speed extremely fast.","Luo Huatang and Wenren Liangping.","The two of them looked coldly at Ling Han, revealing baleful killing intent.","'Finally caught you.'","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"It's been a long time.\"","\"What is it? Not going to hide anymore?\" Luo Huatang asked coldly. In these few days, not only had his fury not subsided, it had instead become even more intense.","Ling Han spread out his hands, \"When did I hide?\"","\"Since you're prepared to die, tell me your name, lest you become a fool.\" Luo Huatang didn't argue with Ling Han about hiding or not; this was meaningless.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and said, \"Since you're asking, then I'm a man of my word. I'm Wenren Liangping!\"","Wenren Liangping's expression instantly darkened. 'F*ck! Just how shameless are you to impersonate me?'","\"Fine, Wenren Liangping, I'll send you on your way!\" Luo Huatang said with a sneer. He charged over.","Ling Han couldn't help but feel amused. At first, he was only teasing him. He didn't expect that Luo Huatang actually didn't know Wenren Liangping's name.","True, they were only cooperating on the matter of killing Ling Han, but in essence, they were competitors on the Imperial Path. Did they need to announce their names and socialize?","On the other side, Wenren Liangping wore a dark expression."]},{"number":4409,"title":"Chapter 4409 Misunderstanding","paragraphs":["Luo Huatang charged over, and Sect Master-level power surged. He used his full strength from the beginning, wanting to crush Ling Han into dust.","If Ling Han was only an ordinary Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator, he would naturally be able to unleash his spiritual body. In any case, each spiritual body was enough to kill the strongest Spiritual Transformation Tier cultivator. However, Ling Han was too freakish, so freakish that even Luo Huatang didn't dare to use his spiritual body which would weaken the original's battle prowess.","Thus, he charged over alone. As his hands intertwined, multiple divine chains of order appeared, stabbing, slashing, or entangling towards Ling Han.","There was a faint smile on Ling Han's face, and he casually shifted his feet. He dodged all of them before the divine chains of order had reached him. By the looks of it, it was really an easy feat.","\"Wenren Liangping, since you dare to provoke me, why are you dodging? Could it be that you're still not prepared to die?\" Luo Huatang said coldly. This was naturally provoking him, hoping that Ling Han could face him head-on.","This caused Wenren Liangping's expression to darken even further. He couldn't help but grumble in his mind. 'Now that we're face-to-face, do you have to address by name directly? What's wrong with you?!'","He couldn't hold it in any longer, and said, \"I'm Wenren Liangping!\"","Yi?","Luo Huatang was shocked. He was Wenren Liangping, so who was Ling Han?","From the tone of his words, it seemed like there was some kind of indescribable and complicated relationship between the two of them.","He couldn't help but connect the dots. Why did Ling Han suddenly dare to come out?","—You have not advanced into the level of Sect Master!","Hence, something was very off.","At first, he had thought that Ling Han had nowhere to hide, so he could only come out for a battle. Instead of dying in such a cowardly manner, it would be better to have a vigorous battle.","But now, his heart was filled with doubts.","Could it be that this was a trap that Ling Han and Wenren Liangping had laid out for him together?","Actually, was he the target of the ambush?","With this in mind, he naturally didn't dare to make another move. He hurriedly looked at Wenren Liangping with a vigilant gaze. This was a true enemy.","Wenren Liangping felt like he was about to go crazy upon seeing this.","F***, you are really sick in the head!","Face-to-face, you still have to call someone by their name. Now? He had only explained that he was Wenren Liangping, and in the end, he had been misunderstood by the latter.","He didn't explain. Firstly, he was disdainful. What kind of mess was this? Secondly, action was better than words.","Boom! He unleashed his full power as he charged at Ling Han.","Luo Huatang didn't immediately attack. He was afraid that Wenren Liangping was deliberately putting on an act, waiting for him to attack so he could launch a sneak attack on him.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Wenren Liangping unleashed his full power with every move, but Ling Han had already advanced into Ninth Change, and his abilities had undergone a qualitative change. His strength had officially advanced into the level of Sect Master, so what did he have to fear?","Ling Han pointed at Luo Huatang, and said, \"Hehe, Brother Liangping, there's no need to continue the act. Let's work together to kill him!\"","He had not thought that he had only been spouting nonsense, and would actually cause such great suspicion to rise up in Luo Huatang.","However, since the misunderstanding between the two of them had already arisen, he did not mind making use of it. He would just treat it as some fun.","As expected!","Luo Huatang's expression was grim, and he revealed a cold smirk. This was a trap to tempt him.","He knew it. Why had Ling Han suddenly appeared? This was too illogical.","\"Don't fall for his trick!\" Wenren Liangping said in a solemn voice. \"If we don't get rid of him, you and I will both be in big trouble! Hurry up and join forces with me!\"","\"Haha, if I make a move now, then there would be big trouble.\" Luo Huatang sneered, \"Act, continue the act!\"","You see, Ling Han's expression was too relaxed. What part of him looked like he was having a mortal duel?","So, your acting skills are really too poor, and you still want to trick me?","Humph, did he really take me for an idiot?","\"Brother Liangping, it's better not to fight anymore. He's not stupid, and won't fall for it at all!\" Ling Han said with a smile.","How could Wenren Liangping pay any heed to him? With a loud shout, his attacks became even fiercer.","However, what was the point?","Ling Han's strength was already no weaker than his. He merely defended and didn't attack, so he was naturally at ease.","Peng, peng, peng! Wenren Liangping's attacks were like the tide as he launched wave after wave of attacks at Ling Han. However, each wave was easily blocked by Ling Han.","Even more \"understanding\" dawned on Luo Huatang. It wasn't like he didn't know Ling Han's strength. If Wenren Liangping really attacked with his full strength, Ling Han would probably be battered and exhausted. He would definitely be able to escape in just a few dozen moves.","But now?","Ling Han was extremely relaxed. They still wanted to trick him like this?","Naive, he was really too naive!","\"All right. Since Brother Liangping has decided to put on a full act, I will cooperate!\" Ling Han released a battle cry, and began his counterattack.","Boom, a terrifying power surged. He stretched out a hand, and a streak of Regulations had already been extracted. It turned into a divine spear, and shot rapidly towards Wenren Liangping.","This was a special technique that he had obtained from the Extreme Flame Earth Spiritual Fruit. The speed at which he extracted the Regulations of heaven and earth was astonishingly fast.","Xiu, the divine spear pierced through the air, shooting towards Wenren Liangping.","Wenren Clan sent out a palm strike towards the divine spear.","Peng!","Power and Regulations exploded, forming a terrifying shockwave. Meanwhile, Wenren Liangping also stumbled back in retreat. There was blood dripping from his palm. It was like amber, and was extremely condensed.","His strength was indeed not inferior to Ling Han, but the gap between the celestial techniques cultivated was too wide. Thus, in a head-on clash, he suffered a slight loss.","This was just like how two people had equal power, but one used a treasured sword forged from tempered iron, while the other used a rusty broken saber. In a head-on confrontation, who would be at a disadvantage?","Of course, because their abilities were equal, Ling Han also stumbled back.","Looking at it this way, the two sides had come to a tie, and Wenren Liangping had suffered a slight loss.","When Luo Huatang saw this, the disdain at the corners of his lips became even more pronounced.","When had Ling Han become so strong that he could stand against a Sect Master? It should be known that this guy's cultivation level had not changed, and he was still a Spirit Transformation Tier.","Thus, it must be Wenren Liangping who had deliberately given way.","Hehe, he was really quite good at acting. He actually deliberately injured his own hand, and bled a little.","He simply crossed his arms over his chest. 'Let's see how long you guys can continue this act.'","Furthermore, though it was an act, they had really used a lot of strength. He was also happy to see the two of them fight to the point of exhaustion. At that time, he would be able to easily pick up the pieces.","Worse come to worst, even if the two of them weren't acting, so what?","He wasn't familiar with Wenren Liangping, and he didn't even know his name.","What he wanted was only one result, and that was Ling Han's death!","Ling Han counterattacked aggressively, using Regulations casually. They turned into various weapons in his hands, slashing, slicing, hacking, stabbing at Wenren Liangping. He was familiarizing himself with this technique, and could use it in other celestial techniques in the future.","In fact, he could even use this as a foundation to create a new celestial technique.","Wenren Liangping's expression became more and more solemn.","This opponent... was actually capable of matching him!","Heavens, was this really a Spirit Transformation Tier?","However, the aura he sensed was truly so. It was definitely Spirit Transformation Tier. He himself had just passed this stage, so he was naturally extremely familiar with it.","A monster, he was truly a monster."]},{"number":4410,"title":"Chapter 4410 Just go along with it","paragraphs":["\"Are you an idiot?\" Wenren Liangping couldn't help but shout at Luo Huatang. \"This guy's strength has increased again. He's already at the level of Sect Master!\"","Haha, hahahaha!","Luo Huatang sneered. Wasn't this the biggest joke in the world?","A Spirit Transformation Tier possessed battle prowess on the level of Sect Master?","To say nothing of the Imperial Son, even the Golden Generation couldn't do it.","So, this guy was a monster that surpassed the Golden Generation?","Are you treating me like an idiot?","Luo Huatang ignored him completely. This must be a deliberate act from Wenren Liangping. His purpose was to make him take the field.","At that time, Ling Han might possess a deadly weapon that could deliver a fatal blow to him.","Right now, he was completely on the upper hand.","—If the two of them fought to the point that both sides were heavily injured, he would be able to easily pick up the pieces. If the two of them stopped fighting and joined forces to attack him, he would also be able to turn around and flee.","'Come, continue your performance.'","Fight, fight, fight. Ling Han and Wenren Liangping battled fiercely, but even if Ling Han possessed battle prowess on the level of Sect Master, he was still unable to overwhelm Wenren Liangping. Furthermore, he still had to rely on the barrage of murderous aura, the black light of illusion, and other means to maintain a tie.","Sigh, no wonder one could be called a great elite from the level of Sect Master onwards. Indeed, from the level of Spirit Transformation Tier to the level of Sect Master, the gap in this step was too wide. The further one went, the stronger one's abilities would soar, completely crushing Spirit Transformation Tier.","Fortunately, in a one-on-one battle, Ling Han wasn't at a disadvantage.","Meanwhile, Wenren Liangping was filled with anxiety. He had been unable to defeat Ling Han for a long time, and Luo Huatang was also eyeing him covetously from the sidelines. It was unknown what he was thinking, and this caused him to feel a sense of worry.","He gave a loud shout, and drew his Spirit Tool. The sword shone brilliantly, and was incredibly sharp.","\"Competing in Spirit Tools?\" Ling Han chuckled. Wasn't this just asking for a beating?","He drew out his staff and similarly delivered an attack.","His Spiritual Power had been weakened slightly, and this attack had also officially advanced into the might of a Sect Master. The blue arc of light had a dangerous beauty to it.","Peng!","The sword light clashed with the arc of light, and both were annihilated.","Ling Han couldn't help but shake his head. This was still limited by his cultivation level. Otherwise, how could the attack delivered by a Saint Tool be so weak?","Of course, he also had a talisman that could unleash the might of a Five Star Sect Master. However, he didn't want to waste it on Wenren Liangping.","He could use his own strength to deal with this opponent. Moreover, it would be more fun to kill him with his own hands.","Meanwhile, Luo Huatang inhaled sharply, secretly exclaiming his luck.","Sure enough, Ling Han was truly hiding a deadly weapon.","If he was suddenly attacked by Ling Han and Wenren Liangping, both of whom were wielding Spirit Tools, he would be severely wounded even if he didn't die.","Fortunately, he was smart enough.","Kill, kill, kill. Ling Han and Wenren Liangping's battle became more and more intense. Every move was extremely fierce, and they began to put their lives on the line.","It wasn't long before both of them were wounded and riddled with wounds.","Hesitation flashed through Wenren Liangping's eyes. Although he wanted to kill Ling Han to avenge his brother, he definitely didn't want to sacrifice his life.","But if this continued, it was really possible that he and Ling Han would die together.","Moreover, Luo Huatang was watching from the sidelines. Who knew what he would do at that time?","Thus, he had a lot of worries.","With this in mind, his attacks became less resolute.","Ling Han was also injured, but it was on purpose.","He could neutralize attacks within six Heavens of power. Although he hadn't advanced to the level of Sect Master, which meant that he couldn't unleash this ability to its full potential, coupled with his powerful physique, Wenren Liangping's attack on him was far less terrifying than he had imagined.","Thus, he deliberately feigned injury, and took the initiative to lower his battle prowess so that he could numb his opponent.","Otherwise, if Wenren Liangping ran separately from Luo Huatang, he would only be able to pursue one of them.","He had no wish to drag this grievance on for too long.","The more they fought, the lower their battle prowess became.","Luo Huatang saw this, and did not make a move all this while. He merely smirked coldly.","All of a sudden, Wenren Liangping revealed a weakness.","Ling Han naturally wouldn't miss this opportunity. He aggressively barged in, seizing this opening to attack.","\"You've fallen for it!\" Wenren Liangping said with a cold chuckle. His battle prowess had suddenly increased by a significant amount.","His power was indeed beginning to decline, but the extent was far from being as exaggerated as it appeared. He was deliberately laying a trap for Ling Han, so that the latter would misjudge, and he would take advantage of the opening to explode, and severely injure Ling Han.","Sure enough, Ling Han had bitten the bait.","Boom! He unleashed a Saint Technique. This was a powerful attack that he had meticulously prepared.","Peng!","His attack arrived, yet it was blocked by an iron fist.","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"What did I fall for?\"","His power was endless. If it was not for the sake of convincing these two people, what need was there for him to cooperate and weaken his battle prowess slightly?","Wenren Liangping's mouth was half-gaping, yet he couldn't speak.","F***, he was laying a trap for Ling Han. He had not thought that Ling Han was also laying a trap for him.","How did he do it?","You are only a Spirit Transformation Tier!","Even if your battle prowess could reach the level of Sect Master, could you compare to a true Sect Master in terms of endurance?","But that was indeed the truth, which gave him a great \"surprise\".","Wenren Liangping had the intention to retreat. Luo Huatang was still unwilling to make a move, and it was even possible that he had killing intent towards him, causing him to worry about the future. How could he go all out in this gamble?","Moreover, even if he went all out, it was still a question of who would be the final victor.","With this in mind, he immediately turned around to leave.","He would let Luo Huatang go and fight Ling Han to the death, and he would take advantage of the opening to recover his strength, and reap the benefits of the conflict. In turn, he would take the initiative.","However, how could Ling Han allow him to flee?","Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was unleashed, and Ling Han immediately caught up to Wenren Liangping. Flames burned fiercely, transforming into a heaven-burning fury.","This placed a huge pressure on Wenren Liangping. He was only the Dao Child of a Holy Land, and hadn't mastered the Imperial Technique, so faced with this True Phoenix's strongest technique, he naturally appeared to be at a disadvantage.","He couldn't escape, so what could he do?","He gritted his teeth. Then the only option was to fight to the death!","Wenren Liangping charged back with all his might, locked in a fierce battle with Ling Han. At the same time, he shouted at Luo Huatang, \"If you still don't make a move, to say nothing of killing this brat, it's possible that you yourself will be consigned to eternal damnation!\"","Luo Huatang was unperturbed. How could it be that he couldn't tell? Whether it was Ling Han or Wenren Liangping, both of them were close to exhaustion.","This was the most beneficial conclusion for him. Regardless of whether Ling Han was in cahoots with Wenren Liangping or not, he could still successfully pick up the pieces.","Seeing that Luo Huatang was unmoved, Wenren Liangping could only swallow his anger. After all, this was his own choice.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them battled fiercely, and Wenren Liangping's disadvantage was becoming more and more obvious.","Ling Han finally used Destructive Energy. This destructive power was too terrifying. It wrapped around his fists, and defense was completely useless in front of such a punch.","\"Urgh!\" Wenren Liangping groaned in pain. Ling Han's fist had easily penetrated his defenses and severely wounded him.","He realized that the situation was not good, and charged towards Luo Huatang without any regard for anything else.","No matter what, he had to drag the other party down with him. Otherwise, he would definitely die today.","\"Finally showing your fox's tail?\" Luo Huatang sneered. He did not make a move, and merely retreated rapidly.","F***!","Wenren Liangping cursed."]},{"number":4411,"title":"Chapter 4411 Killed All","paragraphs":["Wenren Liangping was already at the end of his rope, yet Luo Huatang was still unwilling to help him. How many more strikes could he withstand?","Ling Han used the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and quickly caught up to Wenren Liangping. He launched a barrage of punches.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Three consecutive punches landed heavily on Wenren Liangping's back. Destructive Energy rushed into Wenren Liangping's body, dealing a fatal blow to him.","Pu! Wenren Liangping spat out a mouthful of blood as he fell to the ground.","Die.","Even until death, his eyes were still wide open as he stared at Luo Huatang's handsome face. It was as if he was still making a denunciation against Luo Huatang. How could he possibly be acting to the extent of losing his life?","Luo Huatang, on the other hand, didn't take it to heart at all. He wasn't friends with Wenren Liangping. In fact, he had only just found out Wenren Liangping's name. How could he feel the slightest bit of guilt?","\"Hehe, then I'll just say sorry,\" he said calmly to Wenren Liangping's corpse. \"But don't worry. I'll soon send your murderer to hell with you.\"","Ling Han shook his head, \"Speaking of daydreaming, you are really an expert.\"","\"Haha!\" Luo Huatang laughed loudly. \"You are indeed very strong. A Spirit Transformation Tier being capable of killing a Sect Master, throughout history, you may be the only one. However, your strength is only slightly stronger than that guy, so you must have paid an extremely great price just to kill him.\"","\"Let me guess, how much battle prowess do you have left?\"","\"70% or... 50%?\"","His expression was filled with pride, and he said with a smile, \"Don't pretend to be calm in front of me. I know that you're just pretending to be strong on the outside but weak on the inside.\"","Yi, what else could he say?","Ling Han smiled faintly, and crooked a finger, \"Come, you can experience it.\"","\"Haha, the more you act like this, the more it proves how weak you are in reality!\" Luo Huatang let out a battle cry and charged towards Ling Han.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them fought fiercely, and Luo Huatang quickly frowned.","Why was Ling Han's battle prowess still so strong?","Was this a short-lived flash before death?","However, after another 100 exchanges, Ling Han was still brimming with energy. His power was unlimited, and it was as if he were an endless river or the sea, where there was no sign of an end.","Luo Huatang couldn't help but feel shocked. This guy, it couldn't be that he really had unlimited power, right?","What kind of monster was this?","He inhaled sharply, and a strong sense of regret rose up in his heart.","If he had known, he would have teamed up with Wenren Liangping.","\"Feeling regret?\" Ling Han said with a smile. \"At first, I was just joking. I didn't expect you to fall for it so easily. This proves that you're a vile character, and that's why you're using the most sinister way to guess the intentions of others.\"","\"The treacherous one is you!\" Luo Huatang shouted, as he unleashed Sect Master-level battle prowess.","There was no way he could escape. Just now, Wenren Liangping had already used his life to prove this fact. Furthermore, he had pursued Ling Han several times without successfully catching up to him, which already proved how fast Ling Han was.","He could only fight to the death.","After all, he was presently in his prime condition, while Ling Han had already battled a Sect Master to the death. Even if he still had spare energy, how long could he last?","Thus, as long as he gritted his teeth and endured, he would definitely be able to last until Ling Han could no longer hold on.","With this in mind, he instead increased the intensity of his attacks. He wanted to force Ling Han to go all out, so that he could exhaust his power as soon as possible.","Thoughts were beautiful, reality was cruel.","Ling Han's power didn't decrease. Instead, it was Luo Huatang who was the first to collapse.","After battling fiercely for two consecutive days, even if he had been in prime condition, he would not have been able to hold on any longer. However, to his despair, Ling Han was still very stable, and there was no sign that his power was declining at all.","'Holy f*ck!'","He could finally taste the despair that Wenren Liangping had experienced before. Death was right in front of him, yet no one could help him. He could only hold on helplessly.","\"No!\" he roared in fury.","Pa, a spiritual body inside his body shattered, but in comparison, his power suddenly increased by a notch, and he returned to his prime condition.","—He had self-destructed a spiritual body, turning it into incredibly pure power.","However, this was like drinking poison to quench one's thirst.","However, for the sake of survival, he couldn't care less.","Only by staying alive would there be hope.","Fight, fight, fight.","A day later, the effects brought about by the spiritual body's self-explosion disappeared, and Luo Huatang's power declined drastically again.","He gritted his teeth, and exploded another spiritual body.","To him, this was a destructive blow. Every spiritual body was a part of his power, and with one less, this portion of battle prowess would be forcefully decreased.","But what could he do?","Ling Han smiled faintly. Without two spiritual bodies, his battle prowess had dropped drastically, so how could he possibly be a match for him?","Boom!","Ling Han increased the power of his attacks, causing Luo Huatang to become more and more powerless.","He didn't have the chance to kill a third spiritual body, and he was forcefully killed by Ling Han.","At Dao Child-level, he didn't have a Substitution Seal, so he was naturally completely dead. To say the least, even if he had a Substitution Seal, under the Destructive Energy, his only fate would be death.","Ling Han looked at Luo Huatang's corpse with a cold expression, without the slightest bit of mercy.","This was seeking death, so there naturally wouldn't be any waves caused in his heart.","After searching the two corpses, Ling Han found a few Spatial Spirit Tools, but there was nothing precious inside.","\"Poor people!\" Ling Han shook his head.","He was in no rush to advance. Instead, he took out the remaining two fruits, gold and silver, and consumed them one by one, refining them.","This took him two days, and the ninth spiritual body solidified a little more, but he was still more than half a step away from reaching the consummate level.","There was no hurry.","From the Seventh Change to the Ninth Change, he had been walking too fast on this path, so he still had to control it. He couldn't just focus on increasing his cultivation level and neglect the basics.","He continued forward, and it wasn't long before an expanse of sea appeared before him.","Thus, after a few days of delay, there were naturally more people coming from behind, and they had all cut trees down to construct rafts.","Couldn't one directly fly over?","Ling Han gave it a try. He had just flown to the surface of the sea, when he suddenly felt a massive power sucking towards him. With a plop, he fell into the sea.","\"Hahaha!\" Quite a few people in the vicinity all laughed loudly, but even more people only swept an eye over before withdrawing their gazes.","They had come here to contend for a great opportunity, not to watch the excitement.","\"Brat, stop dreaming,\" a brawny man called out to Ling Han after seeing him appear above the water.","Ling Han hadn't swam out of the water. Instead, he had walked out from the seabed step by step.","Because there was also a powerful pressure in this seawater, he couldn't float at all. Furthermore, even with his physique, he could still feel his skin swelling, as if it was about to break open.","And this was only the coast. If he was in the deep sea, and directly sank to the bottom, how many times more terrifying would the pressure be?","Perhaps even a Venerate Tier elite would be crushed into a pancake.","Ling Han channeled the Ten Cultivation Technique, and his wounds quickly healed.","\"Just obediently go and cut some wood,\" the brawny man continued.","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"I want to try again.\"","Try again?","Hehe, what else do you want to try?","Quite a number of people instantly looked disdainful. 'Oh, you think you're the only one who can? Can you cross the great ocean?'","Didn't you see that everyone was building rafts, yet you just had to show off? Wasn't that mocking everyone's incompetence?","\"You are really arrogant!\" A blue-robed young man said, a cold smile on his face, looking like he had long since seen through him."]},{"number":4412,"title":"Chapter 4412 Ugly People Do Many Acts","paragraphs":["This time, Ling Han was truly baffled.","'F*ck! Who did I offend by crossing the sea? How can I attract animosity?\"","Ling Han chuckled upon hearing this. He looked at the young man in blue robes, and said calmly, \"So what? Can you control what I want to do?\"","\"Haha, I don't have the time to care about you! It's just that you're too arrogant, and I can't bear to see it.\" The young man in blue humphed.","Am I very arrogant?","Ling Han smiled and said, \"Then you haven't seen when I'm truly arrogant!\" Just think, when he had been in Genesis World, he had challenged the Heavenly Venerates. He had made an enemy of Hysteria, a","world-destroying monster. That was what arrogance and domineering was. Now, he was already very reserved, all right?","Ling Han shook his head, and couldn't be bothered to deal with this kind of minor character.","The young man in the blue garment was still shouting, but Ling Han ignored him, causing those around him to shake their heads.","As it turned out, he was a coward.","In the cultivation world, the thing that people looked down on the most was cowards.","You can be defeated, but you don't even have the courage to fight? Hehe. One had to realize that Ling Han and the young man in blue were both at the Spiritual Transformation Tier. Moreover, neither of them had reported their specific cultivation level. Thus, either of them could have possibly won. However, Ling Han didn't have the courage to battle against him, so how could they not feel disdain?","The people around them whispered among themselves, their eyes filled with disdain as they looked at Ling Han.","He still wanted to cross the sea?","'You?'","Yet Ling Han did not take the looks of others to heart. When one had reached a height like he had, what need was there for him to be concerned about this kind of misunderstanding?","He made another attempt, and crossed the sea alone.","Plop! He still fell into the sea.","However, this time, a faint smile appeared on Ling Han's face. He had a sliver of an idea.","He made a third attempt, but it still ended with him falling into the sea.","In everyone's eyes, this result was not the slightest bit unexpected. If Ling Han could really cross with his own power, that would be an inconceivable thing.","\"This is truly rendering me speechless.\"","\"You clearly know that you can't do it, yet you still insist on showing off. You're just making a fool of yourself.\"","\"It can't even be considered a joke. It's just an ugly person doing strange things. I can't even be bothered to take another look at him.\"","The people around them all shook their heads, and couldn't be bothered to pay any more attention to Ling Han. In their eyes, Ling Han was just a coward and a clown that didn't know how embarrassing he was.","Thus, they didn't notice that though Ling Han was still failing time and time again, the time he stayed in the air was getting longer and longer.","\"That's right!\" Ling Han revealed a smile. After dozens of failures, he finally made a discovery.","He released his divine sense, which vibrated at a certain frequency.","Instantly, the whole world changed.","Multiple threads appeared in the sky above the sea, as thin as silk.","It was Regulations.","\"Haha, everyone, I'll take my leave first.\" The blue-robed young man who had previously shouted at Ling Han had already gathered enough tree trunks to build a wooden raft.","This was extremely difficult, because there were only so many trees on the coast. With so many people cutting down trees, there was not much left, and could only be obtained through battle.","Thus, this proved the strength of the blue-robed young man.","Instantly, a few female cultivators ran over, all of them smiling seductively, begging the young man in blue robes to bring them along.","The blue-robed young man looked around. This greatly satisfied his vanity. Thus, with a wave of his hand, he had the four female cultivators all board the wooden raft. Meanwhile, he sent out a palm strike, and the wooden raft immediately flew up. Then, it fell into the sea, riding the winds and waves, rapidly leaving into the distance.","From start to finish, he didn't even cast a second look at Ling Han.","Was there any need to be concerned?","Ling Han was naturally even less concerned. With another leap, he stood","firmly on the surface of the sea, standing in midair.","That was because his foot was stepping on a thread of Regulations.","\"F***!\"","\"Motherf*cker!\"","\"Heavens!\"","Someone saw it, and immediately exclaimed in shock, which also alerted the people beside him. They followed his gaze, and similarly exclaimed in","shock.","Thus, one after another, the news spread. The whole beach was filled with exclamations of shock. They all widened their eyes, looking at Ling Han in","disbelief.","What had they seen?","This was a miracle!","Most of the people here were Spirit Transformation Tiers. In fact, there","were even Sect Masters. However, which of them dared to fly over?","It was not that they did not want to, but rather that they could not.","But now, they saw a miracle. Someone was stepping on the sea, his robes fluttering, like a celestial being.","Those who had previously laughed at Ling Han wanted nothing more than","to dig a hole to bury themselves in.","Was he a clown?","No, they were the real clowns here.","In the distance, the young man in blue also heard everyone's exclamations","of shock. He was even more pleased with himself, but at the same time, he","was also a little puzzled. That was because there were too many people that were making rafts to cross the sea. Was there any need to be so","surprised by him?","\"Heavens!\" A female cultivator on the raft turned around, and her eyes instantly widened. Her face was filled with shock.","\"My goodness!\" The other three women were not any better, their mouths","gaping widely.","The young man in blue hurriedly twisted his neck to look back, and similarly, showed an expression of disbelief. In fact, he even forgot that he had twisted his neck so quickly, that his neck was hurting.","In the distance, Ling Han was walking on air, rapidly approaching him.","'Holy f*ck! I've seen a ghost!\"","Ling Han's speed was very fast. In just a few steps, he had already caught up to him. Then, without a second look, he directly passed by and left. There was no boasting, but leaving in such a high-profile manner was even more humiliating than boasting ten thousand times.","The blue-robed young man really felt an urge to jump into the sea. Previously, he had mocked him in every way possible, but what was the","result?","Ling Han strode over on the sea. That aura... in comparison, he was","nothing.","He could sense gazes of others sweeping over him from the shore, bringing","with it half mockery and half sympathy.","What a tragedy!","Ling Han didn't take the blue-robed young man to heart. His level had long","since surpassed this level.","He strode forwards, and did not use the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, because every step he took had to be taken on the silk of Regulations. If he used the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, the flames of Regulations drawn would conflict with it, and he would no longer be able to step in midair.","This wasn't slow either, and it was countless times faster than the wooden","raft.","It wasn't long before he caught up to the wooden raft in front of him. When he surpassed it, he could clearly see the expressions of the three people on the raft as if they had seen a ghost.","He greeted them, and it was as normal as if he was asking his neighbors if","they had eaten. Then, he strode off, leaving the three people on the wooden raft dumbfounded.","After another while, he caught up to another wooden raft.","This time, he didn't greet them and directly surpassed them. However, the","two people on the wooden raft were still so shocked that they almost fell","into the sea.","Just like that, Ling Han surpassed others all the way. Who knew how many","eyeballs had popped out in shock. Three days later, a horizon appeared in","the distance.","He had initially thought that he had crossed the great ocean, yet immediately discovered that something was off.","This was not a mainland, but rather an island. It was just that it was too big,","and that was why he had the misconception that he had crossed the great","ocean.","After walking for a while, he took a step and landed on the island.","It was so hot!","Ling Han almost stomped his feet. The ground here was extraordinarily","hot, as if supreme true flames were burning beneath the ground, causing","the entire island to become hot and scorching.","He channeled the Starlight Screen to block the heat. Then, he surveyed the","surroundings."]},{"number":4413,"title":"Chapter 4413 Vicious Person","paragraphs":["The strange thing was that even if the heat waves here were so high that even the soles of his feet were about to burn, there was actually still a large number of plants growing here. There were trees and grass, and they were all extremely exuberant.","Why hadn't they been burned to death?","Ling Han casually snapped off a blade of grass, and instantly saw a crimson red liquid emerge from the stem. Upon a closer look, this was actually lava!","F***, what kind of grass was this.","He cut down another large tree. This was amazing. Crimson red lava gushed out, as tall as three hundred meters, and then poured down.","Ling Han dodged the lava rain with a flash.","This was very terrifying, causing him to instinctively feel danger. It was best not to touch it.","As he surveyed the surroundings, he could see that they were all plants of varying heights. If a battle was started here, it would definitely be lively.","—These plants were all extremely fragile, and could very easily be broken. Furthermore, their heat tolerance was frighteningly strong. There was lava surging in their roots, and once they were broken, lava would spray out.","It could be imagined that if two cultivators were to battle here, the result would definitely not be either side winning, but both sides would be burnt to ash by the lava.","Ling Han started to advance.","An island had appeared here, so it shouldn't just be for people to land, right?","Danger had always been accompanied by great fortune. Thus, it was extremely possible that there was some kind of treasure here.","He walked slowly, and as he walked, xiu, he saw someone fly through the air, landing in front of Ling Han.","This was a supreme Sect Master elite, but he looked very young. He looked to be only twenty-four years old. He was dressed in snow-white robes, without a single speck of dust, appearing elegant and otherworldly.","However, the reason why he could fly was not because he too had grasped the threads of Regulations like Ling Han had, but rather because there was no pressure on this island.","This Sect Master glanced at Ling Han, and when he discovered that he was only a Spirit Transformation Tier, he immediately withdrew his gaze, a hint of disdain flashing in his eyes.","A mere Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator was naturally not worthy of his notice.","His eyes swept over the surroundings, as if he was searching for something.","All of a sudden, his eyes lit up, and his gaze locked onto a spot in the bushes.","Ling Han followed his gaze, and saw that he could vaguely see something as red as fire in the bushes, as if it was crystal.","This was what the Sect Master was looking for?","A look of delight appeared on the white-robed young man's face, and he walked towards that patch of grass.","However, before he could stretch out his hand, he saw a fiery shadow scuttle out of the bushes, pouncing towards him.","This was... a giant cat.","This cat was completely fiery red in colour, and did not have a single strand of mixed fur. As its fur fluttered, it seemed to be burning. Its speed was extraordinarily fast. It opened its mouth, revealing sharp teeth.","The white-robed young man frowned, yet turned and ran without hesitation, appearing to be very resolute.","The fire cat gave a low growl, and chased after him relentlessly.","The white-robed young man swept past Ling Han. He thought for a moment, then stretched out his right hand, and actually delivered a palm strike at Ling Han.","This was a subconscious action on his part.","The wild beasts here were extremely hard to deal with. Once he was targeted by them, they would chase and hunt him down for ten days to half a month. He had experienced it before, and it had wasted a lot of his time.","Hence, he made a move to attack Ling Han, so that Ling Han would crash into the fire cat. In this way, it was equivalent to actively provoking the fire cat. Then, it would naturally incite the angered cat to make a move on Ling Han.","Though a mere Spirit Transformation Tier couldn't possibly block a few moves from the Sect Master-level fire cat, he only needed a little bit of time, and would be able to easily shake off this large cat.","As for whether Ling Han had died an unjust death? Hehe, did he need to take that into consideration?","Of course, it was himself that was most important.","Ling Han faltered at this. He hadn't imagined that he would be attacked.","But he only had to think for a moment, and he understood the other's intentions. He was using him as a shield.","There was no animosity between them, so wasn't this a little too ruthless?","In this kind of instant reaction, it was the best way to see through a person's heart. There was no time for consideration at all, and one could only make an instinctive choice.","Thus, this person... was extremely evil!","Killing intent rose up in Ling Han's heart. However, the fire cat had already pounced over.","Should he fight or not?","Ling Han pondered for a moment before throwing a punch at the fire cat.","He was very interested in the thing in the bushes. It was something that even a Sect Master elite wanted to obtain. Perhaps it was related to the great opportunities on this island.","Ling Han barreled towards the fire cat like this, so the fire cat naturally treated him as an enemy. It also swiped out a claw, grabbing out at Ling Han.","Peng!","The fist and claw collided head-on, instantly creating a terrifying wave, completely crushing the trees and plants in the surroundings.","This time, it was lively. Lava fell like rain, spraying all over the sky.","In the distance, the white-robed young man paused slightly, a puzzled expression flashing across his face.","How could a Sect Master-level vicious beast kill a Spirit Transformation Tier with such great commotion? Shouldn't it have insta-killed him?","Forget it, what did it have to do with him?","Guo Yuhang smiled faintly, increased his speed, and strode off.","What a pity for that fire crystal, he thought.","...","Boom!","Ling Han battled fiercely with the fire cat. One punch, one claw, and every move was a head-on confrontation.","This fire cat was at the level of One Star Sect Master, and its battle prowess wasn't excessive. However, it was extremely ferocious, fully displaying the unique traits of a fierce beast.","Ling Han was unafraid. It wasn't that he hadn't killed a One Star Sect Master before. It was just that the environment here was unique. In a fierce battle, lava sprayed everywhere. This possessed terrifying destructive power, causing him great trouble.","On the other hand, the fire cat was completely unafraid of the lava, as if it was merely bathing in the rain. In fact, when it was injured by Ling Han, the lava flowed through its wounds, and they miraculously healed.","F***, are you immortal here?","Ling Han unleashed all of his trump cards. He only had the battle prowess of a One Star Sect Master, so if he wanted to kill this fire cat, he definitely had to show his trump card. Furthermore, he didn't want to waste time now.","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was unleashed. Zi, arcs of lightning flashed, and the oncoming rain of fire was completely blocked by the body of the tower.","It wasn't the Primal Chaos Qi. The current Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower hadn't reached six stars yet, so the power of the Primal Chaos Qi wasn't enough to block the rain of fire. However, the Origin Gold itself could easily do so.","He unleashed another barrage of murderous aura, yet shockingly discovered that it was actually ineffective.","What was going on?","Could it be that it was not a living being?","Ling Han's heart jolted. If it was a living being, then even if it was a Sect Master, he would still be affected by the barrage of murderous aura.","However, he was only slightly stunned, and immediately began another powerful offensive.","The fire cat was actually not too strong. The hardest to deal with was the lava that was spraying around. Its destructive power was too terrifying. That was why the white-robed young man, Guo Yuhang, had left without a fight.","Thus, after the biggest dilemma was resolved, Ling Han soon gained the upper hand. After another few hundred moves, he killed the fire cat.","Pu, the fire cat crumbled, but there was no shower of blood. Instead, lava also exploded, spraying towards him.","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower suddenly enlarged, protecting Ling Han within.","The lava sprayed over, yet it was completely blocked by the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","Ling Han nodded in understanding. No wonder that person had acted as if he were avoiding snakes and scorpions. This kind of vicious beast was indeed difficult to deal with.","Pa, the fire cat's whole body turned into lava, but there was still a fiery red crystal left behind, which fell onto the ground."]},{"number":4414,"title":"Chapter 4414 Flaming Dragon’s Saliva","paragraphs":["Yi, why was it the same as what he had seen in the bushes?","Ling Han picked up this fiery red crystal, and then walked into the bushes. As expected, he picked up another crystal, and they were both as red as fire.","It was exactly the same.","Looks like these crystals were scattered all over the island, and could be picked up, or obtained through killing fierce beasts.","Speaking of which, it was a little funny. Previously, that person was clearly looking for this kind of crystal, and the fire cat also had this kind of crystal on it, but that person avoided it as far as possible, and would rather give up the crystal that had already been discovered.","Was this fire cat really so hard to kill?","This was indeed the case. Without the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, what treasure could block this level of lava rain?","\"It's rare for me to be scammed by someone. This is truly a rare event that would only happen in 10,000 years,\" Ling Han murmured. Instead of getting angry, he smiled.","\"Although this experience is rare, how could it be that I don't want face?\"","Ling Han wasn't in a hurry to find this guy who had screwed him over. Instead, he began to study this crystal.","After spending some time, Ling Han still couldn't make heads or tails of the situation. He didn't discover anything.","He naturally wouldn't throw away the crystal because of this. Instead, he strolled forward.","If he found someone to ask, he would definitely be able to find out the use of this thing.","On the way, he indeed saw a great many people searching for this kind of crystal, but when Ling Han went to ask, these people all looked furious, as if they thought that Ling Han was playing around with them.","What was going on here?","After walking for a long time, Ling Han saw a harbor.","Strictly speaking, this was only a shallow bay, but only this place could be docked from the sea.","Ling Han gave an 'oh'. This should be the starting point for the others. Because the others had all come by raft, they could only go ashore here.","He walked out, and set out from the beach, heading towards the island.","He had not taken too many steps, when he saw a scene that shocked him.","There was a giant whose entire body was burning with flames. His body was trapped by chains, and he was tied to a massive iron pillar. However, his arms and legs were free, but he did not attempt to free himself.","Perhaps, he couldn't do anything to this metal chain at all.","He was seated, but even so, he was still more than 200 meters tall. His flame-like hair seemed to be burning, fluttering wildly.","\"Young man, come here quickly.\" The flaming giant waved at Ling Han.","Ling Han walked closer, but not too close.","He couldn't tell the cultivation level of this giant, but he still didn't dare to be careless. The unknown was the most terrifying.","\"The little guy is quite cautious,\" the giant said. \"Go and get some shiny things. There are them everywhere on the island, and even in the bodies of wild beasts. Get me a hundred, and I will trade this with you.\"","As he spoke, he took out a jade pot, opened its lid, and shone it at Ling Han. There was a fiery red liquid inside, but it was definitely not lava. It was like beautiful jade.","At the same time, an intoxicating fragrance also wafted out. Merely a single sniff was enough to make Ling Han's ninth spiritual body show signs of accelerating solidification.","This was good stuff.","Ling Han retrieved a fiery red crystal, and asked, \"Is this it?\"","\"That's right.\" A greedy expression immediately appeared on the flaming giant's face, \"Give it to me. A hundred would be enough to trade for a drop of Flaming Dragon's Saliva.\"","Dragon's saliva?","It should not be the saliva of the True Dragon, but rather some kind of natural treasure. Perhaps, it was born from the True Dragon, and that was why it was called the dragon saliva.","\"A hundred in exchange for a single drop?\" Ling Han shook his head, \"I'm at too much of a loss. Here, either ten in exchange for a single drop, or a hundred in exchange for ten drops.\"","\"Little guy, it's not like I haven't seen people bargaining with me before, but you're the only one who has to bargain so outrageously.\" The fire giant smiled, and said, \"All right, just for your courage, I'll make an exception for you. 99 fire crystals in exchange for a drop of Flaming Dragon's Saliva.\"","\"I've never seen someone as petty as you either. Why don't we do this? Eleven for one.\" Ling Han sat down and made a counter offer.","The flaming giant wasn't angered, but he still insisted on trading 99 for one, not letting go. No matter how much Ling Han talked, he was still unmoved.","By the looks of it, he really couldn't go cheaper.","Ling Han nodded, turned around, and left.","At present, he only had two fire crystals in his possession, and could not trade for the Flaming Dragon's Saliva no matter what. Thus, he had best go and obtain the fire crystals first.","—No wonder when he had asked others previously, others misunderstood that he was playing around with them. That was because if they went ashore from here, they would definitely encounter the flaming giant.","Additionally, there was no shortage of Sect Master-level elites here, but the giant was still here. What did this mean?","His strength must be world-shaking. Otherwise, he would have long since been robbed.","Ling Han flew into the forest, and searched everywhere.","There were a lot of people, and they all had the same idea, and that was to obtain fire crystals to trade for the Flaming Dragon's Saliva. This was an astonishing opportunity, and no one wanted to miss out on it.","There could only be one person who would become Emperor in future, but every single person had their own fated opportunity. Who did not want to become stronger?","Because the plants here were too fragile and dangerous, it was natural that few people would start a fight here, to avoid getting into trouble.","However, if two people discovered a fire crystal at the same time, it was still possible that a battle would break out. After all, humans would die for wealth, and birds would die for food.","Ling Han had obtained a total of seven fire crystals. If he could continue like this, then he would be able to obtain a drop of Flaming Dragon's Saliva in about 40 days.","\"En?\" A surprised voice rang out, and a figure was seen flying through the skies. At first, he had already flown over, but when his eyes swept over Ling Han, he was startled, and suddenly descended from the skies.","Guo Yuhang.","He was extremely surprised. Why wasn't this brat dead?","Since when had vicious beasts become so benevolent? Were they going to let go of meat that was already at the tip of their tongue?","He definitely did not believe that Ling Han possessed strength that could match a Sect Master. Then there was only one possibility — Ling Han had hidden some kind of rare treasure, and that was why he managed to save his life from the hands of a Sect Master.","\"You're really lucky!\" he said coldly. \"Hand over the treasures on you, and I can spare your life.\"","Ling Han was also very surprised. This island was so big, and he had actually met this person twice in four days.","Hehe, there is no animosity between us, but you pushed me towards a fierce beast, and now that you see that I am not dead, you covet the treasures I have?","How could anyone be so shameless?","Ling Han couldn't help but laugh in spite of himself, and said, \"I've seen a great many shameless people, but there really aren't many as shameless as you. Er, there really aren't many.\"","\"How dare you!\" Guo Yuhang said in a baleful voice, \"Don't think that just because you have the rare treasure, you can escape from the hands of a fierce beast, so you can also survive from my hands! So, if you know what's good for you, hand over the treasure obediently!\"","He was that kind?","Of course not. He was only willing to grant some allowance because he was afraid that Ling Han would use the \"treasure\", so he did not push him too far. However, after Ling Han handed over the treasure, hoho, that would be a different story.","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"I have never liked killing. However, you are an exception, so I am very happy to send you on your way.\"","\"You really won't give up until you're faced with the grim reality!\" Guo Yuhang humphed, stretched out a hand, and grabbed out at Ling Han.","The speed at which the large hand stretched out was very slow. This was something that he had deliberately controlled. He did not want the power to surge, and shatter the surrounding plants, but a majestic power had long since imprisoned Ling Han.","A mere Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator!"]},{"number":4415,"title":"Chapter 4415 Talisman Weapon appears","paragraphs":["However, Guo Yuhang immediately discovered that something was off, because when his \"palm\" encountered Ling Han's power of defense, it could not advance the slightest bit further.","How was this possible?","A measly Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator was actually able to block his attack, even if he had only used a very small portion of his power.","\"How is it?\" Ling Han cracked a smile.","\"Interesting.\" Guo Yuhang soon calmed down.","So what if you are freakish to the heaven-defying level? I am a Three Star Sect Master!","'You want to challenge me?'","Guo Yuhang's figure leaped, and charged directly towards Ling Han.","Boom!","This time, he went all out, and the might he displayed was completely different.","A Three Star Sect Master was naturally terrifying.","Ling Han only took a single strike head-on, and already felt his body tremble violently from the impact. He was about to throw up all his internal organs.","This guy hadn't just advanced into the Minor Advanced Tier, but was at least a three-star or even four-star elite. Otherwise, how could he have been hit so hard with a single strike?","Thankfully, he could disperse a portion of the attack, and added with the toughness of his physique, otherwise, this would not just be uncomfortable. Instead, he would be severely injured, or even killed in fact.","\"Merely a Spirit Transformation Tier,\" Guo Yuhang declared proudly. Though Ling Han was extraordinary, he was only a One Star Sect Master, and was far from being his match.","—And he really had the nerve to boast. His cultivation level was higher than Ling Han by more than a major tier, so it was only natural that he was strong. If others heard this, they would naturally only laugh at him.","\"When I kill you, you will know regret,\" Ling Han said calmly.","Guo Yuhang's eyes were filled with greed, and his attacks became even fiercer.","Ling Han was only in the Spirit Transformation Tier, yet he could possess battle prowess on the level of a One Star Sect Master. Just how inconceivable was this?","Thus, this brat should have some heaven-defying fated opportunity.","Just how great was this great opportunity?","Even the Golden Generation could only watch in dumbfounded shock.","Had anyone ever heard of the legend of the Golden Generation facing his opponent head-on with a gap of a major tier of cultivation level?","There was none!","Thus, if he could snatch Ling Han's fated opportunity, he would be able to surpass the Golden Generation and become the most likely person to contest for the throne.","From an ordinary Dao Child, he had suddenly turned into the strongest prodigy. In future, he could even become Emperor. How could he resist such temptation?","\"Thank you!\" He revealed a smile, and couldn't help but laugh.","\"Your laughter is even worse than pigs squealing!\" Ling Han shook his head.","Instantly, Guo Yuhang's fury surged. His laughter was indeed a little strange, but no one had ever dared to compare it to the squealing of pigs.","\"On the basis that you have gifted me treasures, I will let you die a swifter death.\" Guo Yuhang was going to begin a great massacre. At this time, he completely did not care how much damage the aftermath of the battle would cause, and how much trouble it would cause for him.","His mind was completely occupied by that heaven-defying great opportunity.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and his figure danced, no longer facing Guo Yuhang head-on. However, he would occasionally deliver a barrage of murderous aura, and take advantage of the opening to counterattack. This was something that Guo Yuhang could not guard against, and was very uncomfortable for him.","How could there be such a freakish Spirit Transformation Tier?","If Guo Yuhang had not seen it with his own eyes, and personally exchanged blows with Ling Han, but had heard the retelling from others, he would definitely reprimand it as utter nonsense.","Wasn't it?","A Minor Advanced Tier was qualified to be called a great elite. A Sect Master would be able to suppress a Spirit Transformation Tier with a single finger.","Moreover, he was a Three Star Sect Master, yet he was still unable to defeat Ling Han after several dozen exchanges. No one would believe this.","But the more this was the case, the stronger his greed became. This meant that the great fortune that Ling Han had obtained was incredibly heaven-defying.","He wanted it! He wanted it! He wanted it!","At the same time, he was also a little worried.","What if Ling Han fled?","Though this guy's battle prowess was far inferior to his, his movement technique was extremely slippery. If he ran at full speed, it was very possible that he would not be able to catch up to him.","Such a heaven-defying opportunity!","He had already considered this kind of great opportunity to be his, so he definitely could not tolerate \"losing it after gaining it\".","\"Why do you have to do this?\" he asked as he continued to fight. \"Under my attacks, your only fate is death. Thus, it would be better for you to have a quick end, and save yourself some punishment.\"","Ling Han scoffed and said, \"Not only are your abilities inferior, but your intelligence is also insufficient. Can you say something more creative?\"","F***!","Guo Yuhang's eyes were filled with anger, and his attacks became even fiercer.","There was nothing much to say about persuading others to stretch out their necks and wait to be slaughtered. How could this be described in a way that it was what others yearned for?","\"You have already angered me!\" Guo Yuhang said balefully, \"Previously, I only planned to kill you, and snatch your fated opportunity, but now, not only will I kill you, I will also search for information about your family and friends from your consciousness, and kill them one by one!\"","\"Before they die, I'll tell them that it was you who caused their deaths.\"","Hearing these words, Ling Han's eyes finally became ice-cold.","'I have no animosity with you, yet you brazenly attacked and pushed me toward the wild beast. Now, you covet the treasures that I possess. And because I did not take the initiative to just hand them over, you actually want to threaten my family and friends?'","\"I had wanted to play a few more moves with you, but you are so determined to seek your own death!\" he stated calmly.","\"Hahaha!\" Guo Yuhang laughed loudly, \"You, a mere Spirit Transformation Tier, still want to kill me? How?\"","He was naturally unafraid. Even if a Spirit Transformation Tier obtained the Imperial Weapon, how much of its might could they activate?","Thus, Ling Han could only threaten him verbally.","\"I said I'll kill you, so of course you won't live!\" Ling Han said coldly as he retrieved a talisman.","This was a treasure that he had obtained from the place of darkness, and could blast out the might of a Five Star Sect Master.","Guo Yuhang's eyes swept over the surroundings, and a strong feeling of unease suddenly rose up in his heart.","That talisman was tattered, but for some reason, it made him feel a huge threat.","Talisman Weapon!","He was stunned, but at the same time, he was a little disbelieving.","Talisman Weapons were actually quite common, but the more powerful Talisman Weapons were, the higher the production requirements would naturally be.","For example, the six-star Talisman Weapon not only required the creator to be a Venerate Tier, but even the talisman paper used as a vessel had to be a Venerate Tier-level beast hide, and use Venerable Tier-level blood as ink.","How many forces could afford to use them?","Thus, there was a suspicion in his heart. Was Ling Han bluffing?","He made two preparations. On one side, he was still attacking, and on the other, if he discovered that something was off, he could also immediately escape.","\"Hehe, are you trying to scare me with a Talisman Weapon?\" he said proudly.","\"Just try it then.\" With a wave of Ling Han's hand, his divine sense had already locked onto Guo Yuhang. Then, with a wave of his hand, Spiritual Power stimulated the Talisman Weapon. Xiu, that talisman paper floated towards Guo Yuhang.","Guo Yuhang's greatest fear was actually that Ling Han would not use the Talisman Weapon. Now that you have used it, he only had to dodge it and everything would be fine.","Thus, he smirked internally. After all, he was a rookie, and did not have the slightest bit of battle experience.","He retreated rapidly. Even if the Talisman Weapon wasn't as terrifying as he had imagined, he still decided to avoid it for the sake of safety.","The Talisman Weapon shot out, and immediately emitted a purple-coloured light. Then, the talisman paper directly combusted into ash, but a purple-coloured sword of light appeared, slashing towards Guo Yuhang.","Five Star Sect Master-level!","Guo Yuhang was shocked, and hurriedly turned around to flee."]},{"number":4416,"title":"Chapter 4416 Killed","paragraphs":["Even though the might of the Talisman Weapon was only two minor levels higher than Guo Yuhang, at the level of Sect Master, a difference of one star could bring about a massive gap in battle prowess, what more two stars?","He wasn't Ling Han, who could freakishly battle against an opponent who was a major tier above him.","It should be known that when one had reached the level of Sect Master, which one of them was not a prodigy among prodigies?","He wanted to battle above his cultivation level?","Hehe, at least, he, a Dao Child, would not be able to do so. It was already very impressive that there were few opponents that could match him at the same cultivation level.","He fled, and the purple sword of light chased after him. Furthermore, it was not a physical object, but rather an attack that an elite had left on the Talisman Weapon through a special method. Its speed was naturally far faster than cultivators of the same level.","Shua, the sword of light arrived.","Guo Yuhang had no choice but to turn around to parry. Otherwise, if he was directly hit by a Five Star Sect Master, he would definitely die without leaving a trace of himself behind.","He exerted his full effort, and delivered an attack.","\"Ah!\" He released a terrible scream, and his whole person was sent flying. It could be clearly seen that the lower half of his body was gone.","—It was forcibly destroyed by the sword light.","However, the purple sword of light finally exploded with the might of the Talisman Weapon. It also rapidly dimmed, and disappeared into thin air.","This strike had passed.","However, Guo Yuhang could only scream in pain. Even though his lower body had only been shattered, the foreign martial intent that was contained within the purple sword of light had already invaded his body, making it extremely difficult for him to even raise a finger.","Fear appeared on his face. How had he treated Ling Han previously? Now, the tables had turned. He was so weak and powerless, completely like fish on a chopping board, and could only be slaughtered by Ling Han.","This turn of events was too fast, and he could not accept it.","Ling Han strode over. Though he had wasted a precious Talisman Weapon on Guo Yuhang, he did not take it to heart.","In any case, as long as he advanced into Sect Master-level, even if his battle prowess couldn't reach Five Stars, it probably wouldn't be too far off. At that time, this Talisman Weapon would become useless.","Thus, he might as well use it now, so that he could vent his anger.","\"We can talk things over peacefully.\" Guo Yuhang forced himself to speak. With these words, he spat out a few mouthfuls of blood.","\"Don't, don't, don't. The moment you open your mouth, you're throwing up blood. I'm a person that would become dizzy at the sight of blood, so it's best that you close your mouth,\" Ling Han said with a smile.","Dizzy? Dizzy your sister.","Guo Yuhang was so infuriated that he spat out a few mouthfuls of blood. 'You've already destroyed my lower body, yet you're still saying that you get dizzy at the sight of blood?'","However, his life was in Ling Han's hands at this moment, so he naturally didn't dare to say anything to anger Ling Han.","\"I said I'll kill you, so I will. Do you believe me now?\" Ling Han asked.","Guo Yuhang nodded in agreement. His life was in Ling Han's hands now, so he had no choice but to lower his head.","\"Do you regret it now?\" Ling Han asked again.","Guo Yuhang nodded repeatedly. If he had known that Ling Han was such a freak, he should have ignored his status and ambushed him, so that Ling Han would not even have the chance to use the Talisman Weapon.","Damn it, he was too proud.","Ling Han couldn't help but laugh in spite of himself, saying, \"A vile character is a vile character. Even at this moment, you still have no intention to reflect on your actions. You think that it's someone else's fault that you ended up like this.\"","\"Forget it. There's nothing much to say to you. It's a complete waste of time.\"","Ling Han stretched out a hand, and pressed it down on Guo Yuhang.","\"Ah!\" Guo Yuhang tried his best, but his body was filled with the foreign martial intent. The moment he moved, he would only be asking for his own suffering. The foreign martial intent in his body took advantage of the opening to attack, instantly shattering his mind.","Guo Yuhang died.","\"Yi?\" Ling Han was surprised. He had not even made a move, and he had already died?","So be it if he died, so as to avoid dirtying his own hands.","Ling Han searched Guo Yuhang, and found a few Spatial Spirit Tools, one of which contained nine fire crystals.","\"He arrived much earlier than I did, yet he only obtained nine?\"","Ling Han's expression was filled with disdain, but when he thought about it, Guo Yuhang had clearly discovered a fire crystal, but because of the appearance of the fire cat, he would rather give up the harvest that was close to his grasp.","For such a coward, it was already very impressive to have nine fire crystals.","\"Alright, then I have twenty with this. I've completed one fifth of my quota.\"","Ling Han continued to search for fire crystals. He tried his best to avoid battle, because this was a pointless waste of time.","Of course, if someone insisted on robbing him, he wouldn't mind counter-robbing him.","The cultivation level of Spirit Transformation Tier gave him a perfect cover. Some Spirit Transformation Tier cultivators even wanted to gang up on Ling Han and rob him, but they encountered Ling Han, who was a tough nut to crack.","With the help of these fools, only 22 days later, Ling Han had gathered 100 fire crystals.","\"There's no hurry.\"","He did not return to redeem the Flaming Dragon's Saliva, but rather continued to search for fire crystals. Another 31 days later, the number of fire crystals in his possession had reached as many as 200.","\"All right, let's go find that big flaming guy.\"","Ling Han returned, and soon arrived in front of the flaming giant.","\"Little guy, have you found those shiny things?\" the flaming giant asked, his voice booming.","Ling Han retrieved 99 fire crystals and tossed them toward the flaming giant.","The flaming giant reached over and caught the flaming crystals. He then smiled, and said, \"Aren't you afraid that I won't give the Flaming Dragon's Saliva to you?\"","Ling Han revealed the remaining fire crystals, and said with a smile, \"I'm not.\"","Everyone was collecting fire crystals for the fire giant. Obviously, he needed a lot.","The flaming giant faltered for a moment, then laughed loudly. He took out that jade bottle, and drew out a drop from it. Then, he tossed it towards Ling Han.","Ling Han stretched out a hand and pressed down, similarly controlling this drop of liquid in midair.","A refreshing fragrance seeped out, causing his mystical power to overflow with liveliness, and the ninth spiritual body was showing signs of accelerating in formation.","\"Brat, the Flaming Dragon's Saliva evaporates very easily. When the time comes, don't blame me for giving you fake goods,\" the flaming giant warned.","Only then did Ling Han swallow the dragon saliva in a single gulp. Instantly, a refreshing fragrance spread out in his mouth, making him feel so comfortable that every pore on his body opened up.","He hurriedly leaped up, found a remote place, and began to refine the medicinal effects.","After refining a drop of dragon saliva, his ninth spiritual body also advanced by one-tenth.","\"After another eight to nine drops, I'll be able to reach the peak stage of Ninth Change.\"","Ling Han returned, redeemed another drop of dragon saliva, and similarly found a remote place to consume it.","Then, he set out again on the path to find the fire crystals.","This was really a good way to rapidly increase his cultivation level.","However, more and more people came to the island, which led to the difficulty of finding the fire crystals becoming higher and higher.","Recently, there were more and more robberies, and there were even some people who took risks, and actually had designs on fierce beasts. Some succeeded, while others died terrible deaths.","This naturally affected Ling Han as well. In half a year's time, he had only managed to redeem four drops of dragon saliva.","\"Sigh, business has been difficult recently.\" As Ling Han searched, he searched all over the island.","The strange thing was that there seemed to be an endless supply of fire crystals. There were some areas that Ling Han had clearly searched, but when he turned around after a few days, he actually made another discovery.","\"Hmm?\"","He suddenly sensed a killing intent."]},{"number":4417,"title":"Chapter 4417 Fatal tribulation","paragraphs":["Murderous intent!","Ling Han wore a stern expression as he looked to his left. It was this direction that the killing intent had been emanating from, and it was directly surging toward him.","In a mere instant, a graceful figure appeared, standing in front of him.","Feng Miaoling.","F***, this crazy woman that was like a lingering ghost.","Ling Han had wanted to beat up this crazy woman after he advanced to the level of Sect Master, but he didn't expect to encounter this woman so soon.","Although he now officially possessed the battle prowess of a Sect Master, he should still be no match for Feng Miaoling.","This woman's strength was definitely above three stars. In fact, if he didn't use the Talisman Weapon, he wouldn't be able to deal with her even if he stayed behind.","\"Die, mad man!\" Feng Miaoling immediately charged over, slashing out with the longsword in her hand, as if she wanted to sever even heaven and earth.","Ling Han hurriedly retreated. A wise man does not fight when the odds are against him.","\"Crazy woman, just you wait. If I don't smash your behind, my name isn't Wenren Liangping!\" he shouted as he ran.","If Wenren Liangping still had awareness after death, the casket lid definitely wouldn't close over his corpse.","You are too mischievous.","Feng Miaoling gave chase quickly, but in terms of movement technique speed, Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was definitely number one in the world. In a situation where his power had already advanced into Sect Master level, Ling Han's speed was even faster than hers.","In this manner, in the blink of an eye, Ling Han had already disappeared from her sight.","\"Ah!\" Feng Miaoling slashed madly with her sword in hatred. Pu, pu, pu, the whole sky was filled with a rain of lava, making her appear extremely disheveled.","...","\"Crazy woman, crazy woman, she's really sick.\"","\"I wonder how Jing Haoran is doing. He wouldn't have been killed by the crazy woman, right?\"","\"That shouldn't be possible. That guy's mouth is even more despicable. If he could be killed so easily, he would have been chopped into pieces ages ago.\"","Ling Han shook his head, and continued to search for fire crystals. At present, this was the fastest way to strengthen himself.","Fifty days later, Ling Han found another 99 fire crystals.","103 days later, the number of fire crystals doubled.","He went to redeem the dragon saliva. After ingesting the dragon's saliva, his cultivation level naturally soared rapidly.","\"The situation has exceeded my expectations. As long as I redeem another two drops, I will definitely be able to reach the peak stage of Ninth Change.\"","But by this time, the difficulty level of obtaining the fire crystals had further increased, because more people had come, and they were not willing to leave. The use of the dragon saliva was too great. It could probably push a Sect Master to the peak stage of that cultivation level.","Thus, only Venerate Tiers would leave.","But the problem was, how many Venerate Tiers could be called young?","There were only a few Golden Generations, and they might not have chosen this path either.","Thus, those who could come here were all clinging onto this island.","Just how many people were there?","The entire island was almost filled to the brim with people.","And this was still because there were many obstacles ahead that had blocked the majority of people. Otherwise, there would be even more people here, and it was not impossible that even a needle would not be able to penetrate through the masses of people here.","Ling Han was also slightly driven mad, and felt that it was a little useless, because the longer it took, he might as well choose to cultivate while advancing instead.","Looking at the 70 fire crystals in his hands, Ling Han prepared to wait a little longer. At least, he had to redeem another drop of dragon saliva. Otherwise, it would be too much of a waste.","Fortunately, the signs of robbery on the island were also becoming more and more serious. Ling Han was robbed every few days, and the result was naturally that it was others who gave him fire crystals.","And just like that, a month later, he had gathered 99 fire crystals.","He went to redeem, and obtained a drop of dragon's saliva.","Seeing that he had turned around and was about to leave, the flaming giant couldn't help but feel curious, and asked, \"Little guy, you're leaving just like that?\"","Previously, Ling Han would always redeem two fire crystals.","Ling Han shook his head, \"Business is difficult.\"","He turned around and said with a smile, \"However, I don't mind lowering the purchase price. Why don't I trade fifty fire crystals for a drop of dragon saliva?\"","There was an obvious look of disappointment in the flaming giant's eyes. It was as if he was a child that had been anticipating a birthday gift for a long time, yet the adult had said that he had forgotten it.","Ling Han was astonished. He had thought that this flaming giant was naturally formed from heaven and earth. It only had one use, and that was to exchange for dragon saliva.","But from the look of things now, there seemed to be more to it than met the eye.","Xiu, at this moment, another figure descended.","This was a powerful Sect Master elite.","He was dressed in a tight-fitting green suit, and when his eyes swept over Ling Han, a hint of greed involuntarily rose up in his expression.","The air was still filled with the unique fragrance of the dragon saliva, so Ling Han must have just redeemed a drop of dragon saliva.","Though Ling Han had already consumed it, if he killed Ling Han now, he should still be able to extract the medicinal effects.","He was a Spirit Transformation Tier, so he could be easily dealt with.","He smiled, and with a casual toss, threw his own fire crystals towards the fire giant.","However, the flaming giant didn't hand over a drop of dragon's saliva like before.","\"Where's the dragon's saliva!\" the Sect Master in green raised his voice and asked loudly.","The flaming giant laughed loudly, and suddenly waved his hand. Instantly, his body was covered with fire crystal, which he had traded for from outsiders previously.","Yi, what are you doing?","Boom, the fire crystals lit up one after another, and then began to burn fiercely.","Flames soared into the sky, and waves of heat rolled out. Even Ling Han couldn't help but stretch out a hand to block in front of his face.","However, the flaming giant was completely unaffected. On the contrary, the metal chains that bound his body were burning bright red, and looked like they were about to melt.","F***!","Ling Han immediately turned around and fled. He finally knew what was wrong.","\"Trying to escape?\" the Sect Master in green said with a cold chuckle. He reached over to block Ling Han.","He still wanted to refine Ling Han's body and extract the dragon's saliva.","\"Idiot!\" Ling Han ignored him. He was out of time.","Boom! He unleashed his full speed as he unleashed the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. His flaming wings soared into the sky, and xiu, he disappeared from sight.","The Sect Master in green was startled. He had not thought that a mere Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator would actually be able to burst out with such speed.","However, before he could decide whether to pursue or not, he suddenly felt a terrifying aura behind him.","He turned around, only to see a giant of flames standing behind him. His power was boundless, and it was as if he were a god.","A Venerate Tier elite!","\"Ga, ga, you are the first!\" The flaming giant suddenly moved, and delivered a palm strike at the Sect Master in green.","If a Venerate Tier elite made a move, how could a Sect Master block it?","The Sect Master in green wanted to flee, but a Venerate Tier had already made his move. How could he make it in time if he only wanted to flee now?","Pa, with a palm strike, he was instantly turned into mush, his body and soul destroyed.","\"Interesting little guy, you're quite fast at fleeing.\" The flaming giant looked in the direction where Ling Han had disappeared, but didn't give chase, because there were too many little guys on the island for his amusement.","A Venerate Tier-level killer had joined the battlefield, and this naturally caused a wave of calamity. There was bloodshed everywhere on the island.","There were no Venerate Tier-level outsiders here, so the flaming giant was the only Venerate Tier here. If he wanted to start a massacre, who would be able to stop him?","There was no longer any great opportunity. This was a hell.","Those who were still alive all ran towards the harbour, leaving at the first instant, maddened for the sake of their lives."]},{"number":4418,"title":"Chapter 4418 Again","paragraphs":["Ling Han naturally left at the first instant.","He didn't need to enter the harbor. Instead, he directly soared through the air, stepping on the silk of Regulations as he crossed the sea.","In the distance, he turned his head, and could still see the tall figure of the flaming giant, as well as the shockwave created by the battle, which caused a rain of lava that filled the skies on the island.","Those who came later could no longer reach the island, or they would only be seeking death.","Ling Han shook his head. Who exactly had trapped the flaming giant there?","The flaming giant took out the dragon's saliva as bait. Its purpose was naturally for the fire crystals, which could help him escape.","Most importantly, the Imperial Path would only open once every tens of millions of years. If it was said that the last time the Imperial Path opened, someone had trapped the flaming giant there, then how many tens of millions of years could that large fellow live for?","What a joke.","\"Could it be that the flaming giant was nurtured by the heaven and earth, and was also trapped there by the heaven and earth as... an opportunity and a calamity?\"","Ling Han could only understand it this way. It couldn't be helped. It was even more impossible to say who had trapped the flaming giant here.","It was unknown whether this flaming giant would chase out again after killing everyone on the island.","However, this should only happen a long time after this.","Ling Han walked through the air at an extraordinarily fast speed.","A dozen over days later, the horizon appeared ahead of him again.","However, Ling Han quickly discovered that this was still an island, though it was astonishingly huge.","Again?","En, if it was still the same as the flaming giant, then the first batch of people to arrive would still be able to reap a great amount of benefits.","Ling Han did not hesitate in the slightest, and stepped forwards.","Cold.","He couldn't help but feel a chill run down his spine. Previously, that island was so hot that one could burn, and here, it was bone-chillingly cold.","Surveying the surroundings, this place was covered in snow and ice.","Ling Han waved his hand, sending a cloud of ice and snow flying. Instantly, the degree of coldness soared, causing him to shiver. His battle prowess dropped straight down.","As expected, this was similar to the last island. The environment had a great influence on battle prowess.","He circled the island, and did not see a single person during his journey.","This was very normal, because about everyone had left the same island at the same time, and in terms of speed, could the wooden raft compare to the speed of his flight?","After circling around for a while, he indeed discovered another beach that could allow the wooden raft to reach the shore.","From here, after walking for a while, the corner of his mouth suddenly twitched.","Another giant was chained to a pillar by metal chains.","The only difference was that this was a giant of ice.","F***, the person who had planned all this, just how lazy are you!","\"Little guy, come, come, come.\" The giant of ice waved at Ling Han.","It was the same trick.","Ling Han was speechless, and walked over with a numb expression.","Sure enough, the giant of ice blabbered on and on. Although the item he wanted had become ice crystals, the item he wanted to trade for it was still the dragon's saliva.","Fine then.","Ling Han sighed. In any case, he only wanted to improve his abilities, and as for how lazy the person who had designed this stage was, there was no need for him to care.","He did not bargain. 100 for one, or 99 for one; this gap was really too small.","Moreover, he only needed a drop of dragon saliva to reach the peak stage of Ninth Change.","He set out, and began searching everywhere.","After spending half a day's time, he didn't find any ice crystals. Instead, he encountered a fierce beast, and after killing it, he obtained it from its body.","So this was how it looked like.","The color of the ice crystal was too similar to the color of the ice and snow, so it was very easy to be confused.","Now that Ling Han knew what he was doing, it would be much easier to search for them.","One, two, three. Because he was the only one on the island, his speed was naturally faster.","Three days later, when Ling Han went to redeem the dragon saliva, only then did a second person reach the island.","Feng Miaoling.","What, a, lingering, ghost!","Without another word, this woman immediately moved to attack.","Ling Han hurriedly swallowed the dragon saliva as he used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight to flee.","Crazy woman, this is the last time I will tolerate you.","After shaking off this woman, Ling Han found a secluded place to begin refining the dragon saliva.","As expected, when this drop of dragon's saliva was refined, Ling Han also successfully reached the peak stage of Ninth Change.","He could break through to the level of Sect Master Tier.","Though this was a Mystery Realm, it was naturally formed by the heaven and earth. Thus, unlike other Mystery Realms, the Regulations were complete, so he was completely capable of breaking through to Minor Advanced Tier.","However, Ling Han hesitated for a moment.","Breaking through just like that?","He had exchanged blows with Sect Masters before. Indeed, taking this step would bring about a qualitative change, completely suppressing Spirit Transformation Tier. However, he still felt that those opponents all had their shortcomings.","Spiritual body.","In the Spirit Transformation Tier, it was indeed good to have spiritual bodies. With every additional body, there would be an additional portion of power, because a spiritual body was a spiritual body, and would not affect one's own battle prowess.","And after advancing into Minor Advanced Tier, the advantage of having a lot of spiritual bodies was also very obvious, because the Sect Master's battle prowess was the sum of the main body together with the spiritual bodies. After it was split, the original battle prowess would decline, and the more spiritual bodies there were, the stronger the original battle prowess would be.","There were many spiritual bodies, and this was a good thing. Undoubtedly, what made Ling Han feel that it was not perfect enough was that though the spiritual body was manifested from the original, there was always a certain barrier between it and the original, and it could not work perfectly together.","Unless... he fused all of his doppelgangers with himself. In that way, there would be no problem of coordination.","Of course, the disadvantage was also very obvious. He had lost the convenience of doppelgangers.","After all, the spiritual body could handle some trifling matters, which was very convenient. Furthermore, the existence of the spiritual body also gave the cultivator a chance to live if he encountered danger.","His spiritual body could also transform into the original.","\"No, since I want to pursue the strongest, I must make a choice.\"","\"And I choose... to be the strongest!\"","Ling Han decided not to be in a rush to break through. Instead, he would fuse all nine great spiritual bodies into himself.","He did not know what consequences such a choice would bring. Perhaps, it would make him stronger, but perhaps... this would bring about a calamity.","But when one had reached this kind of height, if he still wanted to break through his limits, he could only explore on his own.","In front of him, no predecessor had ever walked this path before.","\"I'm unafraid!\"","Ling Han firmed his resolve. He began to find wild beasts to battle, hoping to give himself inspiration through battle.","—Smashing the spiritual bodies, and fusing them back into one's own body, this was not just empty words.","Ling Han now had this thought, but about how to make this reality, he could not act rashly.","Fight, fight, fight. He obtained more and more ice crystals, but because the dragon saliva couldn't be stored for a long time, he didn't redeem it. He could only hope that this ice giant wouldn't escape too quickly.","Going by the experience of the last time, he should be able to hold on for at least a year.","The number of people on the island gradually increased, and after the baptism on the last island, the strength of the survivors had also been screened. At least, they would have to be Spirit Transformation Tier-level, and there was absolutely no sign of True Self Tiers among them.","In this period of time, Ling Han encountered Feng Miaoling a few more times. He chose to battle, but he was defeated very quickly all these times, and he had no choice but to run madly for his life.","After doing this a few times, he gradually gained appreciation.","Nine spiritual bodies return to one, he could give it a try."]},{"number":4419,"title":"Chapter 4419 Tenth Change!","paragraphs":["Ling Han began to shatter the spiritual bodies, fusing them back into himself.","However, it was difficult.","At first, he had wanted to obliterate all the spiritual bodies in one go, but he discovered that this was only a pipe dream.","Though the spiritual body was also under his control, when it was about to be destroyed, it would instinctively develop resistance, making it a battle of one against nine... hehe, it should be known that in the SpiritTransformation Tier, the battle prowess of the spiritual body and original were equal.","Hence, one may not even win in a one-on-one battle, what more when it was a one-on-nine battle.","He changed his method, and was no longer so greedy to shatter all the spiritual bodies in a single go. Instead, he chose one, and then had the other eight spiritual bodies help him suppress it together.","This had an effect. The first spiritual body was slowly worn away, and endless energy surged out to nourish the self, making the self inconceivably grow stronger again.","Originally, he had already reached the end of the Spirit Transformation Tier, and it would have been impossible for him to improve any further.","Now, he had turned the impossible into possible.","The record had once again been broken.","Ling Han couldn't help but break into a smile. It was said that there was no limit to the Spirit Transformation Tier. Hoewever many True Selves you formed in the True Self Tier, then that was how many Changes you would be able to reach in Spirit Transformation Tier, because this was how this cultivation level was cultivated, and the restrictions were fixed.","But he still managed to create a miracle.","Ninth Change was the finishing line?","Hehe, then I will fuse all nine spiritual bodies into myself, and that would be... Tenth Change!","A whole seven days passed, and the first spiritual body finally fused completely with the original, becoming a part of the mind again.","The strength of his divine sense had increased greatly!","Ling Han smiled, and was just about to begin refining the second spiritual body, when a strong feeling of hunger rose up in him.","This was not because he was really hungry, but rather a feeling of weakness in terms of power.","He hurriedly absorbed the power of heaven and earth, but it was useless. He was still hungry.","Ling Han went to redeem another drop of dragon's saliva. After ingesting it, his hunger instantly disappeared.","As it turned out, what he needed to fill his hunger was natural treasures.","However, not long after, this feeling of hunger returned.","F***, you've become so greedy?","Ling Han hurriedly went to redeem another drop of dragon saliva. After ingesting it, the feeling of hunger disappeared, but it came back again.","After ingesting four drops of dragon's saliva, he finally managed to rid himself of such a strong feeling of hunger.","Thankfully, he had gathered enough ice crystals previously. Otherwise, how could he have withstood such expense?","However, after four drops of dragon saliva, Ling Han was completely broke.","\"Thankfully, I'm not as hungry as before. Otherwise, it would really be uncomfortable,\" Ling Han mumbled to himself. However, it was obvious that if he fused with another spiritual body, he would definitely need at least four drops of dragon saliva.","\"Just what kind of path have I walked?\"","Ling Han was stunned. To completely evolve the ninth spiritual body only needed nine drops of dragon's saliva — previously, he had used gold and silver fruits to increase his cultivation level a little, so afterwards, he only needed eight drops of dragon's saliva.","But now? He had only fused with a spiritual body, and he had actually used up four drops of dragon saliva.","Then how many drops would he need to complete the Tenth Change?","More than thirty drops?","Heavens!","Just how long was this going to continue for?","However, though he was under great pressure, Ling Han was still pleasantly surprised.","That was because he only needed around nine drops of dragon saliva to complete the Ninth Change, and to complete the Tenth Change, he actually needed more than thirty drops. How much did this mean that his strength had increased?","He moved his limbs, but did not discover any qualitative improvement in his power. On the contrary, his power had decreased.","Just how far had his cultivation declined?","Eighth Change.","He had fused with a spiritual body, which was equivalent to having one less Change, so his power had directly dropped to Eighth CHange?","Then, if he fused one spiritual body after another, would his power fall further and further, weakening to First Change, or even True Self Tier?","If it was another person, they might have to worry, or even stop such a risky action.","This was because this was a path that no one had ever walked before. Who knew if they would walk towards destruction?","However, Ling Han didn't hesitate at all. Since this was a choice that he had made, he would definitely walk to the end.","If he gave up now, he would definitely regret it in future.","\"If I want to rise, I have to suppress it first. Just for the sake of Tenth Change, I need more than thirty drops of dragon saliva. Then, when I succeed, I will definitely explode with world-shaking power,\" Ling Han murmured, filled with confidence in himself.","\"I'll get some more dragon saliva. Otherwise, I really won't dare to continue.\"","He once again set out on the path to find the dragon's saliva, but as more and more people came here, the difficulty of obtaining the ice crystals naturally became higher and higher. After three months, he had only managed to redeem a drop of dragon's saliva.","Ling Han decided to leave. There was not much meaning to staying here any longer.","\"Found you!\" The sound of gritted teeth was heard, and Feng Miaoling appeared again.","It was unknown how many times the two of them had met. She did not waste any more words, and directly made her move.","Ling Han didn't face her head-on, choosing to flee.","But this time, he directly left the island, and tore through the air.","Feng Miaoling was hot on his heels, but as she chased, she suddenly realized that a terrifying pressure was bearing down on her, causing her to fall in a straight line. With a plop, she fell into the sea, and directly sank to the bottom.","Fortunately, this was the edge of the island, so the seawater wasn't very deep. She quickly walked ashore.","She looked at the sky where Ling Han had disappeared, and an expression of shock appeared on her face.","Why was Ling Han capable of flight!","She was a Sect Master, and even she couldn't fly, so how had Ling Han managed to do so?","\"After arriving at the seaside, everyone thought of the simplest method to cross the sea, and that was to use a wooden raft. However, it was obvious that the evil thief had thought of a second method. Though the difficulty level of obtaining it was so high that others would immediately give up, he had succeeded.\"","\"His battle prowess is so strong, and his thoughts are also so agile. He doesn't go with the flow, and is inventive. This is... the aptitude of a Great Emperor!\"","A hint of killing intent appeared on her face. This was a powerful opponent.","\"However, I will not lose to you!\" She immediately regained her confidence, because aside from herself, no one knew how much help she would be able to get.","That evil criminal definitely could not compare to her.","...","Ling Han treaded through the air and continued to advance.","Perhaps there were no more beings like the flaming giant and the ice giant ahead that would ask for any crystals to trade for the dragon saliva, but Ling Han was unconcerned. There were too many people on that island, so his gains were negligible. At this time, he should decisively give up.","The Imperial Path was so long, so how could it only have this little bit of good fortune?","Ten days later, he discovered another large island.","He landed on the island. At first glance, the plants on this island looked very normal. However, upon closer inspection, he gritted his teeth.","The leaves of these plants were too sharp, like supreme weapons.","Ling Han's physique was tough enough, wasn't it? However, he only lightly rubbed the leaves, and immediately, a bloody mark appeared.","He was already like this, so if it were anyone else, they would have directly cut open a wound.","Not only were the leaves sharp, but even the stems were filled with destructive power. If one pounced into the bushes, it was guaranteed that his entire body would be pierced full of holes. It was not impossible that he would die directly.","But what was even more surprising was the fact that these plants themselves were very soft, and could be easily broken.","This was really a strange island."]},{"number":4420,"title":"Chapter 4420 Path of becoming trash","paragraphs":["Ling Han circled around the island.","This had already become his experience. As expected, after walking for a while, he saw a beach that he could land on. Then, using this as his starting point, a giant that was shining with golden light appeared in his vision.","He was still trapped on the metal pillar, still tied with metal chains. Sigh, it was still the same trick.","It was too unoriginal.","Ling Han mocked internally, and the golden giant had already greeted him, \"Little guy, come here, come here!\"","Since he was already here, he would just have to take things as they came.","Fine then.","Ling Han walked over and conversed with the golden giant. The words that he heard were practically the same. However, what he wanted here were silver light crystals, and what he would trade was still dragon's saliva.","Without bargaining, Ling Han expressionlessly set out. He had redeemed this for who knew how many times, and was already familiar with it to the point of numbness.","He continued forward, searching for anything that shone with silver light. At the same time, he kept an eye out for any ferocious beasts.","However, after searching for a long time, he did not find a single silver light crystal.","However, a low growl rang out, and Ling Han turned around to look. A golden panther had appeared diagonally to his side. It was about 70 feet long, and its whole body was covered with metallic scales. It did not have a single feather.","\"So ugly,\" Ling Han couldn't help but grumble.","There were too many things he could complain about in this sea. It was already quite impressive that he could endure for so long.","The golden panther didn't give a toss about his emotions. It immediately charged over.","Thankfully, this was not a Sect Master-level beast, but rather a Spirit Transformation Tier-level beast.","He still wanted to commit violence in front of Ling Han?","With three punches and two kicks, Ling Han dealt with the panther, but when his fists landed on the panther's body, those scales were incredibly sharp, causing the surface of his fists to split open, and blood gushed out.","Hiss, just like those plants, they were clearly soft yet extremely sharp, which was extremely contradictory.","For a Spirit Transformation to be capable of wounding Ling Han, this panther was most likely the first.","However, after the panther was killed, it disappeared, leaving behind only a golden crystal.","F***!","Ling Han instantly bared his teeth. This was definitely a silver light crystal, but the problem was, which color-blind person named this as a silver light crystal?","'Is this f*cking silver?'","Ling Han grumbled endlessly, but still shook his head, and picked up the golden crystal.","No wonder he hadn't discovered any silver light crystals before. He had been looking for silver crystals, okay? How could he have imagined that these were actually gold!","\"I really want to slap someone!\" Ling Han exclaimed in displeasure.","He composed himself and continued to search for the silver light crystals.","This time, he had found the right direction, and added with the fact that he was the first person to arrive here, his gains were naturally great. Very soon, there were more and more silver light crystals in his hands.","Very good, very good. Aside from the troublesome points, the gains here were indeed quite great.","Only after a while, Ling Han could no longer laugh.","He encountered a fierce beast on the level of Sect Master.","Originally, he could have withstood it, but now that his power had dropped to the Eighth Change, he was no longer able to match it.","His Spiritual Power had been strengthened, but the wild beasts here were actually not real living beings. Thus, the barrage of murderous aura was useless. Furthermore, there were no ley lines that he could mobilize, so he, a formations grandmaster, could not make full use of his advantage.","Thus, the only thing Ling Han could do was turn around and flee.","The ferocious beast chased after Ling Han, unwilling to let him go. Furthermore, it was very stubborn. It chased Ling Han for a whole ten days, and only then did Ling Han manage to throw it off his tail.","Fortunately, Ling Han didn't forget to search for the silver light crystals as he fled. He still reaped great rewards.","In this way, the number of silver light crystals in his hands had already reached over sixty.","\"Continue.\"","Ling Han silently made a fortune, but only half a month had passed, and people had already come. Then, gradually, more and more people began to come.","The island was large enough, and with just these people, everyone could completely ignore the others and obtain enough benefits.","After gathering 400 silver light crystals, Ling Han began to fuse with the second spiritual body.","After spending three days, Ling Han's main body once again received a powerful boost, and his Spiritual Power also soared greatly. However, when his spiritual body completely fused together with himself, he discovered that his Spiritual Power had decreased greatly again.","He had fallen to the level of Seventh Change.","It was as if a layer of seal had been placed on him, banning the power of two Changes.","\"If this continues, it's really possible that I'll fall to the First Change or even the True Self Tier.\"","Ling Han gritted his teeth. Was he the first person in history to cultivate to the Spirit Transformation Tier and still experience a drop in cultivation level?","\"In some novels, this is the standard way of how a prodigious protagonist who has become a piece of trash appears.\"","Ling Han mocked for a while, then felt a strong sense of hunger. Hurriedly, he went to redeem dragon's saliva to consume.","After swallowing four pieces of dragon's saliva, this feeling of hunger finally disappeared.","\"Sigh, I'm looking forward to it more and more. When I truly complete the Tenth Change, just how great will the rebound of battle prowess be?\"","Ling Han continued to search for the silver light crystals. However, more and more people came, so his gains weren't as great as before.","\"Should I leave?\"","Perhaps, there would be a fourth and fifth island, and he would be able to continue trading for the dragon's saliva.","\"Although my gains now are a little small, they're not too bad.\"","\"Furthermore, going to the next island, going by experience, it would need at least ten days. This is also a very great waste.\"","\"Forget it, let's search again.\"","Ling Han continued to sweep through the island. Another month later, his gains were so small that he couldn't bear it any longer.","He planned to leave, but then, he shockingly discovered that he was unable to leave the island.","There was an invisible power suppressing him, preventing him from leaving.","This!","Not only him, but Ling Han also discovered that when others wanted to leave the island on the wooden raft, they had just traveled 10 to 15 meters when the wooden raft was pushed back by the waves. No matter how hard they tried, it was useless.","Obviously, they could not leave the island now.","Hiss, did that mean that everyone could only leave after the golden giant was released?","Very soon, everyone realized this fact, and all of them were trembling in fear.","The people here had all experienced the scene of the flaming giant killing people madly, and now they had to do it again?","In this way, many people became absent-minded when they searched for the silver light crystals.","What if when they went to redeem it, it just happened to help the golden giant escape?","Not only would they not be able to redeem the dragon saliva, but they would even lose their lives.","However, there were also courageous people. If others slacked off, it would give them a chance.","Ling Han belonged to the category of people who were calm in the face of adversity. He had been searching for silver light crystals, and his efficiency had increased again.","In half a year's time, he had gathered another four hundred silver light crystals.","He fused with the third spiritual body, then redeemed four drops of dragon saliva to solve the problem of his hunger.","\"As expected... Sixth Change.\"","Ling Han was rendered speechless. It was clear that when he was fusing with the spiritual body, he could feel that he had become stronger, yet when the fusion was complete, his power declined instead of increased.","\"Only Spiritual Power has been continuously improving. It has probably reached the level of Two-Star Sect Master.\"","What kind of concept was this?","If Ling Han unleashed the barrage of murderous aura at this moment, even a One Star Sect Master could possibly have his mind pierced through, and he would be directly insta-killed."]},{"number":4421,"title":"Chapter 4421 Terrible Loss","paragraphs":["However, Ling Han himself was also very weak. If he was ambushed by a One Star Sect Master, he would probably be in big trouble as well.","It was a standard case of strong offense and weak defense.","It couldn't be helped. Who asked his power to drop to Sixth Change?","—For a Sixth Change to be insta-killed by a Sect Master, that wouldn't be strange, right?","\"Hopefully, I can safely survive this period of time.\"","His luck was not too bad. He had stayed on this island for close to a year, yet had not encountered Feng Miaoling even once, which made him sigh loudly that he finally had a change of luck.","Finally, one day, the golden giant gathered all the silver light crystals he needed, and escaped.","Instantly, this giant began a massacre.","Thankfully, everyone was prepared this time. The moment they discovered that the situation was off, they immediately began to evacuate.","The blockade on the seas had disappeared.","True enough, they definitely had to release the golden giant before they could leave.","Ling Han also soared through the air. Although his power had declined, he could still see the threads of Regulations. Thus, this didn't affect his ability to soar through the air.","Additionally, his speed was not affected either. He still maintained his original speed, which made Ling Han feel very gratified.","Twelve days later, he saw the fourth island.","Far from the shore, he saw blazing white lightning enshrouding the island.","Yi, an island of Lightning?","Ling Han was surprised. Previously, they had been the three islands of Fire, Water and Gold, which made him think that this should be the islands of the Five Elements, but now, he realized that was not the case.","There was a random island of lightning, so the deduction of islands of Five Elements was naturally wrong.","He stepped onto the island, and saw that this place was also covered with plants, but the leaves were all entwined with blazing white lightning, intimidating anyone who saw them.","\"Let's not worry about this first. Hurry up and find the giant.\"","\"This time, it should be the lightning giant, right?\"","He found the landing point, then used this as his starting point to search. As expected, he soon found the lightning giant.","Without any nonsense, Ling Han immediately began to search for the lightning crystals.","Lightning crystals were easy to find, as the colors of gold and silver would not be turned upside down like before.","Ling Han continued to silently make a fortune. However, when he also fused the fourth spiritual body, his power fell further, and he was only left with the power of the Fifth Change.","This made it even more difficult for him to face wild beasts. The terrifying Spiritual Power was completely useless, and he could only turn around and run.","Ling Han was extremely displeased. When had he ever felt so aggrieved?","\"Weakness now is for the sake of becoming stronger in future.\"","\"I'll endure!\"","The days of making a fortune quietly alone did not last too long, and more people came from the island.","However, after the torture from the last island, there were fewer people who dared to continue arriving at the islands.","Because if they didn't liberate the giant on the island, they wouldn't be able to leave the island. Firstly, this would waste a lot of time, and secondly, it would be too dangerous.","Thus, a great many people chose to pass the island by instead of landing on it.","This was only the beginning stage of the Imperial Path. In future, there would be plenty of opportunities. Why did they have to fight to the death in such a dangerous place?","However, these people soon returned.","That was because after they had advanced for a while, they discovered that the tides were overwhelming, and they could not advance at all.","Obviously, the giant on the island had to be liberated. Otherwise, no one would be able to leave, and this path would be considered severed.","There was nothing else that could be done, so everyone could only return to the island.","Thankfully, there was no danger at the beginning, and there was also a large number of opportunities, so everyone was very proactive.","In a daze, four months passed.","There were too many people, so everyone's gains became smaller, causing robberies to become more frequent.","Robbery was something that happened all the time, but it had become even more common now.","Ling Han strolled slowly in the mountains and forests. He had to be careful. The plants were merciless, and the slightest touch would cause lightning to strike him. Though it would not kill him, it was enough to numb him for a very long time.","If he encountered enemies at this time, that would naturally be a very terrible thing.","Sha, sha, sha! Light footsteps were heard, and then a wild boar rushed out.","This wild boar's body was massive, and it immediately charged towards Ling Han at an extremely fast speed.","Thankfully, it was Spiritual Transformation Tier-level.","Ling Han nodded. He could still fight a Spiritual Transformation Tier-level beast.","He charged forward, unleashing his full battle prowess.","It could not be helped. His present strength had already fallen to Fifth Change, so he had to give it his all.","After a great deal of trouble, he finally killed this wild boar, and there were also a few charred marks left on his body. Those had been left by the lightning.","\"Leave behind the lightning crystals, and you can scram now.\" Just at this moment, a figure leaped out.","This was a young man who looked to be close to thirty years old. He was dressed in a long red robe, and looked very sturdy.","Ling Han looked towards this person, and asked calmly, \"You want to rob me?\"","\"That's right.\" The red-robed young man did not deny it. He said proudly, \"Don't have any delusions. I have already seen through you clearly. You are only Spirit Transformation Tier Fifth Change, and I... am Ninth Change!\"","\"What if I say no?\" Ling Han asked with a smile.","\"Then you are seeking death!\" The red-robed young man shouted, \"Hand over the lightning crystals quickly, and don't make me ask again!\"","Ling Han spread his hands, \"Isn't my answer already very clear?\"","\"Hehe, people really die for wealth!\" The red-robed young man said coldly, \"Unfortunately, you can't keep this wealth at all, and will only lose your life in vain.\"","He moved aggressively, launching an attack at Ling Han.","Ling Han's feet moved, dodging the red-robed young man's attack. He said with a smile, \"Now, I'll give you a chance to live. Apologize to me, and I can spare your life.\"","\"Hahaha, what a colossal joke!\" The red-robed young man scoffed. Did he think that just because he could dodge one of his attacks, he could continue to dodge?","What mysterious confidence.","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"If you don't believe me, you can give it a try.\"","\"Ignorance!\" The red-robed young man moved again. At present, he did not want to kill Ling Han so quickly. He wanted to capture the latter, and ruthlessly strike a blow to that baffling feeling of superiority he had.","This time, Ling Han didn't dodge.","His power had decreased, but his Spiritual Power hadn't.","The murderous aura surged forth.","Weng, with a though, his strike had reached his target.","\"Ah!\" The red-robed young man immediately released a terrible scream. He was holding his head with both hands, but what was terrifying was that blood was gushing out of his eyes, ears, nostrils, and mouth.","His mind had suffered a serious injury, which directly affected his physical body.","And this was still because Ling Han had held back. Otherwise, with how terrifyingly he could kill a One Star Sect Master, how could a mere Spirit Transformation Tier block a blow from him?","The red-robed young man's bloodshot eyes widened, as he looked at Ling Han in shock.","This was too terrifying. He hadn't even made a move, and the spiritual bodies in his mind had already shattered completely. His battle prowess had dropped all of a sudden to the True Self Tier.","Just what kind of freak are you?","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"Do you believe me now?\"","The red-robed young man cried. If he had known that Ling Han was so terrifying, he wouldn't have come out to rob him even if it killed him.","The reason why he was robbbing lightning crystals was to trade for the dragon's saliva, and if he wanted to trade for the dragon's saliva, it was to make himself stronger, but now?","He directly dropped from the Ninth Change to the True Self Tier.","What a terrible loss."]},{"number":4422,"title":"Chapter 4422 A tiger going down to level land","paragraphs":["However, the red-robed young man was in no mood to pay attention to the problem of his cultivation level. Instead, he was more worried about his own life.","Now, if the other wanted to take his life, it would be a piece of cake.","—For a Spirit Transformation Tier to kill a True Self Tier, wouldn't it be a piece of cake?","\"Spare me!\" He forced himself to his knees, and began to kowtow to Ling Han.","Pride?","Faced with the possibility of losing life, what was pride worth?","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, \"Hand over the lightning crystals.\"","F***, it had become him who was going to be robbed.","The red-robed young man was exasperated, and he could only take out his Spatial Tool and hand it over to Ling Han.","He was truly filled with regret.","Ling Han swept over it with his divine sense. Yo, there were actually 79 lightning crystals inside.","\"Thanks,\" he said with a smile.","The red-robed young man wanted to cry but had no tears. This time, he had really suffered a double loss.","Right at this moment, Ling Han's figure moved, and he had already disappeared.","Only then did the red-robed young man confirm that Ling Han had no intention to kill him. Involuntarily, he couldn't help but plonk onto the ground, his heart throbbing wildly.","Thank goodness, thank goodness, he had finally managed to save his life.","He couldn't help but feel a sense of relief. Originally, Ling Han was completely capable of killing him, yet he had only robbed him instead.","From this aspect, it could be seen just how benevolent Ling Han was.","With this thought, the little bit of resentment in his heart instantly dispersed completely.","...","Ling Han strolled around, looking for lightning crystals everywhere.","There were so many people on the island, so he would definitely encounter other people. Some would just pass by after a short meeting, while others would reveal their ferocious expressions, planning to rob him.","Towards this kind of person, there was naturally no need to be reserved. He would definitely be counter-robbing them.","However, there was also a problem. Once cultivation level surpassed the level of Two Star Sect Master, Ling Han definitely wouldn't be able to stand against that kind of opponent now. He could only choose to flee.","His strength \"advanced further\" back to the Spirit Transformation Tier's Third Change, because he had already fused with six spiritual bodies, and this made it increasingly difficult for him to deal with the fierce beasts on the island—those weren't real fierce beasts, after all.","On this day, he encountered a Spirit Transformation Tier Eighth Change beast. He was no match, so he could only run.","\"Yi?\"","He streaked through the air, and a person was presently passing by below him. His eyes swept over the surroundings, and he exclaimed in surprise.","This person was Kong Wuyang, the Silver Generation of the Peacock Imperial Clan.","He was very surprised, because he had recognized Ling Han — though Ling Han had changed to a certain extent compared to before, he hated Ling Han too much. It could really be said that he would recognize Ling Han even if he was turned into dust.","The problem was that the fierce beast that was chasing Ling Han was only Spirit Transformation Tier Eighth Change.","An Eighth Change had chased Ling Han all over the place?","He could be said to be quite familiar with Ling Han's personality. As long as this guy had the slightest chance of winning, there was absolutely no way he could escape.","So, Ling Han's current battle prowess was inferior to even a fierce beast of Eighth Change?","His heart involuntarily beat wildly.","Previously, he had long since given up the idea of seeking Ling Han out to regain his pride. That guy was too freakish, so he could only have the Golden Generation suppress him.","In fact, he had a feeling that even the Golden Generation might not be able to suppress Ling Han.","But now?","He suddenly realized that his chance had come.","Chase!","He immediately leaped up and chased closely behind Ling Han.","—With the support of the endless resources of the Imperial Clan, he had already advanced into the level of Sect Master. Though he was only One Star, the gap between him and the Golden Generation had further shrunk.","The higher one's cultivation level, the smaller the difference in cultivation level brought about by the age gap.","For example, when one had reached the level of Saint, it was very normal for there to be a gap of 10,000 to 20,000 years between them.","Very soon, he saw that the wild beast had given up the chase. Because its speed was far inferior to Ling Han, it was naturally left behind.","However, he was a Sect Master, so how could he be thrown off his tail?","Ahead of him, Ling Han had already stopped. He too descended.","\"Ling Han!\" he said calmly.","\"Yo, isn't this Imperial Son Kong?\" Ling Han asked with a smile.","Kong Wuyang sized up Ling Han for a while, then said, \"Going by your natural talent in martial arts, and added with the great opportunities here, you should at least be Spirit Transformation Tier Ninth Change, but you don't even dare to battle a wild beast of Eighth Change.\"","\"With your personality, you wouldn't run if you had the slightest chance of winning.\"","\"Thus, there must have been a great problem with your cultivation, causing your battle prowess to drop drastically.\"","\"Like I said, a mere lowly commoner, how could you possibly match the Imperial Son? You must have cultivated some kind of evil cultivation technique, which can allow you to be invincible among your peers, yet sow the aftereffects.\"","\"It's possible that breaking through to the Minor Advanced Tier is the explosive point.\"","Hearing his analysis come to an end, Ling Han actually felt slight admiration.","As expected of the Imperial Son. He clearly had so few clues, yet his deductions were practically all correct, aside from the part about cultivating the evil cultivation technique.","However, Ling Han didn't think that there was a huge problem with him. Instead, he thought that he was just accumulating strength for a great explosion. As long as he survived this stage, he would definitely experience a terrifying increase in strength.","As for this, there was no need to explain it to him.","He nodded very decisively, \"That's right. My present cultivation level has indeed fallen. It should be about Third Change.\"","Seeing Ling Han admit it so readily, Kong Wuyang was a little suspicious instead.","Could it be a trap, deliberately tricking him?","But the problem was, how could Ling Han have predicted that he was on this path? Furthermore, what was the point of doing so?","Worse come to worst, even if Ling Han was only pretending, there was no doubt that he was Spirit Transformation Tier.","Then, as a Sect Master, what was there to be afraid of?","\"Since that's the case, then surrender your life.\" Kong Wuyang stretched out his hand, grabbing out at Ling Han.","Boom! Sect Master-level power surged, and this large hand blotted out the sky and covered the earth, densely covered with divine patterns. It was incredibly terrifying.","If it was not for the fact that he was still wary of the lightning that was entwined around the plants in the surroundings, the might of this attack could be increased a few times over.","However, wasn't it enough to suppress a Spirit Transformation Tier?","Ling Han didn't face this attack head-on. Right now, he was only at the Third Change, so how could he withstand it?","I'll run!","He used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and his figure immediately flew out. At the same time, he sent out a murderous aura attack.","Unfortunately, even if the strength of his Spiritual Power had been increased to the level of Sect Master, it was still useless against a rare treasure on the level of a Great Emperor. This murderous aura attack was completely ineffective.","Ling Han wasn't disappointed. This was within his expectations, so he simply gave it a try with a sliver of hope.","\"Haha, as expected!\"","Seeing that Ling Han didn't even dare to parry his attacks, and directly chose to flee, Kong Wuyang was instantly certain that something had really gone wrong with Ling Han.","\"Die!\" He gave chase.","Having been horribly defeated by Ling Han, he had become the joke of the Ancestral King Academy. In fact, even the members of his clan were displeased with him. The younger generation had practically lost all respect for him, causing him to hate Ling Han to death.","Now, the opportunity to exact revenge was right in front of him, so how could he not be excited?","Die! Die! Die!","He gave chase, wanting to blast Ling Han into smithereens.","However, Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was the fastest movement technique in the world. Ling Han's power had decreased, but his speed was unaffected. As his fiery wings flapped, he gradually threw Kong Wuyang off his tail.","\"You can run away once, but you can't escape forever!\" Kong Wuyang roared from behind.","This time, he was filled with vigor, and was insufferably arrogant."]},{"number":4423,"title":"Chapter 4423 Just a little bit more","paragraphs":["After some effort, Ling Han finally managed to throw Kong Wuyang off his tail.","This little thing.","Ling Han shook his head. If the Tenth Change didn't weaken his power, but instead strengthened it, what need was there for him to fear a battle? And if Kong Wuyang wasn't the Imperial Son, then if he unleashed the barrage of murderous aura, he could still make him kneel down and prostrate in submission.","Unfortunately, he could only allow this guy to be arrogant now.","\"There are three more spiritual bodies. After fusing them all together, it will be clear who is stronger between us.\"","\"Now, I'll let you be smug for a while.\"","However, it wasn't long before Kong Wuyang told everyone about how Ling Han's cultivation had gone wrong. News spread like wildfire, and it wasn't long before everyone on the island found out.","The thought of hunting down Ling Han rose up in quite a number of people.","It was very simple. Ling Han was inconceivably strong, and had even overwhelmed one or two of the Golden Generation. This kind of prodigy... would he have risen up for no reason?","Hence, Ling Han definitely had a great secret hidden on him. If one obtained it, who knows, he may become the second Ling Han.","Dark waves surged on the island, and a great many people noiselessly joined in on the hunt for Ling Han.","If one succeeded in capturing him, he would definitely make a fortune in secret. Otherwise, when the news spread out, he would probably become the public enemy.","Ling Han's situation instantly became extremely dire. It wasn't just one or two people who wanted to kill him, but a whole group of them.","Thankfully, at present, only Two Star Sect Masters and above could pose a threat to him. Of course, Imperial Son was an exception. He was equipped with a Great Emperor-level treasure, and was unafraid of the barrage of murderous aura, so Ling Han could do nothing against him.","However, there were not many Imperial Sons in the first place, and they were scattered all over the 99 routes. Even if Ling Han was very unlucky, and this route here had the highest number of Imperial Sons, it could not possibly be overwhelmingly many. It would only be three to five, at most.","Under such circumstances, it was practically impossible for Ling Han to obtain any more lightning crystals. He could only wait for others to gather all of them, and the lightning giant would be able to break free and leave the island.","Quickly, two months passed.","In this period of time, Ling Han was continuously hunted down, and he killed a group of those weaker than him. Did they really think that just because he had fallen from grace, anyone could bully him? However, there were still a great many people that he could not deal with now, and had no choice but to hide here and there.","Thankfully, this island was big enough. Otherwise, he would not be able to go out to sea either. His situation would definitely be even worse.","Finally, the lightning giant escaped.","Ling Han rushed out of the lightning island at the first instant, heading towards the next island — if it existed.","He only needed another twelve drops of dragon saliva, and he would be able to complete the fusion of all the spiritual bodies. Thus, he had to hurry.","The first person to reach the island had a huge advantage.","He stepped on the air, stepping on the threads of Regulations. He flew all the way, several times faster than the wooden raft.","Ten days later, he saw the fifth island.","Brilliant light blazed.","He stepped onto the island, and saw that every single blade of grass was exuding a blazing white light, so bright that it was blinding, causing him to open his eyes as if he was blind.","F***, his eyes were about to be blinded from the brightness, so how was he supposed to find anything?","After quite a while, he finally somewhat adapted.","He circled around the island and found the giant who would be trading dragon saliva. Er, this giant was naturally exuding blazing light all over his body as well.","Using the same trick, Ling Han began to search for the light crystals.","It was very, very difficult.","\"I feel like my poor eyes are about to go blind. How am I supposed to search?\"","\"Would it be better if Old Black was here?\"","As Ling Han mocked, he continued to search.","Now that he only had the power of the Third Change, it was naturally even more difficult for him to deal with wild beasts. Most of the time, he could only run. Thus, the way he could obtain the light crystals now basically came from picking them up.","Thankfully, he had the advantage of being the first person. Twenty days later, he had gathered a hundred light crystals.","After forty days, the others also reached the island one after another.","From this, it could be seen that though Ling Han had spent some time studying the threads of Regulations before, it was completely worth it. Furthermore, it was more than worth it.","Because the dazzling light was blinding, it naturally made it extremely difficult to hunt Ling Han down, so Ling Han didn't have to go to so much trouble, dodging pursuit from time to time.","Another four months passed, and Ling Han had gathered 400 light crystals.","He immediately activated the fusion of his spiritual body, then went to redeem the dragon saliva to fill his hunger.","As expected, even though he could clearly feel the strengthening of himself, in the end, his power directly fell to the level of Second Change.","A year had passed, but the light giant still hadn't escaped. Because of the unique environment here, it was extremely difficult to find the light crystals.","Everyone had very little to gain, including Ling Han. However, they were already trapped on the island, so they could only grit their teeth and continue.","Another three months passed, and the giant of light finally escaped.","Instantly, everyone began to flee.","Ling Han immediately stepped into the air. Ten days later, the sixth island appeared.","There was an island that was brightly coloured in a variety of shades. It was incredibly vividly coloured.","Yi, what island was this?","After Ling Han stepped onto it, he instantly felt dizzy, and almost passed out.","He hurriedly activated the Starlight Screen, blocking himself from the surrounding environment.","Poison!","He immediately realized that this was a poisonous island. Every flower and grass was exuding poison, so he almost fainted the moment he stepped on it.","No wonder this island was so dazzling. Poison was usually very bright and beautiful.","Forget about it. He first went to find the giant on this island. This was a colorful giant, and Ling Han would have to find seven-colored crystals to redeem the dragon saliva.","Without wasting any time, Ling Han immediately set off.","He had the advantage of time in his hands, so he definitely could not waste it.","Time flew by. When the first batch of people arrived at the island, Ling Han could already redeem two drops of dragon saliva.","He continued to search. Because his abilities had declined further, he had almost never been a match for any wild beasts. If he encountered them, he could only dodge.","Another three months passed, and there were already as many as four hundred seven-colored crystals in his hands.","Ling Han didn't immediately redeem it. Instead, he decided to save up enough for eight drops this time.","\"Ling Han!\"","Boom, Kong Wuyang charged out, and delivered a palm strike. Sect Master-level power was boiling.","After so many days, his strength had improved greatly. Though he had not yet advanced into Two Stars, he was not far from it.","This was very normal. Ling Han could obtain dragon's saliva, so how could it be that he couldn't?","Ling Han didn't linger in battle and immediately fled.","\"Hey, where do you think you're running off to!\" Another palm struck over, covering the sky and sun.","This was shockingly another Imperial Son, Shi Hao of the Golden Cauldron Imperial Clan, who was also of the Silver Generation.","There were only two Silver Generation elites on the island, and they had joined forces at some point in time.","Ling Han humphed. Using the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, he created possibilities in the midst of impossibility. Before the two Imperial Sons surrounded him, he escaped through the only gap between them.","\"Damn it!\" Kong Wuyang couldn't help but stomp his foot heavily. Even Ling Han had managed to escape from him.","\"Chase!\"","He and Shi Hao set off in pursuit of Ling Han together, but Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was really too fast. Even if the two of them pursued him with all their might, it was useless. Very soon, they had lost him.","\"It's fine. There is really a huge problem with this boy's cultivation. His battle prowess is continuously declining.\"","\"The next time we meet... killing him would be a piece of cake.\""]},{"number":4424,"title":"Chapter 4424 Fully fused","paragraphs":["After Ling Han shook off his pursuers, he continued to search for seven-colored crystals.","Though his efficiency had decreased considerably as the number of people increased, he still had some gains. The number of seven-coloured crystals was steadily increasing.","Five hundred, six hundred, seven hundred.","'Soon, I'll be able to reach eight hundred soon.'","Ling Han strolled in the mountains, and the Starlight Screen spread out, resisting the invasion of the poison.","The poison here was everywhere at all times, so one had to be on guard at all times.","Actually, this was still quite good. In some areas, the poison also had a strong corrosive ability, and could very easily corrode the Starlight Screen, and he needed to replenish it with mystical power at all times.","Before this, Ling Han would deliberately avoid these areas, but now that there were more and more people, the seven-colored crystals were harder and harder to find. Thus, he focused his attention here.","There shouldn't be many people in such a dangerous place.","Ling Han strode in, and instantly, the Starlight Screen became colorful. It was filled with corrosive patterns, and would shatter in two to three breaths' time, at most.","Ling Han channeled his mystical power to repair the damaged shield.","For others, this expenditure was really too great, and could not last much longer at all, but for Ling Han, this kind of expenditure was no big deal.","His power had indeed decreased, but his reserves of mystical power had not. On the contrary, there was a considerable increase.","Thus, when others entered into this area, they could only stay for a short ten minutes or so before they had to leave. Otherwise, when the mystical power was completely exhausted, they would die of poison here. And in Ling Han's case, he could practically stay as long as he wanted.","As expected, there was no one here.","After Ling Han searched around, a smile appeared on his face.","Eight hundred seven-colored crystals, all gathered.","He had to leave.","It was naturally impossible for him to fuse with a spiritual body in this area with extraordinarily strong poison. Thus, he strode out.","Unexpectedly, he had just walked out of this area, when seven people walked towards him. They were all young men, and all of them exuded a soldierly aura.","When they saw Ling Han, these seven people were also taken aback. They had not thought that someone would actually barge into the zone of strong poison.","However, they were only startled for a moment before one of them said, \"Ling Han!\" His face was filled with pleasant surprise.","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"Obviously, the reason why you are so happy is not because we are friends.\"","\"That's right.\" That person laughed loudly. They had searched high and low for him, yet finding him had taken them no effort at all.","This guy had the secret of heaven-defying treasures on him, and he had just walked out of the zone of strong poison, so he definitely had seven-colored crystals.","\"Capture him!\" The seven people exchanged looks, and instantly reached a consensus. They moved to attack Ling Han.","They were all Spirit Transformation Tiers, and they were either Eighth or Ninth Change. Their abilities could be considered quite extraordinary.","Ling Han smiled faintly as he unleashed his murderous aura. Peng, peng, peng! Immediately, six people's minds were shattered, instantly dying on the spot. Only one person fortunately survived, though his face was filled with agony.","He was wearing a rare treasure of Spiritual Power, which could resist the barrage of divine sense attacks. However, after being barraged by the murderous aura, this rare treasure directly shattered. However, it was also because the rare treasure had blocked a portion of the barrage that he was fortunate enough to not die.","That person couldn't help but feel shocked. There were seven of them, and they were all Dao Child-level, but they actually couldn't even block a single move from Ling Han.","Who said that this guy had developed a huge problem in his cultivation?","He was clearly only a Spirit Transformation Tier, yet he was able to blast out Sect Master-level destructive power. He was still a super large monster.","He shivered in fear. At first, he had thought that he had encountered a great opportunity, but he had not thought that it would be his death.","\"Heh.\" Ling Han smiled coldly, and unleashed another murderous aura attack. Pu, that person's mind was forcefully shattered.","These seven people all had seven-colored crystals, and there were actually more than 200 in total, which allowed Ling Han to make a small fortune.","He found a place where the poison was relatively weakest, then began to fuse with the eighth spiritual body.","Three days later, he successfully completed the task.","Just like before, he had become much stronger, but it was as if his power had been sealed, and his abilities had decreased to First Change.","He did not think too much about it, and immediately went to redeem the dragon saliva.","\"Ling Han!\" Enemies were bound to meet on a narrow road. He had just swallowed the dragon saliva, when Kong Wuyang charged over.","Boom! His killing intent permeated through the air, and his attacks were as quick as lightning.","Ling Han did not linger in battle at all. He turned around and left.","\"Ling Han, aren't you very mighty and domineering?\" Kong Wuyang shouted through divine sense as he gave chase. \"I remember that you weren't so cowardly and afraid of death in the past.\"","He wanted to provoke Ling Han into turning around to fight.","However, how could Ling Han possibly pay any heed to him? Using Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, he quickly distanced himself from Kong Wuyang.","\"Don't worry, I'll personally chop off your wretched head,\" he said.","Kong Wuyang chased for a few more steps, but then stopped dejectedly.","It could not be helped. He really could not catch up.","He couldn't help but feel gloomy. Ling Han's power had clearly declined greatly, and there was a huge problem with his cultivation, but why did his speed not decrease at all? In fact, even he, a Sect Master and Imperial Son, couldn't catch up to him.","Phoenix Wings Divine Flight!\" he muttered. Only the supreme movement technique passed down by the True Phoenix possessed such extreme speed.","His eyes shone brightly, filled with greed.","This was another reason that he had to capture Ling Han. Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was something that even the Great Emperors of the past were very interested in.","\"I'll definitely catch you!\" he said balefully. Ling Han's cultivation had gone horribly wrong, and his abilities had clearly declined again. At this rate, it was possible that he would fall all the way to the True Self Tier.","Then, how difficult would it be for a Sect Master to kill a True Self Tier?","'I don't believe that your speed can still be so fast.'","He was a little worried. He definitely could not allow others to beat him to it.","...","After Ling Han walked for a while, he immediately found a place where the poison was weaker, and began fusing with the last spiritual body.","Whether it would be smiling proudly above the nine heavens, or falling into the abyss, that would depend on this time.","The present version of himself was incomparably powerful, easily fusing with the ninth spiritual body and absorbing it bit by bit.","It was only a little over two days later, and the ninth spiritual body had completely fused into his mind, and could not be separated.","Kuang!","At this moment, thunder suddenly rumbled in the heaven and earth. Dark clouds gathered densely, enshrouding the island of poison.","It should be known that ever since they had entered here, though there was day and night, there had never been any extreme weather. Thus, when they heard the thunder rumbling, and saw the dark clouds covering the sky, everyone was stunned.","What was going on here?","Could it be that they had been teleported to the island of lightning?","But even if it was the island of lightning, the lightning was still spread all over the plants on the island, so how could it be like this?","However, the Imperial Sons all frowned.","They were experienced and knowledgeable, and not only did they know a great many secrets from ancient records, even they themselves had once broken some kind of limit, and drawn out the heaven's calamity.","This was because someone had broken through their limits, and attracted the jealousy of heaven and earth!","Who was it?","Which guy was so lucky that he actually broke through his limits?","A few people immediately associated it with Ling Han, but soon shook their heads.","Impossible!","This guy's cultivation had developed a huge problem, and his abilities had dropped drastically. Yet, he could still break through his limits? What kind of joke was this?","Looking at the thunderclouds in the sky, everyone was curious.","Who... was this person?"]},{"number":4425,"title":"Chapter 4425 How Strong?","paragraphs":["Kuang, a bolt of lightning struck.","At the same time, in Ling Han's mind, a black shadow appeared.","Its appearance could not be seen clearly. It was completely formed from black mist, but it was exuding a terrifying murderous aura, as if it was a great demon that had killed countless people.","Boom!","It came with the bolt of lightning, but did not disappear with the bolt of lightning. It raised its hand and wreaked havoc in Ling Han's mind.","How could Ling Han allow it to act wantonly? This was formed from the power of heaven and earth, intent on killing him.","What did this mean?","Though no one had ever walked this path before, and the end of this path could not be seen, it was incredibly powerful, that even the heaven and earth would be jealous. Thus, they had sent down the internal demon, wanting to destroy his mind, and turn him into a living corpse.","\"Go!\" His Spiritual Power also transformed into a human figure that charged at the demonic shadow.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","He battled fiercely with the demonic shadow. It was clear that they were both on the level of divine sense, but every time they battled, it would cause tumultuous waves.","This demonic shadow was very strong. In fact, it had even reached the level of Sect Master.","If it were any other person, even if they too had cultivated to Tenth Change, they should have lost all hope by now, because cultivation level and the strength of divine sense were two different things. However, if it was Ling Han, his divine sense was similarly freakish.","After crossing over to the Other Side, his soul had undergone a complete transformation and reached a state of perfection.","He and the demonic shadow battled fiercely, both sides exchanging blows, both clashing head-on without any fancy moves.","Murderous aura!","Ling Han unleashed his most powerful divine sense attack. His divine sense transformed into a rain of swords that slashed toward the projection.","The demonic shadow took it head-on. When the rain of swords had completely dispersed, a few spikes had also stabbed into its body, causing it to dim slightly. However, it immediately launched a counterattack, opening its mouth and spitting out a swarm of black locusts.","These were naturally manifestations of willpower as well, but they were densely packed, as if they were monsters that had come from the depths of hell.","Ling Han threw a mighty punch.","Boom, the majority of the black locusts were destroyed by him, but there was also a small number that had become fish that had slipped through the net, and were biting towards him.","\"Wu!\" Ling Han let out a muffled groan. The destructive power of these locusts was really not small. When they landed on him, they spat out foreign martial intent, wanting to destroy him forcefully.","\"Go!\" he roared loudly, his soul glowing, transparent and flawless.","His soul had long since reached a state of perfection. In fact, it had even rushed up to the level of Sect Master. How could this be a joke?","Boom!","They battled again, blasted again, and fought again.","The demonic shadow was truly powerful. It was actually capable of clashing with Ling Han, whose soul was in a state of perfection. Meanwhile, the two bodies of divine sense were also continuously being exhausted. After every exchange of blows, shards of soul would fall from their bodies.","This was not something as simple as returning to the mind, but had rather vanished without a trace.","Ling Han's spiritual body was originally thirty meters tall, but now it was only nine meters tall.","Of course, with a single thought, he could still enlarge his spiritual body to 30 meters, but in terms of strength, it would definitely be much weaker.","The demonic shadow wasn't much better off either. Its body was similarly sliced, and it looked extremely miserable.","Yet Ling Han was not in a rush. Instead, he was pleased. Though a great many of his soul fragments had been erased, and it looked like his divine sense had dropped greatly, in terms of strength, it was a level higher than it had been.","Getting rid of the weaknesses and keeping the strengths, the toughness increased!","It should be known that his soul was already perfect in the first place, and if he further refined it on this basis, how terrifying would the strength of the purified soul be?","Heaven's calamity was both a tribulation and a great opportunity.","After enduring it, the strength of the soul would soar. It would almost be undying, which was naturally a great thing, but what if he couldn't endure it to the end, and his soul was forcefully destroyed by the demonic shadow? Then, he would be falling into the abyss.","Thus, this was a double-edged saber.","Ling Han was unafraid. He only had one thought, and that was battle.","Fight, fight, fight. The present him did not have any intention of winning, and only wanted to have a vigorous battle.","His soul form became smaller and smaller, and so did the demonic shadow. From thirty meters to nine meters, from nine meters to three meters, then to three feet, one foot, and then half an inch!","The two spiritual bodies were about to be obliterated, but they were still fighting endlessly.","\"Break!\"","Ling Han roared loudly as he threw his final punch.","Peng, the demonic shadow was completely destroyed by him, and vanished without a trace.","This was too dangerous. As long as the demonic shadow could withstand this move, the next counterattack would be enough to destroy Ling Han.","But no matter what, Ling Han had won.","\"Yi?\"","The demonic shadow was shattered, but the last soul fragment turned into incredibly pure energy, nourishing Ling Han's soul.","Even though it was only half an inch tall, it was incomparably dense. The strength of his soul had reached a terrifying extent. It was a supreme nourishment for the soul.","Ling Han's mind was vast and mighty, as if an indescribable change had taken place.","In an instant, Ling Han discovered that his mind had transformed into a golden ocean.","His spiritual form took form, but it was very ordinary and average, and did not have any iridescent light. However, with a raise of his hand, the Regulations of heaven and earth were within his grasp.","Using the Regulations of heaven and earth naturally depended on divine sense. The stronger the divine sense, the faster the speed of using the Regulations of heaven and earth, and the stronger its might.","Xiu, Ling Han opened his eyes, and two streaks of divine light surged out, shooting directly into the endless air, as if they could see through the heaven and earth.","However, his eyes immediately became ordinary, leaving behind only gentleness. The depth of his gaze was indescribable.","\"How... strong am I now?\"","Ling Han stood up and casually moved his limbs. He felt an endlessly terrifying power surge, as if he only needed a light punch to be able to destroy heaven and earth.","This was the Tenth Change, the only Tenth Change in history.","\"Not good, hungry!\"","Ling Han hurriedly ran over to the seven-colored giant, wanting to redeem the dragon saliva to relieve his hunger.","Tenth Change was not within the range of normal cultivation. Even Imperial Scroll would not be able to cultivate to this cultivation level, unless Ling Han came up with a unique idea, and created his own cultivation technique for this cultivation level.","Thus, if he wanted to complete the cultivation of this cultivation level now, the only way was to ingest natural treasures.","\"Ling Han!\" Kong Wuyang appeared again. He charged out from the sidelines, intercepting Ling Han.","This was practically even more clingy than Feng Miaoling.","Ling Han ignored him. He only had one thought now, and that was to quickly redeem the dragon saliva to resolve his indescribable hunger.","Using Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, he soon arrived at where the seven-colored giant was.","\"Four drops of dragon saliva.\" With a wave of his hand, he threw four hundred crystals at the seven-colored giant.","The seven-colored giant was quite straightforward, and directly threw out four drops of dragon saliva.","Ling Han opened his mouth and swallowed all four drops of dragon saliva. Instantly, his hunger began to subside.","However, this had only dispersed more than half of his hunger. He still felt hungry.","Yi, four drops wasn't enough?","After completing the Tenth Change, forming a qualitative change, even his appetite had increased?","Ling Han tossed out another 200 crystals, \"I'll trade for another two drops.\"","The seven-colored giant bared its mouth in a grin. After storing the crystal, it threw out another two drops of dragon's saliva.","Ling Han swallowed it in one gulp. Fiery energy surged through his body, finally dispersing that feeling of hunger. He could only vaguely feel it.","At this moment, Kong Wuyang had already caught up to him.","Ling Han turned around with a smile.","'Come, it's time for an accounting.'"]},{"number":4426,"title":"Chapter 4426 Crushed","paragraphs":["Seeing how Ling Han was clearly planning to fight him, Kong Wuyang couldn't help but be stunned.","Previously, he had provoked Ling Han repeatedly, wanting Ling Han to battle him, but Ling Han had not fallen for it. But now, Ling Han had taken the initiative and looked like he was about to start a confrontation, which made him extremely suspicious.","What was going on?","Why did this brat suddenly make this fatal decision?","Kong Wuyang frowned. There was definitely something off about this.","But the problem here was the aura that Ling Han was exuding was still that of Spirit Transformation Tier. Thus, Ling Han definitely hadn't solved the great problem in his cultivation, and he, on the other hand, with so much dragon saliva piled on him, was already a Two-Star Sect Master.","He was an Imperial Son of the Silver Generation. Just how terrifying would a Two Star Sect Master like him be?","Killing an ordinary Four-Star Sect Master should be child's play, right?","In this way, what did he have to worry about?","Empty city strategy.","He immediately thought. Ling Han was deliberately bluffing. His purpose was to scare him.","That should be the case.","\"Hahaha!\" Kong Wuyang laughed loudly, \"Ling Han, I have already seen through your tricks.\"","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"Do you feel that this scene is familiar?\"","At that time in the Ancestral King Academy, everyone had thought that he was done for, but what happened?","Kong Wuyang's expression involuntarily changed drastically. Back then, it was because of this that he had been thrashed by Ling Han, causing the Silver Generation to lose all face.","\"But you can't do it again. Do you think you can always be so lucky?\" he forced out through gritted teeth.","\"That's right.\" Ling Han nodded, without the slightest bit of modesty.","Kong Wuyang was furious. He had lost all patience, and moved directly, launching an attack at Ling Han.","'Die!'","Ling Han cracked a smile, brandished his fists, and greeted Kong Wuyang's attack.","Yi?","Kong Wuyang was a Silver Generation elite, after all, and was one of the strongest among the Imperial Sons. Naturally, he was extremely clever, and had outstanding intelligence.","If he was bluffing, why did Ling Han dare to return the attack instead of immediately turning around to flee?","That was because if Ling Han was putting on an act, he would immediately die from this attack.","Ling Han was extremely crafty, so how could he possibly be so stupid?","However... he was clearly Spirit Transformation Tier.","In an instant, countless thoughts surged through Kong Wuyang's mind. In the end, he did not withdraw this attack, but rather blasted it down directly.","He refused to believe that a Spirit Transformation Tier could defy the heavens.","He was a Two-Star Sect Master!","Boom, their attacks collided, instantly triggering a terrifying wave of energy. The Sect Master-level power boiled, instantly shattering all the plants and trees in the surroundings. Endless poisonous gas spread out, and had terrifying destructive power against the energy shield.","Xiu, Kong Wuyang was sent flying out of the poisonous gas, his face filled with shock and terror.","How, could this be!","In the clash, he, a Two Star Sect Master, was actually sent flying.","He hurriedly turned around and stood firmly. He felt his chest was slightly boiling, and his blood was not flowing smoothly.","Hiss, Ling Han's power was superior to his, though not by much.","Kong Wuyang's eyes widened, as he looked at Ling Han in disbelief.","\"Impossible! Absolutely impossible!\" he exclaimed in shock. \"You're clearly only Spirit Transformation Tier, so how can you stand against me?\"","No matter how freakish Ling Han was, having battle prowess on par with a Sect Master, Ling Han would only be able to fight against a One Star Sect Master, at most. Furthermore, the Sect Master would have to be on the level of a Dao Child.","Him?","A Two-Star Sect Master, and a Silver Generation one at that. In truth, he was comparable to a Dao Child-level Four Star Sect Master!","After reaching the level of Sect Master, how could there still be mediocre people?","Excluding heaven-defying geniuses, only Dao Child-level prodigies could soar to such heights.","Thus, it was as difficult as ascending the heavens to battle above one's cultivation level.","It was precisely because he knew this that Kong Wuyang was so stunned. A dignified Two Star Sect Master of the Silver Generation was actually sent flying by a Spirit Transformation Tier.","Who could believe this?","Even he could not accept this, all right?","Ling Han smiled and said, \"It can't be helped. I'm that strong!\"","Kong Wuyang took a deep breath. He finally understood why Ling Han had been so weak previously. It was not because he had experienced a huge problem in his cultivation, but rather because of the accumulation of power before the great explosion.","Once he had passed this stage, the hidden dragon would soar into the sky, its might shaking the world.","He was filled with extreme regret. If he had known earlier, he would have spared no expense to kill Ling Han.","However, he thought that Ling Han's cultivation had developed a huge problem, and he would only become weaker and weaker. Thus, he was naturally unwilling to use his trump card. Wouldn't that be a waste?","It was too late for regrets now.","What could he do?","He could only battle.","Kong Wuyang knew that Ling Han would definitely not let him off the hook easily after he had hunted him down so many times.","—If this was in the outside world, he would still be able to use the Imperial Clan as a scare tactic, but in a Mystery Realm? Hehe.","He didn't speak any nonsense, nor did he beg for mercy. He simply adjusted his state of mind to reach the peak stage. He wanted to have a vigorous battle.","\"Ling Han, even if you can kill me, you will have to pay a painful price,\" he said confidently.","\"Hehe, you think too highly of yourself.\" Ling Han shook his head, and suddenly charged out.","After being on the back foot for so long, he couldn't even defeat a Sixth Change or Seventh Change beast, causing Ling Han to be filled with anger.","Now, he was going to battle the world.","Boom, he threw a punch, and endless Regulations whistled, incredibly domineering.","With the support of Ling Han's current soul strength, Regulations were easily used.","Kong Wuyang was astonished. He hadn't imagined that not only was Ling Han's power so powerful that it surpassed him, but even his divine sense was so terrifying.","Could he summon such terrifying Regulations in an instant?","Kong Wuyang greeted the attack, and similarly interwove Regulations, turning them into a shield.","Peng!","With this strike, the shield immediately shattered. The fists of Regulations continued to attack, sending Kong Wuyang flying.","Pu, Kong Wuyang threw up blood madly, his eyes filled with panic and shock.","As powerful as he was, he was actually no match for a single strike from Ling Han?","In terms of power, he was only at a slight disadvantage. At first, he had thought that just because his cultivation level was higher, he would have an advantage in terms of divine sense. In a battle of Regulations, he would have an advantage. Who would have thought that he would still be on the side that was at a disadvantage?","The two disadvantages compounded, actually resulting in him being injured by Ling Han's attack.","I am a Two Star Sect Master!","Ling Han was also slightly surprised. He was actually capable of beating up a Two-Star Sect Master, Silver Generation, so easily.","Tenth Change... was truly terrifying.","\"How can you be so powerful?\" Kong Wuyang asked through gritted teeth, his face filled with defiance.","He knew that his speed was far inferior to Ling Han's, and before the seven-colored giant was released, this was a remote island, and there was no way to leave at all. Thus, he was a wild beast trapped in a cage, and could only fight to the death.","He knew very well what the result would be if he fought to the death.","Thus, he was unwilling to give up, and wanted to understand before he died.","Ling Han gave an 'oh', and said, \"I have cultivated Tenth Change.\"","Tenth Change!","Kong Wuyang was stunned, but he immediately shook his head, \"Impossible, Tenth Change isn't that powerful!\"","Ling Han was surprised, \"You've seen Tenth Change before?\"","\"Amongst the Golden Generation, there were a few that formed ten True Selves when they were at the True Self Tier. Naturally, they could reach the Tenth Change.\" Kong Wuyang humphed. This was a secret of the Imperial Clans, but since he was about to die, he did not care either.","Ling Han gave an 'oh'. So that was the Tenth Change he was talking about.","Actually, if he had not branded the True Self of Destruction on the Celestial Cauldron, he could have completely formed ten or even eleven True Selves, but would that kind of Tenth Change or Eleventh Change be as powerful as he was now?"]},{"number":4427,"title":"Chapter 4427 Crazy Woman","paragraphs":["The strength of True Self Tier would naturally depend on how many cores were branded on the Celestial Cauldron, but it would also depend on the quality of the cores themselves.","Thus, ultimately, under the premise that the Celestial Cauldron was fully covered, what was important was the size of the Celestial Cauldron.","The larger the Celestial Cauldron, the more awesome it was.","Thus, this was also related to the Cauldron Forging Tier.","Things like cultivation naturally depended on layer after layer. The stronger the foundation, the more likely it was to break through the limits.","It was precisely because of this that Ling Han had always focused on tempering his foundations. He would definitely not be careless in this aspect.","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"This Tenth Change of mine is different.\"","How was it different?","Questions flashed in Kong Wuyang's eyes, but he did not ask.","This was obviously a huge secret. If Ling Han was willing, he would naturally say, but if he wasn't, then it would be pointless for him to ask.","He was a Silver Generation elite; did he not have that kind of insight?","\"I only have nine spiritual bodies. However, when I reached the peak stage of the Ninth Change, I erased the spiritual bodies one by one and fused them into my own body,\" Ling Han explained.","Kong Wuyang was dumbfounded.","You maniac!","This was the only thought in his mind.","He was definitely a maniac. Who would have thought of destroying his spiritual bodies and fusing them with himself?","Because the spiritual body could self-destruct, allowing the self to instantly recover to its full state, fusing the spiritual body? Who would have thought of such a terrible idea? Wasn't it more or less the same as self-destructing the spiritual body?","However, Ling Han had still chosen this seemingly crazy path. He had actually opened up a new path.","The path of cultivation was like this in the first place. Generation after generation of predecessors would explore, excavate the limits, break through the limits, and from there, future generations could learn from them and imitate.","Thus, everyone who had walked a path that no predecessor had walked could be called a wise sage.","No wonder Ling Han's strength had been continuously declining previously. That was because Ling Han was obliterating his spiritual bodies. With every additional body that was obliterated, his strength would decrease further.","Kong Wuyang understood, but now, what else could he do but sigh?","Losing to such a maniac wouldn't be unjust, right?","\"We can only battle.\" Kong Wuyang's fighting spirit was reignited. An Imperial Son had never waited for death.","With a battle cry, he ignited the Imperial Blood, and blasted towards Ling Han.","He still had some backbone.","\"Alright, I'll send you on your way in this battle.\" Ling Han nodded, and attacked with his full strength, blasting towards Kong Wuyang.","Though the two of them had always been on opposing sides, but because of the other's performance in the face of death, Ling Han decided to give him a quick death.","Those with courage were still deserving of some respect.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","In just ten moves, Kong Wuyang was killed. It was useless even if he combusted his Imperial Blood.","The higher the cultivation level, the less helpful it would be to combust the Imperial Blood.","Ling Han searched Kong Wuyang's body. Insdide the few Spatial Tools, there were very few treasures.","\"Sigh, what Silver Generation? You're too poor, aren't you?\" Ling Han shook his head, and continued to search for the seven-colored crystals.","He wanted to cultivate to the end of the Spirit Transformation Tier, and now, he could only depend on natural treasures. Moreover, if he didn't gather enough seven-colored crystals, he wouldn't be able to leave this island.","Sounds of battle traveled over from ahead of him.","Fighting here was too common. Originally, Ling Han wasn't the type to join in on the excitement, but it just happened to be in his path, so he didn't deliberately avoid it. Thus, he continued to advance.","After walking out of a thicket, they saw that a person and a beast were engaged in an intense battle.","\"Yi?\"","Ling Han was astonished. This world was far too small.","The person battling with the wild beast was none other than Feng Miaoling.","\"Crazy woman!\" Ling Han blurted out.","Feng Miaoling faltered for a moment, then immediately flew into a rage.","She used her ultimate move, and the great river behind her surged violently. A figure that was completely wrapped in a black Battle Armor rushed out, and pounced towards the fierce beast, directly sinking into the fierce beast's body.","A strange thing happened. The ferocious beast's body immediately shriveled, and it instantly lost all vitality. Then, with a bang, it turned into dust, leaving behind only a seven-colored crystal.","Yi, what kind of deadly move was this? It was so powerful.","\"Yi, what technique is this?\" he asked curiously.","\"Die!\" How could Feng Miaoling possibly care about him? She immediately charged over.","This time, Ling Han naturally wouldn't flee, exchanging blows with Feng Miaoling.","Peng!","The two of them exchanged blows once. Feng Miaoling's figure only swayed slightly, but Ling Han was sent flying.","F***, this mad woman could possibly have charged up to become a Four-Star Sect Master, and added with the super battle prowess of the Golden Generation, her power far surpassed Ling Han's.","Thankfully, he could disperse the attack, and his physique was tough. He was only sent flying, but was completely unharmed.","Feng Miaoling was also taken aback. She hadn't thought that Ling Han would dare to face her head-on, and what was even more terrifying was that this despicable brat was actually only sent flying, completely unharmed.","Was this really a Spirit Transformation Tier?","She couldn't help but think. Previously, Ling Han had been able to cross the seas from the air. The freakish heaven-defying nature made her think that he had the aptitude of a Great Emperor, and now, was kind of performance something that even the Great Emperor of the past could do?","However, when she thought of how this despicable brat had been naked in front of her, she could not tolerate it at all.","'Die!'","She charged toward Ling Han.","Ling Han was unafraid. He stretched out his hand to grab the Regulations, which turned into a divine light that shot towards Feng Miaoling.","Feng Miaoling had no choice but to wave her hand to parry. This divine light of Regulations was on the level of Sect Master. Even if she was a Four-Star Sect Master, she still had to parry it. Otherwise, she would definitely be severely injured if she was hit.","In this way, she naturally could no longer pose a threat to Ling Han.","Her almond-shaped eyes widened, disbelief flickering in them.","The might of the Regulations was too terrifying. It was more or less comparable to her already.","Heavens!","What was a MinorAdvanced Tier? Why could a Sect Master be called a great elite?","Just because after advancing into this cultivation level, the control and use of the Regulations of heaven and earth would increase by another level, causing a crushing effect on Spirit Transformation Tier.","But now, a Spirit Transformation Tier could match her in terms of Regulations. This was far more shocking than the fact that Ling Han's power had reached the level of Sect Master.","Monster, he was definitely a monster.","\"I'd really like to see just how strong you are,\" Feng Miaoling said coldly. The great river behind her was turbulent and boundless, and black shadows kept charging out, causing her battle prowess to further increase.","Ling Han was completely unafraid. 'Who cares what you are? I will obliterate you with a single punch.'","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The two of them battled fiercely. In terms of power, it was naturally Ling Han who was at a disadvantage, but he was able to disperse the attack power, and his physique was also tough. This little disadvantage was completely negligible, and in terms of Regulations, it could be said that it was hard to decide who was stronger between the two of them.","Thus, even though the battle was intense, it was still difficult to determine the victor between the two of them.","If anyone saw this, they would exclaim in disbelief, completely unable to believe their eyes.","A Four-Star Sect Master, Golden Generation, was actually only capable of fighting Ling Han, a Spirit Transformation Tier, to a tie?","Heavens!","Ling Han only felt great. Such a carefree and unrestrained battle made him feel as if he had drunk a celestial fluid, which made him feel incredibly at ease.","It had been a long time since such a great battle had taken place.","After one day and one night, Feng Miaoling suddenly stopped.","Yi, why had they stopped fighting?","\"Your strength has gained my approval. I have decided to choose you as my husband.\""]},{"number":4428,"title":"Chapter 4428 What the Hell?","paragraphs":["Hey, hey, hey, what was going on here?","'Haven't you been calling for a beating and killing? Why have you suddenly fallen in love?'","Ling Han hesitated for a moment before asking, \"Did you take the wrong script?\"","Feng Miaoling wasn't angered. Instead, she smiled and said, \"Since ancient times, I've seen countless prodigies, but none of them can compare to you. So, the only one worthy of being my match should be you.\"","Had a fight become a matchmaking session?","Hold on.","Ling Han looked at him in surprise, \"You are not the Golden Generation, but have been sealed until now with the Primordial Source Clay?\"","Otherwise, why would she say that she had seen countless prodigies throughout history?","The Golden Generation had only lived for 100 or so years, so saying such words was far too laughable.","\"That's right.\" Feng Miaoling nodded.","Hiss, then where had this crazy woman popped out from? What was her relation with Yang Yihuan and He Luo?","Ling Han chuckled and said, \"I'm quite picky about my partner. I won't accept anyone older than me.\"","\"It's all right, as long as I like it.\" Feng Miaoling charged out again. This time, she wasn't going to kill Ling Han, but to make him submit.","Boom, the two of them began fighting again.","They exchanged blows, and it was still a stalemate.","Ling Han really didn't want to fight anymore. By now, Feng Miaoling had already lost all her animosity and killing intent. Rather than calling it a battle, it would be better to call it a spar. It was too boring.","Let's flee.","Previously, he had still wanted to spank this crazy woman's behind, and teach her a lesson, but from the look of things now, if he really beat her up, not only would this woman not be enraged, she would instead be incredibly overjoyed, and would stick to him even more.","Thus, it was better not to. He had to keep his distance.","Right at this moment, a loud rumble was heard from afar, and a massive figure appeared, as if it was indomitable.","The seven-colored giant had escaped.","Just in time.","Ling Han hurriedly used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and directly headed out of the island.","Feng Miaoling gave chase, but how could she possibly catch up?","She looked at the sky where Ling Han had disappeared, and a smile appeared at the corners of her lips, \"As expected of the man I have chosen, running so fast!\"","\"I'm definitely going to have you.\"","She hurriedly rushed to the harbor, and continued to chase after Ling Han.","...","Stepping on the threads of Regulations, Ling Han no longer used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. However, his speed was still astonishingly fast. After all, his current strength had increased again.","\"Not good, the feeling of hunger is back!\"","\"Hiss, could it be that I can't fight now?\"","Ling Han quickened his pace, and rapidly advanced.","However, even though he could fly, an island only appeared in front of him after 12 days.","It was still astonishingly huge, just like the previous six.","Ling Han climbed onto the island. The first thing he did was naturally to observe the terrain.","The plants here seemed to be transparent, and Ling Han carefully snapped one of them in half. Instantly, a terrifying tearing force assaulted him, as if it wanted to tear him into two.","Power of Space.","Ling Han circled around the island. He immediately discovered that if he wanted to go anywhere here, he would have to try his luck.","That was because as he walked, the space suddenly shifted. He took a step, and appeared a few hundred meters away, or even further away.","This was an island of space.","Forget it. As he walked on the island, he searched for anything that could be related to \"spatial crystals\".","Presumably, the giant here should need this kind of crystal.","The simplest method was naturally to kill the fierce beasts on the island, and immediately find out what the spatial crystal looked like.","His luck was not too bad, and very soon, he encountered a fierce beast.","This was a Sect Master-level beast. It had a strange appearance, and its entire body was covered with long red tentacles that fluttered lightly in the air.","The wild beast pounced, charging towards Ling Han.","Ling Han charged forwards. With just a few punches, he had killed this fierce beast, leaving behind a near-transparent crystal.","This was probably a spatial crystal.","Since he knew his target, Ling Han naturally wasn't in a hurry to find the giant on the island.","After a month, he found more than a hundred spatial crystals, but what depressed him was the fact that he actually had not found that spatial giant yet.","The space here was complicated, and he would be teleported from time to time. It was too difficult to directly reach his destination.","However, in this one month, Ling Han didn't waste any time. He found the spatial crystals, and at the same time, transmitted each node to a specific location, forming another map in his mind.","In this way, wherever he went somewhere on the island in the future, he would know what route he should choose.","At this moment, someone finally reached the island.","Another month passed, and Ling Han had more or less travelled all over this island. Finally, he found the corresponding giant.","This giant was also almost transparent, as if it was made of crystal, but there were Regulations flowing inside, which was very mysterious.","Ling Han breathed a sigh of relief. Recently, his hunger had become even more intense, and he had almost eaten all those spatial crystals. Now that he had finally met the giant, he could redeem them.","\"Ling Han!\" A voice rang out.","Shi Hao.","Ling Han stretched out a hand and pressed down, \"Hold on first.\"","He was too hungry, and was not in the mood to fight.","Shi Hao's face involuntarily twitched. What kind of reaction was this?","What do you take me for?","\"Ling Han!\" He raised his voice, and roared again. Then, he charged towards Ling Han.","Ling Han shook his head. As he dodged, he threw the 200 spatial crystals at the giant, \"Exchange for two drops of dragon saliva.\"","\"Little guy, you're working hard!\" the spatial giant said with a smile as he threw out two drops of dragon's saliva.","Ling Han dodged Shi Hao's attack, and opened his mouth to swallow the two drops of dragon saliva.","Surging energy surged, and his hunger instantly disappeared.","He laughed loudly, and looked towards Shi Hao, saying calmly, \"I haven't gone to find you yet, yet you have delivered yourself to my doorstep.\"","\"Ling Han, today is different from the past. Your glory is no more,\" Shi Hao Hao said proudly.","In his eyes, Ling Han was forced to cultivate some strange technique because of the sudden appearance of Yang Yihuan, Myriad Dao, and the others. As a result, a huge problem arose, and his cultivation level declined instead of advancing.","And now, you still want to threaten me?","Haha.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and crooked a finger at Shi Hao. \"Come, I'm in a good mood now, so I'll play with you.\"","\"Stop pretending to be strong.\" Shi Hao humphed, \"Your little deception has long since been seen through. No matter how pretentious you are, it would not be able to conceal the fact that you are weak on the inside.\"","Ling Han clapped his hands, and said, \"I've let you say everything, so let's battle.\"","\"That's precisely my intention.\" Shi Hao moved. His only worry was that Ling Han would run, and he really couldn't catch up to him.","However, how could Ling Han possibly escape this time?","He stretched out a finger, and tapped on Shi Hao.","\"Ignorant!\" Shi Hao sneered, while surprise rose up in his heart. How did Ling Han dare to face him head-on?","Where did you get such courage from?","He didn't care. Ling Han choosing to exchange blows with him instead of running was exactly what he wanted.","\"I'll send you on your way!\" he roared. He unleashed his full power, aiming to kill Ling Han with a single strike. In any case, plucking Ling Han's soul would allow him to know all of his secrets."]},{"number":4429,"title":"Chapter 4429 The stone door appears again","paragraphs":["Ling Han shook his head, and pressed down with his hand. Shi Hao's attack was forcefully stopped.","Hiss, Shi Hao instantly inhaled sharply.","This was too terrifying.","He was a Two Star Sect Master, so just how terrifying was his attack? Yet, it was easily blocked by Ling Han? Just how inconceivable was this?","Weren't you in the Spirit Transformation Tier? Weren't you having a great problem in cultivation?","'F*ck! What the f*ck!'","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"Your uncle is still your uncle. How is it? Are you convinced now?\"","Shi Hao was speechless. Ling Han had easily blocked his attack, which meant that Ling Han's strength was far superior to his.","There was absolute disbelief in his heart, but reality surpassed all else, rendering him speechless.","After a long while, he asked darkly, \"Why?\"an","After all, he was the Imperial Son, so he had already regained his composure.","\"Because I'm strong,\" Ling Han said with a smile.","This show-off.","Shi Hao really wanted to slap Ling Han, but he didn't have the strength to do so, so he could only swallow his anger.","\"There's nothing else to say. We can only battle.\" His fighting spirit was firm. Even if he was outmatched, he could not bring shame to the pride of the Imperial Clan.","Moreover, even if he was willing to swallow his pride and beg for mercy, would Ling Han show any mercy?","Ling Han nodded. In a life-or-death situation, the Imperial Clan still had some backbone. No wonder when the Yin souls invaded, the Imperial Clans didn't just bother about themselves.","After all, there was still the blood of the Great Emperor flowing in their bodies. No matter how despicable they were, they would not fall to the level of currying favor from their enemies.","\"Alright, I'll let you die a more dignified death.\"","Shi Hao laughed loudly, \"It is still unknown who will emerge victorious!\"","He was the first to move. Using the Imperial Technique, he extracted the Dao of Heaven and Earth, which turned into a divine spear that stabbed towards Ling Han.","Ling Han merely threw a punch. Peng, the divine spear immediately crumbled.","The force of his punch did not diminish, and continued to smash towards Shi Hao.","Shi Hao sighed. He was really no match for Ling Han.","There was nothing much to say. Weng, nine spiritual bodies walked out of his body, and along with himself, fled in ten different directions.","Yi, wasn't it agreed that they would only battle?","Ling Han shook his head, and leaped out. Phoenix Wings Divine Flight unfolded, and his speed was instantly raised to its peak.","Did he think that just because he didn't have a spiritual body, he couldn't deal with this trick?","Peng!","He instantly caught up to a spiritual body and threw a punch with his right fist. Destructive Energy surged, and with a single strike, the spiritual body was obliterated.","Ling Han gave chase again. With a single step, the flaming phoenix wings flapped, and he had already caught up to the second spiritual body.","Peng, it was still destroyed with a single punch.","Only by combining the spiritual bodies with the self could one form the most powerful battle prowess of the Minor Advanced Tier. This was also why Ling Han had insisted on fusing the spiritual bodies into the self.","Now that Shi Hao had released all of his spiritual bodies, though this had increased the success rate of his escape, it had similarly weakened the battle prowess of himself and his spiritual bodies by tenfold.","In the first place, he was no match for Ling Han, what more when his own battle prowess was decreased?","One punch, one kill, without a doubt.","Shi Hao was greatly shocked. He had not thought that the two spiritual bodies would only be able to block two punches from Ling Han, and would not be able to have the effect of detaining him.","At this moment, Ling Han took another step and caught up to the third spiritual body.","Peng, it was still destroyed with a single punch.","However, at this moment, Shi Hao had already rushed to a spatial transfer node. Xiu, he instantly disappeared without a trace.","He had already appeared 6000 meters away.","Ling Han ignored him, and continued to hunt down the spiritual bodies.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","One punch, one person, and only another seven punches, and all the spiritual bodies were completely destroyed.","Shi Hao was extremely flustered, and hurriedly arrived at the next transfer point. Xiu, with another transfer, he had already arrived at the other side of the island.","The distance of teleportation this time was even greater.","He should have thrown Ling Han off his tail by now.","Shi Hao thought to himself. He naturally did not dare to relax and be careless, and continued to rapidly run forwards.","However, as he ran, another person suddenly appeared in front of him.","Ling Han!","He was numb with shock. How was this possible?","Ling Han had actually appeared in front of him?","Ling Han smiled faintly, \"I know the transfer node of every place here like the back of my hand, so... it is naturally nothing strange for it to appear in front of you.\"","'Still not strange? You're a monster!'","Shi Hao did not know what else to say. Previously, he had still been able to make a bold claim: only battle. But now? His nine spiritual bodies had all been destroyed, and he was not even qualified to put his life on the line.","\"Any last words?\" Ling Han asked.","\"Whether it is the Golden Generation, Yang Yihuan, or Myriad Dao, they all have the ability to kill you. I will wait for you in the underworld!\" Shi Hao shouted loudly. He knew that this time, it would definitely be difficult for him to escape the calamity.","\"Heh, you had best wait for me to send them down to accompany you.\" Ling Han shook his head, and shot out a punch.","Peng! Shi Hao was instantly killed. Under the effects of the Destructive Energy, the Substitution Seal was also rendered ineffective, and he died completely.","Ling Han searched for a while, and took away the Spatial Spirit Tool that Shi Hao had.","He strode off, and continued to search for spatial crystals to increase his cultivation level, charging to the end of the Tenth Change.","Now that he had reached this stage, he could no longer rely on cultivation techniques to cultivate. He could only rely on natural treasures.","Time passed slowly, and Ling Han collected more and more spatial crystals. He encountered Feng Miaoling, the crazy woman, a few more times. This woman was indeed determined to take him as her husband. She would chase him every time she saw him, and would not give up no matter what.","Finally, more than half a year later, the spatial giant escaped.","Instantly, everyone scattered like birds and beasts, fleeing for their lives.","Ling Han walked through the air. No one's speed could compare to his.","However, the situation this time was slightly different.","He had already flown on the sea for fifteen days, but there was still no land ahead of him.","Yi, could it be that there wasn't an eighth island?","He flew for another seven days, and finally, a horizon appeared in the distance.","What would the eighth island be?","That's not right!","Ling Han was astonished. This wasn't an island, but rather a stone door!","Heavens, there was a massive stone door on the sea. It was as large as land, and towered into the clouds. Merely its aura was filled with intimidation.","Ling Han walked for a while longer, and then arrived at the stone door.","This wasn't the stone door at the entrance to Imperial Path. It wasn't as large as it looked, but it was also filled with an ancient aura, as if it had transmigrated from the primitive age.","There were also various carvings on the stone door.","Ling Han looked closely. The top was the True Dragon, True Phoenix, Qilin and other Divine Beasts. Next, there were human figures, but some of them had bird wings, while others had flaming bodies.","Yi!","Ling Han suddenly faltered. He saw a familiar figure.","Ancestral King Pan Shi!","Ling Han had heard many legends about the Great Emperors, but the only Great Emperor that he had truly \"seen\" was Ancestral King Pan Shi.","That was because he had obtained a portion of Ancestral King Pan Shi's memories, regarding how this Great Emperor had grown from a stubborn rock to a supreme overlord.","He was certain that there were a few carvings on the stone door that were related to this Ancestral King.","Why?","Ling Han was astonished. Why was the image of the Ancestral King Pan Shi here?","Who had inscribed it?","Hold on, there were Divine Beasts such as the True Dragon, the True Phoenix and so on at the top, as well as later Great Emperors such as Ancestral King Pan Shi... hiss, could it be that what was engraved on this was the Great Emperors of all generations?"]},{"number":4430,"title":"Chapter 4430 The Great Emperor appears","paragraphs":["Ling Han looked up at this stone door, his face filled with surprise.","Was this a family portrait of the Great Emperors?","His eyes swept over them, and memorized the appearances of the Great Emperors one after another.","Yi, was this the ancestor of Brother Monkey, the Battle Saint Emperor?","Ling Han saw a Great Emperor with the face of a monkey. He wielded a metal staff, and there was also a tail growing from his behind. It was clearly just a stone carving, yet it exuded a boundless domineering aura that wanted to pierce a hole into heaven and earth.","\"And this is the ancestor of the perverted pig?\"","He saw another Great Emperor. He actually had a pig's head, and held a nine-tooth rake in his hand, exuding a wild aura.","\"It can't be, right? The pervert pig really has a Great Emperor Tier-level ancestor!\"","Ling Han had always thought that the perverted pig was just boasting. Judging by its appearance, it did not have the slightest bit of the bearing of a descendant of a Great Emperor.","Sigh, but he just had to be.","Ling Han's knowledge of Great Emperors was limited, and he could only identify a few Great Emperors. As for the others, he could only keep them in mind. When he found some information in the future, he would make a correct identification.","\"There would be lapses in history from time to time. In fact, even now, it is impossible to calculate exactly how many Great Emperors have appeared in history.\"","\"However, in this place, the image of every Great Emperor is clearly displayed.\"","\"It should be known that it is not every Great Emperor that has walked through Imperial Path.\"","\"Strange, who exactly carved this?\"","Ling Han was curious. He tried to bombard the great doors, but even if he used Destructive Energy, the stone doors still did not move. He was completely helpless.","Hiss, what cultivation level did the person who had carved it have?","Saints couldn't enter this place!","Ling Han couldn't figure it out no matter what. Involuntarily, he couldn't help but feel angry, and punched the stone door.","Instantly, a terrifying aura appeared, and a figure actually walked out of the stone door.","Instantly, a terrifying aura appeared, and a figure actually walked out of the stone door.","F***, Ling Han was dumbfounded. This was actually the Great Emperor that his fist had landed on.","Without another word, this Great Emperor immediately launched an offensive at Ling Han.","It was only a simple palm strike, but it was world-shaking, and was extremely perfect.","Ling Han hurriedly brandished his fists to parry. Boom, boom, boom! The two of them battled fiercely.","This Great Emperor clearly wasn't real, but he definitely wasn't just an empty image either. His battle prowess was incredibly terrifying.","The Great Emperor was naturally domineering. His punches and palm strikes all exuded a might that could suppress the heavens and earth.","After a few moves, Ling Han immediately understood.","The cultivation level of this Great Emperor was unknown, but his power was completely equal to his. This was a completely equal-level battle in the true sense of the word.","In the eyes of others, this was practically hopelessness.","This was a Great Emperor, the synonym for invincible in the world. Even if his cultivation level was suppressed, he should still be invincible among his peers. Who could match him?","But for Ling Han, his ultimate goal had always been a Great Emperor. So what if he faced a Great Emperor at the same cultivation level?","He was unafraid. In fact, he was confident that he could defeat him.","'Come!'","His fighting spirit soared, and he began to battle with the projection of the Great Emperor.","Where had the Great Emperor gone after his death?","The soul had not gone to the Netherworld, but had rather been directly absorbed by the heaven and earth, and become a part of it. Thus, it should be very normal for the heaven and earth to be able to manifest the image of the Great Emperor.","Yi, going by that theory, could it be that the Battle Saint Emperor had already died?","Peng!","He gritted his teeth. The palm strike from the projection of the Great Emperor had landed on his left shoulder, almost breaking his bones. He did not dare to be distracted any longer.","This was a Great Emperor!","Ling Han set everything else aside, and only had the thought of battle.","A Great Emperor at the same cultivation level was really too strong.","What Golden Generation? Compared to the real Great Emperor, they were practically trash. He really did not know how they could bring themselves to compare themselves to the Great Emperors of the past.","In a battle of equal cultivation levels, Ling Han was confident that he could suppress any Golden Generation single-handedly. However, the projection of a Great Emperor was completely capable of opposing him. It was so powerful that it could destroy the heavens and earth, and was indescribably domineering.","However, the victor would definitely be me.","Ling Han let out a battle cry, and countered aggressively, not showing any weakness at all.","However, he soon fell into a disadvantage.","Why? It was clear that his power was not weak.","Ling Han quickly understood. That was because the Great Emperor had created his own path. Thus, even though their power was clearly equal, he still had the upper hand in terms of battle prowess.","After all, power was only a part of battle prowess.","After understanding this, Ling Han counterattacked as he continued to smooth out the path he had taken.","However, this was only the beginning, and it was still far from being complete.","This was just right. He could use this opportunity to continue expanding his territory.","However, after battling for only a day, the projection of the Great Emperor disappeared.","Ling Han immediately sat down in a cross-legged position, recalling the previous battle scenes, capturing every mistake he had made, and then went to make adjustments.","This help was really too great.","Who could ask a Great Emperor to personally spar with them?","No wonder this was called Imperial Path.","A day later, Ling Han continued to issue challenges.","It was very simple. Whichever Great Emperor you wanted to challenge, you would have to pat on the corresponding stone carving of the Great Emperor, and the image of the Great Emperor would appear.","Fight, fight, fight.","The battle time of the Great Emperor's projection was limited, with each battle lasting one day.","This was enough.","Ling Han pondered for a day every day he battled. Slowly, he discovered that his battle prowess was increasing.","This was inconceivable. Logically speaking, he should have long since touched the ceiling of Spirit Transformation Tier-level battle prowess, but on these strongest foundations, he was still steadily improving. It had to be admitted that this was a miracle.","After a month, Ling Han discovered that there was finally a clear direction on the path he wanted to take.","It was still far from the finishing line, but finally, it was no longer vague.","On the other hand, when he was fighting against the projection of the Great Emperor, he had also turned from returning two strikes in every ten strikes to returning three strikes in every ten strikes.","His improvement was obvious!","Another half month later, others finally arrived.","Feng Miaoling.","However, this time, Feng Miaoling merely smiled beautifully at him before turning her attention to the massive stone door, a reverent expression on her pretty face.","These were the generations of Great Emperors, and any one of them was an overlord that had suppressed an era, so they were naturally deserving of respect.","She seemed to be very familiar with this, and immediately sent out a palm strike, activating the projection of a Great Emperor, and began to battle.","This was very normal. She was also an old prodigy like Yang Yihuan. She had entered the Imperial Path more than once, and at most, it was because she had not chosen the same rainbow bridge before. Thus, it was normal that she was very familiar with this place.","The power of the Great Emperor that she had battled against had increased considerably, and was completely in line with hers. This was a true battle of equal cultivation levels.","However, she was completely inferior to Ling Han. They had only exchanged a hundred moves, and she had already been defeated.","Feng Miaoling showed a hint of defiance, but at the same time, there was also a sliver of pride.","She was brimming with confidence, and she thought that she would be able to rival a Great Emperor at the same cultivation level this time. However, she had still lost terribly, and she hadn't been able to fight back at all. She had been defeated after enduring 100 exchanges. However, how many people could withstand 100 exchanges from a Great Emperor at the same cultivation level?","With this in mind, she couldn't help but turn to look at Ling Han.","If it was this guy, he should be able to last three hundred moves... no, five hundred moves.","After all, he was the man that she had her eye on, so it was only natural that he was so strong.","Of course, he was definitely no match for the Great Emperor.","It was not that Ling Han was really inferior to the Great Emperor of the past, but rather because this was a Great Emperor that had had his power suppressed, and not a Great Emperor that had not attained Dao. These were two completely different matters.","Right at this moment, Ling Han stood up and slammed his palm onto the stone door."]},{"number":4431,"title":"Chapter 4431 Opening the doors","paragraphs":["Peng! Ling Han slammed his palm onto the stone door.","A streak of light shot out in response, turning into the projection of a Great Emperor.","Without another word, this projection of the Great Emperor immediately charged towards Ling Han. Every move was indescribably amazing. It was clear that their power was equal, but the might that the Great Emperor delivered was still much stronger.","Ling Han let out a battle cry, and charged forwards fearlessly.","Immediately, Feng Miaoling's beautiful eyes widened, completely in disbelief.","What, what, what!","Ling Han was actually exchanging blows with the projection of the Great Emperor!","No, no, no. He was not that powerful yet. Instead, in every ten moves, he could return three moves.","But even so, she was still completely stunned.","For example, she was already the strongest Imperial Daughter, and had walked through Imperial Path quite a few times, tempering her battle prowess to the pinnacle, but she was still unable to fight back in the face of the projection of the Great Emperor.","To compare oneself with another, it was really infuriating.","This was really a monster!","Though Ling Han was still at a disadvantage, if this corresponding Great Emperor had really returned to his youth, he may not be a match for Ling Han.","Firstly, the Great Emperor might not have reached Ling Han's level at that time. After all, for a Spirit Transformation Tier to be capable of rivalling a Sect Master, or even Two Star or Three Star Sect Master, this was unheard of, and no Great Emperor had ever done so when he was young.","Secondly, the reason why these projections of Great Emperors were so powerful was because they possessed battle experience on the level of Great Emperors. They had already forged their own paths.","Thus, even if their power was suppressed, they were still no match for these projections.","But what about Ling Han?","Monster, a super monster.","Feng Miaoling stared blankly. She had already overestimated Ling Han, but from the look of things now, she had still underestimated him. Furthermore, she had far underestimated him.","So strong. As it turned out, even before becoming Emperor, he could still be as strong as this.","She shook her head, and for the first time, felt dispirited. As it turned out, she was still very far from being the strongest.","Then, she broke into a smile.","It didn't matter. The strongest would be her man.","After battling for a day and night, the projection of the Great Emperor disappeared.","Ling Han immediately began to digest this precious battle experience. He had already reached a point. If he could cross over, he was sure that he would be able to take another solid step on his own path.","The night passed, and more people came. Moreover, they came one after another, almost endlessly.","Three Imperial Sons arrived, but they were all ordinary-level. Then, it was Dao Child, and practically all of them were Dao Childs. The remaining were mediocre, and no longer had the right to come here.","When they saw Ling Han, these people all revealed heated expressions.","In their eyes, Ling Han was a walking great opportunity that they could grasp.","\"Who dares?\" Seeing Ling Han sitting in a cross-legged position, it was obvious that he was digesting his experience from the battle. Feng Miaoling immediately stepped out and drew her treasured sword. Her cold eyes swept over them, her killing intent blazing.","\"Miss, this has nothing to do with you. Don't protect this person, or else—\"","Pu!","A Dao Child wanted to open his mouth to threaten her, but before he could finish his words, Feng Miaoling beheaded him with a slash of her sword.","Sword light danced unhindered, its might terrifying.","This instantly intimidated everyone, and they shivered, not daring to speak any further.","She was a demonic woman, who would kill at the slightest disagreement.","The three Imperial Sons also frowned. Though Feng Miaoling had only made one move, it made them realize that this woman was incredibly frightening. Even they themselves may not be a match for her.","But this was such a good opportunity!","Ling Han's cultivation had developed a huge problem, and his abilities had fallen to rock bottom. This was the best time to kill him. Why had a demonic woman suddenly appeared out of nowhere?","\"May I ask how should I address you, miss?\" An Imperial Son asked Feng Miaoling.","The three Imperial Sons were all conflicted. Why was Ling Han so good with women?","Previously, there was Chi Menghan, and now, there was Feng Miaoling. They both had the aptitude of the Golden Generation, yet they had both been blind enough to fall in love with Ling Han.","\"Get lost!\" Feng Miaoling had no intention of answering at all. She slashed out with her sword, capable of piercing through the heavens.","The sword slashed over, and that Imperial Son hurriedly retreated, his face completely pale with shock.","She was too strong. He was completely no match for her.","Was this the Golden Generation?","\"This is my future husband. Whoever dares to touch him will become enemies with me, Feng Miaoling!\" the woman declared proudly.","At this moment, everyone was about to have a breakdown.","Why would such a powerful Imperial Daughter actually take a fancy to a weak piece of trash like Ling Han?","Hadn't this guy developed a huge problem in his cultivation? Hadn't he long since fallen off the pedestal?","Why, how could such a trashy guy still manage to court the Imperial Daughter?","How could this be believed?","There was nothing else they could do. These people could only go and activate the Great Emperor's carving on the stone door. Fighting with this kind of existence was a rare experience. It was too helpful.","Most people would only be able to last ten moves before being defeated, and some people were even insta-killed.","This was not just a great opportunity, but also a great danger.","It was as if it was saying, \"The might of the Great Emperor cannot be insulted. You can't even block a single move, and you still want to spar with the Great Emperor?\"","Naturally, the only fate was death.","In this way, everyone shivered. They had all decided to recover to their prime condition, and only then would they issue another challenge.","Meanwhile, Ling Han had sunk into a state of deep comprehension. On his own path, he was about to take a very crucial step. Thus, he had completely no time to continue the challenge.","Another three days later, a terrifying aura swept over.","\"Not good!\" Everyone shivered. A supreme elite was about to arrive.","As expected, after only an instant, seven black dots appeared in the horizon. Then, they rapidly enlarged, turning into seven figures that became larger and larger. They were all giants that were as tall as three hundred meters.","Flame-shaped, ice-formed, lightning-shaped... the giants from the seven islands!","Hiss, they actually charged over together.","These were all Venerate Tiers, and not one of them could be resisted by the combined forces of everyone here, let alone seven of them.","This was a supreme killing tribulation.","Ling Han also woke up at the right moment. This aura was too terrifying, and he naturally could no longer sit still.","He swept an eye over Feng Miaoling, yet saw that there was not the slightest bit of panic in her eyes.","Then it should be fine, because she had entered the Imperial Path more than once.","The others weren't like this. They all boarded the wooden rafts and paddled with all their might.","However, how fast was Venerate Tier?","They would arrive in an instant!","Feng Miaoling glanced at him, and only Ling Han remained calm. As for the others, even the Imperial Sons looked terrified.","She couldn't help but feel a sense of pride. As expected of the man she had her eye on. He was calm in the face of any situation, unlike those idiots.","The seven giants charged over, but they didn't give a toss about Ling Han and the others. Instead, they stared at the stone door.","\"Brothers, it's time for revenge.\"","\"Charge in!\"","The seven giants pushed open the stone door at the same time. Hong long long, the stone door immediately released a loud sound, and then a crack appeared.","As expected of Venerate Tier. Ling Han had already tried before, and was completely unable to push open the stone door in the slightest.","Obviously, only when the seven giants were released, would they be able to push open the stone doors, and step into the next stage of Imperial Path.","Soon, the crack in the door became wider and wider, and then the door was completely open.","The seven giants did not cast a look at any of them, and directly passed through the great doors, charging out."]},{"number":4432,"title":"Chapter 4432 North Prosperity City","paragraphs":["Everyone breathed a sigh of relief. They had not thought that the crisis would pass so easily.","After resting for a while, someone still wanted to challenge the projection of the Great Emperor, but discovered that there was no reaction from the stone door.","The others went up to give it a try, and the result was the same.","Obviously, after the doors opened, the \"benefits\" were gone.","This should be a reward for those who had rushed here the earliest. Fighting with a Great Emperor of the same cultivation level would be of great help.","To say who had benefited the most, it was naturally Ling Han. He had arrived too early, and was at least one and a half months ahead of the others. How many times had he exchanged blows with the projection of the Great Emperors?","Helpless, everyone could only enter the great doors one by one. Obviously, this was their next stop.","After passing through the stone door, a plain appeared ahead of them, and looking further behind them, where were the stone doors?","It was clear that there was no turning back now that they had reached this place. They could only forge onwards bravely.","Quite a number of people turned their eyes to Ling Han. This was a great opportunity, and there was a supreme opportunity hidden on him. Furthermore, he himself was in his weakest state, and one only had to move, and he would be able to snatch it.","But when they saw Feng Miaoling standing next to Ling Han with a murderous look on her face, everyone had no choice but to bow their heads.","They could not afford to trifle with her.","They all advanced, fearing that the demonic woman would suddenly develop killing intent and start a massacre.","Ling Han also leaped up, and headed into the distance.","\"Wait for me!\" Feng Miaoling gave chase.","However, how could Ling Han possibly listen? He unfurled his flaming phoenix wings, and his speed increased instead of decreasing.","Feng Miaoling had only chased a few steps, and Ling Han had already disappeared. She was so furious that she stomped her feet.","Everyone gritted their teeth upon seeing this. With such a heaven-defyingly powerful Imperial Daughter by your side, you actually dislike her? And what struck them even harder was the fact that Feng Miaoling had absolutely no intention of giving up, stubbornly continuing her pursuit.","Sigh!","Comparisons were truly infuriating.","Ling Han set off quickly, and after walking for half a day, a city actually appeared ahead of him.","Yi?","There were no city walls in this city, and it was completely open. One could enter the city from any direction.","Ling Han strolled in, and the city was bustling with noise and excitement.","He activated his eye technique and looked over. However, he was surprised because everyone had the flame of life flickering in their bodies.","These were all real living beings, and not manifestations of heaven and earth.","He did not act rashly. Instead, he strolled around first, and discovered that though there were no inns here, there were still restaurants.","Hence, he entered into the restaurant, and began his investigation.","On the Imperial Path, there were a total of nine such cities. This city was called North Prosperity City, and could be considered as a relay station. It was said that further down, there were many dangers. One out of ten people that entered could come back out.","Thus, those who did not have the courage could stay here. That was because once they reached this place, when the Imperial Path closed, they would be teleported out, and if they did not reach this city, they could only be trapped here forever.","Additionally, it was said that there was also an envoy here, who would select the strongest person and deliver a Qingfeng Order.","However, what exactly was the use of the Qingfeng Order? Everyone was vague in their words, and did not have a specific explanation.","Additionally, no one knew who the envoy was. They only knew that this envoy would observe them secretly, and quietly bestow the Qingfeng Order on them.","—It seemed like the people here were deliberately spreading knowledge to outsiders. There was no need for you to deliberately ask around at all. You only had to sit here for a while, and all the information would be revealed to you.","Ling Han and the others weren't the first batch of people to enter the city. Previously, two groups of people had already arrived.","In other words, it was not only those who had chosen this rainbow bridge, but also those who had taken other rainbow bridges. They had reached this city before them.","Ling Han thought for a moment. The people in the city had said that there were a total of nine such cities on the Imperial Path, and there were 99 rainbow bridges. Then, it should be that the people from every eleven rainbow bridges would gather in one city.","Now that there were the people from three rainbow bridges, there was still a shortage of the people from the eight other bridges.","What was the Qingfeng Order?","Ling Han could leave, but he could also stay and see if he could obtain the Qingfeng Order.","—If he had known earlier, he should have asked Feng Miaoling for guidance.","This thought flashed through his mind, and Ling Han immediately shook his head. Forget it, forget it, he'd better forget it. She was already so enthusiastic now, so if he showed her any goodwill, he really wouldn't be able to throw her off his tail forever.","Ling Han settled down in the city. Though there were no inns here, with his cultivation level, where could he not rest?","It wasn't long before those who had exited the stone door arrived one after another. Not long after, they also received the same information as Ling Han. Only a very small number of people left, and the majority stayed behind.","Those who left did not have any confidence in themselves, and thought that it was impossible for them to obtain the Qingfeng Order, so there was no need to waste time.","It wasn't long before the news of Ling Han's cultivation developing some huge problem spread throughout the entire city.","The evidence was irrefutable, because the majority of the people who entered the city in the third wave had participated in the hunt for Ling Han. Furthermore, at the stone door previously, it was also because Feng Miaoling had stepped out bravely, which saved Ling Han's life.","Instantly, quite a number of people were restless, wanting to capture Ling Han and kill him to snatch the fated opportunity from him.","When Ling Han heard about this, he couldn't help but laugh in spite of himself. At that time, he had been studying his own path, and was not in the mood to pay attention to these trash at all. Yet, this caused others to be even more certain that some problem had developed in his cultivation.","He had no intention of explaining either. This was even better. Whoever wanted to take advantage of his misfortune, he would make them pay the price.","Day after day passed, and more and more people arrived at North Prosperity City. A month later, there were already seven groups of people that had arrived, and they were all people that had taken different rainbow bridges.","There were still four batches.","Another month passed, and the last four groups of people had also arrived.","With this, North Prosperity City was bustling with noise and excitement. There were almost 3000 outsiders, and they were all at least at the Spirit Transformation Tier. The number of Imperial Sons had also reached 30, and this was a very powerful force.","Immediately, the Imperial Sons suggested organizing a martial arts tournament.","Wasn't there an envoy hidden among the ordinary citizens, bestowing the Qingfeng Order on whoever was the strongest?","In that case, wouldn't it be simpler to hold a martial arts competition and directly decide the strongest among them?","With the Imperial Sons taking the lead, the various rules of the martial arts competition were also drafted, one after another.","Because there was still a hidden observer, no one dared to go too far. What if they missed out on the Qingfeng Order because of this reason, then wouldn't that be a great loss?","It wasn't long before the competition began.","It was very simple. Sixteen high platforms had been erected in the plaza of the city. Whoever was capable could stand on them to guard the arena for ten days and face challengers. After ten days, the sixteen people standing on the arena would be seeds, and they would be able to enter into the knockout battles for the top sixteen.","In this manner, eight would be chosen from the sixteen, four from the eight, two from the four, and then the final battle would be held, and the strongest person would naturally appear.","Another day later, tall platforms were erected, and the tournament began.","These high platforms were all built from special stone materials, and possessed powerful resistance. They could even withstand the attacks of Sect Masters. They would not be destroyed abruptly in battle.","Ling Han also strolled over. He wasn't in a hurry to go on stage.","\"Yi, Ling Han?\"","\"He actually dares to come here?\"","\"It can't be that he too wants to participate in the tournament, right?\"","\"Hahaha!\"","Everyone burst into laughter. A piece of trash actually dared to come and embarrass himself?","Ling Han stroked his chin. Some people were asking for a beating."]},{"number":4433,"title":"Chapter 4433 Step Out","paragraphs":["\"You guys... are you all asking for a beating?\" Ling Han swept an eye over them, a faint smile on his face.","\"Hahahaha!\" Everyone burst into laughter.","In their eyes, this was the most powerless threat. It was said that Ling Han's power had already dropped to the First Change of the Spirit Transformation Tier, and he could be suppressed by anyone here.","He still dared to issue threats? Hehe.","\"Ling Han, aren't you going to take a piss and look at your reflection?\"","\"That's right, don't you have any idea how weak you are?\"","\"Come, come, come, let me battle you!\"","\"No, I'll do it.\"","Everyone scrambled over one another, wanting to have a battle with Ling Han. After all, Ling Han had been in the limelight too much previously. Whoever could become the first person to defeat Ling Han would definitely be famous.","Moreover, Ling Han still possessed a supreme opportunity. Who didn't want to obtain it and become the second Ling Han?","\"Hehe, is there any need for us to make a move?\" A young man dressed in red and blue brocade walked out, his arms crossed behind his back, his expression filled with pride, \"Just leave this kind of weak trash to my servant.\"","Behind him, there were two young men standing with their hands by their sides.","\"Yi, the Hai Yuan Holy Land's Ma Qiyang.\"","\"Amongst Dao Childs, he can be considered one of the strongest.\"","\"It's said that he had heaven-defying luck and obtained the inheritance of a Saint. Although he's only 400 or so years old, he's already advanced to the Spirit Transformation Tier. He's only one step away from becoming a great elite of Minor Advanced Tier.\"","Many people recognized him, and they all whispered among themselves, expressing their reverence for this man.","It was also because of this Ma Qiyang's strength that everyone shut their mouths, not daring to compete with him.","This was a Spirit Transformation Tier Ninth Change elite! Moreover, he was only 400 years old! Apart from Imperial Sons, who else could rival him?","In the distance, all the Imperial Sons merely watched coldly from the sidelines. They were also happy to have these people humiliate Ling Han. In any case, no matter who had obtained the great opportunity that belonged to Ling Han, would they dare to take it all for themselves?","You see, you were so awesome all those years ago, and still dared to call yourself the Imperial Son Killer, and what was the result?","The Imperial Son was the Imperial Son, forever high and mighty.","At this time, one of the two servants behind Ma Qiyang walked out.","Previously, he had stood with his hands by his sides, completely inconspicuous, but now that he had walked out, it was as if a supreme treasured sword had been unsheathed. Instantly, he shone brilliantly.","\"Hiss, isn't this guy Sheng Haiyuan?\"","\"I know, the Dao Child of the Liuhe Sect!\"","\"Heavens, though the Liuhe Sect is a Venerate Tier-level force, Sheng Haiyuan is still a Dao Child of a sect, no matter what. Why is he willing to become Ma Qiyang's subordinate?\"","\"Obviously, Ma Qiyang is even more powerful than we had imagined.\"","Someone recognized this servant, and when he told them his history, it instantly caused everyone to be stunned.","No wonder Ma Qiyang was so full of confidence. That was because his servant was also a Dao Child. Though his level was slightly inferior, it could not be considered weak either.","Sheng Haiyuan stood in front of Ling Han, his eyes disdainful, a cold smirk on his face.","Ling Han was once a label for the unattainable for him, but now? He was about to defeat him with his own hands.","\"You people have gone too far!\" Xiu, a figure streaked past, and stood in front of Ling Han. Her slender figure was perfect, and her pretty face was enchanting.","This was an exceptional beauty, and immediately, a great many people in the area looked besotted.","Beautiful, too beautiful.","\"Song Lan!\" someone blurted out.","As it turned out, she was the ninth beauty of the galaxy. No wonder she was indescribably beautiful, making one want to commit crime.","\"So it's Song Lan!\"","\"The ninth most beautiful woman in the galaxy.\"","\"Beautiful, truly beautiful!\"","\"If I could sleep with her for a night, I would be willing to live a hundred years less.\"","\"Hehe, in your dreams!\"","Song Lan was a well-known figure, and she was immediately recognized by a great many people. A great many people had dirty mouths, and their expressions were perverted.","In fact, in the outside world, they definitely wouldn't be so unbearable. However, after entering the Mystery Realm to explore, they were constantly on the border between life and death. The pressure was too great, and their hidden nature was gradually revealed.","Ling Han was also very surprised. He had not thought that Song Lan would step out bravely for his sake.","This, he actually did not need.","But at this kind of time, having someone make a move for him, he felt a slight warmth in his heart.","\"Celestial maiden Song, please move aside to avoid being accidentally wounded,\" Sheng Haiyuan said calmly. He was a Spirit Transformation Tier Third Change, and Song Lan had clearly just advanced into Spirit Transformation Tier, far inferior to him.","However, she was a supreme beauty, after all, so he didn't want to be rude.","Yet Song Lan held her sword in front of her, \"If you want to go over, you have to ask my sword first!\"","Yi, was she determined to protect Ling Han?","Everyone couldn't help but feel jealous. Song Lan was a stunning beauty, ranked ninth in the galaxy, and her martial arts cultivation had also advanced into the Spiritual Transformation Tier. With her age of less than a hundred, she could completely be called a super genius.","But it was this kind of prodigy that was both talented and beautiful, yet was completely devoted to a piece of trash. Anyone would feel suffocated, right?","What right did he have?","Ma Qiyang finally spoke up, and said, \"Haiyuan, be careful when you attack. Don't hurt Celestial maiden Song.\"","\"Yes, Young Master!\" Sheng Haiyuan turned around and answered respectfully.","Then, he set his eyes on Song Lan, clasped his hands, and said, \"Celestial maiden Song, apologies!\"","Xiu, he charged over.","Song Lan brandished his sword to parry, instantly unleashing battle prowess of Spirit Transformation Tier.","However, in the Spirit Transformation Tier, the difference of one or two minor levels really couldn't be afforded. That was because the spiritual body was independent of the original, and with every additional spiritual body, the increase in battle prowess was real and solid.","Sheng Haiyuan's three spiritual bodies appeared at the same time, and that was a four-on-two situation. Furthermore, every spiritual body had an absolute advantage in power, so this kind of battle was naturally one-sided.","Fortunately, Sheng Haiyuan didn't dare to wound Song Lan. He was extremely careful, and this allowed Song Lan to last for so long. Otherwise, she would definitely have been defeated instantly.","Even so, she only managed to last a hundred moves, and Song Lan and her spiritual body were already restrained by two spiritual bodies of Sheng Haiyuan respectively, rendering them unable to continue fighting.","Sheng Haiyuan looked towards Ling Han, and said calmly, \"For those who rely on women to stand up for themselves, I will use the power of the First Change to fight you, and that would not be considered bullying you.\"","Hehe, he had indeed only used a spiritual body, but both himself and the spiritual body had the strength of Spirit Transformation Tier Third Change, and still had an absolute advantage.","\"Ling Han, have you really fallen to the point of relying on women?\"","\"Haha, what Imperial Son Killer, you have the nerve to bear such a nickname.\"","\"How embarrassing!\"","\"Get lost, don't dirty our eyes!\"","Quite a few people hit him when he was down, and began to mock and ridicule him.","Ling Han was destined to be a thing of the past. Thus, this should be the only chance to humiliate him.","Ling Han sighed. These people were so despicable.","Previously, he had not made a move because he had seen that Song Lan was not in danger, so he would just treat it as a training exercise for her.","Alright, he would deal with these trash first, then go up onto the martial arts ring and defeat those Imperial Sons.","He looked at Sheng Haiyuan, and shook his head, \"How many pieces do you want to be smashed into?\"","Pu, everyone laughed loudly."]},{"number":4434,"title":"Chapter 4434 All killed instantly","paragraphs":["\"Ling Han, are you still living in the past?\" Sheng Haiyuan asked disdainfully.","Ling Han shrugged, and said, \"Seeing that you were quite polite to Song Lan just now, I had planned to leave you with a complete corpse, but since you insist on courting death, I can only smash you into a shower of blood with a single punch.\"","\"Haha, I discovered that though your strength has declined, your mouth is still as bad as before!\" Sheng Haiyuan laughed loudly.","Everyone nodded. Those who had heard of Ling Han's reputation all knew that he, the large black dog and the little azure dragon were all the type to drive people to death with their curses. All of them had sharp mouths.","Ling Han crooked a finger at him, \"Make your move. I do not have the time to waste on a minor character.\"","\"Damn it!\" Sheng Haiyuan roared furiously, and finally made his move.","Previously, he had wanted to increase his presence. After all, his opponent was Ling Han! However, after Ling Han's repeated mockery, he finally couldn't control himself.","\"Die!\" He charged over, his fists pummelling furiously. Instantly, the air was filled with his fists. Whether it was a few hundred, or a few thousand, his fists pounded like lightning.","Everyone's eyes lit up. How powerful.","\"It's completely on the level of a top-notch Dao Child.\"","\"With such strength, he's actually still willing to become someone's servant?\"","\"Hiss, just how strong is this Ma Qiyang?\"","Everyone exclaimed in shock. If they were at the same cultivation level, how many of them were confident that they could defeat Sheng Haiyuan? More importantly, he was only a servant, so how strong was his master?","Could he compare to the Imperial Son?","\"It is rumored that Ma Qiyang has fused with the blood essence of a Saint. It is very possible that it is not empty words.\"","\"This guy may even have the bearing of an Imperial Son!\"","\"Heavens!\"","Sheng Haiyuan was so powerful, which was enough to prove that Ma Qiyang was even more inconceivably powerful.","Meanwhile, Song Lan looked worried, because she had heard that Ling Han's cultivation had gone horribly wrong, and his cultivation level had fallen back to Spirit Transformation Tier First Change.","How was a First Change going to fight a Third Change?","However, there was nothing that could be done. She was being suppressed by Sheng Haiyuan's two spiritual bodies, and could not move at all.","Right at this moment, Ling Han shot out a punch.","In this punch, he brandished it extremely carelessly. Everyone could clearly see the trajectory of the punch, as if it was overwhelmingly slow.","However, when he threw a punch, a terrifying force surged out, like a violent tsunami crashing towards ordinary people.","Peng!","In just a short while, Sheng Haiyuan and his spiritual body immediately crumbled, directly turning into a rain of blood. Then, they were crushed, not even leaving behind the slightest bit of residue.","At this moment, the entire area was silent.","F***, this was called having a huge problem in cultivation?","F***, who said that?","'You're the one with a problem! You've got a problem with your eyes! You've got a problem with your brain!'","Meanwhile, the two spiritual bodies that were suppressing Song Lan were trembling. They were connected to the original on the soul level, and could sense the helplessness that he felt when he died more clearly than others.","That was a crushing power that would drive one to despair!","Subconsciously, the two spiritual bodies stretched out their hands at the same time and placed them on the heads of Song Lan and her spiritual body. They shouted at Ling Han, \"Don't come over, or I will kill her!\"","As long as her mind was shattered, Song Lan, the ninth beauty of the galaxy, would die.","Ling Han was neither too fast nor too slow. Instead, he showed a smile, \"What do you want?\"","\"What's there to be afraid of?\" Sheng Haiyuan had not even opened his mouth, when he heard Ma Qiyang's baleful voice say, \"Aren't I still here?\"","Hearing these words, Sheng Haiyuan instantly calmed down.","That's right, there was still Ma Qiyang.","He was deeply aware of the strength of this Lord. Otherwise, with his identity as a Dao Child, how could he be willing to acknowledge him as Master?","Yet Ling Han did not even look at Ma Qiyang, and merely said to Sheng Haiyuan, \"Let go!\"","Sheng Haiyuan ignored him. Since his Master had said that there was no need to be afraid, he naturally had no need to be afraid.","Ling Han shook his head. With a thought, a murderous aura surged out.","Pu, pu! Sheng Haiyuan's two spiritual bodies instantly exploded like balloons.","—The barrage of his murderous aura was presently enough to insta-kill any ordinary Two Star Sect Master. How easy would it be to kill a Spirit Transformation Tier Third Change?","It was precisely because he was confident that he could succeed that he was so calm and unhurried.","Song Lan instantly regained her freedom, and hurriedly ran towards Ling Han.","Killing intent flashed through Ma Qiyang's eyes, and he said balefully, \"How dare you kill even my servant.\"","This was a blatant slap to the face!","Oh, he had just said that there was no need to be afraid and that he was there, and what was the result? Sheng Haiyuan had died.","Ling Han smiled calmly, \"Wrong, my courage is much greater than this.\"","\"Ignorant!\" Ma Qiyang humphed, and charged towards Ling Han.","He was now extremely furious. This should have been the time for him to show off himself, yet now, it was only paving the way for Ling Han.","It didn't matter. As long as he killed Ling Han, the world would praise his name in the future.","At this moment, Ling Han threw a punch.","It was clear, simple, and direct.","Anyone could see the trajectory of this punch, but no one thought that if they faced this punch head-on, would they be able to parry it in time?","Peng!","Ma Qiyang didn't even have the time to raise his hand to block the attack. The terrifying power of the punch surged over, crushing him forcefully, turning him into a rain of blood that filled the skies.","Heavens!","In an instant, everyone inhaled sharply.","They could not believe their eyes at all.","Was this real?","Wasn't it said that Ma Qiyang was comparable to the Imperial Son? Cultivation level of Spirit Transformation Tier Ninth Change, and added with the fact that he had fused with the Saint's blood essence, he should have been invincible in a battle of equal cultivation levels, yet he had been destroyed with a single punch.","This, this, this!","Everyone looked at Ling Han in shock. This was different from destroying Sheng Haiyuan. After all, Sheng Haiyuan was only a Spirit Transformation Tier Third Change, but in the case of Ma Qiyang, he was standing at the peak of the Spirit Transformation Tier.","Just how powerful was Ling Han if he could obliterate him with a single punch?","'F*ck your sister! Didn't you say that you had encountered a huge problem in your cultivation?'","Who was screwing them over?","Those who had previously mocked Ling Han were all trembling, feeling as if they had suffered 10,000 points of damage. The extent of psychological trauma was indescribable.","If they had known, they wouldn't have dared to mock him even if they were beaten to death. And to think, they even wanted to kill Ling Han and snatch his fated opportunity.","Wasn't this courting death?","They wanted to cry but had no tears. Which b@stard was screwing them over?","Even those who were walking the same rainbow bridge as Ling Han were dumbfounded. They had personally witnessed Ling Han fleeing on the island, and it was not just once. In fact, even they had gone out to hunt Ling Han down before.","But now, Ling Han was strong to the point that he could insta-kill anyone and anything, which was completely unacceptable to them.","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"Do you regret it now?\"","Everyone hurriedly nodded.","\"Too bad, it's too late!\" He withdrew his smile, and the barrage of murderous aura activated. Pa, pa, pa, masses of people collapsed.","Looking closely, they were all those who had previously mocked him and wanted to make a move on him. None of them were innocent.","Hiss, this caused everyone else's scalps to go numb.","He didn't even need to raise his hand, yet he could deliver such a precise and fatal strike. This guy's strength had already surpassed common sense, and they couldn't even imagine it.","And on those tournament stages, the Imperial Sons all looked solemn.","Ling Han was not crippled. F***, which b@stard was misleading them?"]},{"number":4435,"title":"Chapter 4435 Killing Imperial Son with a Single Punch","paragraphs":["However, even more Imperial Sons were still proud.","No matter how strong you are, you are only a Spirit Transformation Tier.","A Sect Master would crush a Spirit Transformation True Lord. This was a truth that would never change for eternity, and would definitely not change for Ling Han.","And in this place, the majority of Imperial Sons had already advanced into Minor Advanced Tier, so what did they have to fear?","Indeed, you are invincible among your peers, so what?","Only Feng Miaoling smiled. Previously, she had stood in front of Ling Han because Ling Han was comprehending Dao and couldn't be disturbed, and at this time... was there any need for her to step out?","However... that woman actually dared to have designs on her man?","'Humph, I'll kill her after the competition ends. Shameless!'","The gazes of the people below them that were looking at Ling Han were filled with terror. Your uncle is still your uncle. He had first insta-killed Sheng Haiyuan and Ma Qiyang, and then stunned the whole area. Then, it was even more terrifying, as he had directly insta-killed dozens of people with a strange technique.","God of Slaughter!","A great many people did not dare to look at Ling Han, fearing that if they made eye contact with Ling Han, it would draw out his killing intent, and he would insta-kill them.","\"Ling Han, are you all right?\" Song Lan asked in pleasant surprise.","Ling Han scratched his head, and said, \"I'm fine. Which idiot said that I had a problem?\"","Hearing these words, everyone was driven mad.","That's right. They too wanted to know which idiot had given out such false news. Wasn't this just screwing them over?","—If Kong Wuyang found out after his death, how would he feel?","On the high platform, all the Imperial Sons looked down on Ling Han, as if they were the high and mighty lords of the heavens, waiting for the challenge of mortals, but the only result was that he would be easily suppressed.","\"Anyone who wants to become defending champion can come and challenge me,\" an Imperial Son shouted in a deep voice from one of the stages.","His voice boomed out, bringing with it supreme might.","Instantly, the majority fell silent. The might of the Imperial Son was deeply ingrained in their hearts. This represented the strongest battle prowess.","Meanwhile, Ling Han stood with his hands clasped behind his back, his eyes sweeping over stage after stage.","Those Imperial Sons all looked proud, completely unafraid.","Ling Han merely smiled, but did not step forwards to issue a challenge.","It was too early.","There were a total of 10 days. If he went up now, so what if he knocked down an Imperial Son with a single punch? He would still have to wait for 10 days. How boring would that be?","Let's go, find a place to sleep.","\"Ling Han!\" Seeing Ling Han turn around and leave, Song Lan faltered for a moment before hurriedly following him. There were too many things she wanted to say to Ling Han.","Everyone was envious. He wasn't goinf to fight on the martial arts ring, so what could a lone man and a lone woman do?","One didn't need to think to know that.","However, there were also those who made cynical remarks, and said, \"Heh, he still does not dare to match the Imperial Son, so he fled!\"","There were very few people who responded. Even if Ling Han was no match for the Sect Master, he had already completely proven himself just now. He was still the Ling Han that had stunned others and even driven them to despair.","Because there was potentially an envoy present, no Imperial Son would target Ling Han. In any case, everyone was in the city, so Ling Han wouldn't be able to escape.","One day, two days, time passed quietly, and soon, it was the tenth day.","Once midnight had passed, the tournament stage battles would be over, and they would enter into the next stage of the knockout battles.","Ling Han finally arrived at the tournament stage. He chatted with Song Lan for a while. This woman had found a place to live in seclusion alone after the Nine Suns Holy Land disbanded, and she hadn't returned to the clan.","Thankfully, she had obtained a great many fated opportunities on the Imperial Path, and had successfully broken through to the Spiritual Transformation Tier.","Which one should he fight?","Ling Han swept his gaze over the 16 people on the tournament stages. In the end, he leaped onto a tournament stage.","\"Haha, I thought you would continue to be a coward,\" the Imperial Son on the tournament stage said coldly. He was Pei Mingcheng of the Crimson Rainbow Imperial Clan, and belonged to the Silver Generation. At present, he had already charged up to become a Two Star Sect Master.","As he saw it, even a One Star Sect Master would be able to suppress all Spirit Transformation Tiers, what more when he was already a Two Star Sect Master. In fact, he was the Silver Generation.","Ling Han shook his head and said, \"How dare you speak so rudely. I can tell that you don't have any manners.\"","Pei Mingcheng couldn't help but feel stifled. This retort made him feel uncomfortable.","Sure enough, this person had a toxic tongue. The rumors were true.","He no longer attempted to attack Ling Han verbally, because he knew himself well. The result of this bickering was very likely that he would be fuming with anger.","What martial artists looked at was not the ability to speak verbally, but their physical skill!","\"Die!\"","He charged towards Ling Han. Not only was he going to defeat Ling Han, he was even going to kill him.","Who wouldn't be interested in the reason why Ling Han was so powerful?","He clearly wasn't a member of the Imperial Clan, and joining the Holy Land was only a matter of later. So, why was he so powerful that even the Golden Generation was no match for him?","Who would not be interested in this kind of secret?","Ling Han's expression was baleful. If Pei Mingcheng only wanted to spar a bit, then he wouldn't mind stopping before things went too far. After all, it was his habit to speak with a toxic mouth, but it didn't mean that he would really be merciless.","But the moment Pei Mingcheng attacked, his killing intent blazed. It was clear that he wanted to kill him. How could Ling Han not feel killing intent?","He merely threw a punch.","This punch was clearly ordinary, but it seemed to have some kind of demonic power, and was unstoppable!","Peng!","With a single punch, Pei Mingcheng was instantly sent flying, drawing an arc in the skies. Only then did he fall heavily onto the stage. Under the barrage of Destructive Energy, Substitution Seal was completely ineffective, and he died directly.","Hiss, this punch had too shocking an effect.","Pei Mingcheng was no ordinary person. Not only was he an Imperial Son, he was also a Sect Master.","Heavens, even a Sect Master was no match for a single punch from Ling Han?","Not only the spectators, but even the Imperial Sons on the platforms all wore expressions of disbelief. They were so stunned that their eyes bulged.","Was this real?","The only one who still looked normal was Feng Miaoling. She had fought with Ling Han before, so she naturally knew just how powerful Ling Han was.","Otherwise, how could Ling Han be worthy of becoming her future husband?","Of course, it was not all the Imperial Sons that were trembling, because there were four Golden Generations here!","Though they were all Sect Masters as well, they were either Eight Stars or Nine Stars, and their abilities could not be compared to Two Stars or Three Stars Sect Master.","If they moved, they would still be able to easily suppress Ling Han.","In a state of silent shock, the tournament stage battles finally ended.","It was time for the elimination battles.","The sixteen people drew lots to decide their opponents for the quarterfinals.","Ling Han's luck was not too bad. He had drawn a Silver Generation. Though he was a Two Star Sect Master, with Pei Mingcheng's example, it was believed that no one would believe that this Imperial Son could win.","As expected, when the battles for the quarterfinals began, that Imperial Son decisively admitted defeat. There was no reason for him to insist on courting death, when it was definite that he would lose.","The top eight were decided. Aside from the four Golden Generations, there was also Ling Han, Feng Miaoling, and two Silver Generations.","Lots were drawn again. This time, Ling Han wasn't so lucky, drawing a Golden Generation.","Imperial Son Han, Guan Xinghan, Golden Generation of the Xuan Feng Imperial Clan, an Eight Star Sect Master!","The battle began, and Guan Xinghan moved without mercy. He shot out both palms, which turned into multiple black millstones that crushed towards Ling Han.","On the millstones, Regulations were densely covered, and divine patterns interwove, exuding endless might."]},{"number":4436,"title":"Chapter 4436 Outmatched","paragraphs":["The Silver Generation elites all frowned. Even in a battle of equal cultivation levels, they could only retreat in the face of such might. If they stubbornly fought head-on, they would definitely be severely injured.","Feng Miaoling nodded as well. No wonder this generation's Imperial Sons had the title of Golden Generation. Indeed, this was much stronger than the Imperial Sons that she had seen before.","After an era of repression, there was indeed a great backlash.","She exclaimed in her mind.","Boom!","On the other side, Guan Xinghan's killing intent blazed as he pushed the millstones toward Ling Han.","Ling Han didn't faced this head-on. After all, there was a huge gulf between their cultivation levels.","The limit of his battle prowess was probably Five Star Sect Master, and it had to be an ordinary one at that. However, Guan Xinghan was not only an Eight Star Sect Master, but also a Golden Generation.","Who could withstand such might?","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Guan Xinghan attacked madly, while Ling Han was completely unable to fight back. This was a battle on two completely different levels.","However, Ling Han still tried his best to create possibilities in midst of the impossible. He used the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and even if the area of battle was limited, he still tried his best to move evasively in this area, and then take advantage of the opening to counterattack.","In every ten moves, he could return one or two blows.","This was the result of him taking a few steps on his own path of martial arts. Otherwise, having encountered such an opponent, he would not have the chance to fight back at all.","Even though Ling Han was at a huge disadvantage, everyone only felt admiration and fear.","Just how wide was the gap between the two of them?","Merely in minor level, there were already a considerable number of cultivation levels, what more when there was still a major tier of cultivation level that lay between them, but what was the result?","Though Ling Han was at a disadvantage, he was still trying his best to counterattack.","What if Ling Han advanced to the level of Sect Master?","To say nothing of defeating Guan Xinghan, he would at least be qualified to match him, right?","This, this, this, he had just entered into Sect Master-level, and was already capable of matching the Golden Generation that represented the strongest of this era. Just how freakish was this?","Guan Xinghan's killing intent blazed even brighter. He definitely had to kill Ling Han. Firstly, that was so he could get rid of any potential for future trouble, and secondly, he would be able to obtain Ling Han's secrets.","If he could advance another step further, he would be able to dominate the Golden Generation. Then, if the position of Emperor did not fall into his hands, who else would be qualified?","However, no matter what he did, Ling Han was as slippery as an eel. No matter what, he couldn't deliver a fatal strike and completely deal with Ling Han.","After battling for half a day, Ling Han's entire body was covered in sweat, and there were also several new wounds on his body.","After all, his opponent was too strong. Even he could not possibly avoid injury.","After battling for half a day, Ling Han withdrew from the battle, expressing his intention to forfeit.","No one looked at him in disdain. A Spirit Transformation Tier had fought a Sect Master, an Eight Star Golden Generation at that. Moreover, they battled for close to a day before finally expressing his loss. Wasn't this a massive victory?","This was a monster!","Seeing Ling Han stand proudly, Guan Xinghan almost couldn't suppress his killing intent, wanting to continue to hunt down Ling Han.","However, firstly, he had to be wary that there was a mysterious envoy here, and secondly, he had also experienced Ling Han's movement technique. If Ling Han fled with all his might, he would not be able to catch up to him either.","Thus, he did not act rashly.","\"Phoenix Wings Divine Flight!\" All the Imperial Sons thought, their thoughts of capturing Ling Han even hotter.","This person was a walking treasure trove. The True Dragon's legacy, the True Phoenix's legacy, and even the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor's legacy were all in Ling Han's hands.","Ling Han didn't feel any regrets. He had finally exchanged blows with the higher end of the Golden Generation. He was indeed very strong, but he was far from enough to make him wary.","In a battle of equal cultivation levels, he could easily crush him.","'It's fine even if I don't get the Qingfeng Order,' he thought. 'Even if I don't walk the Imperial Path, I still have the confidence to become Emperor, what more when I am only lacking that Qingfeng Order.'","He found a restaurant, and planned to set out after a delicious meal, continuing his Imperial Path adventure.","The dishes were served. He had not eaten many mouthfuls, when he saw a child walk over, drooling as he looked at the table full of dishes.","Ling Han couldn't help but smile, \"Hungry? Come, sit down.\"","That child was really not reserved. Immediately, he sat down, stretched out his chopsticks and picked up the food, beginning to eat.","After eating a few mouthfuls, the child said to the waiter, \"Bring me a wine bowl.\"","Yi?","Ling Han wasn't surprised that this child wanted to drink, but when he spoke, his voice was old, and he didn't sound like a child at all.","What the hell?","\"Young man, I've been observing you for a long time,\" the child said in an experienced voice.","Ling Han chuckled, \"Brat, how old are you this year?\"","\"Pei, I have only cultivated a strange cultivation technique, and that is why I would become a child every three hundred years for a few days. In terms of real age, I am more than qualified to be your grandfather.\" The child declared proudly.","Ling Han gritted his teeth. Even if this child wasn't lying, he was still asking for a beating. From the very beginning, he declared that he wanted to become his grandfather. How could he take advantage of him like this?","\"Don't you have that little bit of common sense that the mouth that eats the food of others is softened?\" he asked with a smile.","At this moment, the waiter brought over a wine bowl. The child filled it up for himself, and immediately began to drink noisily.","Peng!","He placed the wine bowl heavily on the table, and praised, \"Good wine!\"","Ling Han didn't care. Whether you were a child or an old geezer, since he said he would treat, then he would treat.","\"Huh? Aren't you curious about my background?\" the child couldn't help but ask.","\"If you want to talk, you will. If you don't want to talk, it's useless even if I ask,\" Ling Han said with a smile.","\"You definitely don't look like a young man with majestic vitality,\" the child said.","\"You don't look like a child at all, so old-fashioned,\" Ling Han said with a shake of his head.","The child couldn't help but emphasize, \"I'm not a child. It's just because of the cultivation technique I cultivate that I've temporarily become like this.\"","\"You've already said that. My memory is very good, so there's no need to repeat it,\" Ling Han said with a smile.","\"I'm about to die from fury!\" The child panted heavily, and suddenly took out a token, which he slapped onto the table, \"Here, take it.\"","This token was completely dark green in colour, and it was unknown what material it was made of. It looked like stone, yet was at the same time not. It looked like gold, yet was not.","A thought flashed in Ling Han's head, \"Qingfeng Order?\"","\"That's right.\" The child became proud again, his expression saying that he should come and admire him quickly.","Ling Han gave an 'oh', and put away the Qingfeng Order.","\"You're done with an 'oh'?\" The child almost jumped up.","\"Thank you?\" Ling Han probed.","The child was speechless, as if he had suddenly lost all his temper. Only after a while did he say, \"Aren't you curious why I gave the Qingfeng Order to you?\"","\"Why?\" Ling Han asked.","\"I'm the one asking you!\" The child was angered again.","\"How would I know?\" Ling Han spread out his hands, \"That is your own action. I am not the worm inside your stomach that can read your mind.\"","This... seemed to make a lot of sense.","The child sighed. Looks like in terms of bickering, he was completely no match for Ling Han, so it was better not to seek his own humiliation.","Just look, he was trembling with anger, yet Ling Han's expression didn't change at all. This was practically unbelievable.","\"The strongest person being able to obtain the Qingfeng Order isn't definitely the strongest in terms of abilities, but rather the relatively strongest,\" the child explained. \"You are invincible among your peers, and you completely deserve to possess the Qingfeng Order!\""]},{"number":4437,"title":"Chapter 4437 Stone Forest","paragraphs":["Ling Han scratched his head, and said with a smile, \"Although I know that, I'm still a little embarrassed that you're praising me like this right to my face.\"","This... where was the slightest bit of embarrassment?","The child was extremely speechless. He had never seen anyone more shameless than Ling Han.","Forget it. He focused on eating, and ignored Ling Han.","Yet Ling Han asked about Imperial Path, wanting to find out what he would be experiencing next. However, the child did not respond to him, and merely ate and drank madly.","By the looks of it, he wouldn't be able to get anything out of him.","Ling Han also began to eat. After eating and drinking to his heart's content, the child left without a second thought.","He was leaving.","Ling Han also set out to continue his journey. After leaving this city, he turned around to take a look, and a smile involuntarily appeared at the corners of his lips. He had no idea what Guan Xinghan and the others would be thinking, after fighting so hard with one of them finally emerging as first place, but there would be no sight of the envoy delivering the Qingfeng Order to him.","It was definite that they were going to curse, and if they knew that he had obtained the Qingfeng Order, then there would probably be ten thousand curses stampeding madly through their heads.","Haha, interesting.","This wasn't fair?","What a joke. The envoy had not said how to obtain the Qingfeng Order, and it was them who had acted on their own initiative, insisting on hosting a martial arts tournament. Then why did the envoy have to follow their rules?","'You guys can slowly play around and wait.'","Ling Han strode off. He had to break through to the level of Sect Master as soon as possible. Otherwise, if he encountered the Golden Generation, he would only be outmatched, even if he could parry a few moves.","After all, the gap in cultivation level was too wide.","Ling Han advanced on his journey. Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was used, and his speed was astonishingly fast.","Three days later, a stone forest appeared ahead of him.","Ling Han's eyes swept over the surroundings, and couldn't help but frown. This stone forest was completely charred, as if it had just been burned by a great fire. But the problem here was this was a stone forest. It was completely filled with stone pillars soaring into the sky, and there wasn't even half a tree, so how could it be burning?","He walked closer, and raised his head.","The stone forest was truly tall. The shortest of these stone pillars were a few hundred meters tall, while the taller ones were actually a few thousand meters tall, piercing directly into the clouds.","The stone forest was vast, and as far as the eye could see, there was no end in sight.","According to the residents of North Prosperity City, after one passed through North Prosperity City, the Imperial Path would become extremely dangerous, and would this stone forest be the beginning of danger?","He didn't dare to be careless. No one could help him here, so he could only rely on himself.","However, if one observed from the outside, they wouldn't be able to see anything.","Ling Han leaped into the air.","He was going to look down from the sky.","But he had not even begun to advance, when he saw multiple stone pillars glowing all over. Then, xiu, xiu, xiu, multiple pillars of light shot towards him.","He parried with a punch, and couldn't help but grit his teeth. He felt a great pain in his fist, and the surface of his fist had even broken, bleeding bright red blood.","The offensive power of this pillar of light was very strong.","Ling Han hurriedly descended. If there were a few pillars of light, he could withstand them, but if there were several hundred, or even several thousand stone pillars attacking him at the same time, he really wouldn't be able to withstand it.","He had best just walk on the ground obediently. Looks like he would not be able to circle around this stage.","Ling Han adjusted his breathing, and strode into the stone forest.","He stepped in; the ground was soft.","Yi?","He lowered his head to look. There was a thick layer of ash on the ground, and that was why it felt so soft.","Where had the ash come from?","Ling Han raised his head to look. Each of these stone pillars seemed to have been burned before. Could it be that they had produced this?","He dug up a pile of ash, and saw that there were clear layers from top to bottom.","The top layer of ash was very recent. Perhaps, it had only happened one or two days ago.","Ling Han walked forwards, but he didn't walk too fast, because this stone forest was too densely packed. One after another, stone pillars stood in front of him, and he had to circle around them, which naturally greatly decreased his speed.","As he walked, he saw a bright object on a certain stone pillar.","He couldn't help but feel a jolt in his heart, and hurriedly climbed up.","Thankfully, no pillar of light assaulted him.","He could see clearly. This was a scale that was burning like flames, so it looked bright.","\"What powerful power of flames!\" Ling Han used his eye technique to scan the surroundings, and immediately understood.","This was Venerate Tier-level, and even he felt apprehensive. If he touched it, he would definitely die.","However...","He took out the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and without wrapping it with his Spiritual Power, directly used it to enshroud the scale.","He stored it away.","This was forged from the essence of Origin Gold. So what if it was a Venerate Tier-level flame energy? He was completely unafraid.","He had gained a little. If he threw it out at the right moment, even if it couldn't hurt anyone, it could still scare people.","Ling Han smiled knowingly, and continued onwards.","After walking for a while, he felt a powerful wave of heat assault him.","He hung the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower above his head. If there really was a Venerate Tier-level flame spewing out, he would use the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to collect it.","The further he walked, the more terrifying the waves of heat became. Even with the protection of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, Ling Han still felt as if every hair on his head was about to be burnt.","After all, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was only forged from the Origin Gold, and not the real Imperial Weapon. Thus, it was indestructible, but Primal Chaos Qi wasn't indestructible.","He tried to take a different path, and after walking for a while, he discovered that the heat wave had subsided slightly.","After circling around for a while, he was certain that it wasn't that the depths of the stone forest were all as hot as this. Instead, there was a point that was like this, and the heat affected an area.","He could take a different path and leave, but due to his curiosity, Ling Han still decided to get a clear look.","Adjusting his course, Ling Han headed towards the centre of the heat source.","The further ahead he went, the hotter it became.","After about half an hour, he shockingly discovered that a sinkhole had appeared ahead of him. Its depth was indescribable, yet waves of heat surged out, making him feel as if his skin was about to burn.","With his current strength, he could just barely withstand it, but it was really not a pleasant feeling.","Ling Han was slightly relieved. He put away the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, taking it head-on with his physique.","He saw it as tempering, to further temper his physique.","—As long as there was no life-threatening danger, Ling Han was extremely unwilling to rely on external power.","Waves of heat rolled out, extremely scorching.","Ling Han stretched out his head to look at the bottom of the sinkhole, but it was completely dark, and nothing could be seen clearly. Even if he used his eye technique, it was useless. It was as if some kind of energy or Regulations had formed an obstruction.","What... could it be underneath?","Could it be a passageway?","Ling Han gritted his teeth. If this was a passageway, then Imperial Path would really be difficult to travel.","He believed that he could still withstand this kind of heatwave at present, but if he entered into the depths of the abyss and came into direct contact with the source of heat, even with the protection of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, it would probably be useless. He would still be burnt to ashes.","\"What if I use this pearl?\" Ling Han took out the Saint Tool staff. There was a treasure inside, and it was a natural treasure that could resist all negative effects. The prerequisite was that the effects had to be formed naturally, and martial intent could not be contained within.","He activated this bead, and instantly, a shield of light appeared, enshrouding him within.","However, as the wave of heat surged out, this shield of light shattered.","Ling Han's expression involuntarily changed.","He himself could withstand this wave of heat, which meant that this was far from surpassing the might of the Venerate Tier, but why was this natural treasure unable to withstand it?","There was only one answer. This was not a wave of heat that was naturally formed."]},{"number":4438,"title":"Chapter 4438 Alive?","paragraphs":["\"Underneath, there should be a powerful existence. It is he who has formed this kind of wave of fire, and also because of him, his martial intent is mixed within the wave of fire. Thus, even a natural divine item would not be able to block it.\"","Ling Han murmured to himself as he took a few steps back.","It was suspected that there was a Venerate Tier-level existence beneath this deep pit. In that case, it was even more impossible for him to rashly go down and take risks.","\"Yi?\"","He suddenly saw a ray of red light surge out of the sinkhole.","Because he had taken a few steps back, when he saw the red light, the red light was actually not far from the ground.","It was flames!","Ling Han hurriedly broke into a run. Boom, behind him, flames surged out, burning in all directions, instantly turning the surrounding stone forest into a forest of fire.","It was too fast!","There was no way to use the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight here, so Ling Han's speed was greatly restricted. He couldn't outrun the flames at all, so he could only climb up a stone pillar.","As long as he didn't climb to the top, he probably wouldn't be attacked.","Boom, the waves of fire surged past, surging like the tide.","Ling Han breathed a slight sigh of relief. Then, he gritted his teeth. The temperature of this flame was too high, causing all the clothes on his body to dry and crack. It looked like they were about to burn.","F***, this was a Five Star Celestial Material!","Sigh, this was the bad thing about coming to this kind of place to train. It was too expensive.","Ling Han felt a little heartache. As for the issue of his image, he was not considering it. After all, there was not even a ghost in this place, so there was no need to worry that others would see him.","However, very soon, he was no longer in the mood to consider the problem of money, because the wave of heat was getting more and more intense, directly penetrating into his heart and lungs, causing the breath he exhaled from his nostrils to be red in colour, and the temperature to be extraordinarily high.","Was he going to be roasted?","Ling Han felt that it really was a bit like that. See, wasn't he hanging on a stone pillar?","He continued to climb upwards, staying further away from the waves of fire. This indeed improved the situation slightly, but the stone pillar itself was also burning extraordinarily hot, so hot that even his skin was about to fall off.","\"Hu! Hu!\" He kept switching from his left hand to his right hand, and from his right foot to his left foot. He had a chance to escape the stone pillar and \"cool down\" for a while, but as time passed, this was still not feasible.","Forget it.","He leaped up, directly piercing through the clouds.","He couldn't be burnt to the point of severe injury, or even to the point of actually being burnt to death, right?","Yi?","After arriving in the air, Ling Han discovered that the stone pillars here weren't glowing, or launched an attack at him.","Could it be that because of the flames, these stone pillars had temporarily lost their offensive ability?","Forget it. At least for now, he could avoid the assault of the waves of heat.","He cast his gaze over, and saw that there was a pillar of fire behind him that had shot up to a height of three hundred meters. It was precisely coming from the sinkhole.","Furthermore, looking into the distance, there were actually a considerable number of such pillars of fire that could be vaguely seen.","Which also meant that there was more than one sinkhole, and there was more than one Venerate Tier-level existence?","The flames surged, and after about half an hour, they finally stopped, no longer surging.","Another layer of the stone forest had been burnt, and with a slight breeze, the ashes continued to fall, forming a very thin layer on the ground.","Ling Han felt a sense of confusion. This stone forest was continuously burning, and a layer of \"skin\" would be shed every time, but after so many years, why was it still not completely burnt?","This was illogical.","However, he immediately shook his head. There were too many illogical things here. How could he investigate each and every thing in detail?","Weng! The stone pillars lit up.","Not good. The flames had passed, and the stone forest returned to normal. It had become offensive again.","Ling Han hurriedly descended, not daring to face it head-on.","The wave of flames had just passed, and the ground was still filled with a burning sensation, forcing Ling Han to have no choice but to activate the Starlight Screen.","He advanced, and he had not walked too far, when he discovered another scale on a stone pillar.","Had this come out of the colossal pit along with the gushing waves of fire?","Ling Han deduced that there were fierce beasts in the sinkhole, and this naturally had fallen from the bodies of fierce beasts.","\"What a strange place.\"","If one's reaction speed was slower, they would be instantly killed by the pillar of light if they rashly rose into the air, and if they walked on the ground, the waves of fire would also instantly kill them.","The stone forest was too big, and in fact, Ling Han discovered that the stone forest itself was also changing the direction. That was because he was clearly advancing continuously, but after two days, he discovered that he had actually walked back the way he came.","This was too inconceivable.","Ling Han was certain that his mind definitely hadn't been affected. Then, without the influence of external power, why had he suddenly started to walk back the way he came?","What was even stranger was that he was clearly walking backwards, yet did not pass by the place that he had previously walked to.","Though it was all the same scenery inside the stone forest, with Ling Han's insight, he could still distinguish the slightest difference.","Strange, too strange.","Ling Han adjusted his course. However, this time, he was even more shocked, because he discovered that he had walked these paths before.","What was going on?","For example, he had been walking east, but as he walked, he realized that he had turned west at some point in time. Logically speaking, he should have walked the path he walked before, yet the scenery was completely different.","However, he adjusted his direction and headed east again, only to discover that he was actually going back the way he came.","\"There is only one possibility!\"","Ling Han tapped his fingers, \"Actually, this is not some kind of psychedelic formation, but rather the whole stone forest is spinning!\"","—To make an analogy, if he was on the body of a giant tortoise, he would have been heading east at first, but as he walked, the giant tortoise turned 180 degrees. Then, though Ling Han was still advancing straight ahead, he had turned westwards, yet had not gone backwards.","Thinking about it this way, the matter became simple.","\"Hiss, then doesn't that mean that this stone forest is alive?\"","Ling Han gritted his teeth. Could it be that he was presently standing on top of a massive beast? This could explain why the stone forest had not been burnt to nothing, because it was a living creature, so there was growth.","He had to leave as soon as possible.","Ling Han determined the direction, and continued onwards.","However, the stone forest would change direction from time to time, and because it was huge, this change was really noiseless, causing even Ling Han to fall for it. The more he adjusted his direction, the more he lost himself in it.","After ten days, he realized that he had really lost all sense of direction.","Forget about it. He might as well stick to a single direction and walk to the end. He would definitely be able to leave.","And he had also discovered the rhythm of the waves of fire gushing out here. It would happen once a day, punctually, and would last for half an hour.","\"It's coming again,\" Ling Han murmured. He leaped up and soared into the sky.","Boom! True enough, the waves of flames surged over in an instant.","Yi?","He suddenly saw a figure standing proudly in midair in the distance.","Though they were very far away, with Ling Han's sharp eyesight, he could tell with a single glance that that person wasâ¦ Guan Xinghan.","This Golden Generation also discovered Ling Han's presence. Without another word, he immediately charged over.","Boom! Divine light surged from his body, transforming into nine-colored light that boosted his might.","\"Die!\"","This Imperial Son delivered a palm strike, which turned into a colossal axe, intending to slash down on Ling Han."]},{"number":4439,"title":"Chapter 4439 Transforming into a giant","paragraphs":["Ling Han didn't complain about the injustice.","It was not the first or second time that he had been targeted by the Imperial Clan. Furthermore, he had also killed Guan Yuanming. It could be said that he had become deadly enemies with the Guan Clan. If they did not kill him, the Imperial Clan would be losing pride!","He used the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and with a leap, his speed was extraordinarily fast.","In fact, in fact, this place was already filled with soaring flames in the first place. As the flaming wings flapped, they actually created quite a number of waves of fire that swept towards Guan Xinghan.","These flames were far too terrifying, and even Guan Xinghan didn't dare to face them head-on. He had no option but to dodge.","His speed was inferior to Ling Han's in the first place, so if he continued to dodge like this, how could he possibly catch up to Ling Han?","Thus, even though one was fleeing and the other was chasing, there was no danger at all.","\"Ling Han, don't you feel aggrieved?\" Guan Xinghan suddenly spoke up with his divine sense.","Ling Han ignored him. There was nothing much to say to him. When his abilities improved, he would naturally be able to beat him up.","What Imperial Son? What Silver Generation? Hadn't they all been dealt with like this by him?","Which other Silver Generation dared to act arrogant in front of Ling Han?","\"Heh, you clearly didn't do anything wrong, so why does it seem like the entire world is against you?\" Guan Xinghan didn't seem to care, and he continued, \"That's because you clearly don't have any background, yet you're showing signs of becoming Emperor!\"","\"An Imperial Son can display his brilliance to his heart's content, and have no fear of being assassinated out of jealousy. That is because there is the signboard of the Imperial Clan, and no one dares to touch it!\"","\"It's the same for Yang Yihuan and He Luo. Although they don't have the Imperial Clan behind them, they do have a Pseudo-Emperor backing them up. Who dares to touch them?\"","\"Thus, the so-called fair competition was completely unfair from the very beginning!\"","\"Weaklings have no right to demand fairness!\"","Every word was piercing to the heart.","He was deliberately provoking Ling Han, wanting to make Ling Han lose his composure. The best scenario would be if Ling Han couldn't contain his anger and turned around to fight him.","Unfortunately, Ling Han didn't fall for it.","Even though he had only been in this world for a hundred years, just how many years had he passed in the Genesis World?","How could such an old monster be so easily provoked?","That's right. Sometimes, he would act on impulse, but it was definitely impossible that he would fall for such a low-level provocation.","He couldn't even be bothered to pay him any regard. With a flap of his fiery wings, he suddenly sped up, instantly leaving Guan Xinghan far behind.","Guan Xinghan suddenly stopped in his tracks, and did not pursue any further.","If he couldn't catch up, there was no need to waste time.","\"Your fortune is so nature-defying that you have obtained more than one inheritance from the Great Emperor. It is as if you have been favoured by the heaven and earth. If I do not kill you, who would be able to rest easy?\" Guan Xinghan murmured, \"There is only one position of Great Emperor, so you must die!\"","...","After Ling Han broke free from Guan Xinghan, he waited for a while, and the explosion of the waves of fire ended. Peace returned to the stone forest.","He strode forwards, his heart filled with curiosity.","This was the Imperial Path, so the existence of this stone forest was most likely not just to obstruct the advance of those who entered.","What kind of great opportunity would there be?","As Ling Han walked, he drew out the Qingfeng Order.","He studied it for a long time, but still couldn't find anything special about this thing—if he had to say there was one, it would be hardness.","Occasionally, he would take it out to see if it would form a resonance with the environment here.","However, he was only disappointed time and time again.","Time slowly passed, and more and more people entered into the stone forest. Because of how big this stone forest was, Ling Han still encountered others time and time again.","By now, his name was already well-known, so who would dare to provoke him? The moment they saw him, their expressions changed drastically, and they hurriedly turned around and fled.","This made Ling Han very depressed. He wasn't a god of death, so why did everyone avoid him when they saw him?","If the large black dog were here, he would definitely say in disdain, \"Brat, you don't even blink when you kill the Imperial Son. Why should others be afraid of you? Don't you have any estimates in your heart?\"","Another dozen over days later, Ling Han suddenly discovered that the ground was trembling.","Yi, he had not encountered this before.","There was indeed some movement when the waves of fire surged out, but it was definitely not as great as this.","He didn't dare to be careless. He leaped up and stood in the air.","However, no waves of fire surged over, and instead, the stone pillars lit up one after another.","Xiu, xiu, xiu, pillars of light shot out madly.","Ling Han hurriedly descended, brandishing his fists to parry.","Even so, when he landed on the ground, blood was still dripping from his fist.","Boom, right at this moment, the tremors from the ground became even more intense. Ling Han shockingly discovered that the sky was actually spinning.","No, it was not the world that was spinning, but rather that the whole stone forest had suddenly moved.","All of a sudden, his movements sped up, and Ling Han discovered that the ground level in the distance was rapidly becoming lower, and a great many areas that could not be seen at first were all visible — this forest of stone was presently rising into the air.","What on earth was going on?","At this moment, waves of fire surged out.","Run!","Ling Han hurriedly flew away. He wasn't the only one; multiple people were standing in midair.","Everyone looked ahead in shock. That stone forest... was shockingly a person!","No, to be more precise, this was the skin of a certain human figure. His entire body was covered with stone spikes. Previously, he had been lying on the ground, and now, he had suddenly stood up. Thus, everyone felt as if the world around them was spinning.","Hiss, such a colossal person?","Compared to him, the giants they had encountered on the island were on two completely different levels.","It could be clearly seen that there were multiple holes on this \"person\", and it was presently spewing out flames.","This super giant released a howl of pain. Its voice was like thunder, so loud that everyone's eardrums seemed like they were about to burst.","He stretched out a finger and dug into a hole. After a while, he actually took out an insect that was as long as three hundred meters. Its entire body was covered with crimson scales. Then, he ruthlessly threw it onto the ground, and stepped on it.","\"Zhi!\" The insect released a strange cry, and was stomped into mush.","Ling Han saw very clearly that the scales on the insect's body were exactly the same as the one that he had drawn into the Primal Chaos Lightning Tower.","As it turned out, the so-called sinkhole was actually a wound left behind by this kind of insect that had wormed into the body of the giant.","This giant began digging in the other wounds, and drew out long insects, one after another. He trampled them to death. Every time he dug, he would howl, his voice shaking the world so much that it paled in comparison.","When he had emptied out all the insects in his body, it was as if he had lost all his strength. Boom, he collapsed onto the ground, turning once more into a forest of stone.","Everyone's eyes were wide open, as they watched this scene that stunned them, unable to come back to their senses for a long time.","What breed was this giant? And what the hell was this insect?","Yet Ling Han's eyes swept over the area. The giant had already shifted position, leaving behind a massive pit where he had been lying, and in this pit, there were actually a great many plants growing.","Celestial medicine!","His eyes immediately lit up.","These Celestial medicines should have been nurtured by the life force of the giant. After all, there were a great many openings on his body, so there would definitely be energy essence seeping out, turning this place into a small-scale Medicinal Garden.","Xiu, he immediately rushed out, heading straight for the place where the energy was the densest."]},{"number":4440,"title":"Chapter 4440 Black Heavenly Dao Lotus","paragraphs":["\"Humph!\"","Four Golden Generations immediately came to their senses, and set off in pursuit of Ling Han.","The reactions of the others weren't slow either. They followed closely behind Guan Xinghan and the others.","There were only so many Celestial medicines, and those who were faster would be able to obtain them.","Because the wounds of the giant were distributed all over the body, the Celestial medicines were also growing in patches, far apart.","As they flew, everyone made their own choice, and headed towards the growth points of different Celestial medicines.","—Everyone wanted to obtain the best Celestial medicine, but that meant an incredibly intense competition. They would have to weigh their own strength first. Otherwise, they would only miss out on this great opportunity for nothing.","Ling Han headed directly for the Celestial medicine that he felt had the strongest energy, and the four people from the Golden Generation followed closely behind. Feng Miaoling had also appeared. Her speed was similarly swift, not falling the slightest bit behind.","With the six of them here, the others naturally would not seek their own humiliation and fight over this Celestial medicine. If they did, it could only leave themselves empty-handed.","\"Black Heavenly Dao Lotus!\" Chang Daoyu was the first to recognize the origins of that Celestial medicine.","He was the Imperial Son of the Chang Clan, and there was no need to mention the Chang Clan. They were the owner of Galaxy Network. After countless generations of accumulation, the depth of their wealth was something that ordinary people would not even dare to think about.","Hearing his words, Guan Xinghan and the others all looked tempted.","Black Heavenly Dao Lotus, among Six Star Celestial medicines, it could be called peak grade.","What was Minor Advanced Tier?","Cultivating the fruits of cultivation in the mind, plucking the Celestial Qi to nurture them, and when the fruits of cultivation reached Great Accomplishment-level, it would be the day that one reached the consummate level of Minor Advanced Tier.","And the heaven and earth was filled with energy everywhere, but there were very few types that could be called Celestial Qi, and they had to be captured in the Void. And among Celestial medicines like the Black Heavenly Dao Lotus, there was at least a streak of Celestial Qi contained within.","Hence, even for the Golden Generation, this was still an irresistible temptation.","Ling Han's speed was the fastest. With the blessing of Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, who could compare to him in speed?","He did not care whether this was the Black Heavenly Dao Lotus or something else, as long as it was a Celestial medicine.","Xiu, his figure landed on the ground, and pulled out the Black Heavenly Dao Lotus, directly throwing it into his Spatial Spirit Tool.","\"Impudence!\" Guan Xinghan and the others roared. They all charged toward Ling Han.","\"Scram!\" Feng Miaoling shouted, brandishing her sword to slash at Guan Xinghan and the others.","Shua, the sword light was especially fierce, capable of piercing through the Void.","Guan Xinghan and the others were all about to go crazy. Was there something wrong with you, woman? It was clearly Ling Han who had obtained the Black Heavenly Dao Lotus, but why did you attack us?","Idiot!","However, though Feng Miaoling's strength was slightly inferior to theirs, there wasn't much of a gap between them. When this sword strike swept past, they had no choice but to parry.","With this, they naturally could no longer stop Ling Han.","Ling Han's figure flashed again, and he did not greedily pluck the other Celestial medicines. Instead, he left quickly.","Guan Xinghan's eyes were baleful as he stared at Feng Miaoling. \"Are you seeking death?\"","Feng Miaoling was completely unafraid, and said calmly, \"I have killed at least eighty Imperial Sons, even if not a hundred. Who do you think you are?\"","These words caused Guan Xinghan's expression to become filled with fury. He was the Golden Generation, and was acclaimed as one of the people closest to the young Great Emperors of the past. However, Ling Han and this woman completely didn't take the Golden Generation seriously.","What right do you all have?","Chang Daoyu, Liu Xiyun and Su Qianhai, the three Golden Generations, were also seething with killing intent. Since Ling Han had fled, they would vent their anger on this woman.","\"Fine, if you're so determined to seek death, then I'll oblige you!\" Guan Xinghan waved his hands, launching a palm strike at Feng Miaoling.","Feng Miaoling dodged, and didn't confront him head-on.","She wasn't stupid. Guan Xinghan's strength was superior to hers, so fighting him head-on wasn't a good idea.","Chang Daoyu and the others exchanged looks, and joined the battle at the same time.","They wanted to capture Feng Miaoling at the first instant, and use her to threaten Ling Han.","—This woman had stepped out bravely for Ling Han's sake. Clearly, the relationship between the two of them was not shallow.","Ling Han frowned upon hearing this. Although he didn't want to have any kind of relationship with Feng Miaoling, Feng Miaoling had indeed helped him just then. If he left now, he would definitely feel guilty.","He had travelled the world, and the most important thing was having a clear conscience.","The four Golden Generations attacked in unison. Just how terrifying was this?","Amongst those at the level of Sect Master, who could stop this?","Although Feng Miaoling was a freakish prodigy who had surpassed countless years, and her battle prowess at the same cultivation level was incredibly powerful, she was at a disadvantage in terms of cultivation level. She couldn't even match Guan Xinghan alone, what more four Golden Generations.","Instantly, she was in a dangerous situation.","\"Sigh, women are so troublesome!\" Ling Han sighed, yet charged back.","If Feng Miaoling hadn't interfered, he could have actually fled too. However, favors were favors, and these were separate matters.","Seeing Ling Han charge back, Feng Miaoling couldn't help but reveal a sweet smile.","F***, don't f****** misunderstand.","Ling Han immediately wanted to turn around and run back, but this was naturally impossible. Thus, he could only brace himself and charge over.","\"Haha, you've come to seek death!\" Chang Daoyu said with a cold chuckle. He launched a palm strike at Ling Han.","He was a Nine Star Sect Master, and added with the fact that he was the Golden Generation, he was already standing at the peak of Sect Master-level. Just how terrifying was the might of his strike?","Ling Han was no match for him at all, and he hurriedly turned around to dodge.","\"Let's go!\" he shouted at Feng Miaoling.","Feng Miaoling nodded, and charged out with her sword, meeting up with Ling Han.","The four Imperial Sons did not stop her, and took advantage of the opening to form a siege, surrounding Ling Han and Feng Miaoling.","\"Now, you guys are like turtles in a jar!\" Su Qianhai declared balefully.","\"Is that so?\" Ling Han bared his teeth in a grin. The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was unleashed, directly throwing out four scales of fire.","Hong, Venerate Tier-level aura surged out.","The four Imperial Sons were all astounded. F***, why had Ling Han suddenly launched a Venerate Tier-level attack?","They hurriedly dodged, and no matter how conceited they were, they did not dare to match the might of a Venerate Tier.","However, they immediately discovered that they had been tricked.","Though the scale was burning with Venerate Tier-level flames, the force of the attack was extremely weak. They only had to wave their hands and they would be able to sweep it away.","Thus, there was no need for them to dodge at all.","However, the subconscious reaction was definitely to seek fortune and avoid calamity. This was the most normal response.","Taking advantage of this opportunity, Ling Han and Feng Miaoling took advantage of it to escape from the encirclement.","The four Imperial Sons hurriedly gave chase, but whether it was Ling Han or Feng Miaoling, their speed was not inferior to the four Imperial Sons at all. In fact, they had even surpassed them. Thus, as they chased, they were instead getting further and further away from Ling Han and Feng Miaoling.","Finally, they had no choice but to stop harshly.","Damn it, that was a Black Heavenly Dao Lotus!","Flames of fury flickered in the eyes of the four Imperial Sons. Minor Advanced Tier was really too hard to cultivate. Even if they all had the full support of their clans, their progress was still very slow.","For Chang Daoyu and Su Qianhai, this Celestial medicine was enough to help them break through to Venerate Tier-level, and for Guan Xinghan and Liu Xiyun, the Black Heavenly Dao Lotus was more or less enough to help them advance into Nine Stars.","But now, all this had nothing to do with them.","\"If you see him, kill him!\"","\"En!\"","The four of them nodded at the same time. Ling Han definitely had to die. He had really become a serious threat to their path of becoming Emperor."]},{"number":4441,"title":"Chapter 4441 Dimensions Change","paragraphs":["Ling Han and Feng Miaoling ran madly, shaking off their pursuers before finally slowing down.","\"Er, thanks,\" Ling Han said to Feng Miaoling.","Feng Miaoling smiled beautifully, \"You are my future husband, so it is only right that I help you.\"","Er, if you don't say such words, there is still a way for us to communicate.","\"Bye.\" Ling Han turned around and ran.","\"Hey, I'm not an ugly woman!\" Feng Miaoling chased after him, and as she did so, she removed her veil, revealing a breathtakingly beautiful face. She was definitely no inferior to Song Lan, Chi Menghan, and the others.","Ling Han swept an eye over her, and was indeed stunned for a moment. However, he presently was not in the mood for romance, nor did he want to trifle with this crazy woman. If he really took her into his harem, who knows, she may kill the empress and the others.","He definitely couldn't touch this hornet's nest.","Flee.","Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was used, and very soon, he had disappeared without a trace.","After throwing Feng Miaoling off his tail, Ling Han began to study the Black Heavenly Dao Lotus.","\"There is actually Celestial Qi in this!\" Ling Han was stunned. No wonder Guan Xinghan and the others had pursued him so intently.","There were countless energies in the heaven and earth, such as the power of fire, the power of water, and the power of lightning. They could all be absorbed and refined into mystical power. Thus, they could all be called ordinary energy or low-level energy.","And in the case of high-level energy, it could not be refined, and could only be used in battle — aside from a freak like the True Dragon, who had actually created a cultivation technique, which would allow a cultivator to use high-level energy to temper their physique.","However, there was also some extremely rare energy. It was of an extremely high level, yet could be absorbed and refined. Every time a sliver of it was refined, it would be of great help to the improvement of one's cultivation level.","This was called Celestial Qi!","—Cultivating progressed one step at a time, but if one could endlessly absorb Celestial Qi, he could completely realize a leap in cultivation level.","And in the case of the Minor Advanced Tiers who had formed the fruits of cultivation, they could only use the Celestial Qi as irrigation to stimulate the growth of the fruits. They had an incredibly strong yearning for the Celestial Qi.","To describe in further detail, there was actually a difference among Celestial Qi. There was also a notion of quality.","Even for Imperial Clans, which had an astonishing background, and also had a considerable number of Celestial Qi, in terms of high quality Celestial Qi... hoho, that was in extremely limited supply.","When Celestial Qi of different quality was nurtured, the quality of the fruits of cultivation that grew would also be different. Thus, so many Golden Generations had all advanced into Sect Master Tier, but why had only three of them broken through to Venerate Tier?","It wasn't that others couldn't, but rather that their fruits of cultivation hadn't reached perfection yet, and they were unwilling to break through.","And in the case of this Black Heavenly Dao Lotus, the Celestial Qi contained within was of extremely high quality, and would be of great help in improving the quality of the fruits of cultivation.","No wonder Guan Xinghan and the others seemed to have gone crazy after seeing Ling Han take away the Black Heavenly Dao Lotus.","\"Should I eat it or not?\" Ling Han hesitated slightly.","The Black Heavenly Dao Lotus wasn't meant for Spirit Transformation Tier. If he ate it now, the Celestial Qi within it could only be used to increase his cultivation level, and wouldn't have the effect of improving the fruits of cultivation. It was equivalent to a massive waste.","\"The most pressing matter for me now is to increase my cultivation level. Otherwise, I can only run when I see those Golden Generations.\"","\"So what if it's a waste? As long as my cultivation level increases, would I still need to worry about not being able to obtain Celestial Qi?\"","Ling Han was very decisive, and immediately began to eat the Black Heavenly Dao Lotus.","However, this thing was not delicious at all. It was like chewing on grass, causing Ling Han to frown deeply.","\"There should be no one else that would experience such pain when ingesting a high-level Celestial medicine as I am now.\"","\"At this moment, I am really envious of the Ox Tribe and Horse Tribe. They are herbivorous in the first place, and there is nothing unusual for them to eat this.\"","After ingesting the Celestial medicine, the effects were immediately produced.","Bursts of energy surged, incredibly dense.","In his mind, the self was like a bottomless pit, madly absorbing this energy, not leaving a single bit behind. His appetite was astonishingly huge.","However, this Celestial medicine was originally prepared for the Minor Advanced Tier. No matter how freakish he was, he was only in the Spirit Transformation Tier, and was close to reaching its peak. Thus, after half a day, he felt that he had reached the consummate level and was no longer absorbing the medicinal effects.","All right, he had finally reached the consummate level of the Spirit Transformation Tier. Next, he only had to stabilize his cultivation level, and he would be able to break through to the Minor Advanced Tier.","Yi?","He was just about to breathe a sigh of relief. He could finally break through to a higher cultivation level. However, he suddenly discovered that the millions and millions of dimensions in his body were trembling slightly at the same time. They began to absorb the medicinal effects, turning them into pure energy, causing the Spiritual Qi in each dimension to increase greatly.","What was going on here?","What are you all joining in on the excitement for?","A long time ago, Ling Han had fed back to the dimensions in his body, raising all the dimensions to the transcendent level, but now, it seemed like these dimensions were going to evolve again, and advance to a new height.","Ling Han was a little worried. His consciousness entered into the dimensions, and stood together with Shui Yanyu and the others, carefully sensing for any changes.","The Spiritual Qi increased dramatically.","Though the medicinal effects were shared among millions and millions of dimensions, and for every dimension, what they obtained was only a sliver, the dimensions themselves were also of a very low level. A sliver was enough to bring about a massive change.","With the explosive increase in Spiritual Qi, plants grew madly, and all things showed signs of developing a spirit, and the path of cultivation for intelligent creatures became even easier.","What did this signify?","Ling Han could obtain even more Power of Dimensions than this.","That was because the Power of Dimensions was the power of living beings, and only intelligent living beings could respond to Ling Han's consciousness and provide him with Spiritual Power.","Now, the number of intelligent living beings was beginning to increase, and each of them had also become stronger. The Power of Dimension that he had obtained naturally improved as well.","Celestial Qi... actually brought about such a change?","Ling Han was astounded. This was naturally a good thing for him, because a great many extreme breakthroughs were related to the Power of Dimension in his body.","He channelled the Imperial Scroll, speeding up the circulation of the medicinal effects. Though the Imperial Scroll was ineffective at the level of Tenth Change, it was a piece of cake to speed up the circulation of the medicinal effects.","Two days later, the effects brought about by the Black Heavenly Dao Lotus were finally exhausted.","Ling Han's true self was already at the consummate level, reaching the peak stage of the Spirit Transformation Tier. However, he had a feeling that he probably hadn't reached the consummate level of the Spirit Transformation Tier yet. The key lay in the dimensions inside his body.","He could now attempt to break through to the Minor Advanced Tier, but the fruits of cultivation that he bore would definitely be affected, and he would not be able to reach his strongest.","What he pursued was the path of the strongest, so how could he be willing to accept an imperfection?","\"That's good too.\"","Ling Han nodded and said, \"I'll stabilize my cultivation level and prepare to break through to the Minor Advanced Tier. Meanwhile, I'll also continue to search for Celestial Qi, allowing the dimensions in my body to evolve again and reach perfection.\"","However, this was very difficult.","Ling Han sighed. Celestial Qi could only be captured by elites at the Minor Advanced Tier. If one's cultivation level wasn't high enough, they wouldn't be able to sense it at all. They could only obtain it from Celestial medicines or natural treasures. It was something that could only be encountered by chance.","Thankfully, this was Imperial Path.","\"The Imperial Path is actually not to help you become Emperor, but to help you build a good foundation as much as possible, so that you would have the qualifications to break through to become a Great Emperor.\"","Ling Han nodded. Why was it that the Great Emperor was basically in the top ten, or even the top three in fact, among those that had walked out of the Imperial Path?","That was because there was great fortune for those who were in the lead!"]},{"number":4442,"title":"Chapter 4442 CIty at the seabed","paragraphs":["Ling Han stood up, and continued on his way.","The giant had already shifted its position, so there was already a stretch of flat land ahead of him.","At this time, the others had already left, and there were a great many people that had stayed behind in the North Prosperity City. They would not advance any further, and would stay here until the Imperial Path closed, and leave safely.","The previous adventures had already frightened these people, and they did not dare to take any more risks.","Ling Han passed by this massive pit, and after walking for a few more days, he saw a vast ocean stretching out in front of him.","Yi, why was it an ocean again?","The previous trip to the seven islands was still vivid in his mind. In the blink of an eye, he was going to do it again?","Ling Han tried to fly over, but with a plop, he fell into the sea.","Sure enough, there was a terrifying pressure in the air, making it impossible for him to maintain flight. However, there was no terrifying killing intent in the sea, so he could completely swim freely.","Since that was the case, Ling Han didn't expend any more effort to find a way to travel through the air. Instead, he dove into the depths of the sea.","Perhaps, there would be some Celestial medicines in the sea?","At present, he was filled with longing for Celestial Qi, and he could not directly capture it from the heaven and earth, so he could only set his sights on the Celestial medicine.","He hoped that he would be extremely lucky.","The sea... was filled with vitality.","This wasn't a dead sea, but one that was filled with seaweed, fish, shrimp, and all kinds of other lifeforms. However, these lifeforms were all in their most primitive states. They hadn't stepped on the path of cultivation and developed intelligence.","Ling Han continued to swim. Even in the great ocean, he could still channel the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. With a flap of his fiery wings, he could instantly evaporate a large area of seawater around him, so his speed would not be greatly affected.","Of course, if it weren't necessary, he wouldn't have channeled the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight either. After all, this would expend a lot of mystical power.","As he advanced, the variety of living creatures became more and more varied, and also became larger and larger. Ling Han saw giant fish that were several hundred meters long, as well as sea turtles that looked like small islands.","As he advanced, the variety of living creatures became more and more varied, and also became larger and larger. Ling Han saw giant fish that were several hundred meters long, as well as sea turtles that looked like small islands.","These living beings still hadn't developed intelligence, but their bodies were nurtured by the power of heaven and earth, so they had boundless strength. They were already qualified to be called vicious beasts.","Some giant fish were extremely fierce, and after discovering Ling Han, they immediately launched an attack. In the end, they were naturally easily killed by Ling Han. If he found that it was delicious, he would put it away, and if it wasn't delicious, he would directly discard it.","Unfortunately, he did not discover a Celestial medicine.","Sigh, this was the Celestial medicine, after all. How could it be so easily discovered? Furthermore, there should be quite a number of people walking in front of him. Even if there was Celestial medicine, it would have already been plucked.","Another few days later, a city suddenly appeared ahead of him.","Yi!","This was not an island that had appeared in the sea. There was a city on this island, and it was at the bottom of the sea!","This city was extremely large, and it was circular in shape. In the center of the city, there was a tall tower that almost reached the surface of the sea. Then, the height of the buildings on the side gradually decreased, and when they reached the outermost circle, they were only six to nine meters tall.","The architectural style of the city was very gaudy. Some were made into the shape of a conch, while others were shell-like. They were all based on marine creatures.","In the city, there were very strange creatures swimming here and there.","Some were murlocs, but for some that too were murlocs, they had the head of a fish, the body of a fish, and then the lower half of a human. Some were the opposite, having the head of a human, and human arms, but the lower half was the body of a fish.","Aside from the murlocs, there were also lobstermen, octopusmen, and crabmen. Like the murlocs, they had two forms.","This was the city of the Sea Race.","Ling Han immediately swam over. It was a good thing that there was a change in the scenery. He had been afraid that he would be wandering around aimlessly. That could very possibly be a waste of time.","As expected, he wasn't the first to arrive. There were other outsiders in the city, and this was also one of the reasons why Ling Han swam over without hesitation.","The members of the Sea Race didn't pay much attention to him. Perhaps there were too many outsiders here, so he was naturally unremarkable.","However, the people and objects here did not exist for no reason.","Just take the stone forest from before as an example. It was actually a super giant, and insects had wormed into its body and wreaked havoc from the colossal pit. When the giant left, a large amount of Celestial medicines appeared.","Then, what was the purpose of the existence of this city?","Ling Han roamed around, trying to understand the situation.","After a while, he had a rough understanding of this city.","This was the Blue Star Nation, which was ruled by the Blue Star King, and in the far north, there was another Underworld Nation, which was constantly at odds with the Blue Star Nation.","By this generation, there was hope that this feud could be resolved, because the Blue Star King only had one daughter, and in the case of the Underworld Nation, the old king only had one son. The two kings had the intention in having the next generation unite in matrimony. In that way, the two nations would become one, and there would naturally be no more disputes.","This was a good thing. The Prince of the Underworld Nation had already come here, but the princess of the Blue Star Nation had disappeared.","Now, the whole nation was alarmed, and were searching for the whereabouts of this princess.","The disappearance of the princess was a huge matter in the first place, and at this point in time... could it be that it was the doing of the stubborn people in the country, who were determined to fight, and did not want to form an alliance through marriage with the Underworld Nation?","Of course, it was also possible that the culpits were supporters of war from the Underworld, because if the two nations merged, it was destined that some people would lose their power.","In short, the most important thing now was to find the missing princess, so they naturally were not in the mood to care about the problem of outsiders.","As long as they didn't cause trouble, no one would care about them.","Not long after, he encountered Su Qianhai, one of the Golden Generation elites. The latter did not say another word, and immediately charged over. His terrifying battle prowess was not affected even in the great sea.","Ling Han didn't linger in battle, and directly fled.","But this time, he was angered. After shaking off Su Qianhai, he quietly returned.","When the Strange Shadow Steps unfolded, he was like a shadow in the sea. Unless one had a cultivation level that far surpassed him, and was close enough, it would be impossible to discover his existence.","He walked quietly just like that, and found Su Qianhai.","Did they think that he could only passively take a beating?","He snuck over, then suddenly attacked. As he shot out a punch, the Destructive Energy blazed. He had pushed his battle prowess to the extreme.","Peng!","Su Qianhai was a Nine Star Sect Master, after all, and furthermore, he was a Golden Generation. Though he had been hit in a rush, he managed to parry in time, and parried this punch from Ling Han. In fact, the rebound from the collision was extremely terrifying, and sent Ling Han flying, throwing up blood madly.","However, Su Qianhai immediately discovered that where Ling Han's punch had landed, his flesh and bones were actually melting, as if they had disappeared into thin air.","He paled in shock, and decisively severed a large piece of flesh in this area, along with the bones.","He could clearly see that the blood, flesh, and bones that had been severed immediately disappeared into thin air.","What terrifying destructive power.","He looked at Ling Han in the distance as he channeled his secret technique. His blood and flesh instantly began to regenerate, but the growth of his bones slowed considerably. As he approached Ling Han, he said in a baleful voice, \"I didn't expect you to be proficient in the Strange Shadow Steps of the Battle God Palace!\"","As expected of the Golden Generation. He had seen through it just like that?","Ling Han laughed loudly, \"So, you had best keep your eyes open when you sleep. Otherwise, you won't even know when I will chop off your head!\""]},{"number":4443,"title":"Chapter 4443 Missing Princess","paragraphs":["Faced with Ling Han's provocation, Su Qianhai was actually rendered speechless.","He really couldn't catch up to Ling Han, and Ling Han had also mastered the mysterious movement technique of the Battle God Palace. It was really impossible to guard against him when he was planning to kill.","Why was the Battle God Palace so infamous, that others hated and feared them at the same time?","No one knew where their lair was, and the other reason was naturally the Strange Shadow Steps. Many people had been assassinated, without even knowing what was going on.","\"Who would've thought that your true identity is an assassin from the Battle God Palace!\" Su Qianhai finally spoke up.","Ling Han waved his hand dismissively, \"Hehe, don't flatter the Battle God Palace. They are not qualified to take in a prodigy like me! Hehe, it was only by chance that I managed to learn a movement technique from the Battle God Palace.\"","Just how lucky are you?","In truth, in terms of speed, the greatest technique in the world was definitely the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, but in terms of concealment, it would definitely be the Strange Shadow Steps.","Su Qianhai just looked at Ling Han like that, the killing intent in his eyes cold.","It wasn't that he didn't want to kill Ling Han, but that he couldn't.","If one wanted to kill Ling Han, it would either have to be a Venerate Tier elite making a move, or one had to plan ahead of time, so that the latter would not be able to make full use of his advantage in speed. Otherwise, if Phoenix Wings Divine Flightwas used, what Sect Master would be able to catch up to him?","A powerful sense of urgency rose up in his heart. By the looks of it, he had to advance into the fourth pinnacle level. After becoming a Venerate Tier, he only had to stretch stretch out a hand, and heaven and earth could be controlled. Wouldn't it be easy to kill Ling Han then?","However, the problem was that his fruits of cultivation hadn't reached perfection yet. If he allowed the fruits of cultivation to transform into the Fourth Extreme at this moment, it would definitely affect his future potential.","At this moment, he was extremely conflicted.","\"Dumb c*nt, I'll come kill you next time. There's no need to send me off.\" Ling Han's figure flashed, and the Strange Shadow Steps activated. He once again fled into the darkness.","Though Su Qianhai was so angry that even his hair was standing on end, there was nothing he could do.","After Ling Han roamed around the city for two days, the royal family suddenly issued a bounty.","Anyone who could provide information on the whereabouts of the princess would be rewarded with five kilograms of Extreme Radiance Shell, and if they could bring the princess back, they would be rewarded with an additional Extreme Cold Pearl!","Ling Han made some analyses. The Extreme Radiance Shell was really a kind of shell. Its taste was incredibly fresh and delicious, and was also greatly nutritious. It would be of great help in improving one's cultivation level and physique.","And the Extreme Cold Pearl was even more incredible. That was a natural treasure, nurtured by heaven and earth, and contained Celestial Qi!","When the news spread out, not only were the citizens of the Blue Star Nation excited, even the outsiders were restless. In fact, there were also cultivators from the distant Underworld Nation that were rapidly rushing over, wanting to join the ranks of searching for the Blue Star Princess.","Ling Han's heart thumped in excitement. This was Celestial Qi! He needed it!","Sigh, others would only need Celestial Qi after becoming a Sect Master, but him? He actually needed it long before that, when he was only in Spirit Transformation Tier.","However, this also proved how freakish he was.","However, the sea was boundless, so where was he supposed to find this Blue Star Princess?","This was in line with the saying, it was like fishing out a needle from the sea.","Ling Han first went to the palace, but discovered that the royal family here could not be more approachable. Though there were guards in the palace, they were very polite towards the commoners, and there was no ban on visitors at all — as long as they did not go to the bedroom of the king, queen and princess.","With such lax defenses, whether the Blue Star Princess had been kidnapped, or she had left home on her own, either could happen too easily.","Had she run away from home?","Of course, this was very likely. That was because this princess may not agree to marry, so wasn't it very understandable for her to throw a tantrum and run away from home?","But whether the Blue Star Princess had been kidnapped, or she had run off on her own, where should they go to find her?","Several days had already passed, and there were no more clues. How were they supposed to find her?","Ling Han exited the city and roamed around aimlessly. However, he didn't find anything.","This sea was so big, and it was a three-dimensional one at that. If a person was really hidden here, how could they possibly find her?","He racked his brains.","This Blue Star Princess had not disappeared earlier or later, but just so happened to be at such a crucial time when outsiders had come. This was really too coincidental.","Thus, Ling Han definitely wouldn't believe that this wasn't deliberately planned.","Unknowingly, there was a force behind this.","This was Imperial Path, and could be seen as the heaven and earth moving to select a future Great Emperor. Thus, it was very normal for there to be traces of arrangements.","Since that was the case, then the whereabouts of the Blue Star Princess would definitely be traceable. It would not really be like trying to find a needle in a haystack.","Yi?","Could it be that this princess was actually still in the city?","Ling Han suddenly had a flash of inspiration. If a princess who enjoyed a comfortable life suddenly had to wander the world, and there was no shortage of fierce beasts in the sea, how many days would this princess be able to live?","The conditions for obtaining the bounty were that the princess had to return to the palace alive.","Thus, if the Blue Star Princess was still in the city, then where would she be?","Firstly, it must be a very remote place. Otherwise, no matter how well it was hidden, there would definitely be clues left behind. Secondly, there must be someone taking care of her. Otherwise, there would still be clues left behind.","With these two points in mind, Ling Han began to sift through his memory, based on his understanding of this city from the last few days.","\"There are a total of three places.\"","\"The two places are poverty-stricken caves, and there are both good and bad people mixed in. Even the power of the nation would find it very difficult to infiltrate these places. They are both controlled by the underground forces.\"","\"There's also a land of the dead. An earthquake happened in the past, and a terrifying energy surged out. All living things were wiped out there, and it's still considered a land of the dead and uninhabited.\"","\"En, let's go to this danger zone first.\"","Ling Han immediately set off, and soon arrived at his destination.","Previously, he had come here, but did not venture too deep, because he could still sense a strange energy fluctuation.","However, this time was different. He planned to search carefully.","At this moment, he felt a little regretful. That was because there was only one self, and there was no spiritual body that he could send out to help him search.","\"There are gains and losses. Although I have lost some convenience, my own battle prowess has become stronger. This is what is most important.\"","Ling Han strolled slowly. In the centre of this area, there was shockingly a ravine that was so deep that one could not see the bottom. There was also rolling energy seeping out from within, causing one's heart to palpitate.","\"Hmm?\"","He faltered slightly. He had actually heard a song.","This was a female voice, extremely ethereal.","It couldn't be so coincidental that it was that Blue Star Princess that was singing, right?","He followed the direction of the song, and very soon, he saw a figure's back. She was seated on a massive shell, her long hair fluttering in the waves, revealing her snow-white back.","Though she was only showing her back, her willowy waist was slender, her skin was snow-white, and was already very enchanting. However, there was a fish tail growing from the lower half of her body, and it was swaying gently, looking extremely beautiful.","Er, seeing this tail, it should be able to instantly make a great many men lose interest.","Ling Han opened his mouth, and asked, \"Blue Star Princess?\"","The song came to an abrupt stop. The mermaid seemed to have received a shock, and immediately swam forwards. With a wave of her tail, her speed was extremely fast.","Ling Han hurriedly set off in pursuit, and the distance between the two of them rapidly shortened.","Shua, a cold light suddenly shot over from the side, aimed directly at Ling Han's left shoulder."]},{"number":4444,"title":"Chapter 4444 Boss Zhang, the Sea Alligator","paragraphs":["Sneak attack!","However, it was only Spirit Transformation Tier-level.","Now, a Spirit Transformation Tier-level attack wanted to pose a threat to Ling Han? Hehe.","He stretched out a hand and pressed down. This cold light immediately stopped. It was actually a sharp spike.","Ling Han looked towards the side and saw that there was a... sea cucumber standing there?","It was clearly a sea cucumber, but he had a human head, and his whole body was covered with sharp spikes.","F***, did the spines of sea cucumbers look like this?","Ling Han smiled, and said, \"You are misleading my impression of sea cucumbers. If they look like you, would I still have the appetite to eat sea cucumbers in future?\"","That sea cucumber person flew into a thunderous rage, and immediately arched his body. Xiu, xiu, xiu, several more flashes of cold light shot towards Ling Han.","Right at this moment, the woman in front of him suddenly turned around.","Aiyo!","Ling Han's impression of the mermaid also crumbled abruptly. This was indeed a female's image, but her face was green, and her skin was layered at that. It would be more accurate to call her a vengeful spirit with a green face and fangs.","Could this possibly be the Blue Star Princess?","Ling Han couldn't help but scratch his head. The Blue Star Nation was really careless. They clearly sent people to search for the missing princess, yet they didn't even hand out a portrait of the princess.","So, was this green-faced, fanged mermaid really the Blue Star Princess?","Shua, this mermaid also charged back, a harpoon in her hand.","Yi?","As the princess of a nation, would she use such a tasteless weapon? Furthermore, you yourself are a fish, so is it really good to use a harpoon?","Ling Han mocked internally as he brandished his fists.","Peng! A terrifying power surged, and the mermaid's hands instantly loosened. The weapon slipped from her hands, and the web between her thumb and forefinger split open, blood dripping.","The sea cucumber person hurriedly charged over as well. His whole body shook, and sharp spikes shot out madly.","Ling Han activated the Starlight Screen, and the sharp spikes couldn't break through his defenses at all.","He smiled faintly, \"Come, tell me about your origins.\"","The mermaid and sea cucumber both looked stunned. This opponent was too strong. They were completely no match for him.","The two of them still wanted to resist stubbornly, but Ling Han had already lost all patience. The barrage of murderous aura surged out, immediately causing the two of them to scream in pain.","Of course, he had only used a little of his might. Otherwise, with this strike, the minds of the two of them would have long since been destroyed.","\"I'll speak! I'll speak!\"","\"We are the subordinates of the Sea Alligator, Boss Zhang.\"","The two of them hurriedly confessed.","\"What Sea Alligator, Boss Zhang?\" Ling Han asked.","The sea cucumber man hurriedly explained. This Sea Alligator, Boss Zhang, was the boss of one of the two underground gangs in the slums. It was said that he had once been a general of the Blue Star Nation, but for some reason, he suddenly quit the army. Instead, he went to the slums.","This was a Sect Master elite. Thus, he quickly suppressed that slum and became the leader.","\"Then why did you guys ambush me?\" Ling Han asked.","The two of them stuttered for a moment before finally revealing the truth. As it turned out, Boss Zhang was also looking for the Blue Star Princess, and had sent his subordinates to search everywhere for the whereabouts of this princess, while the \"mermaid\" and sea cucumber were responsible for searching this area.","Of course, they had not gained much here, but an idea came to them, and they decided to carry out a robbery here, because they knew that there would definitely be a great many outsiders that were also searching for the Blue Star Princess.","However, it was a shame that their first business trip ended up encountering Ling Han. Not only did they not reap any rewards, but they even ended up as prisoners.","Ling Han didn't make things difficult for the two of them. They only wanted to rob him, and had no intention of killing him. Thus, after he counter-robbed them, he let the two of them leave.","He searched again, but did not find any clues about the Blue Star Princess, so he could only leave.","Now, there were only two places left, which were the two slums.","Would the Blue Star Princess be there?","In that kind of place, the boss of an underground force had extremely great power. In their territory, if someone wanted to live quietly for a period of time, the chances of this was extremely low.","Then, wasn't the Blue Star Princess in these two slums?","Ling Han thought for a moment, but still decided to personally take a look.","He set out, and soon arrived at the east side of the city.","The buildings in the city were the tallest in the center, symbolizing imperial authority, and the further one went, the shorter these buildings became, and when one reached the slums, they were only a few meters tall. There were no more gorgeous adornments like corals, and they looked dilapidated.","The moment Ling Han entered, he instantly attracted the gazes of many people. They all turned to look at him.","However, they all ignored him, having no intention of speaking to him.","After walking for a short while, two octopus people walked over and stopped him.","\"Our boss wants to see you,\" one of them said.","\"Who is your boss?\" Ling Han asked.","\"Sea Alligator, Boss Zhang!\"","Ling Han thought for a moment, then said, \"All right, then let's go and meet him.\"","With these two octopus people leading the way, or rather holding him hostage, they arrived at a conch-shaped building.","The room was very big. After Ling Han walked in, he suddenly felt as if he had entered into a nation of giants.","Indeed, the citizens of the Blue Star Nation were generally huge in size.","\"You're the one who robbed my subordinates?\" A voice rang out, and a sturdy man was seated at the end of the room.","His upper body was human, but his lower body was a crocodile. He had two long legs and an even thicker tail, covered with green scales.","Yi, aren't crocodile's legs very short? What breed are you considered?","Ling Han mocked internally, already confirming the other's identity.","The Sea Alligator, Boss Zhang.","Ling Han's eyes swept over him. With the activation of his eye technique, he had tentatively determined that the other's cultivation level was Six Star Sect Master.","His maximum battle prowess was around five stars, so he probably wouldn't be able to win against this sea crocodile person. However, with his defenses, he wouldn't necessarily lose either.","\"They wanted to rob me, but they weren't as powerful as me. Thus, I turned around to rob them instead,\" Ling Han explained with a smile.","Yet the Sea Alligator smirked coldly, \"On the basis that you have not hurt anyone, return the items, and apologize, and I will forget the past.\"","Ling Han shook his head, \"Boss Zhang is really protective of his own people!\"","\"Humph, no matter how big a mistake my people have made, it is not up to others to interfere!\" Sea Alligator Zhang declared very domineeringly.","\"Then I'm afraid I won't be able to comply.\" Ling Han stood up and was just about to leave.","\"Humph, did I allow you to leave?\" the Sea Alligator said menacingly. Suddenly, he stretched out a hand, and grabbed out at Ling Han.","Ling Han replied with a punch of his own. Peng! The two of them exchanged a blow, instantly creating powerful ripples of water, causing the conch house to instantly shatter.","Thankfully, this seawater had a very strong digestive ability for power, and added with the fact that the structures here were extraordinarily sturdy, when the conch house was shattered, the remaining power had more or less dissipated.","The Sea Alligator was astonished, and looked at Ling Han in disbelief.","Was this guy really Spirit Transformation Tier?","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"I am indeed a Spirit Transformation Tier, as real as can be. Er, Boss Zhang, are you still going to stop me from leaving?\""]},{"number":4445,"title":"Chapter 4445 Prince of the Underworld Nation","paragraphs":["The Sea Alligator was incredibly stunned.","What kind of Spirit Transformation Tier was this? This was too terrifying, wasn't it? It should be known that he was a Six Stars Sect Master, and to only be at a slight disadvantage even in a head-on clash with him, this kind of strength was truly heaven-defying.","He was a decisive person, and he immediately nodded. \"Those two subordinates of mine are blind. I'll apologize to you on their behalf!\"","—If a Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator provoked a Sect Master, based on the hierarchy of martial arts, this was a crime of great rebellion. The Sect Master was completely capable of killing him.","How could the authority of the Sect Master be slighted?","However, Ling Han had only turned around to rob the two of them, and had not taken their lives. From this aspect, it could be said that he was incredibly generous.","Thus, when the Sea Alligator Zhang discovered that Ling Han had battle prowess on the level of Sect Master, he immediately turned around to apologize to Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled and said, \"Boss Zhang is too polite.\"","\"As an apology, I'll treat you to a meal.\" The Sea Alligator was very direct.","Ling Han politely refused. The members of the Sea Race ate raw food and didn't use firewood, so he wasn't used to eating their food.","\"Boss!\" At this moment, a crabman suddenly rushed in.","\"What's going on?\" The Sea Alligator glanced at him, appearing slightly displeased. He was so flustered, had he forgotten how he usually taught them?","\"There's news about the Blue Star Princess,\" the crabman hurriedly replied.","\"En?\" The Sea Alligator Zhang immediately stood up.","Ling Han was also surprised. He had not thought that he would actually have an unexpected gain from this trip.","The Sea Alligator hesitated slightly, but did not keep their words from Ling Han either, and asked, \"What news?\"","\"Someone said that they have information about the Blue Star Princess, and are currently selling it everywhere,\" the crabman said.","The Sea Alligator Zhang immediately humphed, and said, \"How dare they, to even dare to earn such money!\"","Meanwhile, Ling Han was slightly surprised. Judging by the way the Sea Alligator was speaking, he seemed to be on the side of the Blue Star Royal Family. Then why had he left the army in the first place, and come here to become a boss?","The Sea Alligator looked at Ling Han, and couldn't help but smile, \"Looks like we won't be saying goodbye for the moment.\"","\"Hehe.\" Ling Han laughed as well. At present, everyone was searching for the Blue Star Princess, and this was no secret.","\"Lead the way.\" The sea crocodile said to the crabman.","They set out, and soon arrived at a place in the city.","Unexpectedly, there was actually a queue here, and from the scraps of information, they had all come to find out about the disappearance of the Blue Star Princess.","People came out one after another, and immediately left in large strides.","Had they gotten a clue and begun their search?","Finally, it was Ling Han and the Sea Alligator's turn.","The two of them entered, and there was only a snakeman sitting here. Although he had a human face, his hair was like small snakes that were sleeping.","\"So it is a rotten snake like you!\" Sea Alligator Zhang immediately humphed, his eyes revealing a sliver of killing intent.","\"Please calm your anger, General Zhang!\" The snakeman hurriedly put on a smile, and said, \"I'm a citizen of this nation, so all I earn is lawful money.\"","\"I have long since ceased to be a General of the nation.\" The Sea Alligator shook his head, but there was a sliver of nostalgia in his eyes.","\"General Zhang, are you underestimating my ability to gather intel?\" the snakeman said with a smile. He even blinked at the sea alligator. \"On the basis that you're General Zhang, I'll give you a 60% discount and collect 12 drops of conch spirit from you.\"","\"You really dare to ask!\" The Sea Alligator humphed, \"The princess of the Royal Family has also become a tool for you to earn money?\"","\"Hehe, I have so many lackeys, so we have to earn a living somehow! General Zhang, don't you have to take care of a large group of people? You have to take care of even their daily necessities, so you definitely can understand me.\" The snakeman put on a humble attitude.","The Sea Alligator hesitated for a moment, then threw out a bottle. Then, he said, \"If you give me false information, then chop off your own head.\"","\"Don't worry. I've always been a trustworthy businessman, and I definitely won't screw others over,\" the snakeman said with a smile as he put the vial away.","\"Speak,\" the Sea Alligator said darkly, his expression definitely not looking good.","\"6km east of the Green Source Trench, someone picked up the bracelet that the princess had dropped,\" the snakeman revealed the news.","This bit of information was worth twelve drops of conch spirit, and it was under the condition of a 40% discount?","Ling Han knew that the conch spirit was an extremely valuable treasure in the Blue Star Nation. It could help the members of the Sea Race improve their bloodline.","The Sea Alligator immediately turned around and left.","Ling Han naturally left as well. When they walked out, they shockingly discovered that the entrance had actually been cleared. There were more than 20 guards standing guard, shooing the others aside.","A man in purple-gold scales strode over. There were barely any traces of the Sea Race on him, and only his hands were claws, exuding a baleful chill.","When he saw Sea Alligator Zhang and Ling Han, he humphed, and said, \"Don't block my path, scram!\"","'I?'","There was no prince in the Blue Star Nation.","\"Jiao Delei!\" The Sea Alligator opened his mouth, his eyes focused on this armored man.","\"Oh, and who might this be? So it's General Zhang.\" Jiao Delei smiled proudly, \"However, I heard that General Zhang has already removed his armor and returned to the fields?\"","\"Humph, if the Underworld Nation dares to attack, you guys will still see me on the battlefield!\" Sea Alligator Zhang retorted.","As it turned out, this person was the prince of the Underworld Nation.","His fiancee had gone missing, so it was logical for him to come out and look for her. However, wasn't this attitude a little too arrogant? He had not married the princess yet, and he was already treating this place as his own territory?","Yet Jiao Delei laughed loudly, \"General Zhang must be joking. When I marry the Blue Star Princess, the Underworld Nation and Blue Star Nation would be one family, so how could there be any mention of attack?\"","\"Hehe.\" The Sea Alligator merely responded with a smile, and strode off.","Ling Han naturally would not deal with this Prince of the Underworld Nation, and followed the Sea Alligator.","Instead, it was Jiao Delei. His eyes paused on Ling Han, as if he was curious why Sea Alligator Zhang was involved with a human.","However, he quickly withdrew his gaze, and strode into the house.","His fiancee had gone missing, and whether she had run away on her own volition or been kidnapped, it was a matter that would greatly damage his pride. Thus, he had to find the missing princess as soon as possible.","Ling Han followed the sea alligator. Soon, they left the city, and arrived at a massive oceanic trench. There was a large amount of green seaweed in the oceanic trench. No wonder it was called the Green Source Trench.","After walking along the oceanic trench for a while, the sea alligator stopped, and began to search extremely carefully.","There were signs of a battle here.","However, this was the ocean bed, and there were always ocean currents surging here. Many days had already passed, so what other clues could they find?","After a while, the Sea Alligator shook his head, appearing very disappointed.","The trail had been cut off again?","Unable to find any useful clues, Sea Alligator Zhang's mood was not very high. He merely smiled at Ling Han, and left.","Meanwhile, Ling Han circled around for a while longer. Unfortunately, he had not grasped the Regulations of Time. Otherwise, if he traced back time, he might discover something.","Previously, he had always suspected that the Blue Star Princess had fled from the marriage, but since traces of a fight had been discovered here, and there was even a bracelet worn by the princess, it meant that this princess had really been kidnapped now.","'Hmm?'","In the distance, Jiao Delei was presently swimming over rapidly, and there was a team of guards behind him. It was a very extravagant display."]},{"number":4446,"title":"Chapter 4446 Kidnapper Exposed","paragraphs":["\"Scram!\" When Jiao Delei saw Ling Han, he immediately rebuked coldly.","Ling Han wasn't Sea Alligator Zhang. He had regained his arrogant attitude.","\"Hehe.\" Ling Han merely smiled faintly, and ignored him.","\"I told you to scram. Don't you have ears?\" Jiao Delei said balefully. He hadn't been in a good mood these past few days. If anyone dared to trifle with him now, they would become his punching bag.","Ling Han still ignored him. Now that the trail was cut off again, should he give up on the idea of finding the princess to collect the bounty?","\"Human, you actually dare to ignore me!\" Jiao Delei was furious, and waved a claw, \"Apprehend him!\"","Instantly, those guards swam out and surrounded Ling Han.","Ling Han couldn't help but laugh in spite of himself. \"That so-called Prince, this is the Blue Star Nation, so isn't it a little too early for you to issue commands now?\"","\"Sooner or later, it'll be my territory, so what does it matter if it is earlier?\" Jiao Delei humphed.","Instantly, the guards all charged out, attacking Ling Han.","The weapons of these guards varied. Some used harpoons, some used halberds, but all of them were Spirit Tools. After awakening, they shone brightly.","Ling Han shook his head as he unleashed his murderous aura.","Weng, a spiritual attack shot out. Pa, pa, pa, these guards instantly rolled their eyes into the back of their heads, and all of them passed out.","And this was still because Ling Han had held back. Otherwise, what Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator could withstand the barrage of his murderous aura?","Jiao Delei was stunned upon seeing his guards floating along with the sea currents. However, he was more so infuriated and humiliated.","He was indeed astonished by Ling Han's strength. Ling Han didn't even raise his hand, and his Spirit Transformation Tier guards all fell to the ground. However, what followed was fury. He was the son of the Underworld King, so how could it be that he couldn't capture a single person?","\"Human, immediately kneel down and surrender. Don't force me to make a move personally!\" he said balefully.","No matter how strong you are, so what? After all, you are only a Spirit Transformation Tier, and what about him?","A Four-Star Sect Master!","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"I have always been the type to not offend others if they did not offend me. If you insist on offending me, that would only be asking for your own suffering!\"","He took the initiative to charge out, charging towards Jiao Delei.","\"You're seeking death!\" Jiao Delei said with a cold chuckle. He swung his claw, and hong! Five streaks of cold light slashed toward Ling Han.","These five flashes of cold light were all formed by Regulations, as if they were ice.","Ling Han was unafraid, and shot out a punch to greet the incoming attack.","Peng!","Under the barrage of the punch, the five flashes of cold light immediately crumbled. Ling Han was only slightly slowed down, and then charged towards Jiao Delei again.","'What?'","This time, Jiao Delei was finally shocked.","Previously, though he knew that Ling Han's strength was extraordinary, he was only a Spirit Transformation Tier after all, so how could he compare to the strength of a Sect Master? But now that they had exchanged blows, he realized that not only did Ling Han possess Sect Master-level battle prowess, it was even possible that Ling Han possessed battle prowess above his.","How could this not make him pale in shock?","At the first instant, he drew out the Spirit Tool. It was a three-pronged halberd that stabbed towards Ling Han. Boom, the Spirit Tool revived, shining brilliantly.","This was a six-star Spirit Tool, and it was a treasure of this level at that. After he activated it, it released a might that reached the level of Nine Star Sect Master. The Regulations appeared, turning into multiple small flood dragons that entwined around the three-pronged Spirit Tool.","Ling Han didn't dare to face it head-on. He could only retreat with a tap of his foot.","Seeing that he had forced Ling Han to retreat with a single strike, Jiao Delei instantly regained his confidence.","\"Hahaha!\" He laughed loudly. This was the power of the royal family.","\"Idiot!\" Ling Han scoffed. The murderous aura burst forth. Weng, Jiao Delei immediately gave a muffled humph, tears of blood streaming from his eyes.","He wasn't an Imperial Son, possessing a treasure of Spiritual Power that a Great Emperor had created. Thus, he was naturally unable to block the murderous aura.","So what if his cultivation level was higher than Ling Han's? So what if he had a SIx Star Spirit Tool? It was already very impressive that he hadn't been insta-killed.","Jiao Delei finally understood what method Ling Han had used to knock out his subordinates.","Even his eyes were bleeding and tearing. How could Spirit Transformation Tiers stand against that?","However, knowing was one thing, but how was he supposed to defend?","This was practically impossible to guard against.","\"You, who exactly are you?\" He was a little fierce on the surface, but cowardly on the inside.","That was because Ling Han possessed the ability to wound him, or even kill him. Furthermore, this was outside the city, and Ling Han was an outsider. He could completely just kill him and leave.","Ling Han ignored him, and merely unleashed another murderous aura attack.","\"Ah!\" Jiao Delei clutched his head, appearing to be in extreme pain.","How was he supposed to defend against this?","He had already set up a mystical power shield. In fact, he had even covered his body with Regulations, but that attack had still shot over, completely unaffected.","It should be known that even if it was an attack of Spiritual Power, completely unrelated to the mystical power, it was one thing for the mystical power shield to be ineffective, but the Regulations were superior to Spiritual Power. Why was it that even the shield of Regulations could not block it?","Without waiting for him to mull over it, hong, hong, hong, the murderous aura struck him wave after wave, forcing him to retreat continuously. Not only were his eyes bleeding, but even his seven apertures were bleeding.","\"I'll teach you a lesson this time. Remember, if you're not in your own territory, then behave,\" Ling Han said calmly, then turned and left.","He didn't deliver a fatal strike, mainly because this was the territory of the Sea Race. Once he killed Jiao Delei, that king from the Blue Star Nation would probably move as well.","—That was a Venerate Tier elite!","After returning to the city, Ling Han was hesitating about whether he should leave or not.","After waiting for two days, a huge piece of news suddenly spread out.","The Blue Star Nation's princess... had indeed been kidnapped. Moreover, the kidnapping party had even issued a \" ransom demand\", forcing the Blue Star Nation's king to abdicate!","Hiss, had this kidnapping agent taken the wrong medicine? He wanted to become a king just like that after the king abdicated?","All of a sudden, everyone thought that there was something wrong with this kidnapping agent or this group of kidnapping agents. However, as more information was revealed, no one thought so.","That was because the leader of the kidnappers was shockingly the younger brother of the current ruler of the Blue Star Nation!","In the past, he had left angrily because he was displeased that the previous King had passed the throne to his older brother. One had not thought that after so many years had passed, he would still be so malicious. He had kidnapped the Blue Star Princess, and directly threatened the King into abdicating.","Not only did this enrage the entire Blue Star Nation, but even the Underworld Nation expressed their strong indignation, expressing their willingness to fully and unconditionally support the Blue Star Nation. They were determined to save the Blue Star Princess.","It was understandable that the Underworld Nation was so furious, because once the Blue Star King accepted the condition, wouldn't the peace between the two sides come to nothing?","Even if it didn't come to nothing, what was the point of Jiao Delei marrying the Blue Star Princess? Could he still use this political marriage to annex the Blue Star Nation?","Thus, they naturally had to spare no effort to support the Blue Star Nation.","Only a few days later, the general of the Underworld Nation, Jiao Yuan, brought a team of elites over.","Jiao Yuan was the younger brother of the King of the Underworld Nation, and was also the second strongest elite in the Underworld Nation, a three-star Venerate Tier elite.","In the team, there were as many as nine elites at Sect Master-level. It could be said that the Underworld Nation had really invested a lot, sending half of the strongest elites of their nation over."]},{"number":4447,"title":"Chapter 4447 Rescue","paragraphs":["\"Uncle!\"","In the temporary residence that the Blue Star Nation had specially prepared for the Underworld Nation, Jiao Delei paid his respects to Jiao Yuan.","Firstly, this was his uncle, a senior, and secondly, and most importantly, he was a Venerate Tier elite who could crush him with a single finger.","Jiao Yuan raised his hand and asked, \"How's the situation now?\"","\"The Blue Star King is still considering,\" Jiao Delei said.","Jiao Yuan pondered for a moment, \"We have to rescue the Blue Star Princess as soon as possible.\"","\"Understood,\" Jiao Delei replied with a nod. This marriage was related to their plan to annex the Blue Star Nation, and without the Blue Star Princess, they naturally wouldn't need to think about anything beyond that.","\"Go on.\" Jiao Yuan waved him off.","\"Uncle.\" Jiao Delei wanted to say something but hesitated.","\"What is it?\" Jiao Yuan asked.","Jiao Delei hesitated for a moment, then said, \"Nephew would like to ask uncle to suppress a human.\"","\"Oh?\" Jiao Yuan couldn't help but laugh in spite of himself. \"Amongst the humans that came in this time, could it be that there are Venerate Tiers among them?\"","Jiao Delei revealed an awkward expression, and said, \"That human... is a Spirit Transformation Tier.\"","\"Spirit Transformation Tier?\" Jiao Yuan was truly shocked at this moment. He swept an eye over Jiao Yuan, revealing his displeasure.","Are you playing with me?","To ask for his help to suppress a mere Spirit Transformation Tier, who do you think I am?","\"Uncle, this Spirit Transformation Tier is extremely strange. His battle prowess is at least comparable to a Five Star Sect Master,\" Jiao Delei hurriedly explained.","Jiao Yuan laughed in spite of himself. Naturally, he did not believe it at all.","A Spirit Transformation Tier possessed battle prowess on the level of Sect Master, and it was on the level of five stars at that?","Why don't you say that he can even kill Venerate Tier elites?","\"It's true,\" Jiao Delei hurriedly emphasized, and related his previous exchange with Ling Han.","After hearing this, Jiao Yuan's expression became slightly serious, but then his expression relaxed.","No matter how freakish that human was, he was only a Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator. Being able to match a Sect Master was already his limit. Compared to Venerate Tier, the gulf between them was naturally insurmountable.","\"The most important thing now is to find the Blue Star Princess. Everything else can be set aside first,\" Jiao Yuan emphasized.","\"Understood,\" Jiao Delei replied respectfully. No matter how domineering he was, he wouldn't dare to ruin this important matter.","...","Another few days later, the location of Sha Yuanxing's lair was unexpectedly exposed.","Oh, Sha Yuanxing was the younger brother of the sovereign of the Blue Star Nation, and was also the leader of the kidnapping squad this time round.","It was like this. One of his subordinates had entered into the city to gather information, yet accidentally let the cat out of the bag. In the end, he just happened to be apprehended by a member of the Underworld Nation, and under strict interrogation, the location of Sha Yuanxing's lair was forced out of him.","Now, Jiao Yuan had already moved out with elites, wanting to personally rescue the Blue Star Princess.","When the news spread out, the outsiders from the Blue Star Nation also moved out one after another.","They were naturally no match for Jiao Yuan, a Venerate Tier elite. However, they weren't going to face Jiao Yuan head-on. Instead, they were going to take advantage of the stalemate between Jiao Yuan and Sha Yuanxing to rescue the Blue Star Princess first and return to collect the bounty.","Who didn't know how to fish in troubled waters?","Ling Han followed behind the team led by Jiao Yuan. They left the city and headed north.","Setting aside the factor of water, there was actually not much difference between the ocean bed and land. Though there were no trees, there were corals and seaweed. Though it was dark, cultivators would not be affected at all in such an environment.","They traversed many oceanic trenches and mountain peaks, and finally, they arrived in front of a massive coral forest.","Sha Yuanxing's lair should be here.","Boom!","Jiao Yuan unleashed his aura like a tidal wave as he sent a message through divine sense to Jiao Delei, saying, \"I'll hold Sha Yuanxing back, and you take the chance to rescue the Blue Star Princess.\"","He didn't say that he wanted to kill Sha Yuanxing, because Sha Yuanxing was also a Venerate Tier At most, his abilities were slightly inferior to his, so how could it be easy to kill him?","\"Yes, Uncle.\" Jiao Delei nodded. This was naturally a good chance for him to perform. Being rescued from isolation and helplessness, a young girl's heart was the easiest to be touched. She would definitely fall in love with him at first sight.","\"Jiao Yuan?\" A deep voice rang out, and a man walked out from the coral. He strode forwards boldly, his royal air filled with confidence.","\"Sha Yuanxing!\" Jiao Yuan shouted loudly. \"Hand over the Blue Star Princess, or I will behead you today!\"","Sha Yuanxing smiled faintly, \"Why have you come here instead of staying quietly in your Underworld Nation? Hehe, when did the Underworld Nation become Sha Tongyu's lackey?\"","\"Humph, looks like you're determined to force me to make a move!\" Jiao Yuan immediately charged towards Sha Yuanxing. \"You're only a Two Star Venerate Tier; do you think I don't know your strength?\"","The two of them exchanged blows. Boom, the terrifying commotion instantly shook the heavens and earth.","This was a Venerate Tier-level battle!","\"Let's go!\" Jiao Delei waved his hand, indicating for those Sect Master-level elites to follow.","He was extremely at ease. His uncle was a Three Star Venerate Tier, so victory was naturally within his grasp. Moreover, Jiao Yuan didn't want to kill Sha Yuanxing, so he naturally wouldn't push him too far, forcing Sha Yuanxing to put his life on the line.","Not only him, but the others also followed suit, sneaking into the coral forest.","After all, this was Sha Yuanxing's lair, and who knew how many elites were still lying in ambush here. Thus, it was naturally best to be careful.","However, as they ventured deeper and deeper, they didn't come across any ambushes. It was just that this coral forest was extremely complicated. After circling around it, they suddenly realized that they had actually exited the coral forest somehow.","Ling Han naturally entered into the coral forest as well, but he was very unfortunate. At the first instant, he bumped into Guan Xinghan, who immediately charged towards him.","There was no need to linger in battle. Ling Han immediately fled, and then used the Strange Shadow Steps to sneak back.","If it weren't for the fact that he was in a rush to find the Blue Star Princess, Ling Han wouldn't have minded dealing a blow to Guan Xinghan. However, the gap in cultivation level between the two of them was extremely large. Even if he successfully launched a sneak attack, he would still suffer a backlash and pay a corresponding price.","Thus, he decided to look for the Blue Star Princess first.","The coral forest was incredibly complicated, but it could not hold up to the fact that Ling Han's ability of deduction was too strong. Very soon, he had made heads or tails of the situation. He searched, and could practically guarantee that he would not take the same path twice.","Close to half a day later, he passed through a coral cave, and the space ahead of him suddenly opened up, revealing a conch-shaped building. It was not very tall. Otherwise, it could not have possibly been hidden in the coral forest.","He used his divine sense to sense the surroundings, and discovered that there was someone inside.","Was it the Blue Star Princess?","With a sweep of his divine sense, all the details were practically revealed to Ling Han, as if he could see them with the naked eye.","This was a mermaid. The upper half of her body was human, while the lower half was a fish tail. Her hair was crimson red, and she was astonishingly beautiful.","Spirit Transformation Tier.","When Ling Han sensed the other's cultivation level, he strode in.","Pu!","This mermaid was eating, and when she saw Ling Han walk in, she instantly spluttered out all the food in her mouth. Then, she looked dumbly at Ling Han, her face filled with shock.","Was this how a captive should look like?","Ling Han cracked a smile, \"Your Highness, it's time to go home.\"","The mermaid looked at him dumbly, \"Why is it you? Where's Uncle?\"","F***, this seemed to be a huge trap!"]},{"number":4448,"title":"Chapter 4448 A Trap","paragraphs":["Shouldn't the Blue Star Princess be wild with joy upon seeing someone come to her rescue?","But what kind of expression did she have?","Her face was filled with shock!","Moreover, as a hostage, why was she still in such a good mood to eat? Moreover, she had even addressed Sha Yuanxing as Uncle.","There was something fishy, there was a trap!","Of course, this trap was not meant for him, but rather targeted the Underworld Nation.","Ling Han felt that everything was too coincidental.","You see, in a situation when they were completely clueless, the specific information about the princess being kidnapped was suddenly revealed. Through the mouth of a snakeman, they were lured to the Green Source Trench, which then led to Sha Yuanxing.","Because it involved the issue of annexing the Blue Star Nation, the Underworld Nation could no longer sit still, and sent out Jiao Yuan to assist, fearing that Sha Tongyu would not be able to hold up and surrender his throne.","It was too coincidental. Sha Yuanxing's subordinate just happened to bump into someone from the Underworld Nation, and he had even let the cat out of the bag, revealing the location of Sha Yuanxing's lair.","If everything was too coincidental, then it was completely deliberately planned.","Ling Han mocked internally, yet a smile appeared on his face, and he said, \"My name is Ling Han, and I have deliberately come to save Your Highness.\"","\"I don't need you to save me. You can leave.\" The Blue Star Princess waved her hand, looking like she was in a hurry to chase him away.","Er, compared with the cunning and wily Sha brothers, this princess really did not have much subtlety. However, it was precisely because of this that she appeared adorable.","\"Your Highness, there is no need to be afraid. Your uncle is being held back by Jiao Yuan, and now is the best time to flee,\" Ling Han said, deliberately teasing this princess.","The Blue Star Princess hurriedly shook her head, \"You don't understand!\"","\"What do I not understand?\" Ling Han asked.","\"Because—\" The Blue Star Princess was only innocent, but she was not stupid. Realizing that she was about to spill the beans, she hurriedly covered her mouth with her hand.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and said, \"Then let me guess. Could it be... that the real purpose of this so-called disappearance of the princess is to kill Jiao Yuan?\"","\"How did you know?\" the Blue Star Princess blurted out. Then, she immediately realized that something was off, and instantly, her expression was filled with regret.","Ling Han smiled and said, \"It's all right. I guessed this myself, so it has nothing to do with you.\"","\"That's right. You guessed it, but I didn't say it,\" the Blue Star Princess murmured. Comforting herself, she immediately smiled again, appearing a little endearingly silly.","Ling Han echoed her words, and said, \"So because you're suppressing such a secret in your heart, you can't tell anyone, so you must be feeling very depressed, right?\"","\"I'm about to die from suffocation!\" The Blue Star Princess nodded repeatedly. This was a friend that knew her well.","\"In any case, I've already guessed it now, so why don't you tell me?\" Ling Han said with a smile.","The Blue Star Princess hesitated for a moment, appearing slightly hesitant. However, upon further thought, Ling Han had indeed guessed their ultimate motive, so the details naturally weren't important anymore.","Most importantly, she really felt uncomfortable from holding it in, and wanted to share it with someone!","The matter had to start from a long time ago.","Long ago, when the current King of the Underworld Nation had just ascended the throne, Sha Tongyu and Sha Yuanxing had already felt that this person was filled with ambition. One day, he would make a move on the Blue Star Nation.","As expected, the Underworld Nation continued to make small moves after this, waging war repeatedly, wanting to use force to force the Blue Star Nation to submit.","However, the Blue Star Nation was protected by an ancient formation, so even if the overall power of the nation was inferior to the Underworld Nation, it would only be empty words to say that the Underworld Nation would destroy the Blue Star Nation.","However, this wasn't a good idea. After all, who would want to be pummeled all the time?","Thus, Sha Tongyu and his brother began to lay out their plans.","Firstly, they had created signs of discord between brothers fighting over the throne. Sha Yuanxing had left angrily, causing the Blue Star Nation to feel as if they been crippled.","Then, under the continuously strengthening oppression of the Underworld Nation, the Blue Star Nation put on a posture of seeking peace, intending to have the crown prince and crown princess of the two nations get married.","For the Underworld Nation, this was naturally what they wanted.","As long as they gave birth to a descendant that possessed the bloodline of the royal family of the Blue Star Nation, they would be able to control the ancient formation of the Blue Star Nation, and complete their dream of annexing the Blue Star Nation.","However, this was a huge trap.","The Blue Star Nation had created a false image of the princess's disappearance. Of course, for the sake of authenticity, the Blue Star Princess had indeed been brought out of the palace, and she had been kidnapped by the \"infamous\" Sha Yuanxing.","Because the plan had been laid out for many years, when they found out, the Underworld Nation did not suspect anything. Instead, they mobilized Jiao Yuan, bringing with them almost half the Sect Master elites of the nation, to guarantee that they would definitely rescue the Blue Star Princess, and complete the mission of the two royal families uniting through marriage.","However, what awaited Jiao Yuan was the combined forces of Sha Yuanxing and Sha Yuanxing.","Once Jiao Yuan died, and added with that half of the Sect Master elites of the nation, the Underground Nation's vitality would naturally be greatly damaged. To say nothing of invading the Blue Star Nation, they could only depend on the ancient formation to struggle at death's door.","In this way, not only could the Blue Star Nation be safe and sound, it could even ensure that it would flourish for tens of thousands of years, or even longer.","As for Sea Alligator Zhang, he belonged to the category of powerful people that the Blue Star Nation had removed, putting on a display of weakness for the Underworld Nation. Additionally, it was also because the Blue Star Nation wanted to clean up the slums. Since it was impossible to get rid of all these local ruffians, it would be better to keep them under the control of their own people.","Why couldn't the Blue Star Princess leave even though Jiao Yuan had already fallen into the trap?","That was because Jiao Yuan was a Three Star Venerate Tier elite, after all. Even if Sha Tongyu and his brother teamed up, it would not be an easy feat to kill him. If he was determined to flee, and if worse came to worst, he would have to pay some price, but he would definitely be able to escape.","Thus, in order to ensure that Jiao Yuan was killed, they had to set up a formation so that he would not be able to easily escape.","Moreover, Venerate Tier elites were too powerful, so this formation definitely couldn't be set up in advance. If there was the slightest bit of aura leaking out, Jiao Yuan would definitely be able to see through it.","Thus, the Blue Star Princess couldn't appear now. Once she escaped, there would be no point for Jiao Yuan to continue battling. Whether he realized something was off or not, he would definitely flee.","Ling Han nodded. Looks like Jiao Yuan wouldn't be able to escape death this time.","However, this had nothing to do with him.","\"Er, if I bring you back to the palace, will the bounty still be valid?\" Ling Han asked.","\"It should be.\" The Blue Star Princess nodded. After all, this was the words of the Royal Family. Even if it was for the sake of screwing over the Underworld Nation, it could not be so easily annulled, and break their word so easily.","\"That's good.\" Ling Han nodded.","Boom!","The ground suddenly started to tremor violently, and it was as if it were about to collapse.","\"The great formation is activated!\" Blue Star Princess looked into the distance. From this position, she could easily see a massive blue screen of light in the distance.","That direction was where Sha Yuanxing and Jiao Yuan had been battling.","\"Let's go, let's go!\" The Blue Star Princess appeared slightly excited. She could only stay in the coral forest these few days, which made her feel extremely uncomfortable.","Ling Han smiled, and left with Blue Star Princess.","After swimming for a while, and just when they were about to come out of the coral forest, they suddenly bumped into a group of people.","Jiao Delei.","'What a pitiful child,' Ling Han thought.","\"It's you!\" Jiao Delei's eyes suddenly widened, revealing an angry and embarrassed expression.","Ling Han actually managed to save the Blue Star Princess before he did.","This was too despicable!"]},{"number":4449,"title":"Chapter 4449 Caught in the Act?","paragraphs":["The Blue Star Princess also widened her small mouth, and her pretty face flushed, as she buried her head in her hands.","After all, this was a trap laid against the Underworld Nation, and she was the most important part of it. With how easily embarrassed she was, now that she had seen the victim of their plans, she would naturally feel guilty.","However, when Jiao Delei saw this, suspicion instantly rose up in his heart.","Why did she look like she had done something wrong the moment she saw him?","She was clearly the one who had been kidnapped, yet it was as if she had betrayed him?","How could it be!","He looked towards Ling Han, his eyes practically popping out.","Had he been cuckolded?","\"Detestable human!\" he cursed in a low voice. This was the only possibility. Otherwise, why would the Blue Star Princess look guilty the moment she saw him?","Seeing the fury on his face, Ling Han couldn't help but feel awkward.","You have misunderstood.","Furthermore, you have to think about it. The Blue Star Princess was a fish in the first place, so how was he supposed to... make a move?","\"Kill him!\" Jiao Delei pointed at Ling Han.","Instantly, the nine Sect Masters behind him all turned to look at Ling Han, revealing baleful expressions.","\"Merely a Spirit Transformation Tier, let me deal with him!\" a crabman said, moving his eight legs at a surprisingly fast speed. Then, with a wave of his two large pincers, he scissored towards Ling Han.","Three Star Sect Master?","Ling Han shook his head. This was delivering himself to death.","If the Blue Star Nation hadn't set a trap for the Underworld Nation, Ling Han would have to think about it. If he killed this person, he definitely wouldn't be able to go to the Blue Star Nation to collect the bounty. Whether increasing his cultivation level was more important or venting his anger was more important would be worth considering.","But now, hehe, he did not have the slightest bit of reservations.","He greeted the incoming attack, brandishing his fists in a rapid barrage.","Peng!","It was only a single strike, and the crabman was sent flying. Cracks appeared on his pincers.","'What?'","Seeing this scene, those elites of the Underworld Nation were all dumbfounded, completely unable to believe their eyes.","What kind of f****** Spirit Transformation Tier are you!","Even the Blue Star Princess was gaping, looking at Ling Han in shock.","Impressive!","Only Jiao Delei's reaction was slightly better, but he still felt a sliver of shock. That was because he knew just how sturdy the pincers of the crabman were. They were comparable to Six Star Divine Metal, and a crack had actually appeared on them from a single punch. Just how terrifying was the destructive power of this punch?","\"Attack! Attack together!\" However, he immediately roared, \"This freakish human can't be judged with common sense.\"","En.","The remaining eight elites all walked out. There were seahorsemen, murlocs, and sea turtlemen, and they all drew their Spirit Tools. Some had a cultivation level as high as seven stars. Though their Spirit Tools were not as strong as Jiao Delei's, when the nine of them attacked together, their might was still terrifying.","A worried expression immediately appeared on the Blue Star Princess's face. These nine great generals were also the people that they planned to kill together this time, but this coral forest was too big. The elites that the Blue Star Nation had laid in ambush could not find them easily just like that.","Now that Ling Han was facing it alone, the situation was very dire.","Jiao Delei saw this, and couldn't help but feel even more certain.","This was an adulterous couple!","You see, he had not even made a move from his side, and the Blue Star Princess was already so worried.","No man could tolerate this!","Yet Ling Han was eager to give it a try. With a battle cry, he took the initiative to attack.","\"You're seeking death!\"","\"What an ignorant human!\"","The nine great generals all smirked coldly. Though Ling Han had previously displayed strength that surpassed the crabman, it was only comparable to a Five Star Sect Master, at most. However, among the nine of them, there were three that had attained Five Stars, or even actually surpassed that level.","They all moved to counterattack. Various Regulations manifested, their brilliance shaking the skies.","Ling Han smiled and unleashed his murderous aura.","\"Ah!\" \"Wu!\" \"E!\"","All of a sudden, the nine great generals all showed expressions of pain. Those above five stars were still fine, and recovered after a little pain, but the six below five stars were miserable. All of them were bleeding from their seven apertures. One of them had even directly lost his battle prowess, and his whole person was floating, stomach facing upwards.","'Holy f*ck!'","You are only in the Spirit Transformation Tier, and faced nine great Sect Masters alone, you actually did not even raise your hand, and caused the nine great elites to suffer a loss. In fact, one of them had directly passed out?","Monster!","Since Ling Han had made his move, how could he be merciful? He waved his hands, and reaped the harvest without any mercy.","Peng! Destructive Energy was wrapped around his fist, and with a single punch, he had directly pierced through the chest of a swordfishman.","Boom, the murderous aura surged again, and instantly, terrible screams rang out again. Aside from three Sect Masters that had reached Five Stars and more that continued to push their attacks over, four of the remaining five people were grabbing their heads and screaming. The last one was the one who had been knocked unconscious previously. This time, his mind had directly exploded, and he had died.","He had only made two moves, and two Sect Masters had already died by Ling Han's hand. It was as if they were not people that could be considered great elites at all, but mere commoners that could be killed easily.","Xiu, Ling Han used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight and quickly left the battle area, dodging the three attacks that were aimed at him.","Under the barrage of the murderous aura, Ling Han wasn't afraid of being ganged up on at all—unless all of them were far more powerful than him.","Right now, his soul was already perfect. In fact, it was even being purified further on the foundations of perfection. Just how terrifying was this?","The Blue Star Princess's small mouth was gaping, while her hands were pressing down on her chest, as if she feared that her heart would jump out of her chest if she was too shocked.","Meanwhile, Jiao Delei's hair was dancing wildly in his fury. His hands were tightly clenched into fists, and he had used so much force that the veins on his forehead were popping.","\"I'm going to kill you!\" He brandished his three-pronged halberd and joined the battle.","\"Humph!\" Ling Han was completely unafraid, and charged out again.","The murderous aura continued to blast out, greatly disintegrating his opponent's battle prowess and coordination. Then, he could do as he liked. Waving his fists, he was agile, imposing, and majestic.","This was the path of cultivation that he had walked, and now, he was playing it out to his heart's content.","A maniac of martial arts like him would definitely use every opportunity to increase his strength.","\"I should give this fist technique a name.\"","A thought suddenly occurred to Ling Han. This actually couldn't be called a fist technique, because there was no fixed technique. It was just a way of using energy and Regulations.","\"It can't be called the Fists of Fury anymore. I have neither joy nor sorrow now, and let nature take its course.\"","\"En, since my name is Ling Han, I'll call it Han Fists.\"","He had always been an idiot when it came to naming. Just look at the pet beasts by his side. They were all like Little Red and Little White, and now, this had finally brought disaster to his path fo cultivation as well.","—If the future generations were to study the fist technique that Ling Han had created, they would definitely praise it greatly and complain endlessly at the same time. How could Ling Han come up with such a name that was not impressive or domineering at all?","Ling Han was immersed in his own world. He used the Han Fists, and various high-level energies were continuously combined, attempting to unleash the strongest destructive power. Meanwhile, Regulations was freely used, turning into saber flashes, sword flashes, and projections, all of them overbearing in their might.","Jiao Delei and the others all roared in fury. They clearly had the upper hand in terms of battle prowess, yet were completely unable to do anything against Ling Han. Instead, they were being punched left and right, continuously losing members.","Crazy, they were really going crazy. What kind of Spirit Transformation Tier was this!"]},{"number":4450,"title":"Chapter 4450 Fighting Against Many Alone","paragraphs":["A great battle ensued.","On Jiao Delei's side, the number of people was continuously decreasing. At the beginning, there were ten of them, but two of them had died right from the start. The remaining people were quite hardworking, and only after fighting for half an hour did another two die.","These were all below five stars in battle prowess, and above five stars, even if they were affected by the barrage of murderous aura, it was still difficult to deal with them.","This was especially the case for that Seven Star Sect Master. The might of his counterattack could not be underestimated. With a single strike, the Regulations directly slashed into Ling Han's mind, preventing him from expelling it for at least a minute. He had to focus his divine sense before blasting the murderous aura again.","Moreover, he had only been caught off guard by Ling Han at the beginning. Now that he had regained his footing, and with Jiao Delei's participation, he possessed a Spirit Tool that could unleash a battle prowess of nine stars. It was extremely powerful.","If it was not for the fact that Jiao Delei was selfish, and insisted on stimulating this Tool by himself, then having the Seven Star Sect Master stimulate the Spirit Tool, the pressure on Ling Han would undoubtedly be even greater.","Right now, Ling Han was using the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. The seawater evaporated continuously, and a vacuum was actually created from the heat. He moved unhindered here and there, and Jiao Delei and the others couldn't even touch a corner of his clothes.","Their expressions changed drastically. If this continued, they would lose more members.","Who would have thought that this Spirit Transformation Tier would be so freakish?","Jiao Delei was already filled with regret.","After impulsively attacking, he realized that he may have misunderstood.","In such a short amount of time, how could the Blue Star Princess possibly fall in love with Ling Han at first sight? Furthermore, an adulterous relationship had happened in such a dangerous place?","But now that things had come to this, even if he was willing to give up, what about the deaths of the four great generals?","Only killing Ling Han would appease the fury of the Underworld Nation.","However, how was he supposed to kill Ling Han?","Before this, who would have thought that a Spirit Transformation Tier would be so hard to kill?","He gritted his teeth, and said, \"General Tie, you control this Spirit Tool. I'll go and inform Uncle that the princess has been rescued, and there's no need to continue fighting. He'll move to kill this human.\"","One of the sharkmen took the Spirit Tool and nodded. \"Alright.\"","He was the Seven Star Sect Master, and added with this Spirit Tool, he alone was enough to suppress Ling Han.","He should have done so long ago.","\"There is no need for you all to be here. All of you, go and protect the prince!\" With the halberd in hand, the sharkman appeared mighty and powerful.","\"Yes.\" The other Sect Masters all nodded.","Jiao Delei glanced at Ling Han again, then suddenly turned around and left.","Ling Han didn't give chase. The sharkman could be considered a powerful opponent, and he couldn't be careless.","Jiao Delei and the others left, yet the sharkman was in no rush to make a move. Ling Han's movement technique was too agile, and he had no confidence that he could capture him. Thus, he only had to detain Ling Han here as much as possible, and when Jiao Yuan arrived, killing Ling Han would be a piece of cake.","Since the other party didn't make a move, Ling Han had no interest in making a move either. He merely said calmly, \"I'm afraid I have to tell you some unfortunate news. That General Jiao of yours is really going to be burnt this time..\"","'Hmm?'","The sharkman smirked coldly, \"Exaggerating!\"","Ling Han shrugged and said, \"Believe it or not, it's up to you. You can wait, and see if it's Jiao Yuan who comes or the person who's going to kill you!\"","The sharkman's expression involuntarily changed drastically. He carefully recalled the entire process, and then, his expression became uglier and uglier. In fact, even his body was trembling slightly.","\"Ling Han, how could you tell him?\" the Blue Star Princess asked in slight displeasure.","Ling Han smiled, \"It's all right. In any case, Jiao Yuan has already fallen into the great formation, and there are two great elites besieging him. He is like a fish in a pond, and would not be able to do much.\"","\"That's true.\" The Blue Star Princess was indeed easily deceived, and nodded.","Hearing these words, the sharkman's heart became even more fervent.","Was this really a trap?","He hurriedly turned around and chased after Jiao Delei and the others. He was going to stop these five people. Even if Jiao Yuan could no longer be saved, he had to at least preserve some hope for the Underworld Nation. Otherwise, they would be suppressed by the Blue Star Nation for tens of thousands of years.","\"Let's go,\" Ling Han said to the Blue Star Princess.","\"Yi, are you going to waste these corpses?\" The Blue Star Princess pointed at the four Sect Masters that Ling Han had killed.","Ling Han was stunned for a moment, \"I didn't expect you to have such extreme tastes. They are humanoid monsters, and I can't bring myself to eat them!\"","Although these giant crabs and sea cucumbers looked very tempting, cooking a seafood soup should be very delicious, right?","The Blue Star Princess rolled her eyes at him, \"No, no. The Sect Master has a fruit of cultivation in his body, and the fruit of cultivation contains Celestial Qi, don't you know?\"","That's right!","Ling Han faltered upon hearing this. Celestial Qi wasn't something that only existed in natural treasures. Sect Masters also had Celestial Qi.","He could not waste it.","If these four members of the Sea Race were human, then even if he knew that there was Celestial Qi in their bodies that could be extracted, Ling Han probably wouldn't be able to do it. However, it didn't matter if they were from another race. He would just treat it as killing fish and crabs. In any case, he wouldn't eat them.","\"Hurry up. If we don't take away the fruits of cultivation as soon as possible, they will be assimilated by the heaven and earth,\" the Blue Star Princess warned.","Ling Han first sliced open the crabman, and obtained a bright object in his head. It was only the size of his pinky, but contained astonishing power.","The fruit of cultivation.","As the light surged, the energy was also rapidly dissipating, returning to the heaven and earth.","Ling Han hurriedly channelled the Imperial Scroll and absorbed all the energy in the fruit of cultivation. However, he couldn't absorb most of it, and in the case of the Celestial Qi, he could only extract a sliver.","He did the same with the remaining three generals of the Sea Race. He obtained four wisps of Celestial Qi, which was pitifully little.","\"It's too impure. It can't compare to the Black Heavenly Dao Lotus at all. I would have to refine about a hundred fruits of cultivation of Sect Masters to match the quantity approximately, and in terms of quality, the gap is even greater.\"","\"Fortunately, I'm only upgrading my dimensions now, so I don't need any high-quality Celestial Qi.\"","\"In the future, when I advance into the Minor Advanced Tier, this method is not advisable.\"","Ling Han pondered for a moment before nodding at the Blue Star Princess and saying, \"Let's go back to the palace.\"","They continued onwards, but they had not walked too far, when they encountered another person.","—The outsiders that had entered this place also wanted to find the princess and collect the bounty.","\"The Blue Star Princess!\" This was a small team of seven. When they saw the Blue Star Princess, they all looked pleasantly surprised.","Although they had never seen the Blue Star Princess before, one of them was a human outsider, while the other was a mermaid. Even an idiot would be able to guess, right?","At this moment, Ling Han couldn't help but complain again. No wonder the royal family didn't even attach a portrait of the princess even though they were clearly offering a bounty to find her. As it turned out, they weren't sincerely searching for her at all.","Now that he thought about it, it was an obvious loophole.","The seven of them looked at Ling Han again, and couldn't help but grit their teeth.","At present, Ling Han's might was already deeply ingrained in the hearts of the people, so who did not know?","After the seven of them weighed the pros and cons, they all shook their heads, and took the initiative to retreat.","They were no match for Ling Han. If they tried to be brave and make a move, they would only be asking for trouble.","Ling Han didn't make a move either. He was in a rush to send the Blue Star Princess back to collect the bounty.","The two of them continued onwards, but enemies were bound to meet on a narrow road. Not long after, they encountered Guan Xinghan.","\"Run!\" Ling Han grabbed the Blue Star Princess, and suddenly sped up with Phoenix Wings Divine Flight.","Everything could be discussed after he advanced into the Minor Advanced Tier."]},{"number":4451,"title":"Chapter 4451 Obtaining the Extreme Cold Pearl","paragraphs":["After circling around the coral forest for a while, Ling Han finally charged out with the Blue Star Princess in tow.","Not far away, the blue screen of light could already be clearly seen.","\"Let's go there,\" Ling Han said. Since Sha Tongyu and Sha Yuanxing were both here, he only had to bring the Blue Star Princess there. What need was there for him to waste his energy to go to the palace?","The Blue Star Princess was also very curious about the progress of the battle, and hurriedly nodded.","The area covered by this light screen was very large. After circling around for a while, Ling Han finally saw the ongoing great battle inside.","Jiao Yuan, who had once been arrogant and haughty, was now riddled with wounds. Not only had he lost an arm, but his body was also riddled with wounds, all of which had pierced through his body.","He was close to his end.","Jiao Yuan kept trying to break out of the siege, but the blue light screen blocked him. Though cracks appeared on the light screen with each punch, and it could be broken with a few more punches, how could Sha Tongyu and his brother possibly give him the chance to attack the light screen calmly?","Under the terrifying attack, Jiao Yuan had no choice but to parry.","Once Jiao Yuan returned to the battle zone, the light screen would automatically mend itself under the effects of the formation, which meant that everything had gone back to square one.","Thus, Jiao Yuan was a trapped beast, and death for him was only a matter of time.","And if it was not for the fact that Sha Tongyu and his brother did not want to pay too high a price, they would have long since killed Jiao Yuan.","Ling Han withdrew his gaze, and turned to look elsewhere.","Not far away, Jiao Delei and the other elites of the Underworld Nation were also surrounded. The elites of the Blue Star Nation were all mobilized, and even Sea Alligator Zhang was among them.","Sixteen Sect Masters versus six; the conclusion was already very clear.","Ling Han chuckled, and walked forwards with the Blue Star Princess in tow.","\"Everyone, I've rescued Her Highness!\" he said as he walked. \"Since everyone is here, I'll leave her here.\"","Seeing Ling Han and the Blue Star Princess walk over, Jiao Delei and the others all looked furious.","How could they not understand by now? This was the trap that the Blue Star Nation had dug for them, and the most important chess piece was the Blue Star Princess.","It could be said that without the disappearance of the Blue Star Princess, there wouldn't have been so many elites from the Underworld Nation, giving the Blue Star Nation a chance to get rid of them all in one go.","It was too late for regrets.","\"B*tch, you're going to die a horrible death!\" Jiao Delei said through gritted teeth.","\"How dare you!\" The generals of the Blue Star Nation all rebuked. This was their future queen.","At first, they had been facing off against each other, but because of these words, they immediately began fighting again.","Ling Han also charged into the battle. Though the Celestial Qi contained in the kind of fruit of cultivation of a Sect Master was limited, and was not pure, Celestial Qi was too hard to find. Having it was better than having none.","\"Die!\" Jiao Delei roared as he glared at Ling Han. He didn't care about anything else, and he simply unleashed his full power at Ling Han.","\"He, you're dreaming.\" Ling Han unleashed a cold punch. Wrapped in Destructive Energy, he instantly suppressed Jiao Delei to the point of being unable to fight back.","Without the help of a Spirit Tool, how could Jiao Delei possibly be a match for Ling Han? Under Ling Han's fists, he retreated continuously.","Among the generals of the Blue Star Nation, aside from Sea Alligator Zhang, the others had not witnessed Ling Han's battle prowess. At first, they were still puzzled. A mere Spirit Transformation Tier cultivator actually dared to barge into a battle at Sect Master-level. Just how tired of living was he?","But only now did they know that this human was actually heaven-defyingly strong!","Weng!","Ling Han selectively blasted out murderous aura attacks, instantly causing the generals of the Underworld Nation to cry out in pain. Even that Seven Stars sharkman showed an expression of pain, unable to resist.","Although the generals of the Blue Star Nation were confused and baffled, they were experienced in the battlefield, so how could they possibly miss such a good opportunity? Naturally, they took advantage of the opening to make a move.","Sixteen against six, one side was already on the upper hand, what more with Ling Han's full-power help?","Peng, peng, peng! With this round of attacks, they immediately killed one of Jiao Delei and his group, while another two were severely injured, practically losing their battle prowess.","The moment Ling Han made his move, the outcome of the battle was instantly decided.","Although Jiao Delei and the others would definitely be destroyed in the end, their stubborn resistance would definitely cause a certain amount of damage to the generals of the Blue Star Nation.","Now, with the addition of Ling Han, they could eliminate the enemy without any damage. This effect was shocking, wasn't it?","Jiao Delei released a furious roar of despair, but it was useless. Under the effects of the murderous aura, Ling Han didn't need to make a move at all. Sea Alligator Zhang and the others attacked with all their might, and very soon, Jiao Delei and the others were all killed.","Ling Han moved very quickly, and took away the fruits of cultivation of these elites of the Sea Race one by one.","Sea Alligator Zhang and the others gritted their teeth. This human was really not reserved at all.","However, with Ling Han's existence, they had indeed killed their opponents without paying any price. This was also the reward that Ling Han deserved.","\"Ah!\" At this moment, Jiao Yuan was finally killed as well. A Venerate Tier elite died in battle, and a powerful shockwave spread out, traveling far and wide.","\"Jiao Ming will soon find out about Jiao Yuan's death. With his personality, he will definitely launch a wave of attacks,\" Sha Yuanxing said.","\"M-hm,\" Sha Tongyu replied with a nod. \"However, he's only one person, after all. Moreover, he's also missing many generals, so we can definitely block him.\"","\"Congratulations, Your Majesty!\" Sea Alligator Zhang and the other generals all half-knelt, their faces filled with joy.","As it turned out, the king and his brother had not fallen out with each other. This was all a trap.","Now, the Blue Star Nation no longer had to worry about being bullied by the Underworld Nation.","Sha Tongyu raised his hand, indicating for everyone to rise, while his eyes turned towards Ling Han.","Even when they had been battling fiercely just now, he still had the spare energy to divide a portion of his attention to Ling Han.","This was truly a terrifying human. He was clearly only in the Spirit Transformation Tier, yet possessed battle prowess on the level of Sect Master. In fact, he even had some mysterious means that could affect a large number of Sect Masters.","\"Very good, you saved the princess,\" he said. With a wave of his hand, a bead instantly shot towards Ling Han.","Extreme Cold Pearl.","Ling Han stretched out a hand to catch it, and said with a smile, \"Many thanks, Lord Monarch. Then, I shall take my leave.\"","He had no interest in participating in the battle between the members of the Sea Race. For him, the most important thing was to increase his cultivation level, so that he could advance into the ranks of Sect Masters.","\"Not staying?\" Seeing Ling Han leave, Sha Yuanxing said with a smile, \"Though this human is only a Spirit Transformation Tier, he has the ability to influence the outcome of a battle between Sect Masters. If we can absorb him into our ranks, when we resist the counterattack of the Underworld Nation, our casualties would be even smaller.\"","\"This is a matter of the Sea Race, after all. Moreover, that human is filled with pride, so he may not listen to us,\" Sha Tongyu said. \"That's good too. As long as he doesn't help the Underworld Nation, victory is still in our grasp.\"","\"True.\" Sha Yuanxing nodded. Now that the Underworld Nation was short of a Venerate Tier, ten Sect Masters, and the high-end battle prowess of their ranks was directly halved. If the Blue Star Nation still couldn't deal with this, then they really didn't have the right to exist.","\"Let's go back. We need to make some preparations to face Jiao Ming's counterattack,\" Sha Tongyu said. \"You haven't returned home for many years.\"","\"Haha, all right!\" Sha Yuanxing nodded.","The two elites walked side by side. The Blue Star Princess naturally had the protection of the generals, so there was no need to worry that they would really encounter bandits."]},{"number":4452,"title":"Chapter 4452 Finally Becoming Sect Master","paragraphs":["Ling Han didn't care about the revenge from the Underworld Nation.","He did not return to the main city of the Blue Star Nation. Instead, he found a coral bush nearby, and after hiding inside, began to refine the Extreme Cold Pearl.","As the Imperial Scroll channelled, endless energy surged over, as well as a sliver of Celestial Qi.","Previously, though Ling Han had extracted the Celestial Qi of the six Sect Masters, they were all negligible. They had indeed improved the dimensions in his body slightly, but they were still far from saturating the dimensions.","And now, there was also Celestial Qi nurturing and increasing the strength of the dimensions inside his body.","Invigorating.","This feeling was really comfortable. It was like he was soaking in a hot spring, and every single pore on his body had opened up.","And what made Ling Han even happier was the fact that under the nourishment of this sliver of Celestial Qi, the dimensions in his body were also gradually becoming saturated.","It was finally about to be completed.","Sect Master-level was really close at hand.","Ling Han hurriedly suppressed his excitement, and continued to absorb Celestial Qi.","Two days later, the Celestial Qi was completely absorbed, and Ling Han smiled.","Success.","\"After so many days of battle, my accumulation is already enough.\"","He had long since reached the peak stage of the Spirit Transformation Tier. The only thing missing was that the dimensions in his body weren't perfect enough, so he no longer needed to accumulate comprehension of this cultivation level.","Furthermore, the opponents he was fighting now were all at the level of Sect Master, so the experience he had accumulated was enough.","\"Begin breaking through to Minor Advanced Tier!\"","Ling Han sat in a cross-legged position. He released the hold on his cultivation level, and allowed it to soar madly.","Regulations of heaven and earth appeared, one after another. Ling Han actually \"saw\" a higher level dimension.","The energy of heaven and earth had dimensions, and the level of energy that could be absorbed and converted into mystical power was the lowest. It was parallel to this world, and was in the same dimension. And higher level energy was in a higher dimension. This could not be touched, and could only be sensed through divine sense.","Why did one need Spirit Diagrams?","The Spirit Diagram was to sense the path corresponding to the higher level energy of the dimension. Without this path, the divine sense would not be able to touch this kind of dimension.","Ling Han could see higher level dimensions now because he was in the process of breaking through. After he completely broke through, it would be impossible for him to enter into this state again.","And the so-called Spirit Diagram, was it that when predecessors had broken through to the level of Sect Master and Venerate Tier, they had glimpsed high-dimensional energy, and subsequently deduced it in reverse, and thus grasped the corresponding high-level energy?","Ling Han discovered that as he was currently breaking through to the Minor Advanced Tier, he could only see six levels of high-level energy. There was no seven, eight, or nine-star high-level energy, and if it was Destructive Energy, there was even less need to mention it.","Every kind of high-level energy was in the corresponding high-level dimension, and they were clearly separated. However, there were also some energy that were exceptions. They were extremely unstable. At one moment, they would be in this dimension, and at another, they would be in that dimension, changing indefinitely.","Celestial Qi!","Ling Han immediately understood why Celestial Qi could be used to nurture the fruit of cultivation, but other high-level energy couldn't?","Because this kind of energy was extremely unstable, and did not have a fixed dimension, when it entered into a normal dimension and could be captured, it would naturally be absorbed just like ordinary energy.","However, Celestial Qi itself belonged to a higher level, so it was naturally awesome.","The first step to breaking through to Minor Advanced Tier and forming the fruit of cultivation!","The fruit of cultivation was the understanding of martial arts, and the grasp of the essence of heaven and earth. After forming the fruit of cultivation, the speed of channeling Regulations would be ten times or even a hundred times faster than Spirit Transformation Tier.","Why was Sect Master able to suppress Spirit Transformation Tier?","A Sect Master was able to summon Regulations with a single move, and turn them into an attack. His speed was ten to a hundred times faster than a Spirit Transformation Tier, so this naturally was a one-sided suppression. Of course, a Sect Master was also completely superior to Spirit Transformation Tier in terms of power.","Ling Han had already walked his own path. Thus, he only needed to bury this knowledge and turn it into a Tree of Dao, then nourish it with Celestial Qi, and produce the fruit of cultivation. When the fruit of cultivation ripened, it would transform into Fourth Extreme, and that would be Venerate Tier-level.","In his mind, a small dot of light appeared. This was the seed of the fruit of cultivation.","Inside Ling Han's body, an earthshaking change happened.","The formation of this dot of light signified that Ling Han had taken the most crucial step, and had already advanced into Minor Advanced Tier.","However, precisely because of this, Ling Han's divine sense could no longer see the energy in the high-dimensional space.","It didn't matter. With the Spirit Diagram, he could extract energy from the high-level dimension, and with the Celestial Qi, as long as it appeared in this space, he would be able to sense it and capture it.","\"Previously, I was equivalent to a Five Star Sect Master, and now that I have truly advanced into the level of Sect Master, how strong would I be?\"","Ling Han casually raised his hand, and waves of power surged. Regulations materialized in his hand, forming God Tools, ferocious beasts, and various other forms.","\"The greatest improvement is still the use of Regulations. Power has only increased by one star, at most,\" Ling Han murmured.","In truth, his power had long since reached the level of Sect Master, and the height of five stars at that. Thus, after he had truly broken through to the level of Sect Master, the increase in power was not as great as he had imagined.","However, the speed at which he channelled Regulations was even faster, far surpassing the level of an ordinary Sect Master. This was the greatest boost to his battle prowess.","\"The higher the cultivation level, the smaller the advantage of power, and the more important the soul is.\"","Drawing on Regulations naturally belonged to an ability of divine sense, and it was the same for extracting high-level energy. At this point, the importance of divine sense was further highlighted.","\"Remodel the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.\"","\"Then, go and find Guan Xinghan, and the others to call them to account!\"","Ling Han began to reconstruct the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. He used the Sect Master-level Regulations to refine the Pseudo-Imperial Weapon. Endless high-level energy was extracted and transformed into Dao Flames.","After a whole ten days, he finally stopped.","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was already Six Stars. Moreover, this was forged from Origin Gold, and by itself, it possessed great might. Even if Ling Han had just advanced to the Minor Advanced Tier, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower could still be considered the strongest six-star Spirit Tool.","\"Let's go!\"","He stood up and returned to the main city of the Blue Star Nation.","However, when he arrived, he shockingly discovered that all the outsiders had left.","—The Blue Star Princess had already been rescued, so what was the point of everyone staying here?","On the other side, the Underworld Nation was unwilling to accept this great loss, and launched a great battle, but their high-end battle prowess was severely damaged, causing them to lose this battle, and they had no choice but to retreat back to the main city of the Underworld Nation.","At present, this sea belonged to the Blue Star Nation, at least for the next tens of thousands of years, unless a prodigy from the Underworld Nation rose up strongly and turned the situation around single-handedly.","Ling Han hurriedly moved, and continued onwards.","A dozen over days later, he entered into the territory of the Underworld Nation.","He kept a very low profile. After all, Jiao Delei ultimately died by his hand. If his father knew that he was passing by, would he let him go so easily?","Another seven days later, he had already left the main city of the Underworld Nation far behind.","Now, he had nothing to worry about.","Ling Han used the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, but this time, he shockingly discovered that there were trajectories in space. When he followed these trajectories, his speed instantly spiked tenfold.","This was the true Phoenix Wings Divine Flight."]},{"number":4453,"title":"Chapter 4453 Waterfall","paragraphs":["A smile appeared on Ling Han's face.","After advancing into Minor Advanced Tier, everything was different.","Why was it that Minor Advanced Tiers could be called great elites, while Spirit Transformation Tiers couldn't?","Taking this step, the true qualitative change was not power, but rather the grasp of the Regulations of heaven and earth.","Xiu, Ling Han's figure continued to speed up. In fact, even his physical body was faintly aching.","Ling Han didn't dare to speed up any further. After reaching this kind of high speed, the Regulations transformed into blades that slashed at his body. If he was any faster, his body would be forcefully sliced into pieces.","This surprised him. Even with his physique, he couldn't withstand running at full speed?","No wonder it was said that Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was not only a movement technique, but also an offensive technique.","Invigorating!","Ling Han thought internally. In future, he was completely capable of capturing someone, and just like that, he would be able to run as fast as lightning, and who knew how many people would be able to hold up against that.","Three days later, he exited the sea, and there was a plain ahead of him. After walking for another two days, he could see a massive waterfall from afar, crashing down from the skies. Even at such a far distance, he seemed to be able to hear the loud splashes of waves.","After seeing the waterfall, and then truly arriving at the foot of the waterfall, Ling Han still spent a day's time, which showed how colossal this waterfall was.","Ling Han surveyed the surroundings. The waterfall was cascading down, forming a wide river, and there were many people standing at the banks of the river at the foot of the waterfall. They were all outsiders who had entered this time.","However, Ling Han did not see such Golden Generations like Guan Xinghan, or Liu Xiyun. Nor was there that crazy woman, Feng Miaoling. Even the Silver Generations and ordinary Imperial Sons were missing.","Someone was currently charging against the waterfall, all the way upwards, but in their rush, they had lost their momentum, and were washed down by the waterfall. Then, they were washed far away by the rapid flow of the river, and only then did they manage to climb out of the river and onto the bank.","Ling Han walked over and asked the others about the situation.","Seeing that it was Ling Han, the person who was questioned immediately shivered, and explained the situation in full detail.","As it turned out, if one wanted to go to the next stage, they would have to go against the flow of the waterfall. That was the only path there.","Should he directly fly into the sky, and then take a shortcut?","No, some people did indeed want to take a shortcut, but in the end, they were killed by the terrifying Regulations.","This was the Imperial Path, and only those with the strongest abilities, talent, and determination could pass through. Otherwise, wouldn't the Imperial Path be undeserving of its name?","Thus, after arriving here, the majority of Dao Child cultivators were also blocked, unable to advance any further.","Those who were lucky naturally obtained great fortune, and those who were unlucky... hoho, that was all they could do.","\"Ling Han is here!\"","Instantly, whispers spread out. Everyone looked over, focusing their gazes on Ling Han.","\"If it's Ling Han... there shouldn't be any problem, right?\"","\"There's definitely no problem. The impact of this waterfall varies from person to person. The higher one's cultivation level, the greater the force they'll sustain.\"","\"Sigh, I really want to know. He's clearly in the Spirit Transformation Tier, but why is his battle prowess so terrifying?\"","\"Hehe, if you know, then wouldn't you be able to become a second Ling Han?\"","\"Who knows how many Imperial Clan elites wanted to capture him and snatch his secret, but what happened? Do you know how many Imperial Sons this guy killed?\"","Everyone was envious. It was clear that Ling Han had only come from the Holy Land, but why was he a hundred times, or a thousand times more outstanding than them?","Ling Han clasped his hands behind his back and looked at the waterfall. Just as he was about to leap in, he paused slightly.","He dismissed the idea of charging into the waterfall, and instead continued to size up this waterfall.","Shua, right at this moment, a flash of sword light suddenly appeared out of thin air, slashing towards Ling Han's neck. The Regulations condensed and entwined around the blade of the sword, endlessly increasing the destructive power of this strike.","Strange Shadow Steps, assassin from the Battle God Palace","The attacker... was shockingly a Sect Master, and an eight-star Sect Master at that.","If Ling Han was still a Tenth Change, then if he did not react in advance, then even if he possessed a supreme movement technique like Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, he would still be beheaded by this strike, and would not be able to dodge at all.","But now... hehe.","Ling Han stretched out a hand, and grabbed out. Pa, the blade of the sword was grasped in his hand.","\"Why do you guys always like to deliver yourselves to be killed when my cultivation level increases?\" Ling Han shook his head. At present, he was a One Star Sect Master, and if it was battle prowess, even he himself did not know how strong he had become.","The Sect Master-level assassin faltered upon hearing this. He hadn't expected Ling Han's reaction to be so quick. Moreover, Ling Han's power was also so great that he could even block this sneak attack.","\"Minor Advanced Tier elite!\" The assassin was astonished. He hadn't imagined that Ling Han would actually break through at such a critical moment.","Realization instantly dawned on him. No wonder Ling Han had come so late. Previously, he must have hidden somewhere to break through.","\"Damn it!\" He abandoned his sword without hesitation, turned around and fled.","As a qualified assassin, he had always believed in leaving after a single strike, and definitely did not want to linger in battle.","\"Can you leave?\" Ling Han threw a punch. Boom! Regulations shot out casually, turning into a rope that bound the assassin.","There was a flash of cold light, and the assassin drew another sword, slashing out at the rope of Regulations.","Peng!","The sword struck down, and the rope of Regulations actually did not break.","The assassin was astonished. Although the sword in his hand wasn't a Spirit Tool, it was forged from Six Star materials. After he activated it, it was powerful enough to unleash the might of a nine-star Sect Master, yet it was still unable to slice through Ling Han's Regulations.","This young man's rate of growth was really too fast. It had only been a hundred years, and he had already advanced into Sect Master Tier, which was comparable to the Golden Generation. And in terms of battle prowess of the same tier, even the Golden Generation could only stare in dumbfounded shock.","He had not entered into the Imperial Path deliberately to kill Ling Han. Instead, his main purpose was to contend for the great opportunity, but since he had seen Ling Han, there was naturally no reason for him not to make a move.","However, the result made him feel great regret.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and casually waved his fists. However, it was as if the heaven and earth were responding to him. The Regulations bloomed like flowers.","The assassin was astounded.","How was the strength of a Sect Master judged?","Power was a part of it, but aside from that, there was another more important factor, and that was Regulations.","Ordinarily speaking, a One Star Sect Master could only draw on one type of Regulations. If one wanted to draw on two types, three types, or even more Regulations, he would need to accumulate them over a long period of time. Of course, if he took too long to accumulate them, the Regulations that had been formed the earliest would dissipate. There was a limit to this, and one could not accumulate Regulations forever.","Ling Han threw out a punch so quickly. Logically speaking, he should only be able to deliver a Six Star Regulations, but what did he see? Regulations were blooming like flowers!","How many Regulations did this have to be?","Nine... fifteen.","The assassin knew very well that he could condense ten Regulations in an instant, surpassing the ordinary eight-star Sect Master, yet he was still unable to compare to Ling Han?","This was too freakish!","He hurriedly parried with his sword, not daring to be struck by Ling Han at all. Otherwise, with so many Regulations unleashed at the same time, even if he did not die, he would be severely injured.","However, even though they were both clashes of six-star Regulations, there was no qualitative difference. In that case, those with more numbers would definitely have an advantage.","Boom!","In the exchange of blows, the Regulations of that assassin were completely annihilated, and Ling Han still had four left. They turned into four Divine Swords, and continued to slash out."]},{"number":4454,"title":"Chapter 4454 Killing the Eight Star Sect Master","paragraphs":["The assassin was shocked, and hurriedly dodged.","\"How could you possibly be so strong!\" He paid a small price to dodge this attack, and a wound appeared on his arm.","This was too inconceivable. This was merely a One Star Sect Master, and he could actually condense fourteen streaks of Regulations in a single strike. Who would believe this?","All around them, everyone was also dumbfounded.","Those prodigies who had not broken through to the level of Sect Master were still fine, but those prodigies that were already on the level of Sect Master were all gritting their teeth. They knew very well how difficult it was to deliver a punch with fourteen flashes of Regulations.","Sect Masters below five stars didn't even need to think about it, and for those above five stars, they would need a little time to accumulate. It definitely couldn't be done in an instant.","So, what kind of monster was this?","Ling Han merely smiled. The reason why he was so freakish was naturally because his divine sense was too perfect and too powerful.","In the first place, his divine sense had already surpassed the level of an ordinary Sect Master, and after crossing to the Other Side, his divine sense had also reached perfection. Afterwards, it was further purified. Who could compare to the quality of this kind of soul?","The stronger and more perfect the divine sense, the faster the speed of sensing and extracting the Regulations of heaven and earth would be.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, \"That's right. I'm also curious. How can others live with themselves if I am so powerful?\"","F***, this was showing off.","But in truth, Ling Han indeed had the right to do so.","A freak like him, was there a second one in this world?","\"Even the Golden Generation can't compare!\"","\"Perhaps, Yang Yihuan or Myriad Dao can.\"","\"That's right, there's also these two freaks!\"","Though everyone admitted that they were no match for Ling Han, based on simple jealousy, they wracked their brains to think of competitors for Ling Han, refusing to admit that he was invincible.","The assassin roared, and tried his best to break out of the siege.","However, this was all in vain.","In terms of power of Regulations, he was Eight Stars, while Ling Han was only Five Stars. In reality, he was on the upper hand. However, in terms of Regulations, Ling Han could unleash 14 Regulations with a single strike, while he could only unleash 10. Moreover, Ling Han was overwhelming him.","Thus, both of them had their own advantages, and for the moment, it was hard to decide the victor.","Ling Han entered into a prime state, and used the Han Fists. Instantly, his battle prowess spiked madly.","Previously, when he had battled against a Great Emperor ar the same cultivation level, it was clear that their power levels were completely equal, but it was still the Great Emperor of the same cultivation level that had emerged victorious, suppressing Ling Han to the point that he did not have any temper. Why? That was simple. Every Great Emperor had walked their own path. Thus, so what if their power levels were the same?","It was the same now. Ling Han had already begun to walk his own path. Though he had not reached the height of a Great Emperor, his opponent was still no Great Emperor.","Very soon, he had the upper hand.","A dead silence fell.","A One Star Sect Master could crush Eight Stars!","Heavens, who could believe this?","When one had reached the level of Minor Advanced Tier, martial artists could be called great elites, and there was a gulf between a One Star Sect Master and a Two Star Sect Master. Practically no one could fight above their cultivation level.","It could not be helped. For those that could become great elites, which one of them was not a prodigy among prodigies?","Since both of them were prodigies, why was it that you could battle with a disadvantage in cultivation level?","Thus, Ling Han's performance was simply inconceivable. His freakishness was unbelievable.","However, reality was reality. Under Ling Han's barrage of punches, the assassin was practically unable to fight back.","Seeing that the situation was not good, the assassin began to try breaking out of the siege at all costs.","He would rather sustain severe injuries than die.","Ling Han smiled, and couldn't be bothered to waste any more time. He activated his murderous aura.","Weng!","\"Ah!\" The assassin immediately grabbed his head and screamed. He felt as if his mind was about to explode, and his seven apertures were all covered with blood.","Ling Han caught up to him, and attacked aggressively.","The assassin barely managed to counterattack, but under the suppression of the murderous aura, he couldn't organize a decent counterattack at all. The wounds on his body increased in number and became heavier.","After a few dozen more moves, he was forcefully killed.","Everyone looked at Ling Han with reverent gazes. This guy was already capable of killing an Eight Stars Sect Master. Then, aside from Lin Xuan and a limited few members of the Golden Generation that had advanced into Venerate Tier, who else would be able to suppress him?","Would this era belong to this young man?","Ling Han didn't collect the fruit of cultivation from this assassin. Firstly, the assassin was a human, so it would be too much of a conflict for him to dissect his own kind and use their parts. Secondly, he had already advanced to the level of Sect Master, so he needed pure, high-quality Celestial Qi to nourish the fruit of cultivation.","He ignored the reactions of the others. Instead, he stood up and entered the waterfall.","Boom! A devastating power instantly surged over, with Regulations transforming into small swords that slashed at his body, yearning to tear him into pieces.","Ling Han activated the Starlight Screen. As he advanced to the level of Sect Master, the Starlight Screen also underwent a qualitative change, fusing with the Regulations and further improving its defenses.","Regulations against Regulations, both sides were Six Stars, and Ling Han was unafraid.","This small swords of Regulations were continuously and endlessly washing over Ling Han's body. It was as if there were three, or even five, Sect Masterstaking turns to attack Ling Han.","If it was another One Star Sect Master, he would definitely collapse very quickly.","One against three to five, how was he supposed to block?","However, Ling Han could condense fourteen flashes of Regulations with a casual strike, so what was this worth against him?","Going against the flow, he charged towards the top of the waterfall.","After charging up for a while, the impact of the waterfall suddenly increased, and the strength of small swords of Regulations also increased accordingly.","Ling Han merely smiled, and did not throw a punch. He still used the Starlight Screen to block.","It was enough.","This rendered everyone speechless. It wasn't like they hadn't attempted to go against the flow of the waterfall before. What was the result?","Looking at Ling Han again, he hadn't made a move yet. It was too easy for him.","When he had charged halfway, the impact increased further, and the small swords formed by one streak of Regulation had also turned into three!","This was a little terrifying. Under the continuous barrage of attacks, even Ling Han had no choice but to become slightly more alert, brandishing his fists to disperse the attacks.","Charge, charge, charge again.","Three quarters, four-fifths, nine-tenths!","Ling Han was already nearing the top of the waterfall. At this moment, the impact had reached the level of a Four-Star Sect Master. The small swords of Regulations had also formed into four streaks. This was enough to make 99% of One Star Sect Masters despair.","However, Ling Han was still at ease, easily reaching the end.","There was a black door of light in the center of the waterfall ahead of him.","Was this the Transference Portal that would lead to the next area?","Ling Han thought to himself, yet he rushed over without hesitation, and entered into the doorway of light.","Instantly, a mysterious power took effect, and space changed.","When Ling Han took another step, he actually appeared in the desert.","He didn't immediately move. Instead, he closed his eyes and sensed this area.","He still couldn't sense the ley lines.","Ling Han shook his head. This made him unable to use the Star Steps, but that was all right. He had now grasped the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. This was the strongest movement technique in the world, so wasn't it enough?","He walked forwards. Since he was not familiar with this place, he was not bothered either. He simply headed in a specific direction.","After walking for three days, a castle appeared ahead of him.","He walked over, and as his eyes swept over the surroundings, he couldn't help but feel surprised."]},{"number":4455,"title":"Chapter 4455: Brother Monkey appears","paragraphs":["Chapter 4455: Brother Monkey appears","Editor: Henyee Translations","The people here were all outsiders, but there were more than a thousand of them.","—Just how many people had been stuck at the waterfall previously?","Yet there were more than a thousand people here. What did that mean?","More people who had taken other rainbow bridges had gathered here. In fact, all those who had taken different rainbow bridges would be gathered here.","“Ling Han!” A cold voice rang out. Lin Xuan stepped over. The Venerate Tier aura surged, and standing in front of Ling Han, he was like a lion that was staring at a weak lamb.","This kind of comparison of strength was completely one-sided.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! More Imperial Sons appeared. There were Golden Generation Imperial Sons, Silver Generation Imperial Sons, and ordinary Imperial Sons.","Being able to become the Imperial Son, if one did not even have the ability to pass through the Imperial Path, that would really be too inferior.","Aside from them, there was also Myriad Dao, Origin and Ding Shu, but He Luo and Yang Yihuan were still absent.","With their strength, how could it be that they couldn’t even make it here?","Of course, that was impossible. Thus, there could only be one reason, and that was the passageway corresponding to the rainbow bridge that they had taken had not opened yet.","This was very normal. For example, on the seven islands on the sea, everyone had to work together. It did not mean that anyone with overwhelming battle prowess would definitely be fast.","Or perhaps they had entered the Imperial Path many times, and gone to some special place.","Feng Miaoling was present, but she did not make a move. She merely hugged her sword sheath, and looked coldly at those Imperial Sons.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “What is it? It’s been a long time. Have you missed me?”","“You’re already at death’s door, and you still dare to be so arrogant?” Guan Xinghan sneered. Although he was a whole major tier lower than Lin Xuan, he was also a Golden Generation, so he didn’t appear weak in front of Lin Xuan.","Because if he wanted to, he could completely advance into Venerate Tier in a short period of time. However, he wanted to be stronger, and that was why he was slowly polishing his cultivation at Minor Advanced Tier.","Ling Han glanced at him and said, “The adults speak, so kids should shut up. Don’t you know the rules?”","Guan Xinghan was instantly seething with anger. His eyes were baleful, and he felt an urge to attack.","“Ling Han, you are really a centipede,” Lin Xuan said calmly, “You have clearly been blocked from Imperial Path, yet you can still appear in front of me. This is really a shock to me.”","Seeing that Lin Xuan had no intention of immediately making a move, Guan Xingxuan didn’t dare to overstep his boundaries. After all, he was a Venerate Tier elite, so appropriate respect was still necessary.","‘Are you saying that I won’t die, or that my vitality is tenacious?’","Ling Han chuckled, and said, “There are still many things that surprise you!”","Lin Xuan ignored him, and continued, “However, you are too stupid. You clearly know that I want to kill you, yet still dare to appear in front of me. This is practically courting death!”","Ling Han’s smile remained unchanged, but thoughts raced through his mind.","When it came to battle prowess, even if he had the Saint Tool in hand, it was still impossible for him to match the Venerate Tier elite. It could not be helped. Limited by his cultivation level, the Saint Tool could not unleash its strongest might.","So, the only option was to run?","Even if he couldn’t use the Star Steps, Ling Han was confident that with Phoenix Wings Divine Flight’s extreme speed, allowing him to have the advantage of a major tier even in front of an Imperial Son. He wouldn’t be afraid of a Venerate Tier.","However, he had just advanced into the ranks of Sect Masters, and was just about to kill everyone in his way, when a Venerate Tier appeared. Was someone playing around with him?","“Which b@stard dares to bully Old Sun’s brother?” At this moment, a voice filled with violence suddenly sounded.","Ling Han immediately looked pleasantly surprised, and looked towards the source of the voice, “Brother Monkey!”","This voice was none other than Brother Monkey!","Everyone also followed Ling Han’s gaze, their faces filled with surprise.","At this time, there was actually someone who dared to help Ling Han?","Didn’t he know that Ling Han’s opponent was the Golden Generation, and a Venerate Tier at that? Moreover, it was not just one even?","The people in front of him all stepped aside, and then a monkey with the face of a thunder god appeared.","Who else could it be but Brother Monkey?","Right now, Brother Monkey was dressed in a suit of golden armor. There was also a crimson cloak wrapped around his back, and he held a black metal staff in his hand. However, there were nine golden threads on each end of the metal staff.","Brother Monkey cocked his head, and the staff in his hand was already raised, pointing directly at Lin Xuan.","This attitude was too provocative, exuding a monstrous viciousness.","Lin Xuan also looked over, and couldn’t help but raise his eyes in surprise.","A Venerate Tier elite!","This was actually a Venerate Tier elite.","It wasn’t rare for Venerate Tier elites to appear. Merely the Fire Cloud Imperial Clan had around 20 Venerate Tiers, and if one looked all over the world, to say nothing of tens of thousands of Venerate Tiers, there would definitely be a few thousand.","However, those that could enter the Imperial Path were extremely rare.","As far as he knew, there was only himself, Imperial Son Ming, and Imperial Son Tian. Because there was still a relative age limit for entering into the Imperial Path, Venerate Tier elites had to be under five thousand years old.","But now, another Venerate Tier of the Monkey Race had actually appeared, which naturally surprised him.","“Who are you?” he asked darkly.","However, Brother Monkey didn’t answer. Instead, he charged over and said, “Take a strike from Old Sun’s staff first!”","Boom, the metal rod crashed down like a mountain, no, a mountain did crash down. Regulations intertwined, indescribably terrifying.","That was how domineering he was. He was not going to play around.","Lin Xuan’s expression also changed drastically. He didn’t dare to face this attack head-on, instead leaping back in retreat.","This staff missed its target, and hit the ground. The ground instantly cracked, and trembled madly, but what was surprising was that the castle ahead of them was unmoved.","However, what was even more shocking was the sturdiness of the ground.","A Venerate Tier elite’s attack actually only cracked the ground, and did not shatter or disintegrate it.","Next, the cracked earth was actually healing, as if it was filled with vitality.","As expected of the Imperial Path. How strange.","Yet Ling Han’s attention was not on this. Instead, he exclaimed in pleasant surprise, “Brother Monkey, you have broken through to Venerate Tier!”","Brother Monkey slung the metal rod over his shoulder, “I have broken through, and rushed to Two Stars at that!”","“Haha!” Ling Han laughed loudly. He was both happy for Brother Monkey, and in his case, he had another powerful helper.","Seeing the two brothers converse, everyone was surprised.","Among the Golden Generation, Lin Xuan, who could be considered the strongest, was actually forced back by a monkey’s staff strike, not daring to face it head-on?","Heavens!","The Imperial Sons all wore solemn expressions, especially the Golden Generation. They were far more familiar with how terrifying Lin Xuan was than the others. Even he didn’t dare to face him head-on, so just how powerful was his opponent?","Lin Xuan frowned. It wasn’t that Brother Monkey was more freakish than him, but that he was at a disadvantage in terms of cultivation level.","Even if he had obtained a considerable number of opportunities in the Imperial Path, he was presently only a One Star Venerate. There was still some time before he could break through.","After all, the higher one’s cultivation level, the more difficult it would be to break through. He needed to accumulate more experience.","“A Two Star Venerate Tier!” he spat out word by word, wariness flickering in his eyes.","If the other was just those ordinary Venerate Tier elites outside, then he wouldn’t care. After all, wouldn’t the Golden Generation be able to battle those one level above them? However, those who could appear here were definitely prodigies among prodigies, especially those at the Venerate Tier. Being able to enter the Imperial Path at such a young age, how awesome was that?","When Brother Monkey had moved just now, he had seen very clearly that there were nine Seven Star Regulations entwined around the metal rod.","Though he was conceited, he was also very clear that after he advanced into Two Stars, he would only be able to fire out nine Seven Star Regulations with a single strike.","Thus, this monkey’s natural talent in cultivation was definitely not inferior to his.","Since that was the case, the difference of a single star was like the difference between heaven and earth."]},{"number":4456,"title":"Chapter 4456: Domineering Monkey","paragraphs":["Chapter 4456: Domineering Monkey","Editor: Henyee Translations","Brother Monkey humphed, and looked at Lin Xuan. “Have you asked Old Sun’s staff for permission to kill my brother?”","This attitude was too disdainful.","Lin Xuan was a Golden Generation elite, so how could he tolerate such contempt?","But after all, there was an obvious gap in strength between them. He had no choice but to suppress the fury in his heart, and asked darkly, “Who are you, sir?”","Such a freakish genius, comparable to the Golden Generation, could it be that he was the same kind of monster as Yang Yihuan?","“Your Grandpa Sun!” Brother Monkey placed the staff on his shoulder. Amidst his strange violence, there was also a kind of shamelessness.","Lin Xuan’s eyes bulged, and he almost burst into action.","This was too despicable. For better or worse, you are a Venerate Tier, so how could you say such shameless words?","“You—” He pointed at Brother Monkey.","“You, what you, eat Old Sun’s staff again!” Brother Monkey had a hot temper, and immediately swung the staff again, completely unreasonable.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The strength of a Two Star Venerate Tier elite was unleashed to his heart’s content. Brother Monkey was incomparably domineering.","Lin Xuan couldn’t contain his anger any longer, and he summoned the Jade Water Sword replica to parry this attack. However, there was a difference of one star between the two of them, so he was instantly sent flying.","Brother Monkey took advantage of the victory to continue the attack. “To dare wound one of Old Sun’s brothers, if I don’t beat you into mush, Old Sun will write my name backwards!”","He was too aggressive. Under the barrage of staff strikes, Lin Xuan was completely unable to match him, and could only dodge left and right.","Everyone was dumbfounded upon seeing this.","This was the Golden Generation. In a situation when their cultivation levels were equal, he actually looked like he was outmatched?","Actually, even the Golden Generation couldn’t possibly be invincible among their peers, but their reputation was too great, making everyone have the misconception that they were invincible among their peers.","Now that the legend had been shattered, everyone was naturally surprised.","“Brother Lin, let me give you a hand!” Imperial Son Ming moved, joining the battle.","“Two Stars versus One Star, this is too unfair. I’ll join too.” Imperial Son Tian also joined the battle.","The three Venerable Tier-level Golden Generation elites teamed up to battle Brother Monkey.","These three people were all One Star Venerate Tier elites, and when they joined forces, their battle prowess had more or less reached Two Stars. Thus, it wasn’t long before the battle situation was stabilized.","Brother Monkey laughed loudly, his heroic spirit soaring. As he brandished the metal rod, there was a terrifying pressure. It was as if a light strike would shatter even a star.","“Saint Tool!” Imperial Son Ming exclaimed in astonishment.","This was no ordinary metal rod, but had been forged from Saintly Material. However, it was only so-so. It was not a Saint Tool, and could not draw on Saint-level Regulations. However, Saintly Material was Saintly Material, after all. When it was brandished, it was extraordinarily heavy, and had terrifying destructive power. One would be severely injured if he even came into contact with it.","Hiss, just how terrifying was this monkey’s strength?","“I know, you’re a descendant of the Battle Saint Emperor!” Imperial Son Tian said in a solemn voice.","Battle, Saint, Emperor!","A Great Emperor!","Everyone exclaimed in shock. No wonder Brother Monkey was so awesome. As it turned out, he was actually the descendant of a Great Emperor, and was also the Imperial Son.","“What are you blabbering for? Come fight me!” Brother Monkey’s fighting spirit blazed, and he brandished his staff repeatedly. Regulations and power perfectly fused together, their might shocking the heavens.","He suppressed the three Golden Generations all by himself, and it was only him who could attack. Lin Xuan and the others could only defend.","Everyone was speechless as they watched.","Could it be that this was the end of the legend of the Golden Generation?","Previously, Ling Han had appeared out of nowhere, sniping Imperial Sons all the way, sweeping aside all opposition of the Silver Generation. In the end, there were even two Golden Generations that had been defeated by him.","Fortunately, the two Golden Generations were still at a low cultivation level after all, so he was still unable to shake the foundations of the entire Golden Generation. Now, however? The three most powerful members of the Golden Generation were still being suppressed.","From today onwards, the legend of the Golden Generation was really going to be exposed. For example, Ling Han, Yang Yihuan, and Brother Monkey all came into being aggressively, completely not inferior to the Golden Generation at all. In fact, they were even slightly superior.","Brother Monkey had battled to the point of madness, and was seething with rage. His eyes were about to burst, and his high fighting spirit had solidified, soaring into the heavens!","This stunned everyone. Such fighting spirit had never been seen before.","No wonder Brother Monkey’s ancestor’s title was Battle Saint. He was really a battle maniac, unyielding and forceful.","Brother Monkey gave him a beating. His style of battle was ‘I can be injured, but I will definitely defeat you’.","However, Lin Xuan and the others didn’t want to fight him head-on. If they were injured here, it would obviously affect their subsequent journey on the Imperial Path. Thus, once their morale weakened, they were naturally at an even greater disadvantage.","Thankfully, they were the Golden Generation, after all. With the three of them working together, they could still defend completely. In fact, they even had the vague momentum to counterattack.","Lin Xuan and the others wanted to defend until Brother Monkey’s fighting spirit fell, so that Brother Monkey would take the initiative to ask for peace. In that way, they would naturally be proud.","However, the problem was that Brother Monkey had inherited the courage of his ancestor. Once he started fighting, he didn’t consider the consequences at all. He only had one thought, and that was to determine the victor.","This caused Lin Xuan and the others to be unable to bear it at all. If they continued to fight like this, the three of them would definitely be finished. Of course, Brother Monkey was definitely not much better either. It was very likely that he would die with them.","This was something that they could not accept.","Who were they?","This was the Golden Generation, some of the strongest prodigies among prodigies. They had a high chance of becoming Emperor.","Would they die with Brother Monkey? Or would they be severely injured from the battle, and lose all hope of becoming Emperor?","How could this be!","Thus, the three of them had no choice but to seek peace.","However, Brother Monkey didn’t care at all. “If you guys want to kill Old Sun and my brother, you’ll have to suffer Old Sun’s fury!”","The metal rod swept out, and Brother Monkey became even more deranged.","Helpless, Lin Xuan and the others could only flee. Meanwhile, Brother Monkey gave chase, not allowing the slightest bit of sand to enter his eyes1.","Three fled, while one pursued. In an instant, they had disappeared into the horizon.","The moment the four Venerate Tier elites left, everyone breathed a sigh of relief. This was the only four Venerate Tier elites. With them here, even the other Golden Generation elites would feel suppressed.","“Ling Han!” Guan Xinghan shouted again. His eyes were filled with killing intent as he stared at Ling Han.","Ling Han glanced at him, and asked casually, “What is it? Are you asking for a beating?”","“There’s no one protecting you now, and you still dare to be arrogant?” Guan Xinghan said coldly.","Xiu, Ling Han had already charged out. Phoenix Wings Divine Flight unfolded, and wherever the flaming wings flapped, they actually formed multiple small firebirds that pounced towards Guan Xinghan.","What, Ling Han actually dared to take the initiative to attack?","Everyone was astonished. It should be known that Guan Xinghan was an Eight Star Sect Master. Although he couldn’t be considered one of the best in the Golden Generation, he was definitely the stronger ones. Thus, Ling Han’s initiative to attack was practically courting death.","“Where did you get such courage from?” Guan Xinghan sneered. He was naturally aware of Ling Han’s strength. Although he was freakishly heaven-defying, possessing strength capable of matching the Five Star Sect Master when he was in the Spirit Transformation Tier, he was neither a Five Star Sect Master nor an ordinary Sect Master!","He stretched out a hand, which turned into a giant palm that grabbed out at Ling Han. It was like it was forged from rock, exuding an ancient aura. There were also streaks of dark veined patterns that interwove to reveal the profound secrets of the heaven and earth.","Humph, Ling Han had been able to act arrogantly in front of him previously completely because of Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, but in a head-on confrontation?","Even 10 Ling Hans added together wouldn’t be able to withstand a single strike from him.","‘Die!’","Peng, the phoenix wings swept past, and flames burned the skies. That rock-like hand actually melted rapidly.","‘F*ck!’"]},{"number":4457,"title":"Chapter 4457: Destruction of the Myth","paragraphs":["Chapter 4457: Destruction of the Myth","Editor: Henyee Translations","What was going on? What was going on?","Everyone was watching dumbly, their eyes blank.","What had they seen?","Ling Han had actually blocked Guan Xinghan’s attack!","How was this possible?","Who was Guan Xinghan?","This was the Golden Generation, and he was already about to reach the end of the Minor Advanced Tier. His abilities could be considered one of the strongest in this tier.","But in Ling Han’s case?","“He just entered into Sect Master level.”","“En, from the aura that I sensed, he is indeed One Star Sect Master without a doubt.”","“Previously, he was only in the Spirit Transformation Tier, so it’s normal for him to have just advanced into the level of the Sect Master Tier.”","“The problem is... how can he stand against an Guan Xinghan who is Eight Stars!”","Hiss, everyone inhaled sharply, feeling their scalps go numb.","Previously, Brother Monkey had moved aggressively, and it was one against three, suppressing the three Venerate Tier-level Golden Generation elites. It had already caused everyone to be stunned, causing the invincible legend of the Golden Generation to teeter on the verge of collapse.","But now, Ling Han was even more kickass, attacking a stronger opponent with himself being weaker, not losing at all. Just how freakish was he?","Guan Xinghan also focused his gaze, “You actually suddenly advanced to the level of Sect Master!”","He knew very well that when Ling Han had been in the Spiritual Transformation Tier, he had already possessed strength that could match the strength of a Five Star Sect Master. Now that he had advanced into the Minor Advanced Tier, his abilities had naturally increased even further.","The problem was, how long had it been? This brat actually broke through?","Was the barrier of cultivation level non-existent?","Logically speaking, without accumulating enough power for too long, if one was in a rush to break through, it would definitely lead to the shortcoming of having weak battle prowess. However, this was completely unapplicable for Ling Han, who was overwhelmingly strong.","He sighed deeply, and immediately calmed down.","He hadn’t lost. Moreover, he was an Eight Star Sect Master. He was no weaker than Ling Han, so what was there to be afraid of?","“From now onwards, you will be eliminated at all costs!” Guan Xinghan said balefully. When your freakishness threatens the Golden Generation’s ability to become Emperor, you would naturally be eliminated.","—Unless you had a Great Emperor-level background, then everyone would be wary, and would not dare to make a move.","But in Ling Han’s case?","He only had a single Saint backing him up, and in the case of Buddha Doga, his reaction should not be too intense.","Ling Han chuckled, “Then you all would also have to have such abilities!”","He attacked again, unleashing the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. Flames soared into the sky.","He didn’t just use the movement technique alone. He shot out the Han Fists. This was his own path based on the various Imperial Techniques that he had used as reference. It was a fist technique completely suited to himself.","Boom! He threw a punch, and heaven and earth reverberated. Regulations materialized, transforming into fourteen God Tools that slashed at Guan Xinghan.","Guan Xinghan humphed, and replied with a palm strike, “You are indeed extraordinary. You have just entered the ranks of Sect Master, and can already deliver fourteen Six Star Regulations in a single strike. It can be claimed that there has never been anyone like you before, and there will never be anyone like you in future. However, I am an Eight Star Sect Master!”","As he delivered a palm strike, it turned into a millstone. It was as black as ink, yet was densely covered with silver veined patterns, and was filled with demonic nature.","Peng!","The two of them exchanged a blow, and Ling Han’s figure instantly slid back.","In terms of power, he was still no match for an Eight Star Sect Master, what more when it was a Golden Generation. Furthermore, Guan Xinghan could also deliver fifteen flashes of Regulations with a single strike. In fact, he had one more flash than Ling Han. This naturally was his advantage again.","However, Ling Han had walked his own path. Wasn’t this the same?","Guan Xinghan’s figure also swayed, and he retreated more than ten steps. Teng, teng, teng! With every step he retreated, the ground cracked a bit, and after a dozen steps, a deep ravine appeared on the ground.","Hiss, it was a tie.","In a battle of an Eight Star Sect Master versus One Star Sect Master, and it was a Golden Generation at that, yet he could only manage a tie?","What kind of freak are you!","Everyone looked at Ling Han in shock, completely speechless.","Heavens! Heavens! Heavens!","Guan Xinghan was both speechless and stunned. He had already overestimated Ling Han, yet he was still confident that he could win. This was because Ling Han’s power and grasp of Regulations were all inferior to his. Thus, there was no reason for him to lose.","However, after exchanging blows, he found out that the feeling that Ling Han gave him... was just like a young Great Emperor that had walked out of the primitive doors.","It was clear that their cultivation levels were completely the same, yet he was still being suppressed. He had no temper at all.","Now, this feeling was exactly the same.","No, no, no. If Ling Han was also Eight Stars, it wouldn’t be as simple as suppressing him. Instead, he would be able to easily crush him.","How was this possible! He was the Golden Generation!","Guan Xinghan’s expression was livid. How could it be that the legend of the Golden Generation was really going to be destroyed?","Ling Han didn’t give him time to be stunned. With a battle cry, he unleashed another punch.","He was influenced by Brother Monkey’s fighting spirit. Now, he only wanted to fight vigorously and to his heart’s content.","Who cares about victory or defeat, who cares about loss or gain!","I only ask for a battle.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","With the support of such fighting spirit, Ling Han attacked without any reservations, and in truth, he could both disperse a portion of the attack he took, and also had a strong physique as a shield, so he completely had that kind of confidence.","On the other hand, Guan Xinghan was also a Body Arts practitioner, but he hadn’t cultivated the True Dragon Imperial Scroll, so his physique at the same cultivation level couldn’t possibly compare to Ling Han’s. Moreover, he couldn’t automatically disperse attacks either.","Thus, he would have reservations when he attacked, to avoid trading injury for injury with Ling Han.","In this way, he naturally gradually fell into a disadvantage.","Everyone was once again astounded by this. This was the Golden Generation! He had the advantage of seven minor levels of cultivation level, yet he was actually outmatched?","You’ve got to be joking.","And all the Imperial Clan elites looked cold, their killing intent blazing madly.","Ling Han was too freakish, far surpassing the strongest generation, so much so that others didn’t even have the confidence to match him.","This kind of person... had to be killed.","Otherwise, would there still be any suspense about the battle for the throne?","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Another Golden Generation charged out, joining the battle.","Boom, the Golden Generation had long since advanced into Sect Master-level. The lowest cultivation level among them had reached Five Stars. Every single one of them could pose a threat to Ling Han, what more when twenty over of them were attacking together?","In fact, Chang Daoyu, Su Qianhai, and the other Nine Star Sect Masters were also among them. Any one of them would be slightly stronger than Ling Han in a one-on-one battle, what more when they were working together?","Yet Ling Han was completely unafraid. His fighting spirit was like a tidal wave, and as Phoenix Wings Divine Flight unfolded, he shuttled back and forth among the great Imperial Sons, throwing punches madly. Regulations exploded, and he would fight anyone he saw.","On the other hand, the Imperial Sons were slightly apprehensive. They couldn’t hurt their own people, right?","Relying on his speed, Ling Han was able to move freely under the combined attacks of the Imperial Sons. Though he was constantly facing a life-threatening danger, he was always able to resolve it in time.","F***, this was really invincible!","Everyone was watching, all of them gritting their teeth, completely in disbelief.","As it turned out, Ling Han was already this powerful.","Ding Shu, Origin, and Myriad Dao were also watching, all of them frowning slightly. They too had incredibly strong confidence, but if they asked themselves honestly, if they were in Ling Han’s shoes, just how many moves would they be able to sustain from the attacks of so many Imperial Sons?","Without Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, the world’s top movement technique, they probably wouldn’t be able to last ten moves.","They all had ambitions to become Emperor, but Ling Han suddenly seemed to be leaving them in the dust, causing them to feel a strong sense of urgency."]},{"number":4458,"title":"Chapter 4458: All Arrived","paragraphs":["Chapter 4458: All Arrived","Editor: Henyee Translations","Now, Ling Han had cast aside all thoughts of victory and defeat, and only wished for a satisfying battle.","Invigorating!","He continued to laugh loudly, and his Han Fists continued to attack. It was as if he wanted to exhaust all of the mystical power in his body.","However, even if he was so freakish, even if he still had the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, his opponents were still over twenty Golden Generations, after all. As time passed, he was still wounded.","Wounds were left on his arms, lower abdomen, and thighs. Blood was gushing out, but it was as condensed like liquid gem, and did not roll down.","And this was still because of his strong physique, as well as the fact that he could disperse a portion of the attack on his own. Otherwise, this would not be something as simple as just a wound appearing. Instead, his arms, legs, or even his waist would have been severed.","But so what?","Ling Han was completely unconcerned, and merely swung his fists even faster. With a single strike, fourteen Regulations bloomed at the same time, their destructive power incredibly terrifying.","A great many Imperial Sons were also injured, but they were all five-star or six-star Sect Masters, and their individual battle prowess was already no match for Ling Han. If it was not for the help of others, they might even have been killed by Ling Han.","This caused them to be shocked, and their killing intent also blazed even brighter.","They definitely could not allow Ling Han to continue growing. Otherwise, they would really be facing the judgment of an apocalypse.","Because there was no precedent of the Golden Generation joining forces, they naturally lacked coordination at the beginning, but as the battle continued, this coordination slowly improved.","It was just a few Nine-Star Sect Masters that were impeding Ling Han, and as for the others, they were accumulating Regulations on the sidelines. The moment they attacked, a dozen over Regulations bloomed, and even the Void was about to be torn apart.","After advancing to the level of Sect Master, he indeed had the ability to tear open the Void.","The Golden Generation was freakish in the first place, so even the Five Star Sect Master could unleash 12 flashes of Regulations in a single strike. If he condensed them to the extreme, it was completely possible that he could unleash 15 flashes of Regulations in a single strike.","This was naturally terrifying, and posed a huge threat to Ling Han.","In just a short while, the injuries on Ling Han’s body increased, and his whole body had turned bright red.","Of course, the Imperial Sons had also paid a considerable price, but with so many people sharing the burden, the situation was naturally much better than Ling Han.","“Hiss, he actually didn’t retreat?” Everyone bared their teeth, stunned by Ling Han’s fighting spirit.","To say nothing of a one-on-many battle, even if it was a one-on-one battle, with Ling Han’s cultivation level as a One Star Sect Master, no one would call him a coward if he retreated after a few exchanges with any Golden Generation cultivator. They would only give him a thumbs up.","But now, Ling Han had already slapped the Golden Generation’s face repeatedly, yet he was still embroiled in battle?","It was impossible for him to win, so what else was there to prove?","Ling Han really didn’t want to prove anything. Since he could still fight, he would fight until he was at the end of his line. In any case, once Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was used, who would be able to catch up to him?","He channeled the Ten Cultivation Technique, and rapidly recovered from his injuries, maintaining his condition at almost all times.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","He aggressively counterattacked. This was his style. ‘If you don’t trifle with me, I won’t trifle with you either, but if you anger me, I’ll return the favor tenfold, or a hundredfold.’","‘Die!’","The Golden Generation was indeed engaged in a fierce battle, and had no time to think. Meanwhile, the remaining Silver Generation and the ordinary Imperial Sons all felt their hearts grow colder and colder. As it turned out, they were still so far away from the highest level of battle prowess.","Now, their cultivation level was gradually catching up. A great many members of the Silver Generation had advanced into Sect Master-level, but they knew that if they joined the battle, they would only be insta-killed by Ling Han.","Since when had the Silver Generation become so weak?","No, it was not that they were weak, but rather that Ling Han was too strong.","“Hmm?”","Two figures descended from the sky, and when they saw the intense battle that was ongoing, they all looked surprised.","Yang Yihuan, He Luo!","These were two people who had entered the Imperial Path at least ten times. Their abilities were unfathomable.","“This brat... is too shocking!” He Luo looked at Ling Han, surprise flashing across his face.","“He is indeed amazing.” Yang Yihuan nodded, but at the same time, he was also confused.","Previously, when he had appeared, he had swept aside the Silver Generation, his might unmatched. Only Myriad Dao could match him, but now, another guy had actually appeared, which made even him feel apprehensive.","He suddenly felt like things had gone out of control.","“Yi?” He Luo looked in a direction, and couldn’t help but feel surprised. “Feng Miaoling!”","Yang Yihuan also looked over, and similarly looked slightly surprised. However, he immediately felt relieved. The two of them had appeared, so what was so strange about Feng Miaoling also appearing?","What about the other guys? Had they not arrived yet, or had they still not appeared?","There were a few “old” guys that had even walked through Imperial Path several times more than he had, so it was normal that they still hadn’t appeared, as there was no need for them to walk through Imperial Path again.","“Brother Yang, do you want to play?” He Luo pointed at the battle ahead of them.","“Forget it.” Yang Yihuan shook his head. “Can’t you see that Feng Miaoling is only watching the battle?”","He Luo smiled, and cast another look at Ling Han. His eyes could not conceal a sliver of shock, and then he said, “The prodigies of this generation are like a gushing spring. After great repression, a great explosion has occurred. Looks like our fated opportunity would be in this lifetime.”","“Brother He is no longer suppressing your cultivation level?” Yang Yihuan asked with a smile.","“Brother Yang, isn’t that what you think as well?” He Luo also smiled.","The two of them laughed loudly.","Actually, they had long since cultivated to the Venerate Tier, but every time they cultivated to this cultivation level, they would sever their cultivation level and start from the beginning again and again. Every time they re-cultivated, their battle prowess would become slightly stronger.","To them, it was too easy to return to Venerate Tier-level. They had already experienced this many times.","Weng, a terrifying aura assaulted them.","“En?” The two of them were startled, and simultaneously looked behind them.","A figure streaked across the skies, and instantly appeared above the battle.","“Bunch of weaklings. You can only bully Old Sun and my brother if you join forces!” Brother Monkey appeared, and with a cold humph, two streaks of white gas shot out from his nostrils. Boom, the white gas shot down, instantly causing a huge explosion.","Boom! The Golden Generation elites were all thrown off their feet, drenched in blood.","So what if they were the Golden Generation? With a gap of a major tier, they would only be insta-killed by Brother Monkey.","And this was still because Brother Monkey had not delivered a fatal strike. Otherwise, with a single thought from him, even a Sect Master would only die.","Of course, the Imperial Sons all had Substitution Seals. They would have to be killed a few more times, to use up all their Substitution Seals.","This was not because Brother Monkey was apprehensive, but rather because he wanted to leave these people for Ling Han to deal with.","“Scram!” Brother Monkey shouted lightly. His Fiery Golden Eyes were domineering and filled with killing intent.","These Golden Generations didn’t even dare to fart. This was a Venerate Tier, and he could smack them to death with a single strike. How could they be qualified to speak tough?","“Brother Monkey, where are those three people?” Ling Han also stopped, not even casting a look at Guan Xinghan and the others.","This caused the Golden Generation elites to want to vomit blood. The feeling of being ignored was even more humiliating than being scolded harshly.","“They ran away,” Brother Monkey said very easily.","Ling Han nodded, and his fighting spirit subsided. He slung an arm around Brother Monkey’s shoulder, “Brother Monkey, there’s been no news of you for so long.”","“I went to a place, and Old Sun almost died inside.”","C"]},{"number":4459,"title":"Chapter 4459: Lost All Six Senses","paragraphs":["Chapter 4459: Lost All Six Senses","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han told Brother Monkey about his experiences during this time.","Brother Monkey went to a Mystery Realm to break through to the Venerate Tier. Thus, he didn’t connect to the Galaxy Network again. When he came out, Ling Han basically didn’t use the Galaxy Network anymore, and it just so happened that the Imperial Path opened, so Brother Monkey directly set foot on the Imperial Path.","As they conversed, more and more people gradually arrived.","Ling Han looked around, yet he didn’t discover the empress, the large black dog, and the others.","Could it be that they were still blocked outside?","Ling Han’s expression was slightly dark. These Imperial Clan elites were truly shameless. It was one thing for them to block him, but they were even stopping the large black dog, the empress, and the others!","Humph, so what if you guys do this? In the end, the imperial throne would have nothing to do with the so-called Golden Generation.","Ling Han’s killing intent soared. By the looks of it, he would have to kill a few more Imperial Sons.","“The doors are open!” Someone said, and the doors of the ancient castle ahead of them were actually slowly opening.","By the looks of it, all the corresponding passageways of the rainbow bridges had already been opened. Thus, the next section of the path had also been opened.","In an instant, everyone squeezed in through the gap in the door that had been opened.","Those that had appeared here now were all prodigies among prodigies. They had experienced multiple eliminations, so every single one of them were extremely strong competitors. They had to make the most of their time, and could not fall behind others.","“Brother Monkey, let’s go too,” Ling Han said to Brother Monkey.","“Alright.” Brother Monkey nodded. “Then let us brothers turn this place upside down.”","“Haha!” Ling Han was also filled with heroic spirit.","The two brothers walked towards the main doors of the ancient castle together. At this time, Ding Shu also walked over. Beside him was Myriad Dao, Origin and Feng Miaoling.","“Do you still want to spar?” Ling Han looked towards Ding Shu.","He had made an agreement with Ding Shu. Whoever could break through their limits at a certain cultivation level, and the other could not, or whoever could win in a battle of equal cultivation levels, would be able to take the position of Big Brother.","At present, they were both at the level of Sect Master, so he did not know whether Ding Shu would challenge him or not.","Ding Shu was extremely depressed. After he had advanced to the level of Sect Master, he had indeed wanted to have a battle with Ling Han, but when he had seen the great battle between Ling Han and the Golden Generation, he knew that he had no chance.","The gap was a little wide.","“When I break through the limits of the Minor Advanced Tier, I’ll battle you again,” he said dejectedly.","“En?” Ling Han raised a brow.","“Big, Big Brother!” Ding Shu said through gritted teeth.","This was too despicable. In the Genesis World, he was also an absolute overlord, and no one could compete with him. Yet now, he actually had to address Ling Han as Big Brother, which made him feel extremely displeased.","That was because the two of them had the same starting point, and had both originated from the Genesis World. Why was he inferior to Ling Han?","Origin and Myriad Dao had already stepped onto Minor Advanced Tier. However, these two people weren’t familiar with each other. It was just that they had been famous on the Galaxy Network before, and had risen up at almost the same time, which was why they were listed together.","They entered into the ancient castle, and saw that this place was filled with great trees that soared into the skies. Vegetation covered the ground, densely packed together, yet not a single building could be seen.","“Brother Ling, I’ll take my leave first,” Origin clasped his hands and said to Ling Han.","“All right,” Ling Han nodded. With everyone together, how were they supposed to split the treasures?","It was best to separate, to avoid conflict.","The others did the same. Even Ding Shu took his leave. They were all confident, and were completely unafraid of encountering danger.","Meanwhile, Ling Han and Brother Monkey walked forwards. They passed through the forest, and stepped on the grass. The Spiritual Qi here was dense, and the vegetation was growing madly. It was lush and verdant.","Although Brother Monkey had an impulsive personality and wouldn’t waste time on words if he could fight, he was very patient at this moment. He jumped up and down along the way, and didn’t clear a path with his staff.","“There’s Celestial medicine!” Brother Monkey suddenly exclaimed, raising his nose.","Yi, Brother Monkey’s nose was also like a dog’s?","Ling Han did not say anything about this, and merely followed Brother Monkey. Very soon, they discovered a Celestial medicine.","Unfortunately, this Celestial medicine was only Five Stars, and did not have much effect on Ling Han and Brother Monkey.","It was fine. Couldn’t he still give this to the empress and the others?","Sha, sha! sha. The sound of rustling leaves rang out, and they could see that someone had also come over. However, when he saw Brother Monkey and Ling Han, his expression immediately became serious. Hurriedly, he clasped his hands, and slowly retreated.","Ling Han picked up the Celestial medicine, and Brother Monkey did not even cast a second look at it. Naturally, he did not take a five-star Celestial medicine to heart.","The two of them continued onwards.","“Brother Monkey, after the Imperial Path is over, should we return to Celestial Sea Planet to take a look?” Ling Han asked.","“Sure,” Brother Monkey nodded. “It’s been a long time since I last saw Chen Fengyan. At that time, he was always following behind Old Sun.”","Ling Han couldn’t help but chuckle. When Chen Fengyan saw that he had advanced to the level of Sect Master, what kind of expression would he have?","It would have been fine if that old nephew had advanced into Sect Master-level, but if he was still in Spirit Transformation Tier, he would probably die of embarrassment.","Haha, he was actually slightly expectant.","Ling Han thought mischievously.","The two brothers continued to advance. There were indeed a considerable number of opportunities in this ancient castle, but they were mostly targeted at those below the level of Sect Master. Perhaps it was because they were more unlucky, so they did not manage to find them.","They didn’t deliberately search for it. After walking for a while, a corner of the building vaguely appeared ahead of them.","The two of them exchanged a look, and both sped up.","It wasn’t long before a building appeared before them.","This was a palace, and in terms of location, it should just happen to be in the centre of this ancient castle.","They arrived at the entrance of the palace. The doors were already open, but they could only see complete darkness. As for anything else, they could not see anything else.","“Let’s go.”","Brother Monkey was fearless, and took the lead.","Ling Han smiled, and followed closely behind, walking alongside Brother Monkey.","The moment he entered, darkness instantly enveloped him. He couldn’t see anything at all, and it was as if he had suddenly become blind.","No, not only sight, but also hearing. In fact, even his divine sense had been cut off.","Ling Han had clearly entered with Brother Monkey, yet at this moment, he couldn’t sense Brother Monkey’s presence at all.","He suddenly turned around, yet he couldn’t see the door at all.","Transferred?","He turned around and walked forward.","Two steps later, he appeared outside the palace and came out.","The world was clear, and sight, hearing, and divine sense all returned.","In just a short while, Brother Monkey also strode out.","“Interesting. The six senses are sealed in here,” Brother Monkey said.","Ling Han nodded, and smiled at Brother Monkey, “Again?”","“All right.”","The two of them entered into the palace once more, and instantly, the feeling of relaxation disappeared again. However, neither of them retreated this time. Instead, they continued onwards.","With his six senses sealed, even if Ling Han communicated with his divine sense, he was still unable to contact Brother Monkey. He felt as if he was the only one in this world.","No, there were still millions and millions of dimensions in his body. Every dimension was filled with vitality and intelligent life.","Countless psychic powers of belief were released. Though they were all extremely weak, as the saying went, ‘dripping water penetrates stone’, one mustn’t underestimate weak power.","Ling Han strode forwards, and after about ten minutes, light suddenly appeared ahead of him.","The galaxy shone brilliantly!"]},{"number":4460,"title":"Chapter 4460: Burying Time","paragraphs":["Chapter 4460: Burying Time","Editor: Henyee Translations","They were clearly walking in the palace inside the ancient castle, so why was there suddenly a field of dazzling stars?","Ling Han was surprised. He was presently standing in the galaxy. There were stars in the distance, and as the starlight shone on him, it was as cool as water.","Yi, he clearly hadn’t channeled any movement technique, nor had he stepped on Regulations, so how could he stand in the galaxy?","This most likely wasn’t a genuine galaxy.","Ling Han strode forwards. As expected, the Void seemed to have solidified, allowing him to walk easily.","However, he had only taken a few steps, when a star suddenly exploded with astonishing light. Then, he saw a figure appear in front of him. It was made up of starlight, and had an indescribable beauty to it.","However, this starlit human figure immediately threw a punch at Ling Han.","Fight? Come on then!","Ling Han let out a battle cry, and charged towards the starlight figure, his iron fists also booming loudly.","Peng! He exchanged a punch with the starlight person, and couldn’t help but feel surprised. The starlight person’s power was actually only slightly inferior to his, and there were as many as eight Regulations.","This was battle prowess that could match the Golden Generation’s.","However, in front of Ling Han, what was this worth?","He did not use his full power, but with a barrage of punches, it was only ten moves, and the starlight figure was forcefully shattered.","Yi?","He discovered that the star that had previously exploded had shot a ray of light towards him, which directly surged in his mind, nourishing his fruit of cultivation.","This was originally a small sapling, but now, it had grown slightly.","Yi, Celestial Qi?","However, after a while, the light from the star disappeared.","Ling Han looked over, and saw that this star was much dimmer than before. Perhaps, after a few more times, it would completely dim.","In other words, only those who had entered this space the earliest would have the chance to be nurtured by the starlight. As for those who had entered after that, even if they too had walked all the way here, they would not have such great fortune.","Ling Han smiled in satisfaction.","He continued to advance, and soon, another star lit up. Then, the figure of starlight reappeared.","Its strength... was more or less the same.","Ling Han stepped forward to greet him. With a few punches and kicks, he had dealt with this starlit person.","In a battle of equal cultivation levels, who could be a match for him?","After destroying this starlit human figure, his Dao Fruit Tree grew a little.","He laughed loudly, and pushed forwards. With the continuous nourishment of the Celestial Qi, his fruit of cultivation also grew at an astonishing speed.","As expected of the Imperial Path, it was a place of great fortune.","Originally, Ling Han was still some distance away from the Golden Generation, especially those like Lin Xuan and the others, who had already advanced into Venerate Tier, but through this kind of fateful encounter, he was completely capable of catching up or even surpassing a portion of the Golden Generation.","Right now, Ling Han was already standing at the forefront of the younger generation.","As they battled, the speed at which he disposed of his opponents was too fast. Merely a day later, he had arrived at the end, and saw that a path had appeared ahead of him.","He couldn’t help but feel regretful. It ended just like that?","Though the Dao Fruit Tree was thriving, it still hadn’t produced any fruit of cultivation. It was still some distance away.","He tried to retreat, but when he walked again, no starlight figure appeared again.","There was nothing else that could be done. He should just continue onwards.","He walked out of the passageway, and surveyed the surroundings. He saw that there was actually a cemetery ahead of him. Multiple burial mounds towered. Some tombstones were as tall as three thousand meters, and the burial mounds were like great mountains. Some tombstones had been broken, and it was unknown whether it was because they had been corroded by time, or had been broken in battle.","Would there be Yin souls or zombies charging out?","Ling Han was filled with anticipation as he strode into the cemetery.","However, the breeze rustled eerily, but no enemy appeared.","Er, all right then.","Ling Han was slightly disappointed. At present, he longed for battle, because if he battled and killed enemies here, there would be many benefits.","He walked past one tomb after another, his eyes sweeping over them, wanting to see who was buried here.","However, these tombstones were all the same, with no words on them.","Were the people buried here all nameless people?","Ling Han suddenly felt an urge to dig up a grave. Was someone really buried here?","He forcibly dismissed this kind of impulse. If the ancients had really slumbered here, then how could he bring himself to dig up their graves when there was no enmity between them? How could he allow the ancients to not be able to have peace even after death?","The deeper he went into the cemetery, the eerier and darker the environment became. There was also a bone-deep chill.","After walking for half a day, the exit of the cemetery appeared ahead of him, or rather the entrance.","What surprised Ling Han was that there was actually another thatched cottage here.","It couldn’t be that there were people living here, right?","Ling Han walked over, yet saw the thatched cottage creak open, and an old man in grey robes walk out.","“Dream of a Thousand Years.” The grey-robed elder stretched lazily, then turned to look at Ling Han, as if he had just seen him. A hint of surprise appeared on his face, “Young man, what are you doing here?”","This old man... could not be seen through at all!","A Saint?","But in the case of Saints, wouldn’t they be unable to enter into the Imperial Path?","Could it be that it was here that he had broken through?","All of a sudden, thoughts flashed through Ling Han’s mind. However, a smile appeared on his face, and he said, “This junior is just passing by.”","“Oh.” The grey-robed old man nodded, “That’s right. This is a cemetery. You are so young, so what have you come here for?”","Ling Han was curious, and couldn’t help but ask, “Senior, who are the people buried here? Why are there graves but no words?”","The grey-robed elder looked into the depths of the cemetery, and said slowly, “What is buried here is not a person, but rather time.”","“Time?” Ling Han couldn’t understand. How could time be buried?","Although there was indeed such a theory, it was only a metaphor. It couldn’t be that someone had really built a cemetery, right?","“Hehe, since you’ve met this old man, we can be considered somewhat fated,” the grey-robed old man said with a smile. “Come, young man, this old man will treat you to a drink.”","“Thank you, Senior,” Ling Han said with a smile.","The grey-robed old man brought Ling Han into the thatched house. The furniture here was really simple. There was only a bed and a stone table, as well as a stone stool.","The grey-robed elder had Ling Han sit on the stone stool, while he himself sat on the bed. Then, he took out a wine pot and two wine cups from who knows where, and placed them on the stone table.","Ling Han picked up the wine pot and poured a cup of wine for himself and the grey-robed elder.","Yi?","He looked at the wine that had been poured out. It was extremely murky, and there was not the slightest bit of fragrance of wine from it.","“What is it? Are you complaining about the wine?” the grey-robed old man asked with a smile.","“It certainly doesn’t look like much,” Ling Han said honestly.","“Haha.” The grey-robed old man laughed loudly. He held a wine cup, and a nostalgic look appeared in his eyes. Then, he raised it, “One toast to the heavens, one toast to the earth, and one toast to the ages.”","Then, he drained the cup in one gulp.","Ling Han hesitated for a moment before also picking up his wine cup and draining it in a single gulp.","Yi?","He suddenly felt a wave of intoxication assault him, and in an instant, he felt very dizzy. With his cultivation level and physique, he was completely unable to withstand it. Involuntarily, he couldn’t help but lay down on the table, and very soon, began snoring.","“After so many lifetimes, it’s time to take a gamble.” The grey-robed old man walked out of the thatched cottage, then turned to look at the wine pot on the table, “Brat, you’re really lucky. Throughout history, there were less than ten people who could drink the Time Wine.”","“I can consider today as forming a good karma!”","He took a step, and a great golden path spread out, and he instantly disappeared without a trace."]},{"number":4461,"title":"Chapter 4461: Heaven Crushing","paragraphs":["Chapter 4461: Heaven Crushing","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han was snoring loudly.","He entered one dream after another, and it was so real that it was difficult for him to distinguish dream from reality.","In the dream, he began as a weak cultivator and continued to grow until he reached his peak. Again and again, it repeated endlessly.","But in this kind of dream, not everything went smoothly for him.","Sometimes, he would be killed right after advancing into the Foundation Building Tier, and at other times, he would become a Saint.","Ling Han tried all kinds of cultivation techniques. Some didn’t work, while others did, broadening his horizons.","He was walking on his own path. This kind of dream that seemed so real was too helpful, letting him know how much time he could save by walking on this path. There was no need for him to take the wrong path.","After an unknown amount of time, Ling Han slowly woke up.","His cultivation level hadn’t increased in the slightest, and so had his divine sense. However, Ling Han had a feeling that his battle prowess had become stronger again.","That was because he had advanced a little further on the path that he had taken.","He got up, and saw that the grey-robed old man was no longer in the room. Only the wine pot was still there, as if it was proving that Ling Han’s experiences before he got drunk were all real.","“This old man... who exactly is he?”","Ling Han felt that the number of elites in this universe had exceeded his imagination. Ever since the appearance of Buddha Doga, the top elites had popped out, one after another. For example, the Lord of Yin River, the Lord of Blood Ocean, as well as some planet that had suddenly appeared, where there was obviously a supreme elite within the restrictions.","They were all Pseudo-Emperors?","These people who already had one foot into the imperial throne seemed to be about to achieve dao right in front of his eyes. If he competed with them, how small would his chances of winning be?","The grey-robed elder he had met previously was plain and unadorned, completely insignificant, but it was precisely because of this that Ling Han felt that the latter was strong.","—For better or worse, he was already at the level of Sect Master, yet he could not even sense the strength of the other party. Then wouldn’t that indirectly mean that the other party was strong?","“Hiss, could this senior also be a Pseudo-Emperor?”","Ling Han gritted his teeth. He was only a Sect Master, and the difficulty level had already reached the point that he would have to face many Pseudo-Emperors?","This was obviously impossible. Perhaps there were a few Pseudo-Emperors that had come from ancient times, but there should be pitifully few of them.","“No matter what, I only have one path to take, and that is to become stronger as soon as possible.”","Ling Han exited the straw hut, and planned to continue onwards. However, he suddenly felt an aura approach.","He stopped, and looked behind him.","A slender figure rapidly approached. This was a young man who looked to be only twenty-three or twenty-four years old. He was dressed in snow-white silk robes, spotless, as if he was a deity.","His appearance was very ordinary, but his eyes were extremely lively, and his gaze was even deeper. One would be captivated with a single look, and be unable to extricate himself.","It was as if he had not expected that there would be someone ahead of him. Thus, when he saw Ling Han, a hint of surprise appeared on his face, but he quickly withdrew it, and asked, “How should I address you, friend?”","This person was at the level of Sect Master, but his exact star level could not be distinguished. There was a fog enshrouding him, and even his eye technique could not see through it.","Ling Han sized him up a few times, then said, “Ling Han.”","“Ling Han?” The young man gave an ‘oh’, as if he had obtained a very good reason. If it was Ling Han, then it would not be strange for him to walk ahead of him. He smiled slightly, “I am Heaven Crushing.”","Heaven Crushing!","The Heaven Crushing that had risen up strongly on the Galaxy Network all those years ago? The Heaven Crushing that had been on the same level as Myriad Dao and Origin?","It was extremely likely that he was the second person to walk out of the palace. This meant that his battle prowess at the same cultivation level was extremely strong. As expected of the freak that could stand side by side with Origin and Myriad Dao.","“Brother Ling, how about a spar?” Heaven Crushing asked.","Ling Han raised a brow, and said, “Sure!”","At first, he had no intention of fighting. Instead, he was in a rush to go to the next place, and continue to increase his cultivation level.","However, with his personality, how could he be afraid of a battle when he was being challenged?","Fine, then let’s have a spar with the last of the three strongest members of Galaxy Network from all those years ago.","Heaven Crushing let out a battle cry, and already charged towards Ling Han.","Boom, the two of them did not dodge, and came to a head-on confrontation.","Teng, teng, teng! Ling Han couldn’t help but retreat. Meanwhile, Heaven Crushing also swayed and bled from between his thumb and forefinger.","This strike... Heaven Crushing had the upper hand in terms of power, but in terms of Regulations, he was slightly inferior to Ling Han. Thus, the result was that Ling Han was sent backwards, while Heaven Crushing was slightly injured.","“Are you really a One Star Sect Master?” Heaven Crushing waved his hand, and the wound quickly healed.","“As real as can be,” Ling Han said with a smile.","Heaven Crushing’s smile disappeared, and his expression became serious.","That attack just now could be considered a tie. Both of them had their own strengths, but he was a Four-Star Sect Master!","Four stars against one star, and it was actually a tie, which he could not accept.","—If this was known to a Golden Generation like Guan Xinghan, he would definitely complain incomparably, because even an Eight-Star Sect Master like them would only be able to fight Ling Han to a tie.","You did it with just four stars, so how much more awesome was that compared to the Golden Generation?","“Impressive!” Heaven Crushing said sincerely, then charged out again.","Boom!","He controlled Regulations, and shot out a palm strike. Space was forcibly torn apart, and high-level energy surged, turning into a terrifying and boundless attack.","Ling Han was naturally unafraid, and greeted the attack with a raised fist.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Neither of them used any tricks, and merely faced the other head-on.","After several dozen moves, Ling Han was indeed sent flying a great many times, but in truth, it was Heaven Crushing that was at a greater disadvantage.","That was because after every exchange of blows, the injuries he had sustained were real and genuine.","It wasn’t that his defense wasn’t high. In fact, he was also a Body Arts cultivator. However, he was slightly weaker than Ling Han, so he only suffered some light injuries every time. His foundations weren’t damaged, and it didn’t affect his battle prowess at all. However, he was covered in blood, and he looked extremely disheveled.","“Great!” Heaven Crushing threw his head back and roared with laughter. “Ling Han, show me all of your abilities. Otherwise, if you’re insta-killed by me, don’t regret it!”","Boom! A layer of black energy suddenly wrapped around his hands, causing one’s heart to palpitate.","‘Holy f*ck!’","Ling Han faltered upon this. He was far too familiar with this. This was Destructive Energy!","Through his and Ding Shu’s examples, it could be proven that only the Genesis World’s Master could grasp Destructive Energy.","Hiss!","Ling Han did not say another word, and also channelled out the Destructive Energy. However, he controlled it slightly, and only wrapped it around his fists.","“Yi?” Heaven Crushing was also taken aback.","The two of them exchanged a look, and both of them gave an ‘oh’ in their hearts. They were already completely aware of each other’s origins.","“Come!” Heaven Crushing roared, unleashing a murderous aura that transformed into a divine saber in Ling Han’s mind. It was going to wreak havoc.","Ling Han humphed. The Dao Fruit Tree trembled slightly, and this God Tool shattered.","In terms of divine sense, which Sect Master could compare to him?","He was very curious. At first, he had thought that only he and Ding Shu were from Genesis World, but now, he shockingly saw a third one.","What about Origin and Myriad Dao?","Doubt welled up in Ling Han’s heart. Perhaps these two people were as well.","...Just how many were there?"]},{"number":4462,"title":"Chapter 4462: Energy Jade","paragraphs":["Chapter 4462: Energy Jade","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han pondered, but his hands didn’t stop, endlessly exchanging blows with Heaven Crushing.","They didn’t hold anything back, unleashing their ultimate techniques and Mystical Powers.","Of course, Ling Han still held back, such as the strength of the Destructive Power, and he did not use the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower either, and in fact, he still hadn’t used the Han Fists yet. Now, this was one of his strongest trump cards.","Heaven Crushing roared endlessly, and as his hands attacked repeatedly, his divine sense also condensed Regulations, turning into multiple God Tools. Like giant axes that opened the sky and struck the ground, they slashed towards Ling Han.","Ling Han laughed loudly. He too condensed Regulations, turning them into God Tools, and greeted Heaven Crushing.","After fighting for half a day, it was still a tie.","The two of them stopped at the same time. It would be meaningless to continue fighting unless they used their stronger trump cards.","“Trade?”","“All right!”","Neither of them said what they wanted to trade, but both of them knew very well.","Sure enough, they each took out a Spirit Diagram and handed it over to the other.","Ling Han unfoldedit to take a look. Heaven Crushing was not playing any tricks. This was indeed a corner of the Destructive Energy Spirit Diagram.","Of course, he didn’t play any tricks either.","The two of them took the Spirit Diagram and began to cultivate. After half a day, they stood up at practically the same time, and traded back the Spirit Diagrams.","From this, it could be seen that there was not much difference in their comprehension ability.","As expected of the ruler of the Genesis World!","Though they had all had different encounters after coming out of Genesis World, there was really nothing to be said about their comprehension ability for being able to become the overlord of a territory. They were definitely the best choice.","“Please.”","“Please.”","The two of them exchanged a smile, then went their own way.","In future, they would definitely be powerful competitors on the Imperial Path, but before that, they appreciated each other’s talent.","“If I encounter Myriad Dao and Origin again, I definitely have to test them out again. Whether they are the Genesis World’s Masters or not,” Ling Han murmured. He had already obtained six corners of the Destructive Energy Spirit Diagram, and according to his deductions, he would be able to reach perfection with three more corners.","Thus, if Origin and Myriad Dao had both mastered Destructive Energy, he would only be a sliver away from completely mastering Destructive Energy.","He used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. With a competitor like Heaven Crushing, he didn’t dare to slack off, and he had to make the most of his time.","As for Brother Monkey, there was naturally no need for him to worry at all. He was a Two Star Venerate Tier elite, and in this place, he was the strongest elite, without equal.","After walking for a while, a dried up lake appeared in front of him.","What dense Spiritual Qi.","Ling Han was shocked, and saw that there were multiple pieces of brightly coloured jade at the bottom of the lake. It was precisely these stones that were exuding a dense energy, that he could sense even from very far away.","This energy was extremely pure, without the slightest impurity.","Ling Han descended, but he didn’t dare to move too quickly. Otherwise, if he disturbed the balance of this space, it was very likely that an energy storm would form, and even he would be torn apart.","The entire area around the lake was filled with dense energy that had almost solidified. Furthermore, its level was extraordinarily high. Even if Ling Han had already slowed down his pace, he had only created a slight breeze, and the surrounding energy had already turned into blades, slicing at his body. Instantly, a considerable number of holes appeared in his clothes, as well as a few wounds.","How terrifying. This destructive power was comparable to a Nine Star Sect Master. Furthermore, this was only produced through Ling Han’s slight movements. If his movements were slightly greater, just how terrifying would it be?","Moreover, Ling Han had already channeled the Ten Cultivation Technique, yet his wounds were actually unable to heal. Although his injuries weren’t severe, this was still extremely strange.","However, the more this was the case, the more curious Ling Han became.","He advanced slowly, feeling as if he were forcibly squeezing into a formation created by God Tools. It was inevitable that he would be scraped, and the result of touching the God Tools would be lacerations.","Was there anyone that would torture themselves like this?","Ling Han grimaced. It was useless even if he activated the Starlight Screen, as it would explode with a light touch.","He advanced slowly, leaving a trail of blood behind him. It was an extremely tragic sight.","It hurt, it hurt, it hurt. Ling Han gritted his teeth. When these energy blades sliced into his body, it was really very painful, causing him to almost cry.","He took out that Saint Tool, wanting to use the natural treasure to resist these energy blades. However, he shockingly discovered that the shield formed by the precious pearl was ineffective.","Strange, wasn’t this treasure capable of resisting natural negative effects?","This was the handiwork of some elite?","It didn’t seem like it.","Ling Han sensed with his senses. This was indeed the purest energy. The reason why it possessed such terrifying destructive power was because it was too dense.","This was just like how a paper sword couldn’t kill someone. However, if one compressed 1000 or 10,000 pieces of paper into a thin piece of paper and made it into a sword, would one still be unable to kill someone?","If one walked one path to the extreme, no matter how weak they looked, they would still be able to unleash terrifying might.","Ling Han suddenly came to a realization.","Unfortunately, he did not dare to sit down and cultivate in seclusion here. That would really be a suicidal action.","He walked slowly, and finally arrived in front of the jade closest to him. He stretched out a hand to touch it, and it was extraordinarily hard.","This was completely condensed from the power of heaven and earth!","Hiss, this was extremely terrifying.","It should be known that the energy of heaven and earth could not be seen at all, and could only be sensed, and this was only the energy of a low-level dimension. The energy of a high-level dimension could only be communicated through the divine sense following the path of the Spirit Diagram.","He had only heard of energy that was so dense that it turned into gas, and now, it had actually turned into a solid body, and it was extremely hard at that. Just how dense was it?","No wonder the surrounding environment had become filled with killing intent. The slightest movement could disintegrate a person.","Ling Han thought internally. If this energy jade could be carved into a weapon, then just how much damage would it cause when shot out?","Absorb it?","That was impossible.","Firstly, after reaching the level of Sect Master, the factor that troubled cultivators was Celestial Qi, and not mystical power. Secondly, this was too dense. Even absorbing a little was enough to make Ling Han suffer greatly, and it was not impossible that his body would directly explode.","En, since that was the case, then what about making it into a weapon?","Ling Han carefully stored the Energy Jade in his hand into his Spatial Tool, but with a pa, this Tool directly exploded.","F***, so terrifying?","Ling Han switched to another Spatial Spirit Tool and tried again. The result was the same; it couldn’t bear the weight at all.","‘Can’t I deal with you?’","Ling Han directly drew out the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and put it away again.","This time, the Energy Jade was safely stored into the first level of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","Ling Han smiled eerily. If Origin Gold still couldn’t deal with you, then you really could fly to defy the heavens.","Since he had already taken one, why shouldn’t he take a few more?","Ling Han moved again, and began to roam around at the bottom of the lake, endlessly picking up the Energy Jades. After spending half a day’s time, he finally collected all of them.","He gritted his teeth. He had been bleeding all this while, and his wounds were extremely painful.","Since he had picked everything up, he had to leave as soon as possible.","Ling Han still didn’t dare to move too quickly. He slowly retreated, and in this process, he discovered that the energy intensity of the environment had slightly weakened."]},{"number":4463,"title":"Chapter 4463: Frightening Might","paragraphs":["Chapter 4463: Frightening Might","Editor: Henyee Translations","This was understandable.","The reason why the environment was so dangerous was because of those Energy Jades. Now that the Energy Jades had been taken away, the environment would naturally recover slowly. However, this time could possibly be very, very long.","Ling Han finally retreated out of the lakebed area. When he arrived at a completely normal environment, he hurriedly sat down in a cross-legged position and channeled the Ten Cultivation Technique again. His injuries were finally under control, and they were slowly improving.","It should be known that for such superficial injuries, he should have been able to heal them immediately with a single thought.","After a whole three days, the wounds finally scabbed over completely, but they were only scabs.","Ling Han retrieved an Energy Jade and started to examine it.","Ling Han’s divine sense swept over it, and his expression changed slightly.","The energy contained within could only be described as terrifying.","In an analogy, this was equivalent to the sum of all the energy on a large star.","What kind of concept was that?","The Venerate Tier elite was powerful enough, wasn’t he? As long as the Venerate Tier elite was given enough time, he would be able to blast a star to bits.","However, if a star exploded, the energy that burst out in that instant would be enough to shatter even the Venerate Tier elite. Thus, the Venerate Tier elite had the ability to destroy a star, but would definitely not do so, unless he no longer wanted his life, or could escape before the arrival of the great explosion.","However, this was extremely difficult, because even if the Void was torn open, the massive explosion of the planet was enough to affect even the surrounding Void.","Thus, the Saints were basically the ones who had obliterated planets.","How could Ling Han’s face not turn green?","Previously, it was equivalent to him sitting on a barrel of dynamite. He was really lucky not to have died.","“As expected, the ignorant are fearless. If I had known that these Energy Jades would be so terrifying, would I still go down?”","Ling Han murmured to himself. This was because the Energy Jade wasn’t stable. It would explode if he exerted too much effort.","Thankfully, the lakebed area was extremely dangerous, so he didn’t dare to make any big movements at all. He had to be careful. Otherwise, if his hands and feet were a little heavier... he would have been done for.","“What if I use this thing to smash someone?”","Ling Han’s eyes lit up. This Energy Jade was too unstable. As long as one took a bit of force, it would detonate the energy within, and the power that would burst out would be enough to insta-kill a Venerate Tier.","Perhaps, even Saints could be wounded if they were careless.","Of course, if he was obliterated the moment it left his hand, he would be the unluckiest person.","“That’s not right!”","“This should be even more destructive than a star exploding, because just how big is a star? And just how big is this thing?”","Under the condensation of millions and millions of times, how could destructive power be equivalent?","“If I go and smash people like this, will I also seek death?”","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel suspicious. Because he had never tried it before, he had absolutely no idea what kind of terrifying destructive power would be created after this Energy Jade exploded, and just how wide would the radius of effect be.","“Hmm?”","Someone was coming.","Lin Xuan.","Ling Han fled into the shadows at the first instant. Although the Strange Shadow Steps wasn’t the world’s fastest movement technique, it was definitely the most impressive technique of concealment.","Lin Xuan descended, and a suspicious expression appeared on his face.","Just now, he had sensed an aura, but now, it had disappeared.","Ling Han?","This was his first reaction. Otherwise, how many people could hide in front of him?","“Come on out, what’s the point of hiding?” he said calmly, but his voice was booming, turning into waves that spread out in all directions.","Under the soundwave, the air was crushed and distorted, and no one could hide at all.","Ling Han moved quickly to dodge the soundwaves.","He retreated 50km, and only then did the soundwave weaken. It did not have such powerful might.","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. He had just wanted to know the might of the Energy Jade, so wasn’t this a very good opportunity?","Let’s give it a try.","He held onto an Energy Jade, then suddenly swung his hand. Xiu, this jade smashed towards Lin Xuan.","Even though there was a distance of 50km between the two of them, with the Sect Master-level power, it was enough to penetrate a planet with a rock. This little bit of distance was really not much.","Xiu, the Energy Jade tore through the air, whistling as it smashed towards Lin Xuan.","Ling Han, on the other hand, turned around without hesitation. He used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight and fled.","He wasn’t afraid of Lin Xuan, but he was afraid of the shockwave created by the explosion of the Energy Jade. A distance of 50km was too insecure for a large explosion that could kill a Venerate Tier elite.","He didn’t have a Substitution Seal.","“Humph!” Lin Xuan immediately discovered Ling Han, and directly stretched out a hand to grab him.","Hong, a large hand split open the skies, and in an instant, it had reached a few hundred km, a few thousand km, as if the whole heaven and earth could be covered by it, terrifying without bounds.","When a Venerate Tier elite made a move, so what if it was a Sect Master?","He naturally saw the jade that was thrown at him, but he didn’t take it seriously at all, all right? To say nothing of the fact that this was only a rock, so what if it was a Spirit Tool? Activated by a Sect Master, even the might of an Imperial Weapon would be limited. It couldn’t possibly pose a threat to a powerful Venerate like him.","The Energy Jade was extremely unstable. Originally, the intense friction with the air was enough to cause it to explode, but previously, Ling Han had wrapped the mystical power around it, which had the effect of cutting it off, so it did not explode.","However, Lin Xuan sent out a palm strike, and Venerate Tier-level power surged out. What was Ling Han’s tiny bit of mystical power worth?","Boom, the Energy Jade immediately exploded.","In an instant, Lin Xuan’s expression changed drastically in shock.","‘Holy f*ck!’","This was too terrifying. Was a Saint making a move?","He hurriedly turned around to flee, using all his strength.","He indeed had the Substitution Seal on him. However, this was created by a Saint, and it could only take effect on attacks below the level of Saint. If he took this attack head-on, his only fate would definitely be death.","He was the Golden Generation, after all, and he was also one of the three strongest prodigies in this prodigy group. His movement technique was also astonishingly fast. In fact, he didn’t even hesitate to use the secret technique, with blood spurting from all over his body. In an instant, he exploded with speed that surpassed his own strength.","Hong, energy surged rapidly. To say nothing of Lin Xuan, even Ling Han’s Phoenix Wings Divine Flight was far inferior to this speed.","Under Lin Xuan’s incredibly terrified gaze, the energy that had exploded had already caught up to him and swallowed him whole.","“F*ck!”","Ling Han turned around to take a look, and gritted his teeth. That was because the energy wave was presently catching up to him at a frightening speed.","In this Mystery Realm, there was no way for him to tear a rip into space and flee. Furthermore, in fact, with how terrifying this burst of energy was, even if he had entered into the Void, as long as it was still affecting the core area, he would still be affected by the energy.","Thus, he could only flee with all his might now.","It was too late!","Boom, the energy shot over from his back, and directly sent Ling Han flying. Then, it caught up to him, and was sent flying again. After more than a dozen times, the might of this great explosion finally reached its greatest extent. Terrifying energy surged towards the skies and the ground.","Looking up, a massive mushroom-shaped energy mass had appeared in the sky, and as for underground, it could not be seen for the moment, but as long as the energy mass dispersed, he should be able to see a massive sinkhole."]},{"number":4464,"title":"Chapter 4464: Severely Injured","paragraphs":["Chapter 4464: Severely Injured","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han gritted his teeth.","Hu, he could feel pain, which meant that he was not dead yet.","Ling Han crawled up, only to discover that all of his clothes had been torn to shreds. His skin was also riddled with wounds, some of which were so deep that even his bones could be seen.","Hiss, he had clearly run so far, but the energy storm still affected him.","As expected of a deadly move that could kill Venerate Tier elites.","Thankfully, he had fled fast enough, and the area affected by the concentrated Energy Jade was much smaller, but within this range, it was ten to a hundred times more terrifying than the explosion of a star.","“I wonder if Lin Xuan is dead yet.”","Ling Han looked at the ball of energy soaring into the sky. Even if he was still very far away, he could still feel that terrifying fluctuation. If he rushed in now, his only fate would be death.","After a long time, this energy storm finally passed. Though there were still lingering shockwaves in the air, they no longer had much destructive power.","Ling Han channeled the Ten Cultivation Technique and got his injuries under control. However, he was severely wounded, and wouldn’t be able to recover in a short while.","It was fine, as long as it did not affect his battle prowess.","He strode forward, his eyes continuously searching.","As expected, a deep pit was blasted into the ground, and there was still dense energy rising from it.","After a while, he revealed a smile.","Found him.","Near the edge of this deep pit, there was a person lying down. Who else could it be but Lin Xuan?","However, the present Lin Xuan was in a miserable state. He had lost his left arm and right leg, and his whole person was sprawled out on the ground. The flame of life was extremely weak.","He wasn’t dead yet?","Ling Han was astonished. Venerate Tier elites were truly difficult to kill. He had long since prepared himself, and he had fled with all his might. However, he was still riddled with wounds. Meanwhile, Lin Xuan was caught off guard, and he actually didn’t die?","However, looking at where Lin Xuan had fallen, it was clear that he was already at the periphery of the great explosion.","“You really can run!” Ling Han shook his head.","At this moment, Lin Xuan suddenly moved, and then he got back up.","“Ling, Han!” he called out through gritted teeth, his voice filled with fury.","He had almost died!","Now, though his life was saved, he had lost an arm and a leg. Of course, he was a Venerate Tier, and furthermore, he was the Imperial Son. The clan definitely had Great Herbs to help him recover, and it would not leave behind any future trouble.","But the moment he thought of it, he still felt lingering fear.","Previously, he was really just a little bit away from the gates of hell.","He used his divine sense to check on his present state, and couldn’t help but pale. He had suffered heavy injuries, and his abilities had already fallen out of Venerate Tier. Furthermore, if he didn’t treat his injuries in time, his injuries would worsen, and his abilities would fall further.","However, killing a person who had just entered the ranks of Sect Master was not a problem.","He kicked out with one leg, and a terrifying power surged out. Like a divine flying general, he charged towards Ling Han.","“Die!” he roared in fury. He had actually almost died at Ling Han’s hands, causing him to feel lingering fear and fury.","Boom, he controlled this furious attack, and shot it towards Ling Han.","All of a sudden, sixteen Regulations bloomed, as bright as fireworks.","These weren’t Seven Star Regulations, but rather Six Star Regulations.","Ling Han smiled. Lin Xuan’s strength had already fallen below the level of Venerate Tier, and was now about the level of the Nine Star Sect Master.","If it were an ordinary Nine Star Sect Master, Ling Han wouldn’t be afraid at all. He would be able to defeat him just by charging forward. However, Lin Xuan was a Golden Generation, and even in a heavily injured situation, his power and Regulations would still surpass Ling Han.","Then, he would mainly dodge and drag out the battle. When Lin Xuan’s injuries worsened, his battle prowess would definitely fall further.","No!","Ling Han shook his head. He didn’t have the patience to wait slowly.","Since a very long time ago, Lin Xuan had always maintained a lofty attitude, viewing him as an ant, and could kill him as he liked. Now, since the major tiers of both sides were equal, Ling Han wanted a battle.","His battle prowess was far inferior?","Then he’d use the Spirit Tool to compensate for it.","Ling Han summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. Weng, the Pseudo Imperial Weapon released a terrifying aura.","This wasn’t an Imperial Weapon, but how could the might of Origin Gold be negligible under the power of a Sect Master?","Peng!","Lin Xuan’s attack arrived, and was completely blocked by the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. Meanwhile, a bolt of lightning flashed past, striking back at Lin Xuan.","This was the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. It was rare for Origin Gold to have dual attributes, which could both attack and defend.","“What!” When Lin Xuan saw this, he hurriedly waved his hand again, dispersing the lightning.","Zi, blazing white lightning was still flickering around him, indescribably terrifying.","The might of this strike was actually comparable to his strength!","Though there was no shortage of six-star precious tools in this world, to be able to deliver an attack that could threaten him, this must be one of the peak grade Six Star Spirit Tools. It may even be a Seven Star Spirit Tool, a Saint Tool!","It was naturally impossible for this to be an Imperial Weapon. There were only so many of them in the world, and it was even more impossible for it to fall into the hands of a minor character at the level of the Sect Master.","He blocked this attack, then glanced at the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. He couldn’t help but blurt out, “Imperial Weapon!”","This was truly a f*cking slap to his face. He had just said that this couldn’t possibly be the Imperial Weapon, and what was the result? He was incredibly familiar with that boundless aura. It was the Imperial Weapon!","No, he immediately overturned his decision.","This wasn’t the Imperial Weapon. It didn’t have the aura of a Great Emperor.","“Origin Gold!” he exclaimed in shock, greed flickering in his eyes.","The Imperial Weapon was forged by the Great Emperor, and the material used to forge the Imperial Weapon was the Origin Gold. However, every piece of Origin Gold was in the most dangerous places of this heaven and earth. Even the Great Emperor would have to pay a certain price to retrieve it.","Thus, the Imperial Weapon had only been forged after the Great Emperor had ascended Dao, and he had gone to look for Origin Gold.","But now? Ling Han actually had a piece of Origin Gold in his possession.","Lin Xuan couldn’t help but feel extremely regretful. If he had known earlier, he would have killed Ling Han at all costs and snatched the Origin Gold from him.","Before becoming Emperor, he already possessed the Origin Gold, so what kind of nature-defying good fortune was this?","This was equivalent to having obtained destiny, and was destined to become Emperor.","“I can’t let you live!” Lin Xuan said balefully. He definitely had to kill Ling Han. Otherwise, with how freakish he was, and how he had been blessed by destiny, how could his course to becoming Emperor be blocked??","On the other hand, if he obtained the Origin Gold, it would be equivalent to being blessed by the heavens, and he would naturally be able to stand out from the rest.","Boom! He unleashed his full power.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and greeted the attack with a punch. The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower floated lightly, releasing streaks of Primal Chaos Qi. As lightning flashed, it was incredibly terrifying.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them battled fiercely. Ling Han had the help of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, so he was completely unafraid of Lin Xuan. Power clashed, and Regulations clashed.","Very quickly, Lin Xuan frowned.","He was severely injured, and his abilities had decreased to the level of a Nine Star Sect Master. However, this battle prowess was still unstable, and was still declining.","The problem was that Ling Han was filled with fighting spirit. His battle prowess was at its peak, and if this continued, he would definitely be in trouble.","He could no longer fight. If he continued to fight, he would definitely die!","Lin Xuan forcibly endured the humiliation, turned around and fled.","As long as his injuries were under control, when his strength returned to Venerate Tier-level, killing Ling Han would naturally be a piece of cake.","However, this was really an incomparable humiliation. A dignified Venerate Tier elite, a Golden Generation elite at that, was actually forced to flee for his life by a One Star Sect Master?","How humiliating."]},{"number":4465,"title":"Chapter 4465: Out of options","paragraphs":["Chapter 4465: Out of options","Editor: Henyee Translations","Lin Xuan fled.","Ling Han smirked coldly, and set off in hot pursuit.","“Lin Xuan, have you ever thought that this day would come for you?” he said through divine sense.","Lin Xuan’s face flushed red, and killing intent surged from his body. However, he had to forcefully suppress this urge.","This was a great humiliation. This was really a great humiliation. He was a dignified Golden Generation, and had the potential to be number one, yet was actually being hunted down by a nameless nobody. How could he accept this?","In his eyes, no matter what accomplishments Ling Han had achieved, he was only an ant.","It could not be helped. This was the pride of the Imperial Clan.","But now, this pride had been mercilessly shattered.","“If you don’t use underhanded techniques, killing you will only be the matter of a single move!” he retorted through divine sense.","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh out loud, “Lin Xuan, you, a Fourth Extreme cultivator, can bring yourself to say such words to me, a Minor Advanced Tier cultivator?”","‘Nonsense, you already have the advantage of a major tier and a great many minor levels. If you still can’t win in a head-on battle, then why don’t you quickly find a rope to hang yourself with?’","Lin Xuan merely sneered, “When I recover from my injuries, that will be the day of your death!”","He made up his mind. Once he recovered his abilities, he would kill Ling Han at all costs.","This was to wash away the humiliation, and definitely could not let a third person know about today’s matter. On the other hand, it was also for the sake of the Pseudo-Imperial Weapon. Though it was far from being powerful, but it represented the fortune of heaven and earth.","The heavens favoured him, and he was destined to become Emperor!","“You won’t be able to wait until this day!” Ling Han also said coldly. Lin Xuan wanted to kill him, so how could he not want to kill him?","Xiu, the two of them used their movement techniques to the extreme, and streaked through the skies at an incredibly fast speed.","In terms of movement technique speed, Lin Xuan was originally not inferior to Ling Han. After all, he was a Venerate Tier and added with an Imperial Technique, this was comparable to Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. But the problem now was that his strength had declined, which greatly affected his speed.","To his shock, he discovered that Ling Han was slowly catching up to him.","If he was caught up, his injuries would become more and more serious as they continued to battle. His battle prowess would also decline further, and in the end, he would no longer be a match for Ling Han.","Then next year, today would really be the day of his death anniversary.","Anxiety gripped at his heart, and he increased his speed as much as possible. At the same time, he tried his best to search, wanting to use the terrain to throw him off his tail.","However, this was a flat stretch of land, and there was no place to hide at all, causing him to lose all hope.","Behind him, Ling Han was getting closer and closer.","“Lin Xuan, go all out in battle. At the very least, you can die with some dignity.” Ling Han shot out a punch. He had already used the Han Fists, Regulations glowed, Destructive Energy blazed. He had obtained the sixth corner of the Destructive Energy Spirit Diagram, and the destructive power of Destructive Energy had increased to another level.","They were too close, so Lin Xuan had no choice but to turn around to parry. Peng, with just one punch, he was sent flying.","What!","Lin Xuan’s expression changed drastically again. His battle prowess had clearly decreased just a little, so why had he fallen into such a disadvantage in this exchange?","Moreover, his protective mystical power was rapidly being destroyed. A terrifying energy surged over, causing him serious injury.","What kind of high-level energy was this? It was as if he had been directly struck by an Imperial Weapon, and it was indestructible.","Hiss, what kind of monster was this?","“You’ve already walked your own path!” Lin Xuan was shocked, his eyes popping out of his head, filled with envy and jealousy.","To become Emperor, one would definitely have to walk their own path, but these words were really easy to say. If one really wanted to do it, it would be as difficult as ascending the heavens!","Ordinarily speaking, the Great Emperors of the past would only begin to walk their own paths when they had reached the consummate level of Venerate Tier. By the time they reached the level of Saint, this path would become even clearer, and they would eventually reach the end, where they would become Emperor.","Even for someone as freakish as him, he still had absolutely no idea how to take that first step.","However... this guy in front of him, who was only at the level of Sect Master, had done it.","He was only One Star!","No, looking at the completion rate of this fist technique, it was definitely not something that had just been cultivated!","Heavens, could it be that Ling Han had already started to walk his own path when he was in the Spirit Transformation Tier?","Lin Xuan was speechless with shock. He had already overestimated Ling Han, but only now did he know that his understanding of Ling Han was only the tip of the iceberg. This person had too many secrets.","He turned around and started to run.","In terms of battle prowess, he was already no match for Ling Han. Thus, the only thing he could do was flee. As long as he could throw Ling Han off his tail, and when his injuries recovered, he would still be able to crush Ling Han. Furthermore, this kind of battle prowess suppression could still be maintained for a very long time.","As long as, as long as he could escape!","However, Ling Han had already caught up to him, and didn’t give him any chance at all. Under the barrage of punches, he was tired of parrying.","The destructive power of Han Fists was already terrifying to begin with, what more when it was boosted with the Destructive Energy. If a Great Emperor at the same cultivation level stood in front of Ling Han, he would probably be beaten to burst.","“Ah!” Lin Xuan roared. He was unwilling to accept this.","His true strength was enough to overwhelm Ling Han, and once he killed Ling Han, the latter’s fortune would all belong to him.","Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, Pseudo-Imperial Weapon... These were all items that he was extremely envious of. Obtaining one would allow him to leave the rest of the Golden Generation behind in the dust, and there was no other that could match him. But now, he was like a stray dog.","He felt sullen. He was really unwilling to accept this.","“Hoho, unreconciled?” Ling Han smirked coldly, “In the past, you relied on the fact that your cultivation level was higher than mine, and bullied me whenever you wanted to. Have you ever thought about whether I am willing or not? Just how much anger have I been holding back?”","“And now, I’ll return them all to you!”","Peng, peng, peng! Han Fists waved furiously, and though Lin Xuan managed to just barely disperse them, he was still scraped by the aftermath of the strikes. Just how terrifying was Destructive Energy? It immediately caused his injuries to worsen.","His expression twisted, and he cursed, “You are merely a lowly commoner. How can you compare to me?”","“I am a Golden Generation, and I am the strongest Imperial Son!”","Boom!","What answered him was Ling Han’s powerful and fierce punch.","Lin Xuan was instantly sent flying, his body slanting as he crashed several dozen km away. Only then did his momentum finally run out, and he landed with a bang.","“Yi?” A surprised voice rang out.","Lin Xuan spat out a mouthful of blood, and forcibly raised his head, only to see a person standing in front of him.","Yang Yihuan.","He couldn’t help but feel as if he had found his savior. Hurriedly, he exclaimed, “Friend Yang, save me!”","What pride? He couldn’t care less; he didn’t want it anymore!","At present, he only wanted to live. As long as he could live on, he would have a chance for revenge, and as long as he killed Ling Han, he had a 99% chance of becoming Emperor, and once he became Emperor, would the world dare to slander him?","Yang Yihuan raised his head, only to see that Ling Han had already caught up. A look of confusion appeared on his face, and he was even more stunned. Since when had Ling Han become so powerful? He could even defeat a Venerate Tier elite?","Ling Han stopped, and his eyes focused on Yang Yihuan. He asked calmly, “Brother Yang, do you want to interfere?”","Yang Yihuan spread his hands and said, “I’m not familiar with this Brother Lin, so why should I interfere?”","Lin Xuan instantly felt his vision darken, and almost fainted.","He hurriedly said, “Yang Yihuan, I am the descendant of Fire Cloud Ancestral King, and if you save me, the rewards will be incredibly generous! Furthermore, from now onwards, the Fire Cloud Imperial Clan will become your backer, and no one in this world would dare to offend you!”","Ling Han was extremely curious as he looked at Yang Yihuan. He wanted to see if Yang Yihuan would be moved."]},{"number":4466,"title":"Chapter 4466: Regrowing Severed Limbs","paragraphs":["Chapter 4466: Regrowing Severed Limbs","Editor: Henyee Translations","“No one dares to trifle with them?” Yang Yihuan countered with a question.","“Of course!” Lin Xuan nodded, a hint of pride appearing on his face.","The Imperial Clan was a noble existence that had been developed over countless years. Even in this kind of situation, it was inevitable that he would feel a little proud.","Yang Yihuan couldn’t help but splutter in laughter, “Then let me ask Brother Lin, why are you being hunted? Since no one dares to trifle with the Lin Clan, what need is there for me to interfere?”","This!","Lin Xuan was directly dumbfounded, not knowing how to answer at this moment.","F***, who the f*** knew that there was such a freak like Ling Han, that would dare to make a fatal move even on Imperial Clans.","This kind of monster would only appear once in tens of millions of years. If he didn’t die, he would either become a Saint or become Emperor in the future.","Why was he so unlucky to have encountered him?","Everyone said that the prodigies of today were all unlucky, because they had encountered the Golden Generation, and were destined to be outshone.","But now, he realized that it was the Golden Generation that was the most unfortunate. They were clearly the generation that had the greatest chance of becoming Emperor, but in the end? One after another, freaks popped out, completely overshadowing their brilliance.","“Golden Generation, hoho.” Yang Yihuan seemed to feel rueful, “I really don’t know where you guys got the courage to call yourselves that! And you say you’re comparable to the Great Emperors of the past? Haha, I’m about to die of laughter!”","This was extremely mocking, and it was clear that he was extremely disdainful of the Golden Generation.","If it were any other time, Lin Xuan would have definitely moved by now, letting him know the consequences of disrespecting an Imperial Son, especially the Golden Generation.","But now? He could only feel resentment in his heart.","“In the past, the Great Emperor was much stronger than you guys!” Yang Yihuan shook his head, and said, “To say nothing of the Great Emperor, even I could have easily defeated you at the same cultivation level back then! Even so, I still had to slumber for eternity, continuously increasing my strength so that I would be qualified to fight for the throne in this lifetime.”","“You? Hehe.”","This was practically a merciless blow.","Although Lin Xuan hadn’t fought Yang Yihuan before, Yang Yihuan had walked out of the demonic mist and defeated the Silver Generations consecutively, proving that his talent was comparable to the Golden Generation. Perhaps, it was possible that he had really surpassed the Golden Generation.","Thus, Yang Yihuan was indeed qualified to say such words.","The Golden Generation? Bullsh*t, just showing off.","Lin Xuan suffered a huge blow. He had always thought that he was already close to how the ancestor of the Lin Clan had once been, and in future, could become the second Great Emperor of the Lin Clan, creating a legend and myth.","But now that he was suddenly told that he was still very far away from the Great Emperor, how could he not be shocked?","Ling Han cracked a smile, “Then please step back a little, Brother Yang.”","“All right.” Yang Yihuan nodded, and as expected, stepped back.","Lin Xuan was filled with despair. It wasn’t easy for him to meet someone, and it was still a freak like Yang Yihuan. In the end, the latter wasn’t willing to make a move at all.","His injuries worsened further. If he continued to battle Ling Han, his only fate would be death.","However, if he didn’t fight, his only fate would be death.","A cornered beast would still fight, what more when it was a Golden Generation like him. He would definitely not raise his head and wait for death until the moment of his last breath.","He still had this bit of fighting spirit.","“Then, let’s fight to the death!” Lin Xuan was prepared. Faced with Ling Han, although he only had one leg and one arm, he exuded a powerful aura.","Once one was prepared to die, they would naturally burst out with a powerful fighting spirit.","Boom, he began to combust the Imperial Blood, making his final gamble.","However, combusting the Imperial Blood was extremely useful when one was at a lower cultivation level. It could greatly increase one’s battle prowess, but the better one’s natural talent, the higher one’s cultivation level, and the lesser the boost brought by combusting the Imperial Blood.","For a Venerate Tier elite and Golden Generation like Lin Xuan, the boost brought about by combusting Imperial Blood was negligible, but when the situation had reached such dire straits, he naturally had to use whatever means he could.","However, as the Imperial Blood boiled, Lin Xuan’s aura was like an ocean, rippling out in waves. It was actually continuously increasing, not only reaching the level of a Nine Star Sect Master. In fact, it was even possible that he could even surpass this level.","How was this possible!","Even Lin Xuan himself had not expected this. He looked at the severed arm in disbelief, and felt an itch and pain in his bones, but what was shocking was that the severed arm was presently regrowing!","Not only was his severed arm regrowing, but so was his severed leg.","It should be known that it was either a Saint-level Great Herb, or a Saint, that was qualified to regrow a severed limb, but now, his vitality was clearly greatly damaged, and his battle prowess had dropped to the level of Sect Master, but he actually regrew a severed limb?","How could he not be shocked?","This was the result of combusting the Imperial Blood.","That’s not right. Burning the Imperial Blood could only increase one’s battle prowess. Since when could it be used as a Saintly medicine?","Ling Han and Yang Yihuan hadn’t expected this either. Astonishment spread across their faces.","Have you f****** cheated?","In a mere instant, Lin Xuan’s severed arm and leg regrew, and his strength had also stabilized at the level of Nine Star Sect Master. In the end, he was still unable to break through to the level of Venerate Tier.","However, his injuries had already stabilized, and did not worsen any further. Thus, he had completely gained the ability to battle Ling Han again.","“Haha, hahahaha!” This was something that even Lin Xuan hadn’t expected, but he was naturally overjoyed about this. “Ling Han, you didn’t expect this, did you? This is the power of the Imperial Clan!”","He spoke as if everything was under his control.","“Die!” Lin Xuan charged out. Now that he had all his limbs, his injuries were also under control. He was only short of returning to Venerate Tier-level battle prowess, so he naturally had nothing to fear.","Ling Han smiled faintly. As long as he was still a Sect Master, what did he have to fear?","Let’s battle!","Ling Han summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and greeted Lin Xuan’s attack. The two of them once again engaged in a bloody battle.","As Yang Yihuan watched the battle, he murmured, “This isn’t right. How can burning Imperial Blood allow severed limbs to regrow?”","He racked his brains, greatly troubled by this problem.","After a long while, his expression suddenly changed, “Unless—”","He did not continue, but rather nodded, his expression becoming serious, “So that’s how it is!”","“Then should I give him a helping hand?” Yang Yihuan murmured to himself, “After all, we’re both on the same side! Sigh, forget it, forget it. This guy’s aptitude is just so-so, and there’s no way he can become Emperor. The real Imperial Son of the Lin Clan definitely can’t be him!”","If anyone heard this muttering, they would definitely go numb with shock.","According to him, even the Golden Generation was only “average aptitude”. In fact, they were not even qualified to be called the Imperial Son?","Yang Yihuan looked at Ling Han and said, “This brat is the one who deserves to be taken seriously. His battle prowess is actually so freakish, and is even slightly stronger than the young Great Emperor. If I want to become Emperor, he should be the strongest competitor.”","He observed carefully, and his expression became more and more serious. Ling Han had already walked his own path, and this was something that he had not managed to do either.","Severing his cultivation level time and time again, starting from the beginning, wasn’t it all for the sake of planting seeds to regrow from the destruction, waiting for a day when he could walk out on his own path?","But he had done it in a single go.","“Could it be that one is really destined to become Emperor?” He frowned, “If it is not you, no matter how hard you try, there would always be no hope?”","He turned to look at Ling Han again, killing intent flickering in his eyes."]},{"number":4467,"title":"Chapter 4467: Killing Lin Xuan","paragraphs":["Chapter 4467: Killing Lin Xuan","Editor: Henyee Translations","However, Yang Yihuan ultimately didn’t make a move.","He turned around and left, his expression resolute.","After this journey on the Imperial Path, he would no longer sever his cultivation level. Instead, he would attempt to break through to Saint Tier. After accumulating for so many lifetimes, it was time for him to set everything aside and walk his own path.","With such worries, how could he possibly become Emperor?","What Great Emperor wasn’t filled with confidence in themselves? How could they be so cowardly?","Ling Han and Lin Xuan battled fiercely.","Now, Lin Xuan no longer had any worries. Although he only had the battle prowess of a Sect Master, he didn’t have to worry about his injuries worsening at all. He was naturally unafraid.","Ling Han naturally wasn’t afraid either. He unleashed his Han Fists, unleashing his full battle prowess.","Regulations were like flowers, and the fist technique was elegant, either heavy or light, changing according to one’s will.","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower floated up and down, pouring down streaks of Primal Chaos Qi. This was Ling Han’s first layer of defense. Even if it was broken, there would still be the Starlight Screen, and if it was broken, there would still be his tough physique, which could automatically disperse a portion of the attack power.","In terms of defense, he was freakish.","And in terms of attack, he was similarly freakish. Though he was limited by his cultivation level, and it was inevitable that there would be an upper limit to his abilities, when the Han Fists were used, Destructive Energy surged, this was still incredibly terrifying.","Lin Xuan shockingly discovered that even if he had the battle prowess of a nine-star Sect Master, he was still unable to suppress Ling Han.","It could not be helped. The Pseudo-Imperial Weapon was too strong, and had practically blocked all his attacks. Even if it had not dispersed all its power, only twenty to thirty percent of its might was left, so what threat could it pose to Ling Han?","On the other hand, his physique was only slightly tougher in terms of defense, but against Destructive Energy, it was practically useless. The destructive power of this kind of high-level energy was too terrifying.","He was extremely confused. Could it be that there was a high-level energy that surpassed nine stars in this world?","Otherwise, why couldn’t the Nine Star Energy that he had mastered compare to it?","He was injured, and Destructive Energy was filled with destructive power. Once it invaded his body, he would need to expend a great amount of energy to resist. Otherwise, under the wreaking havoc of this energy, his physical body would be destroyed, and his soul would also be destroyed.","With this bit of power, it was inevitable that his battle prowess would decrease slightly.","And this was a vicious cycle. That was because his battle prowess had dropped, which meant that the chances of him being hit by Ling Han’s attacks would become higher, and then his injuries would worsen. He would have to divide more attention to resist the Destructive Energy.","Hiss, it had already come to this, so why was he still unable to change his fate?","Lin Xuan gritted his teeth before turning around to flee again.","Ling Han gave chase, while laughing loudly, “Lin Xuan, why are you running again?”","“Come, come, come. Didn’t you want to kill me?”","“Weren’t you filled with pride just now?”","Hearing Ling Han’s mockery, Lin Xuan’s face flushed red, but he didn’t say a word.","He couldn’t win, so what could he do?","His figure flashed rapidly. Because his injuries were already under control, there was no need for him to worry.","However, he was still not as fast as Ling Han. Very soon, Ling Han had caught up to him, and they had another great battle.","With every battle, Lin Xuan would be struck a few times by the Destructive Energy, and his injuries would slowly accumulate. His situation began to become worse again.","However, Lin Xuan no longer had any Imperial Blood that he could burn. Now, he was completely focused on fleeing for his life.","He still held onto hope. As long as he encountered Imperial Son Ming or Imperial Son Tian, everything could be turned around.","However, as time passed, he still hadn’t come across Imperial Son Ming or Imperial Son Tian. This place was far too vast, so to coincidentally came across these two people, his chances of success would be infinitesimally close to zero.","Half a month later, Lin Xuan was once again in despair.","His injuries were so severe that he could barely suppress them any longer.","This time, it was caused by the gradual acccumulation of Destructive Energy. The destructive power of this kind of high-level energy was too great, and it was also very stubborn. It was incredibly hard to remove, unless he could stimulate and expel it without being disturbed. If he wanted to accomplish this task in battle, this was an impossible mission.","His body was covered with injuries, and there were even some places where his bones could be seen. Logically speaking, he should have already collapsed.","However, the Golden Generation was still the Golden Generation, after all. Lin Xuan was filled with a longing for life, and this turned into an incomparable fighting spirit, allowing him to persevere.","Even Ling Han was slightly impressed. In terms of willpower, Lin Xuan was really tenacious.","Unfortunately, he could not possibly spare this opponent just because of this.","“It’s time to end this!” He charged forward, and with a wave of his divine sense, xiu, xiu, xiu, xiu, fourteen streaks of Regulations turned into God Tools that appeared out of thin air, slashing towards Lin Xuan.","Lin Xuan resisted with all his might, but his battle prowess dropped again. He was still pierced by one of the blades of Regulations, causing him to scream in pain. His right arm instantly drooped.","Ling Han was neither happy nor angry, and once again shot out a punch.","Peng!","Lin Xuan tried his best to resist, but his arms were crossed over his chest, and they were directly pierced through by a punch.","Pu!","Ling Han’s fist directly pierced through Lin Xuan’s chest. Destructive Energy exploded, instantly annihilating all of Lin Xuan’s vitality.","Lin Xuan’s eyes widened, filled with shock and astonishment.","Had he really died?","Didn’t he have a Substitution Seal?","“You—” He only managed to say a single word before his head tilted, and he collapsed onto the ground.","Ling Han breathed a long sigh of relief. This Golden Generation was truly difficult to kill. It had actually taken him half a month’s time.","However, he had finally killed Lin Xuan in the end, and vented his anger harshly.","He searched Lin Xuan’s corpse, and found a few Spatial Spirit Tools. One of them even contained a considerable number of Celestial medicines, reaching six stars, which was what he was in desperate need of now.","This must have been obtained by Lin Xuan before, but he was already a Venerate Tier elite, so he naturally did not need Six Star Celestial medicines. However, with how precious it was, there was definitely no reason for him to waste it, so he put it away.","Now, however, Ling Han was benefiting from this.","“You have finally done a good deed.” Ling Han smiled faintly. He did not immediately consume the Celestial medicine, but rather began his journey.","Originally, he was the first, but now, in order to hunt down Lin Xuan, he had spent a whole half month’s time. A great many people should have surpassed him by now.","He determined the direction, then advanced.","Another seven days later, another palace appeared ahead of him.","He walked to the door, and saw three words written on it: Golden Roc Palace.","Ling Han was extremely curious. Who had built this?","However, an old man in grey had built a tomb before and buried time. It didn’t seem strange for a Golden Roc Palace to appear here.","He entered the palace, and this time, his six senses weren’t sealed. This was a grand palace, and the walls, ceiling, and ground were all decorated with lifelike golden rocs.","These golden rocs were all different in size, and their movements were also different. Some were spreading their wings and flying high, some were fighting with their prey, and some were sleeping soundly. After Ling Han had taken a few steps, he was presently stepping on a golden roc. Suddenly, with a flash of golden light, this golden roc actually came back to life.","A sharp cry rang out, and the golden roc pounced towards Ling Han. Ling Han met it head-on, but it was incredibly powerful. Its battle prowess was not just a little bit stronger than him.","He still wanted to charge forward, but as he charged forward, he activated even more golden rocs.","Ling Han hurriedly retreated. If he continued to charge forward, he would be seeking death."]},{"number":4468,"title":"Chapter 4468: Golden Roc Palace","paragraphs":["Chapter 4468: Golden Roc Palace","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han was extremely disheveled as he fled from the palace.","He was already strong enough, but these golden rocs were all on the level of the Nine Star Sect Master, and were completely comparable to the Golden Generation. Without using his trump card, Ling Han wouldn’t even be able to match one of them, what more a bunch of them?","Thus, it was impossible to barge through this place by force.","Ling Han walked to the entrance of the palace. Previously, he had only drawn it out by stepping on the pattern of the golden roc. Then, what if he directly flew over?","Stepping on empty air, he strode forwards.","However, he had not taken a few steps, when he saw a golden light flash, and another golden roc flew out from the ground, pouncing towards Ling Han.","‘F*ck! It’s useless even if I don’t step on the ground?’","Ling Han sighed. This place was obviously not so easy to pass through.","He started to battle with the golden roc. He unleashed the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower and the Han Fists, unleashing his full power.","However, he discovered that this golden roc wouldn’t be injured at all.","Right now, to kill a Nine Star Sect Master of the Golden Generation, he could only rely on the Destructive Energy to slowly wear down his opponent’s wounds. This would allow his opponent’s wounds to continue to worsen until they eventually became uncontrollable.","However, this golden roc wouldn’t be injured at all, and it would maintain its strongest state at all times. How was Ling Han supposed to deal with this?","He had no choice but to retreat. There was no point in continuing the battle.","Was it impossible to forcefully barge through or fly through the air?","Ling Han once again returned to the entrance of the palace, and began to carefully observe.","There was no reason that it could not be passed. It was just that he had not found the trick yet.","Ling Han carefully observed, taking in all the images.","After a few minutes, he closed his eyes, but in his mind, images came to life. Those golden rocs danced in his mind.","After a while, he opened his eyes, looked at the ceiling, looked at his surroundings, and then looked at the ground.","A smile slowly appeared at the corners of his lips.","So that was the case.","When the patterns on top, bottom, left, and right were combined, it just happened to be a three-dimensional map of the golden roc hunting. If he stood on this path, he would be attacked, as if he was its prey.","However, there was also the image of the golden roc resting. Standing at this kind of node, he would be safe.","That should be the case.","He took a step, and he had already stepped on a floor tile. As expected, he was safe and sound.","He continued onwards, one step after another, all landing at a safe node.","As expected, his judgement was correct.","Ling Han continued to advance. After spending some time, he arrived at the end of the palace hall. There was a door here that allowed him to walk out.","He took a few more steps, and had already walked out of the palace.","Yi, there were no benefits at all?","Ling Han frowned. Or could it be that he had passed too late, so there was no longer any benefit for him?","Thankfully, he had killed Lin Xuan, and obtained a few Six Star Celestial medicines. Otherwise, he would really have suffered a great loss.","Let’s go.","He quickened his pace, and his figure shot forwards rapidly.","Along the way, he left the mountains and rivers behind him. With Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, his speed was indescribably fast.","Yi?","He could see a dense mist seething ahead of him.","It couldn’t be another place with dense energy, right?","Ling Han flew over, and with a sweep of his gaze, he discovered that what was exuding dense mist was a massive rock, but it was not the Energy Jade that he had previously obtained. This rock was as black as ink, and the aura it exuded was like a sharp blade. Even though it was still very far away, Ling Han still felt a stinging sensation.","And at the top of this large rock, there was actually a plant that was similarly pitch-black. It had bloomed a dark green flower, the size of a palm.","There were still a few people standing under the large rock.","Yang Yihuan, Feng Miaoling, He Luo, Origin, Myriad Dao, Heaven Crushing, Ding Shu, the strongest few of the younger generation were all here.","Sensing Ling Han’s approach, these seven people all cast their eyes over. When they discovered that it was Ling Han, everyone’s eyes narrowed.","Ling Han was too freakish, and could be considered the strongest competitor.","“Yo, everyone is here,” Ling Han waved his hand in greeting.","“You really came at the right time,” Myriad Dao said first.","“What is it?” Ling Han looked towards Ding Shu.","“Just when the destructive power of the Black Ink Stone was about to reach its lowest point, you just happened to appear,” Ding Shu said. “Sigh, there’s going to be another competitor for this Iron Ink Flower.”","Iron Ink Flower?","“Brother Ling is so strong, so why don’t we team up and kick him out of the competition?” Yang Yihuan suddenly suggested.","“All right!” He Luo immediately nodded, his face all smiles.","“Agreed.”","“Agreed.” Ding Shu and the others all nodded.","“Agreed.” Unexpectedly, even Feng Miaoling nodded.","Ling Han looked towards Ding Shu, and couldn’t help but sigh. Was this really his underling?","“Brother Ling, it can’t be helped. You’re too strong. If we don’t work together to kick you out first, then no one will be able to win over you!” Yang Yihuan said with a faint smile.","Of course, this was only an excuse. They were all the top prodigies in the world, so which one of them wasn’t bursting with confidence?","Ling Han sighed, “You guys are the strongest prodigies in the world, after all. Is it appropriate for you to target me like this?”","“Hehe.” Yang Yihuan and the others only smiled, without the slightest bit of embarrassment.","“Why doesn’t anyone tell me what this Iron Ink Flower is?” Ling Han said with a smile. “If it’s useless, there’s no need for you guys to chase me away. I’ll leave by myself.”","“Then you can leave. It really isn’t of much use,” Origin said with a smile.","“Sigh, it’s meaningless to say that.” Ling Han shook his head.","“There’s Celestial Qi contained in the Iron Ink Flower, and it’s of the highest quality.” It was Feng Miaoling who revealed the truth.","Ling Han gave an ‘oh’. No wonder even someone like Yang Yihuan, who had experienced Imperial Path a few times, was attracted. That was the highest grade of Celestial Qi.","He broke into a grin, “Then I’m sorry. Looks like we really have to fight!”","“Come!”","His majestic aura soared into the sky. The seven people in front of him could be considered the strongest prodigies of the current era. In a one-on-one battle of equal cultivation levels, even the Golden Generation was no match for them.","And now, Ling Han actually wanted to fight the seven of them alone?","If it was anyone else, they would have lost their courage and confidence, right?","However, Ling Han’s fighting spirit soared, and he only wanted to have a vigorous battle.","Yang Yihuan was the first to move, charging towards Ling Han.","Origin and Myriad Dao followed closely behind, unleashing battle prowess that was indescribably terrifying.","Ling Han let out a battle cry and charged forwards.","Under the combined attacks of the three strongest prodigies of the current era, Ling Han didn’t dare to hide his strength anymore. Han Fists was unleashed, and his fighting spirit surged out like an ocean.","“What!”","“He has already created his own path!”","Feng Miaoling and He Luo both exclaimed in shock. Even if they severed their cultivation level and cultivated again and again, they still hadn’t touched the slightest bit of it. They were completely unable to find their own path.","Yet Ling Han had accomplished this!","“Haha, Brother Ling, come fight me!” Origin and Myriad Dao Ling both laughed loudly, and their offensive immediately changed.","Their moves were no longer limited to some kind of Imperial Technique, but were incredibly agile, possessing their intent.","This was... their own path of cultivation."]},{"number":4469,"title":"Chapter 4469: Chaotic Battle of the Strongest Prodigies","paragraphs":["Chapter 4469: Chaotic Battle of the Strongest Prodigies","Editor: Henyee Translations","What!","Feng Miaoling and He Luo were given a fright again, and Yang Yihuan was also gritting his teeth. He didn’t expect that aside from Ling Han, there would be another two freaks who had walked their own paths.","Heavens, why had they appeared in this era?","Who would have thought that Ling Han was not the only person who had walked out of his own path of cultivation at the level of Sect Master. There was also Origin, as well as Myriad Dao.","Ling Han smiled and unleashed his murderous aura toward the two of them.","Weng, he immediately discovered that Yang Yihuan was completely unaffected by the barrage of murderous aura. He had rare treasures to resist this kind of attack, and if it was Origin and Myriad Dao, they too used their divine sense to launch a fierce counterattack.","In a one-on-one battle, it was definitely Ling Han’s divine sense that was stronger, but he was multitasking. To attack three people at the same time, the might of the murderous aura naturally decreased slightly, and was just barely dispersed by Origin and Myriad Dao.","In this way, the three of them knew what was going on.","The other... probably had the same origins as him.","If one wanted to cultivate a Mystical Power like the murderous aura, they would have to make use of the Power of Dimension in their bodies when they were in the mortal level, and aside from the Genesis World’s Master, who else could do it?","As expected!","Ling Han had verified it. Origin and Myriad Dao were also the masters of the Genesis World.","En, after the battle, he could trade with them for something like the Destructive Energy Spirit Diagram and so on.","The four of them battled fiercely.","Though both Origin and Myriad Dao had walked their own paths, they had clearly just begun, and were far from being comparable to Ling Han.","To make a forceful comparison, then it was possible that they had only taken five or six steps, and if it was Ling Han, he was already a hundred steps away.","Thus, though it was one against three, Ling Han was not at a disadvantage at all.","“Haha, I’m also here to join in on the excitement!” He Luo laughed loudly, and joined the battle.","His fighting spirit soared. In this era, there were actually three people that had walked out on their own path of cultivation, causing him to feel tremendous pressure and excitement. He was going to have a vigorous battle, and who knows, he may be able to gain enlightenment.","Feng Miaoling, Ding Shu, and Heaven Crushing also joined the battle in quick succession. What shocked Yang Yihuan and the other two “old prodigies” was the fact that Ding Shu and Heaven Crushing also walked out of their own paths of martial arts.","‘Holy f*ck!’","They were stunned to the extreme. This kind of prodigy... there were actually as many as five of them?","At the beginning, it was indeed a battle of seven against one, but as the battle continued, the battle situation became chaotic.","They were all prodigies, so they were naturally dissatisfied with each other. Moreover, the space was limited for a seven against one battle, so it was inevitable that they would collide with each other. As they collided, it was inevitable that flames of war would erupt.","The scene was a complete mess. At present, everyone saw everyone else as their enemy, and their battle prowess was fully unleashed. They had no qualms at all, and barged around recklessly.","‘Hmm?’","They could all be considered top-notch elites among Sect Masters, and immediately discovered that the aura exuded by the Black Ink Stone was weakening.","One could harvest herbs now!","Previously, this aura was filled with killing intent, and even they did not dare approach, or they would definitely be killed. But now, this aura was rapidly weakening, which meant that the time was ripe, and they could pluck the Iron Ink Flower.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Their battle became even more intense, with each person unleashing their full power.","There were indeed some that were stronger. It could not be helped. It was impossible for everyone’s cultivation level to be exactly the same, but no matter how strong you were, if you were targeted by two or three people at the same time, there was still nothing you could do.","Hence, everyone was impeded, and could not break out of the siege to pluck that Celestial medicine.","At this point in the battle, everyone was truly angered.","They were all the strongest prodigies of the present generation, and all of them were filled with confidence in themselves. They all thought that they could suppress the masses, and stand out from the masses. Thus, they also set aside their previous agreement.","The value of the Iron Ink Flower was indeed astonishing, but without this kind of treasure, they could still advance. However, if they could suppress the masses now, that would be an indescribable sense of accomplishment.","In their eyes, this could be seen as a prelude to the competition for the throne. In future, the eight of them would be the strongest competitors on the path to becoming Emperor.","Hence, none of them were willing to admit defeat, and all wanted to charge out of the siege.","The Eight Immortals Cross the Sea, each showing their Mystical Power1.","As the battle progressed, those like Ding Shu and Heaven Crushing all used Destructive Energy, but Origin and Myriad Dao still didn’t, making Ling Han suspicious. Though they were the Genesis World’s leaders, it was highly possible that they didn’t obtain the Destructive Energy Spirit Diagram.","“That should be about it.”","Ling Han was no longer zealous in battle. With a battle cry, he began to break out of the siege aggressively.","He channeled the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and he charged forward. Surging flames burst out, forcing those around him to have no choice but to retreat and temporarily avoid his attacks.","This movement technique was an Imperial Technique in the first place, and possessed super strong attack power. It belonged to the secret technique of the ancient True Phoenix that allowed it to move unhindered in the world, so how could it not be powerful?","Furthermore, it was fast.","Xiu, Ling Han shot out like an arrow of fire, directly breaking through the siege.","Yang Yihuan and the others all gave a loud shout, and chased after Ling Han with all their might. All of them shot out their strongest techniques, determined to stop Ling Han no matter what.","The Iron Ink Flower was a small matter, but whoever could stand out and pluck this Celestial medicine would have an even more important significance.","However, in terms of speed, what movement technique could compare to Phoenix Wings Divine Flight?","Ling Han left them in the dust as he charged toward the top of the boulder.","Now, though the aura exuding from the massive rock had weakened considerably, it still possessed very strong destructive power, turning into streaks of solid light that covered the huge rock like the spikes of a porcupine. Furthermore, this was not static, but was constantly changing in length.","Ling Han had to circle around. He didn’t want to be stung or cut by these rays of light. Otherwise, it would be too late for regrets.","Yang Yihuan and the others did the same. As they gave chase, they continued to dodge these rays of light.","In this way, Ling Han’s speed was still the fastest. With a leap, he appeared above the huge rock, and was just about to stretch out his hand to pluck it, when he saw a hand actually stretch out at the same time, grabbing out at Iron Ink Flower.","‘Hmm?’","This was not the seven people below, but rather someone who had taken advantage of the chaos to make a move.","Ling Han directly channeled Destructive Energy and threw a punch.","Boom, a black-colored energy also ignited on the other’s hand. It was actually... exactly the same!","Peng!","Ling Han exchanged a blow with this person, and felt a massive power rebound back at him. Instantly, his arm went numb.","However, the other party was not much better either, and similarly bared his teeth.","Ling Han didn’t have time to waste. He summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower which floated above his head before reaching over again.","His opponent tried to block him, yet their attacks were completely useless against the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","Ling Han took advantage of the opening to pluck the Iron Ink Flower, and directly stored it into the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. Then, he rapidly retreated, and flew down from the giant rock.","Seeing that the Iron Ink Flower had already been plucked by Ling Han, Yang Yihuan and the others also stopped attacking and turned to look at the ninth person who had suddenly appeared.","This was actually a woman!","She was tall and slender, with a slender waist. She was wearing a tight-fitting dress, which completely outlined her graceful curves.","An exquisite celestial maiden!","When they saw her appearance clearly, everyone thought. However, this woman was not the slightest bit weak. Her exquisitely beautiful face had clear lines, and her heroic spirit was reserved. Furthermore, she had an indescribable dominance, like an empress.","She looked at Ling Han with surprise, as if wondering why Ling Han could also use Destructive Energy."]},{"number":4470,"title":"Chapter 4470: Seven Rulers","paragraphs":["Chapter 4470: Seven Rulers","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Beauty, what’s your name?” Ding Shu was the first to speak.","The woman swept an eye over them, parted her red lips slightly, and said, “Shui Qingchang.”","“Yo, so lively. Have I come too late?” A voice that sounded like it was asking for a beating rang out, and Jing Haoran’s figure streaked past, and landed.","From the very beginning, he showed his suicidal nature, throwing coquettish glances at Feng Miaoling and Shui Qingchang. “These two young misses are so beautiful. Are you interested in having dinner with me tonight?”","“Get lost!” Feng Miaoling and Shui Qingchang moved at the same time. Boom, the terrifying attack turned into a turbulent wave.","Jing Haoran hurriedly retreated, dodging this blow. Then, he patted his chest, as if a heavy burden had been lifted from his shoulders, “Fortunately, I have been practicing my escape techniques. Otherwise, I would really be in serious trouble!”","Everyone was speechless. You are so despicable, so why haven’t you died yet?","Good people really didn’t live long, while bad people lived for a thousand years.","“Come, let’s battle again!” He Luo’s heroic spirit soared, and he was the first to launch an attack, blasting towards Ling Han and the others.","Chaotic battles broke out again.","This time, without the Iron Ink Flower, everyone’s purpose of battle had instead become even purer.","I am the strongest!","“Interesting, interesting!” Jing Haoran smiled, and actually leaped into the fray as well.","On the other side, Shui Qingchang also charged in after a moment of hesitation.","Previously, the battle royale of eight people was already chaotic enough, and now, it had become ten people, and what was even more shocking was that whether it was Jing Haoran or Shui Qingchang, they had both walked out on their own paths of cultivation.","Yang Yihuan, He Luo, and Feng Miaoling were all astounded by this. In fact, they even wanted to buy a block of tofu and smack themselves to death.","They called themselves prodigies, and didn’t even take the Golden Generation seriously, but compared with Ling Han and the others, they were like retards.","How could they bring themselves to look down on others?","The more people there were, the more dangerous the battle royale would be, because you didn’t know how many attacks would be directed at you at the same time.","Thus, as they fought, this battle gradually became more conservative. Everyone focused on defense.","In this way, it was no longer interesting.","Ling Han was the first to stop fighting. However, people gradually retreated from the battle, and in the end, everyone stopped.","They exchanged looks, and an alarm bell rang in their hearts.","The ten people here should be the strongest competitors in the future on the Imperial Path. What Golden Generation? They merely had a slight advantage in cultivation level because they had cultivated a few years earlier. In a battle of equal cultivation levels, hoho.","If this kind of assessment was known to outsiders, they would definitely say that they had gone mad.","—Hadn’t the Golden Generation always been synonymous with the strongest? Now, they were actually looked down on like this?","Ling Han looked at Shui Qingchang, and asked with a smile, “Shall we trade?”","“All right,” Shui Qingchang nodded. She naturally knew what Ling Han meant.","“I’m still here!” Jing Haoran raised his hand and said.","What rendered them speechless was the fact that not only was this guy also the Genesis World’s leader, he had even mastered a corner of the Destructive Energy Spirit Diagram.","Ling Han couldn’t help but sigh in emotion. How was such a person able to cultivate to become the strongest of the Genesis World?","Ding Shu, and the others were also eager to give it a try. They already knew that Shui Qingchang and Jing Haoran were the masters of Genesis World, possessing a corner of Destructive Energy Spirit Diagram.","However, they didn’t rush it either. Ding Shu traded with Heaven Crushing first, while Origin and Myriad Dao’s gazes were slightly adrift. As the Genesis World’s Masters, they actually didn’t manage to grasp this incomparably powerful high-level energy.","They had fallen behind!","Ling Han exchanged Destructive Energy Spirit Diagrams with Shui Qingchang, and they both started to cultivate on the sidelines.","The Genesis World’s leaders all had outstanding comprehension ability. After all, they were prodigies that had stood out from the infinite dimensions, so how could they not be smart?","In just half a day’s time, they all stood up and traded back the Destructive Energy Spirit Diagram.","Ling Han went to find Jing Haoran again, and made another trade.","—Just how many chances had there been previously? Unfortunately, neither of them had used their trump card, so neither of them knew that the other’s origins were the same as theirs.","After another half a day, Ling Han left in satisfaction. As for how Shui Qingchang, Ding Shu, and the others were going to trade, that was none of his business.","He now had eight corners of the Spirit Diagram.","Ling Han’s heart burned with desire. As long as he obtained one more corner, he would be able to obtain the complete version of the Destructive Energy Spirit Diagram. At that time, just how terrifying would the Destructive Energy be?","He swept an eye over them. Those like Yang Yihuan, Feng Miaoling, He Luo, Origin, and Myriad Dao had already left first because it had nothing to do with them.","He was leaving.","He activated his movement technique and found a secluded location. He then started to refine the Celestial medicine.","The battle royale previously allowed him to understand that though his freakish talent was unmatched, he was slightly behind in terms of cultivation level. For example, Heaven Crushing and Shui Qingchang had both reached the level of Four-Star Sect Master.","Thus, he had to raise his cultivation level as soon as possible.","Excluding Feng Miaoling and the other “old monsters”, for those like Ding Shu, Shui Qingchang, and the other Genesis World Masters, the degree of freakishness was only slightly inferior to him. They completely had hopes of becoming Emperor.","And one would know just by looking at history. Some Emperors were not the strongest prodigies of that era. Of course, they were not weak either, and were only slightly inferior. In the end, their fated opportunity defied the heavens, and they surpassed their competition at the last moment.","Thus, he definitely could not be careless. Otherwise, if he missed the imperial throne because of his own negligence, there would really be no room for regret.","He first took out the six-star Celestial medicine that he had obtained from Lin Xuan, and began to refine the Celestial medicine.","A wisp of weak Celestial Qi was extracted by him, nourishing the Dao Fruit Tree.","This thing specialized in eating Celestial Qi. Previously, no matter how Ling Han used mystical power to irrigate it, it did not have the slightest reaction, but once the Celestial Qi entered, it immediately thrived and grew, its speed extremely fast.","However, there was only a sliver of Celestial Qi, and it was immediately used completely.","Eat again.","Ling Han took out the second Celestial medicine, and began chewing on it.","He obtained another wisp of Celestial Qi, which he quickly used up again.","When he refined the last Celestial medicine, aside from the Iron Ink Flower, the Dao Fruit Tree finally matured, blooming a fist-sized flower. Then, it rapidly wilted, bearing a tiny fruit.","This fruit was only the size of a walnut. It was circular in shape, and there was a golden thread on it.","A golden line signified that he was a One Star Sect Master.","Ling Han wanted to cry but had no tears. He had paid such a great price, and he was actually considered a One Star Sect Master now?","Then what was he before?","He sighed, took out the Iron Ink Flower, and began to gnaw on it like a cow chewing on a peony1.","The taste was really not good.","Ling Han evaluated as he ate, but though the taste was not good, he did not waste the slightest bit, and ate the root as well.","“Fortunately, cultivators have strong physiques, or else what if they get a stomachache?”","Ling Han realized that he was showing signs of becoming like Jing Haoran, and hurriedly stopped himself from complaining further.","Boom, this was awesome. The Celestial Qi surged, turning into a silver phoenix that bared its fangs and brandished its claws, as if it was unwilling to be refined by Ling Han, and wanted to charge out.","‘Hehe, you’ve already entered my body, yet you still want to commit violence?’","Ling Han channelled the Imperial Scroll and forcefully suppressed the medicinal effects.","Not long after, this silver phoenix became obedient. Wisps of Celestial Qi seeped out, and was absorbed by him."]},{"number":4471,"title":"Chapter 4471: Two Star Sect Master","paragraphs":["Chapter 4471: Two Star Sect Master","Editor: Henyee Translations","In his mind, the Dao Fruit Tree did not grow any further, but the fruit of cultivation was rapidly growing in size.","The golden line on the fruit of cultivation became darker and darker, and finally, there was no more change.","Ling Han discovered that there was clearly still Celestial Qi left, but the Dao Fruit Tree was no longer absorbing it.","‘What is it? Disdaining it now?’","No.","Ling Han shook his head. This was because he had already reached the limit of a One Star Sect Master. Thus, he now needed to break through the barrier to Two Star Sect Master, before he could continue to absorb Celestial Qi to increase his cultivation level.","It was fine. In any case, the Celestial Qi was locked inside his body, and could not possibly dissipate for the moment.","Ling Han began to break through to become a Two-Star Sect Master. This was completely his comprehension of the Regulations of heaven and earth, and was also the “fertilizer” for the Dao Fruit Tree.","Speaking of comprehension ability, he naturally did not lack it. His hands pressed down on empty air, and the Regulations actually solidified one after another, which he easily grasped.","Endless enlightenment blossomed in his mind, and he revealed a smile.","Boom!","In his mind, the Dao Fruit Tree suddenly began to grow again. It only stopped when it had grown one third taller, and on the fruit of cultivation, a second golden line appeared, though it appeared much dimmer than the first.","Two Stars.","Because there was still Celestial Qi, Ling Han naturally continued.","With the nourishment of the Celestial Qi, the fruit of cultivation continued to grow, but even when the Celestial Qi was completely exhausted, the second golden thread had not reached its limit.","Which also meant that he was still a bit away from the peak stage of Two Star Sect Master.","This speed was already fast enough.","In the outside world, he could only rely on luck to capture the Celestial Qi that had appeared in the high-level dimension. That would really be a chance that would disappear in a flash. Perhaps, it would take a hundred years, a thousand years, or even longer in fact, before he could take a small step forwards.","Ling Han stood up, then quickly threw a punch.","Fifteen Regulations.","He was surprised. When he had been a One Star Sect Master, he had been able to deliver fourteen flashes of Regulations with a single strike, but after advancing into Two Stars, his improvement was actually so small?","However, when he thought about how ordinary Sect Masters could only fire out nine Regulations with a single strike when they reached Nine Stars, what did he have to complain about?","“My foundations are too good. Hence, the moment I advance into Sect Master-level I would be able to crush an ordinary nine-star Sect Master.” Ling Han nodded. However, the heavens were also just, and could not possibly allow him to be unjustly strong.","“Sigh!” Ling Han shook his head. At first, he had thought that after advancing into Two Stars, he would be able to beat up Yang Yihuan and the others, but in the end, his improvement was only so slight.","Thankfully, the increase in power was very obvious, so he finally felt a sense of accomplishment after breaking through.","“Let’s continue forward.”","He had been delayed for a few days, so he had probably fallen far behind the others again.","Ling Han flew over, using Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. He wanted to shorten the distance between him and the people in front of him as much as possible.","Three days later, another palace appeared ahead of him.","Yi, were the people on the Imperial Path so fond of building palaces?","Ling Han arrived at the entrance of the palace hall. He raised his head and saw the words “Fire Tiger Palace” written on it.","He thought back to the Golden Roc Palace. After entering, would there be flaming tigers all over the walls?","As he mocked, he walked into the palace.","Yi?","He was astounded. The walls and ground were quite clean, and there was no graffiti, but in this hall, there was a massive flaming tiger that was napping. With a single exclamation, flames spluttered out of its nostrils, turning into two long fire dragons. Then, with an inhalation, the flames were drawn back.","This feeling was like a child playing with snot, inhaling and exhaling.","“No, I can’t go further and further on this path of mockery.” Ling Han gritted his teeth. Just think about Jing Haoran; he was hated by everyone.","He looked at the flaming tiger again, then assessed its battle prowess in his mind.","“I feel like it’s Nine Star Sect Master, but as for his battle prowess, we’ll only know after a battle.”","Ling Han took another step. Weng, as if something had been triggered, the giant flaming tiger suddenly woke up, opened its eyes, and looked towards Ling Han.","“Little guy, do you also want to challenge me?” the giant flaming tiger said loudly, directly reverberating in Ling Han’s mind, as if it wanted to directly shatter his soul.","This was not a real living being.","Ling Han nodded internally. This was reasonable. Otherwise, how could it be possible to live for tens of millions of years?","“Can I only pass through here if I defeat you?” Ling Han asked.","“Hehe, as long as you can block a single move from me, you can leave,” the fiery giant tiger said. “However, the more moves you can block from me, the shorter the path I’ll arrange for you to take.”","“He, you have to know that there are some passageways that you would not even be able to walk out of in a year and a half.”","Ling Han nodded, and said, “Then please give me some guidance, Lord Tiger King.”","The words ‘Tiger King’ seemed to tickle the fiery tiger, and this fiery tiger enjoyed it very much. It said, “Seeing that you are so sensible, no matter which level you pass, I will increase the specifications another level.”","“Thank you, Lord Tiger King.” Ling Han clasped his fists. In any case, he wouldn’t lose anything by saying a few good words.","“Come,” the fiery giant tiger said.","Ling Han charged out. Boom, Han Fists was used. At the first instant, he unleashed his full battle prowess.","“Yi?” The fiery giant tiger couldn’t help but be startled. It had not thought that Ling Han’s battle prowess would actually be so astonishing.","As the guard here, its abilities were naturally strong. However, against Venerate Tiers and Sect Masters, it couldn’t treat them the same. Its battle prowess would definitely make corresponding adjustments, guaranteeing that it could suppress its opponents, but not render them completely hopeless.","However, the strength of Ling Han’s battle prowess gave it a shock.","“What a little guy!” it exclaimed. Then, it sent out a palm strike, which smashed towards Ling Han.","Ling Han brandished his fists to parry. Fifteen flashes of Regulations surged, as dazzling as flowers.","Boom!","In a head-on clash, Ling Han instantly gritted his teeth.","This fiery tiger was unbelievably strong!","He clearly wasn’t a Venerate Tier, yet with a swipe of his claw, 20 flashes of Regulations lit up at the same time.","Whether it was power or Regulations, the fiery tiger had far surpassed the Nine Star Sect Master, and even the strongest Sect Master in history could not possibly reach this kind of height.","Obviously, the fire tiger’s battle prowess limit was definitely Venerate Tier-level. Thus, if it used the six-star Regulations, the number could completely surpass the limits of a Sect Master.","This was too unfair.","Thankfully, he did not have to defeat this opponent. He only had to block a few more moves as much as possible.","He went all out, using the Phoenix Wings Divine Flight to dodge and parry the fire tiger’s attacks. He tried his best to drag things out.","After a hundred moves, no matter how freakish Ling Han was, he was still at the end of his rope. He was forced into a dead end by the fire tiger, and there was no more space for him to move.","“Little guy, I’ve finally caught you!” The giant flaming tiger laughed loudly, and waved its claws again, planning to completely defeat Ling Han.","However, right at this moment, Primal Chaos Qi surged. Peng, this claw was actually blocked.","Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower!","The fiery tiger was dumbfounded. ‘This, why do you still have trump cards?’","“There’s no rule against using Spirit Tools, right?” Ling Han said with a smile.","The fire tiger subconsciously shook its head. There was indeed no such rule. Furthermore, even if you used a high-level Spirit Tool, its battle prowess would also be adjusted accordingly. Instead, it would only speed up your defeat.","But the problem was, the Spirit Tool in Ling Han’s hands... was only Sect Master-level."]},{"number":4472,"title":"Chapter 4472: Alchemy Saint’s Abode","paragraphs":["Chapter 4472: Alchemy Saint’s Abode","Editor: Henyee Translations","Since Ling Han was only using a six-star Spirit Tool, how could it possibly use Venerate Tier-level power?","This was inconsistent with the rules.","Even if it was incredibly strong, it did not dare to break the rules. This was the basis for its survival. If it disobeyed the rules, it would immediately die.","The fiery tiger was speechless. How could there be such an opponent?","Helpless, it could only strengthen its attacks begrudgingly to defeat Ling Han as soon as possible.","Its battle prowess actually surpassed the level of Sect Master. Though it was only using six-star Regulations, what Sect Master could deliver twenty Regulations in a single strike?","Hence, within the same cultivation level, no one could defeat it.","The problem was that Ling Han, added with the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, was also the strongest existence among Sect Masters. Though he was not as strong as the fire tiger, if it was just delaying time, there was no problem at all.","Two hundred moves, three hundred moves, five hundred moves.","The fiery tiger didn’t even want to fight anymore. At this time, even if it defeated Ling Han, it wouldn’t make much difference. He would definitely be given the shortest path.","Boom!","However, for the sake of its pride, the giant flaming tiger still attacked aggressively, and finally defeated Ling Han.","“Lord Tiger King is truly impressive!” Ling Han praised. “Among those at the same cultivation level, you’re the first to defeat me.”","‘Holy f*ck! Is this a compliment?’","The fire tiger couldn’t laugh at all. It actually the strength of a supreme Venerate Tier elite. This was the result of having its battle prowess suppressed. However, it still used more than 500 moves to defeat Ling Han. This was practically a humiliation to the tiger.","“You can leave.” It waved a paw, and instantly, a ray of light wrapped around Ling Han, instantly sending him away.","What the eye doesn’t see, the heart doesn’t grieve over. It felt tired.","Xiu, Ling Han entered a passageway. This place was empty, and there was no other person.","He strode forwards, and in only a day’s time, he had walked out. Ahead of him was a stretch of rolling hills.","So fast, it had only been a day.","Ling Han recalled what the fire tiger had said before. The longest passage would take about a year and a half. In comparison, he practically hadn’t wasted any time.","He smiled confidently. In terms of endurance, he himself, added with the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, could really be considered the number one in the world.","By now, he should have regained his first place, right?","Unfortunately, he was clearly the first person to pass, so why wasn’t there any reward?","Ling Han thought for a moment. Perhaps the shortest amount of time would be the reward.","Would there be any great fortune on this path?","There was a glimmer in his eyes as he continued to scan the surroundings.","After walking for a while, he couldn’t help but be startled, because he saw an ancient battlefield.","In this place, corpses lay everywhere, bones were everywhere, and broken armor was everywhere.","Strange, why was there an ancient battlefield here?","Ling Han walked in, wanting to see if this battlefield really existed, and not just an illusion.","The wind blew past lightly, causing the sand to flutter. In some places, even the bones buried underground could be seen.","Ling Han bent down and picked up a piece of Battle Armor. It had been too long, and it had also suffered a very heavy blow. It had long since turned into ordinary metal, and was shattered with a light squeeze, fluttering in the wind.","However, Ling Han was certain that a long time ago, this was at least a Six Star Divine Metal.","He had seen a great many broken pieces of armour, and discovered that the majority of their raw materials were Six or Seven Star-level, which also meant that the level of the battle at that time was considerably high.","Furthermore, Sect Masters and Venerate Tiers generally wouldn’t wear Battle Armors. This would affect their flexibility to a certain extent. Only during large-scale battles would they wear Battle Armors to avoid attacks going off-course.","In the past, just how large would the scale of this battle have been?","Ling Han looked around as he walked, searching for anything valuable that had been left behind.","Unfortunately, even if it was a high-level Divine Metal, it had still turned into ordinary metal due to the corrosion of time, and its divinity was gone.","What a waste. This was too much of a waste. How many Six Stars and Seven Stars Divine Metal were there here? If he sold them, he would be able to exchange them for a considerable number of high-level Celestial medicines.","After walking for half a day, he suddenly saw a broken stone tablet.","There were words on it.","Ling Han walked over, and with a sweep of his gaze, he saw that it was written in the oldest characters. The unique trait of the words of that era was their simplicity. One word could express a very deep meaning.","However, it was also because of this that it would be extremely difficult for future generations to read it.","Ling Han read with great difficulty, and after quite a while, he finally understood what was written here.","As it turned out, there was an Alchemy Saint buried here!","And the reason why a war had broken out here was also because there were four forces fighting over the supreme alchemical pill that the Alchemy Saint had left behind.","However, the stone tablet had broken off, so the contents recorded here were not complete either.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel his heart skip a beat.","Alchemy Saint!","He could now concoct Seven Star alchemical pills. In fact, with the strength of his divine sense, he could even just barely attempt concocting a Saint Pill.","What Ling Han lacked was pill recipes. After all, every pill recipe was finally confirmed after a flash of inspiration from predecessors, after countless attempts of experimentation.","At present, he did not have the time to make such an attempt. Thus, with the recipes for the alchemical pill that was readily available, he naturally could concoct a Six Star, Seven Star, or even Saint Grade alchemical pill.","Let’s go and take a look at the abode of that Alchemy Saint.","Ling Han set off in a flash, and following the instructions of the stone tablet, he soon arrived at his destination.","The abode had already been opened. Only one of the two great doors was open, while the other had already been beaten to the point that only half was left. Looking inside, it was a complete mess.","It was clear that this place had already been visited many years ago.","Could there still be any gains?","Ling Han held onto a sliver of hope, and walked in.","Main hall, empty, bedroom, empty, alchemy storage, empty... Ling Han walked around, and finally arrived at the alchemy chamber. In other places, he had zero gains.","After stepping in, Ling Han suddenly discovered that the originally chaotic alchemy chamber had miraculously recovered.","—Originally, the alchemy cauldron had been lying on the ground, and now it was standing erect, completely unscathed. The shelf that had originally held the medicinal ingredients had already collapsed, but was now as good as new.","Just as Ling Han was feeling surprised, a white-bearded old man walked in. Without waiting for him to react, he passed through Ling Han’s body, as if he did not have a physical body.","Ling Han instantly came to a realization. This should have been a remnant scene from who knew how many years ago, and now, like an image, it was repeating itself.","Then, this was the Alchemy Saint?","At first, Ling Han had already given up hope, but now, hope was burning again.","As the Alchemy Saint walked, he was picking medicinal ingredients from the shelves. At the same time, he mumbled, “The pill recipe for the Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill should be completed today! I’ve been thinking hard for ninety-three years, and as long as I trade the Black Leaf Grass for the Hard Yellow Root, there won’t be any problem.”","As he spoke, he took out medicinal ingredients and began to concoct.","If it was another person, they would definitely be wearing a dumbfounded expression.","That was because even if he looked, it would be useless. If he did not know how to concoct alchemical pills, it would be useless no matter how closely he looked.","But for Ling Han, this was very useful.","—How could he not understand with the Alchemy Saint demonstrating right on the spot?"]},{"number":4473,"title":"Chapter 4473: Receiving pill recipes","paragraphs":["Chapter 4473: Receiving pill recipes","Editor: Henyee Translations","Three days later, the Alchemy Saint successfully concocted the Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill.","Ling Han broke into a grin. He had also successfully grasped the method to concoct this alchemical pill.","“Seven Star Venerate Tier-level!”","Ling Han murmured to himself. Though he had indeed grasped a few Seven Star pill recipes, they did not improve his cultivation level, and in the case of this Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill, it could refine the Celestial Qi in the Celestial medicine, and improve its grade.","This was astonishing, and its value could not be any greater.","“However, I’ve never heard of such alchemical pills. They’ve either been lost, or they’re in the hands of a limited number of forces. It’s impossible for them to be taught to outsiders.”","Just for the sake of this pill recipe, Ling Han felt like he had made a huge profit.","Celestial Qi was too rare, and there were pitifully few high-level Celestial Qi. Being able to improve its grade through alchemy, how many people would go crazy for it?","Right at this moment, the illusion disappeared. Ling Han was just about to leave, but he didn’t expect that Alchemy Saint to appear again.","He was still concocting alchemical pills, but in a different manner.","This time, it was directly a Saint Pill.","In the case of Saint Pills, every Saint could theoretically refine their own pills. However, they would need to use their own blood essence as a medium, and that would consume too much of their own blood essence. Furthermore, the types of Saint Pills that could be refined were extremely limited.","Thus, it was naturally still more convenient for an alchemist to do the concoction. Furthermore, there were a wide variety of them, and they could be custom-made.","Ling Han didn’t care whether he could refine Saint Pills or not. Even if he could, he didn’t have the ability to obtain the ingredients. He only needed to memorize it now, and it would definitely be useful in the future.","Five days later, the Saint Pill was completed.","The illusion disappeared, and then came back again. This time, it had become a Six Star Celestial pill.","Ling Han’s interest was piqued. This was because he was only at the Sect Master level right now. What he needed was precisely the Six Stars Celestial Pill.","He did not know the name of the alchemical pill that the Alchemy Saint had concocted, because it was not every time that the Alchemy Saint would speak to himself, but with his understanding of alchemy, he was sure that this alchemical pill was more or less the same as the Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill. It could elevate the level of Celestial Qi.","That was because the ingredients used to concoct the Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill were more or less the same, and the technique was exactly the same.","Then let’s call it Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill.","In terms of naming, Ling Han had always been incompetent. Thus, it was naturally just so-so and casually named.","He was immersed in it, and continued to study it. He memorized pill recipe after pill recipe, and his heart was filled with satisfaction.","He was indeed a prodigy-level martial artist, but in his bones, he was also an alchemist!","“It’s a shame that I ingested all of the Celestial medicines before. Otherwise, if I refine them now and increase the quality of the Celestial Qi, perhaps I’ll already be a Three Star Sect Master!”","The quality of the Celestial Qi had too great an influence on the fruit of cultivation. It not only determined the rate of growth of the fruit of cultivation, but also its quality.","Ling Han felt extreme regret. Unfortunately, who would have thought that he would relive the experience of an Alchemy Saint here?","He soon let go of his thoughts of loss and gain, and continued to observe.","However, a month later, the images he saw were repeated. Furthermore, when it was the second time, the images were clearly slightly blurred.","In other words, not everyone could obtain this kind of good fortune.","Ling Han smiled sheepishly. Out of those that could come here, how many of them were alchemists?","He gritted his teeth. Unknowingly, he had stayed here for another month. He probably wouldn’t be able to keep his first place again.","Hurry up.","He walked out of the abode and continued to advance.","After leaving the area of the ancient battlefield, there was a great ocean ahead of him, but flying over it was completely no problem. Another seven days later, he discovered an island, and searched around the island. He actually found a Six Star Celestial medicine. Unfortunately, it did not contain Celestial Qi.","This made Ling Han a little disappointed, but he still put away the Celestial medicine, and continued onwards.","Since he had gained something, it was very likely that he was still in the lead. Of course, it was also possible that he had still fallen behind. However, the people in front of him were completely focused on rushing, and had no thought of searching this island at all.","He hoped that this kind of gain would be more. It would be best if he could get him a few Celestial medicines that contained Celestial Qi. He wanted to try concocting the Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill.","Another few days later, Ling Han discovered the second island. However, this time, after searching once, he discovered that there were traces of excavation on the ground, and it was very new.","Obviously, there was indeed someone in front of him. Previously, he had not made a move, but when he saw the second island, the other party could not hold himself back.","Ling Han activated his movement technique. He didn’t advance in a straight line, but rather slightly changed his direction.","Another four days later, he reached the third island.","After a round of searching, he had a small harvest. He had obtained a Six Star Celestial medicine, but similarly, it did not contain any Celestial Qi.","Sigh, this kind of Celestial medicine was really too rare. How could he expect to always be overwhelmingly lucky?","Ling Han continued onwards, traversing the seas. One island after another was searched by him, and time passed quietly.","Two months later, Ling Han discovered that a pillar of light that soared into the sky had appeared ahead of him.","Yi?","This pillar of light wasn’t on his path of advancement, but rather slightly off course. However, Ling Han didn’t have an accurate direction in the first place, and now that he saw this pillar of light, he immediately sensed something.","That should be the guiding light.","He adjusted his course and headed in the direction of the pillar of light.","After a whole seven days, he finally arrived in front of the pillar of light.","This was still an island, but it was not very big. There was no vegetation on the island, only multiple jagged rocks.","Ling Han wanted to reach the island, yet he discovered a repulsive force. At first, it was negligible, but as he advanced, it rapidly strengthened, like a spring. When it had been compressed to a certain extent, it began to bounce back.","With a bang, Ling Han was sent flying.","“Haha, Brother Ling has also arrived.” Origin’s voice was heard.","Ling Han looked to the side, and sure enough, Origin was standing in midair, nodding at him.","Previously, though they had had a great battle, they were all the masters of Genesis World, and had a sense of familiarity that was incomprehensible to ordinary people.","Ling Han also nodded at Origin, “Who else has arrived?”","“Yang Yihuan, Feng Miaoling, and He Luo,” Origin said. “They’ve come here more than once, so they’re obviously heading straight here.”","“What the hell is this pillar of light?” Ling Han pointed ahead, “Looks like the opportunities here are not small, so Yang Yihuan and the others rushed here directly.”","Origin nodded, “I have probed them a few times, and according to them, this may be related to the Great Emperor.”","Ling Han looked ahead. The pillar of light was still there. The light was clearly very gentle, but who would have thought that it would produce an incredibly powerful rebound?","“Aren’t we going to this island?” he asked.","“It’s difficult,” Origin said. “The further we go, the greater the obstruction. Thus, everyone is waiting. When the obstruction is slightly weaker, we’ll go to the island.”","Everyone’s strength was different, so whoever had outstanding abilities would be able to take the lead and be the first to reach the island, snatching that fated opportunity.","—Related to the Great Emperor? Then what was it?","Ling Han strode forwards, and began another attempt.","The force of the rebound began to strengthen, and Ling Han’s progress instantly slowed down. When he was about 1.5 km away from the island, Ling Han stopped, unable to advance the slightest bit further."]},{"number":4474,"title":"Chapter 4474: Imperial Origin","paragraphs":["Chapter 4474: Imperial Origin","Editor: Henyee Translations","Origin also walked over, and stood in a similar position to Ling Han.","“If I don’t use my secret technique, I can only walk here,” he said.","Ling Han nodded. He gave a loud shout, and shot out a punch. Just like there was an enemy in front of him, he was going to carve out a path of blood.","This was effective. He overcame all obstacles and continued to advance.","However, when he was about 500 meters away from the island, Ling Han was once again blocked.","The resistance was already so great that he could not advance any further.","Were they really unable to advance any further?","Ling Han channelled the Destructive Energy, raised his fist and waved it again. Instantly, he began to advance again.","Destructive Energy was indeed awesome, especially now that he had obtained as many as eight corners of the Spirit Diagram, and was only a step away from completion.","However, after advancing another 250m, he was unable to advance any further.","The resistance was so great that no matter how high the level of Destructive Energy was, nothing could be done.","It was just like how a sharp blade could easily slice a clay sword, but if this clay sword was as big as a small mountain, how would it be able to cut it?","Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower!","Ling Han used his trump card again. The Pseudo-Imperial Weapon floated above his head, dispersing a portion of the obstructive power, allowing him to advance further.","Finally, he set foot on the island, but now that he had reached this step, he really could not advance the slightest bit further. The resistance on the island was extraordinarily strong.","Ling Han’s eyes swept over the surroundings, and a hint of surprise appeared on his face. That was because what he saw from here was different from what he saw from outside.","There were streaks of golden veined patterns here, as if they were some kind of trajectory. However, Ling Han merely swept an eye over them, and he was forced backwards by the resistance.","Peng, he was like a rock thrown from a catapult, smashing out at an incredibly fast speed.","In this manner, those golden veined patterns instantly disappeared.","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. The resistance on this island was indeed incredibly strong, but it was still possible to get onto the island, and what did those golden veined patterns mean?","Some kind of cultivation technique?","It didn’t seem like it.","Ling Han quickly shook his head. Could it be a path?","Could one enter the island with this kind of path without being affected by the resistance?","Ling Han pulled himself together, and once again headed towards the island.","Everything went on as usual. He forged onwards with all his might, unleashing all his trump cards. He once again set foot on the island, and saw the golden veined patterns reappear.","He hurriedly memorized it, but it was only an instant, and he was once again sent flying.","Again, again.","Ling Han was in high spirits, and charged back.","Not long after, peng, he was sent flying again.","Origin watched him come and go, and couldn’t help but be speechless.","What do you think this is, a game? Is it really that fun?","Again and again, Ling Han was indomitable. Every time he was sent flying, he would see the golden veined patterns a little clearer. Though the progress was very slow, it was steadily progressing.","A few days later, Yang Yihuan and the others also ran over. Because this island was not very big, they could still catch a glimpse of Ling Han from where they were standing — it was mainly because he was sent flying too far every time, and there were practically no blind spots.","“What’s he doing?” Seeing how Ling Han was “playing” so happily, Yang Yihuan and the others were all very confused.","“Er!” Origin shrugged, expressing that he too was completely confused about the situation.","Xiu, Ling Han was sent flying again.","“Brother Ling, is this fun?” Yang Yihuan couldn’t help but ask with a smile.","Ling Han flew over from the distance, and nodded, “It’s fun.” After saying this, he headed back to the island.","Yang Yihuan, He Luo, and Feng Miaoling all shook their heads. They had already walked through the Imperial Path quite a few times, so they naturally knew that it was impossible to set foot on this island by force. They had to wait patiently until the resistance weakened and subsided by itself.","However, when Ling Han squeezed into the barrier of resistance this time, they all looked shocked.","That was because not only had Ling Han stepped onto the island, he had even taken a step forwards.","What!","Yang Yihuan and the others were all astounded. Even though it was only a small step, its significance was too great.","With this step, would there be a second step?","In front of their stunned eyes, Ling Han indeed took his second step. It was steady and stable.","Heavens!","“No way, this guy can really reach the island?” Origin inhaled sharply.","“I know that this guy is freakish, but he can’t be freakish like this, right?” Yang Yihuan gritted his teeth.","With such a comparison, would they still have any face left?","They didn’t know that there would be golden veined patterns on the island, and these veined patterns were the path to reach the island. If they followed this path, the resistance would decrease greatly.","However, the first step was to set foot on the island. Even as freakish as Yang Yihuan and Origin were, they couldn’t do this.","Just ask the people of the world, how many of them could possess Origin Gold?","“Not good, if that’s the case, then Imperial Origin...” He Luo immediately said.","Yang Yihuan and Feng Miaoling didn’t speak, but their expressions became very ugly.","“Imperial Origin? What Imperial Origin?” Origin asked from the side.","Yang Yihuan hesitated slightly, then said, “Alright, looks like that guy is going to get the Imperial Origin first, so there’s no need to keep it a secret anymore.”","He paused for a moment before continuing, “Imperial Origin is a part of the Great Emperor’s power after his death. Even heaven and earth can’t assimilate it.”","He Luo continued, “If we can refine the Imperial Origin, we would be able to glimpse the experiences of the Great Emperor when he achieved Dao. It would be of great help to us in our attempt to break through to become Emperor.”","Origin gave an ‘oh’. No wonder Yang Yihuan and the others had been standing guard here all this while. They had entered the Imperial Path more than once, so they naturally knew this place like the back of their hands. In fact, they had even obtained Imperial Origin before.","He did not take it to heart, because he had already walked his own path. He only had to walk this path to the end, and the position of Emperor would be right in front of his eyes.","“Imperial Origin can help you open up your own path of martial arts, and also allow you to take fewer wrong paths,” Feng Miaoling added.","Only now did Origin reveal an expression of shock. He could take fewer wrong paths; this help was really too great.","He set his eyes on Ling Han. This guy had already walked further than him on the path of martial arts, and now that he would be able to obtain Imperial Origin, he had further left him behind.","A sense of urgency rose up in his heart, and he even felt a sense of hesitation. This was something that he had never experienced in his long life.","Being able to ascend to the pinnacle in the Genesis World, he had naturally experienced countless trials and tribulations. In the end, he had successfully walked out and entered into a new world. Similarly, he had also risen proudly. Even the Golden Generation was no match for him at the same cultivation level.","However, now that he had met his match, it seemed like he was no match for Ling Han in any way.","He had to work twice as hard. Otherwise, it was really possible that the imperial throne would fall into Ling Han’s hands.","Only one Great Emperor could appear in an era!","...","Speaking of Ling Han, after countless attempts, he finally grasped the pattern of the golden veined patterns. Taking the first step was precisely where the resistance was the least. Though it was still very shocking, it was within the range that he could bear.","Lightning flashed in his mind, and golden veined patterns appeared in his mind. He resolutely took the second step, then the third, and the fourth.","In the eyes of ordinary people, this island of obstruction was completely invincible, but under Ling Han’s feet, though this could not be considered a smooth path, it was still not enough to become an obstacle.","What exactly was hidden here that Yang Yihuan and the others were so determined to obtain?"]},{"number":4475,"title":"Chapter 4475: Secret of Regulations","paragraphs":["Chapter 4475: Secret of Regulations","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han advanced slowly, but every step was extremely steady.","Every step he took was extremely precise and was paid great attention to.","Only at these nodes would the resistance on the island decrease to the lowest, allowing him to advance. Otherwise, if he took a wrong step, he would be immediately sent flying.","Behind him, Yang Yihuan and the others also began to make attempts. How could prodigies like them submit to others? Since Ling Han could do it, they naturally thought that they could as well.","Unfortunately, they didn’t have any Origin Gold, and without such a powerful weapon, how could they compare to Ling Han?","Peng, peng, peng! They tried repeatedly, yet were sent flying time and time again.","Ling Han ignored them. His concentration was currently on high alert.","When he took the second step, the golden veined patterns that his eyes had seen disappeared, and he could only depend on his own memories. Thus, on one hand, he had to resist the still very frightening resistance, and on the other, he still had to rack his brains to remember. He definitely could not allow the mistake of a single step.","This was a twofold test. Whichever one it was, he would not be able to advance any further.","That was close. Whether it was in terms of abilities or comprehension ability, Ling Han was at the top of the world, and there was not the slightest bit of error.","He continued to advance. This island was very flat, and there were no mountains. In fact, there weren’t even any larger rocks. It was a flat stretch of land, and his vision was completely unaffected.","Slightly less than half a day later, Ling Han was already covered in sweat. Because of his high concentration, he even felt a little dizzy and vision blurring. However, he was finally close to the heart of the island.","Ahead of him, a rock protruded, and it should be the only rock on the island that would protrude so high.","On top of the rock, there were three crystalline pearls, and they were all milky white in colour. Upon a closer look, the aura of Primal Chaos was rolling within the pearls, but it did not seem to be solid, but rather gaseous.","Ling Han did not relax his spirit. He was cautious and conscientious, and continued onwards.","Another ten minutes later, he arrived in front of the rock. He stretched out his hand to grab the three pearls.","This should be what Yang Yihuan and the others wanted.","When his fingers touched these three pearls, he had not even grabbed them, when the three pearls actually shattered one after another, turning into three streaks of gas that fused into the palm of his hand.","‘Yi, what the hell was this?’","Ling Han only felt his mind tremble, and his thoughts began to rapidly evolve. The path of martial arts spread out beneath his feet, and he continuously simulated the direction of his advance.","This had the same effect as the Time Wine!","Hold on!","In Ling Han’s eyes, Regulations materialized, from one star to nine stars.","Theoretically speaking, he wouldn’t be able to touch the Seven Star Regulations unless he reached the peak stage of Sect Master, but now, it wasn’t just the Seven Star Regulations. Even the Eight Star Regulations and Nine Star Regulations appeared in front of him one after another, easily within reach.","Unlike in the Mountain Sea Heaven, where Regulations were only as simple as materializing. This was presenting even the secret of Regulations, allowing him to easily comprehend it.","Hiss, this was shocking.","What was the greatest difficulty of blocking a cultivator?","His comprehension of the Dao of Heaven and Earth, and what was the Dao of Heaven and Earth? Wasn’t it Regulations?","Now that the secret of Regulations had been analyzed, did the barrier of cultivation level still exist?","Having glimpsed this kind of secret of heaven and earth, to say nothing of the fact that it would be no problem for him to break through to Saint Tier all the way, it was even possible for him to become Emperor!","However, in just the time for a single breath, the boundless Regulations began to dim, and very soon, they would never be seen again.","Ling Han knew that this must be the effect of the three pearls, allowing him to temporarily see the secrets of Regulations, but this was too nature-defying, and could not possibly be maintained for long. It was only the time for a single breath.","Could he possibly memorize all the Regulations in such a short amount of time?","Impossible!","Every Regulation was incredibly complex. If one was greedy, there was only one possibility that he would not be able to remember even a single one.","Ling Han was very practical, and thus set his eyes on a Seven Star Regulation.","Remember, remember, remember. His eyes widened, wanting to memorize all the profound secrets of this Regulation.","However, it was really just the blink of an eye, and all the Regulations had disappeared.","Ling Han only managed to memorize a quarter of it.","“Though that is the case, I think that when I have thoroughly grasped this portion of Regulations, I should be able to mobilize it to a limited extent.” Ling Han looked excited. He was a Sect Master, and if he suddenly shot out a Seven Star Regulations, even if it was just a portion, just how terrifying would that be?","Seven Star Regulations naturally overwhelmed Six Star Regulations. This was Venerate Tier-level Regulations!","Why didn’t he choose the eight-star Regulations or even nine-star Regulations?","F***, he was a Sect Master. Even if he had memorized a portion of the Saint-level Regulations, or even the Imperial Regulations, would he have the ability to use them?","Thus, instead of being greedy and ruining things, it was better to be practical.","Ling Han was a very practical person. He would do as much as he could.","Furthermore, he was very confident in himself. As long as his cultivation level was high enough, would the secret of Regulations be able to stump him?","Thus, he only chose those that would be of greatest help to him now, and not those that might be of help to him in future.","He discovered that the resistance on the island was already ineffective against him.","After obtaining the three pearls, it was as if he had gained the approval of this island. Thus, he could come and go as he pleased.","Ling Han did not leave at the first instant. Though he could no longer see the Regulations of heaven and earth, the path of cultivation was still evolving.","After half a day, this effect finally disappeared, and the island no longer glowed. The obstructive force had completely disappeared.","Xiu, xiu, xiu. Yang Yihuan and the others all flew over.","“Brother Ling, congratulations!” they all clasped their hands and said. There was a smile on their faces, but it couldn’t hide their disappointment.","Ling Han nodded, then asked, “Do you guys know the origins of that bead-like object?”","“Imperial Origin,” Feng Miaoling said. When she looked at Ling Han, the despondence in her eyes had already disappeared, and what replaced it was admiration. This was awesome. They had stepped onto the Imperial Path again and again, and when had they not waited until the resistance was more or less decreased to be able to reach the island to retrieve the treasure?","But what about Ling Han? Compared to him, they were on two completely different levels.","This gaze terrified Ling Han. ‘You’re not going to be infatuated again, are you?’","Thankfully, Feng Miaoling quickly explained the origins and uses of Imperial Origin.","Ling Han was surprised. That was because from Feng Miaoling’s mouth, the use of Imperial Origin was only to help cultivators open up their own path of cultivation, or speed up the progress of their path of cultivation. They had not seen the effects of the secret of Regulations.","What was going on here?","“In the past, how many Imperial Origins did you guys usually obtain?” Ling Han asked.","“How could there be a few? Of course, there’s only one,” Yang Yihuan said with a smile.","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. Looks like this was the reason.","He had reached the island against the resistance, so the heaven and earth’s reward for him would be much more generous. There were as many as three Imperial Origins! And with the combined effects of three Imperial Origins, he could glimpse the secrets of Regulations.","Yi, could this be the true meaning of Imperial Origin?","After all, the path of martial arts was something that one had walked on their own. They could walk it out without any help. If they couldn’t, it would be useless no matter how much help and hints they were given.","Just look, how many times had Yang Yihuan and the others walked the Imperial Path, and how many times had they obtained Imperial Origin? Yet, they were still unable to open their own paths of cultivation."]},{"number":4476,"title":"Chapter 4476: Stone turtle","paragraphs":["Chapter 4476: Stone turtle","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han didn’t say this.","Otherwise, who knew how jealous Yang Yihuan and the others would be.","“Let’s go. Since the Imperial Origin has already been taken, there is no meaning to continue staying on this island,” He Luo said.","“Is there still Imperial Origin ahead of us?” Ling Han asked.","Yang Yihuan and the others all smiled, but did not answer.","There must be, but they didn’t want Ling Han to get any more information, so they weren’t willing to leak out any more information.","After all, if Ling Han participated, that would truly be an unfair competition. No one would be able to do anything but stand by and watch.","Humans were naturally selfish, what more when this involved the only qualification to become Emperor.","The five of them split up, but the general direction was the same, and they continued onwards.","Ling Han analysed the secrets of Regulations he had seen as he sped forward.","Previously, it had only been an instant, and he had completely committed it to memory. Now, he was truly beginning to comprehend it.","He multitasked, and while maintaining his high speed of flight, his comprehension was also gradually entering an optimal state.","“This... No, that way!” he murmured continuously. Occasionally, he would frown, and at other times, he would smile, his expression extremely colourful.","He was only a Sect Master, yet he was comprehending a Seven Star Regulation. This was too difficult.","If he went to the Mountain Sea Heaven, even if the Seven Star Regulations manifested in front of him, he would only be able to stare blankly. Without reaching the peak stage of Sect Master, there was no way he could comprehend it.","No one said that if they went to the Mountain Sea Heaven, they would definitely be able to break through. It would only decrease the difficulty of breaking through slightly.","Previously, when the Mountain Sea Heaven opened, those people whose lifespans were close to drying up all left with the awareness that they would die of old age there. No one dared to say that when the next time the Mountain Sea Heaven opened, they themselves would be able to successfully break through.","However, Imperial Origin was different. It directly displayed the secret of Regulations, and this gave Ling Han the chance to grasp high-level Regulations in advance.","Though this was still very, very difficult.","“As expected of the power of a Great Emperor!”","“No, according to my deduction, this should be a tiny bit of martial intent from the Great Emperor.”","“They all say that the Great Emperor is too strong. After death, his soul would not enter into the Netherworld, and would be directly absorbed and assimilated by the heaven and earth. Hence, since this is a Mystery Realm that was naturally formed by the heaven and earth, and is called the Imperial Path, then wouldn’t it be very normal for it to leave behind a sliver of the martial intent of the Great Emperor?”","Thoughts streaked through Ling Han’s mind, but he immediately dismissed them, and concentrated on deducing the secrets of Regulations.","If he could use the Seven Star Regulation at the level of Sect Master, his awesomeness would definitely increase greatly.","A whole half month later, a large island appeared ahead of him.","Ling Han flew down, a sliver of a smile appearing at the corners of his lips.","He stretched out a hand and swiped in front of him. Immediately, a ray of light that was thinner than even a spider’s thread appeared in front of him. It was as black as ink, but exuded an incredibly terrifying aura.","This was the silk of Regulations, Seven Star Regulation!","He could finally use the Seven Star Regulation, but he could only mobilize a sliver of it. Furthermore, he was unable to move it with a single thought. The Regulation would appear, but he would need some time to accumulate it.","“Though that is the case, it still has great practical value.”","Ling Han nodded. After all, this was a Seven Star Regulation. Logically speaking, it should have been impossible for a Sect Master to use. Only when he had reached the peak stage of Sect Master, would he be able to glimpse a sliver of its profound secrets, and use it as a trigger for his breakthrough.","Now that he could use it in battle, how heaven-defying was that?","He first roamed around the island, but did not find any Celestial Herb, nor did he encounter any obstruction. Obviously, there was no way that there was any Imperial Origin hidden here.","“He Luo.”","His eyes swept over the surroundings, and saw that He Luo had also appeared on the island. However, the latter did not greet him. Instead, he went directly to the other side of the island.","This island was very narrow and long. When He Luo reached the other end, he actually stepped on a rock by the coast. A strange scene appeared. This rock actually moved, turning into a sea turtle that carried him out to sea.","Yi?","Ling Han was surprised. Could it be that the use of this island was only a crossing point?","He secretly rejoiced. Thankfully, He Luo had appeared in time. Otherwise, he would not have known what to do at all.","After all, he had walked the Imperial Path quite a number of times, so he naturally knew how he should proceed in the next stage.","The other party ignored him. Ling Han could understand this, because there was definitely still Imperial Origin ahead of him. He had to try his best to stop Ling Han here, so that he would have a chance of obtaining it.","Ling Han smiled. He also arrived at the other side of the island, and began his search.","The beach here was covered with rocks, and they were all shaped like turtles. There were also veined patterns on the back of the turtle, which was extremely complicated.","How should he choose?","Ling Han was at a loss, so he randomly jumped onto a rock. Instantly, this rock moved, and four limbs actually stretched out of the rock, turning into a sea turtle. Then, it slowly turned around and headed towards the ocean.","The stone turtle gradually sped up, not the slightest bit slow.","Ling Han was slightly confused. Why did he have to use the stone turtle as a vessel to cross the sea? Even if its speed wasn’t slow, it wasn’t as fast as a cultivator flying over directly.","However, he soon found out the reason.","Not long after entering the sea, flashes of sword light shot out from the sea from time to time.","Ling Han merely glanced at it, and already knew that he would not be able to block this sword light. Probably, it could even insta-kill Venerate Tiers.","However, though the stone turtle had no battle prowess, it could block the sword light, making the back of the turtle a safe place.","So that was the case.","Ling Han nodded in understanding. It was no wonder that he had to use the stone turtle to cross the sea.","Yi, hold on.","Ling Han shockingly discovered that after swimming for a while, this stone turtle actually turned around and returned.","Ahead of him, the island that he had previously left very quickly reappeared before his eyes.","‘Why have you come back?’","The stone turtle swam to the beach, then stopped. It retracted its limbs, and turned back into a giant rock.","Ling Han was slightly dumbfounded. Was this considered a day trip?","‘What on earth is going on?","He jumped onto another rock, and immediately, four limbs stretched out of the rock, turning once more into a sea turtle, which carried Ling Han out to sea.","This time, the turtle journeyed for three days, yet slowly brought Ling Han back again.","‘Holy f*ck!’","Ling Han did not jump blindly onto the third rock again. He believed that if he wanted to cross the sea, he would definitely have to ride on these stone turtles. However, if he were to try them one by one like this, it was possible that he would have to spend a few months, or even a few years, or even a few decades, before he would be lucky enough to encounter the right rock.","There must be a trick to it.","A thought flashed through Ling Han’s mind, and his gaze landed on the veined patterns on the stone.","Could it be related to this?","Ling Han found the first and second stone, and carefully compared the veined patterns on them.","After a while, he broke into a smile.","The veined patterns on every stone were a labyrinth, and the correct route to walk out of the labyrinth was exactly the same as the route that the stone turtle had taken him on.","He could be considered to have solved half of the dilemma, and the remaining half was how was he supposed to find the correct route?","“Simple. The wrong path would ultimately lead one back.”","“Thus, the correct route would definitely not end on this island.”","With this in mind, Ling Han started to search again.","Multiple rocks were eliminated by him, and his progress was very fast.","‘Hmm?’","Another person had come.","Guan Xinghan."]},{"number":4477,"title":"Chapter 4477: Seven Star Regulation!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4477: Seven Star Regulation!","Editor: Henyee Translations","A smile involuntarily appeared at the corners of Ling Han’s lips.","He just happened to have found the right rock, and was in a good mood. Furthermore, Guan Xinghan had coincidentally delivered himself to his doorstep at this moment, which made him overjoyed.","“Ling Han!” Though the island was very big, with his eyesight, Guan Xinghan naturally discovered Ling Han at the first instant.","Wariness flickered in his eyes. After all, even the combined forces of the many Golden Generations hadn’t been able to apprehend Ling Han. This lowly commoner was overwhelmingly powerful.","“Thank you,” Ling Han said seriously.","Yi, what was going on?","Guan Xinghan frowned. This ‘thank you’ was too dumbfounding for him. He didn’t seem to have done anything that could make the other party feel grateful.","He knew that Ling Han was not the type to be predictable, but this was really too baffling to him.","“What for?” he couldn’t help but ask.","Ling Han smiled and said, “Thank you for coming so far to seek death. It’s said that gifts are light, but friendship is heavy. Thus, I’ll accept your life.”","‘Holy f*ck!’","Guan Xinghan finally realized that Ling Han was teasing him. He couldn’t help but fly into a thunderous rage, and his expression was as dark as could be. He balefully said, “What you can rely on is merely movement techniques. In a head-on clash, I can destroy you at any moment.”","“Come on then!” Ling Han crooked a finger, “If you don’t come, then you’re a b@stard.”","Guan Xinghan couldn’t hold back any longer, and charged towards Ling Han. His hands slashed out, like they were heavy axes. Regulations wrapped around his palms, and there were a total of sixteen of them.","Yi, he had broken through, and advanced into nine stars.","This was normal. There were too many opportunities here. In the first place, he was an eight-star Sect Master, so it wouldn’t be strange for him to take another step forward.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and greeted the incoming attack fearlessly. As he threw a punch, fifteen Regulations bloomed at the same time.","Peng!","In the exchange of a single blow, Guan Xinghan’s figure swayed, and he took a few steps back. Ling Han, on the other hand, had only retreated slightly more than him, and there was no overwhelming difference in battle prowess.","This!","He was a nine-star Sect Master, and judging by the aura that Ling Han was exuding, he was only a Two-Star Sect Master.","Thus, there was still a gap of seven minor levels between him and Ling Han. However, he surprisingly didn’t have a crushing advantage. At most, he only had a slight advantage.","No, Ling Han hadn’t been injured at all in this exchange. In fact, he hadn’t suffered any setbacks at all. He had immediately charged back, and this could only be considered a tie.","Heavens, with an advantage of seven stars, a dignified Golden Generation was actually only able to fight someone equally?","He really wanted to die.","“Hehe, what Golden Generation?” Ling Han said in disdain. “If you hadn’t cultivated for a few more years, I would have been able to smack you to death with a single hand.”","These words were far too sarcastic, yet Guan Xinghan was still unable to refute them.","If Ling Han was also a Nine Star Sect Master... he knew himself well. He was definitely no match for a single move.","“Damn it!” he cursed softly, and took the initiative to slow down the rhythm of the battle.","He knew that this kind of rapid barrage would not be able to kill Ling Han. In fact, it would not be able to penetrate Ling Han’s defenses. Thus, he needed some time to accumulate Regulations. By then, eighteen or even twenty Regulations would be unleashed at the same time. He did not believe that he would not be able to kill Ling Han.","How could Ling Han not tell? He laughed loudly, and launched an offensive, forcing Guan Xinghan to have no choice but to parry. He had no time at all to accumulate Regulations.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The two of them continued to exchange blows. Judging from the situation, Guan Xinghan still had the upper hand. After all, whether it was power or Regulations, Guan Xinghan had an advantage. However, against Ling Han’s extremely strong defense, this little advantage was still not enough to turn into victory.","This made Guan Xinghan anxious. What if Brother Monkey suddenly came later?","If a Venerate Tier elite made a move, he would definitely die.","He began to slowly slow down the rhythm of the battle again, but this time, it was extraordinarily slow. He did not want Ling Han to notice anything off.","With Ling Han’s rich battle experience and sensitivity to battle situations, how could he not have noticed?","However, he couldn’t be bothered to continue fighting.","Since you want to end the battle quickly, I will oblige you.","Seventeen Regulations, eighteen Regulations, nineteen Regulations, and twenty Regulations.","Guan Xingxing couldn’t help but smile. ‘Finally!’","“Die!” he shouted loudly, and as his divine sense spread out, 20 flashes of Regulations appeared at the same time, gathering into a Divine Sword, which ruthlessly slashed towards Ling Han.","Twenty flashes, what Sect Master couldn’t be killed by that?","Ling Han laughed, and raised a fist to parry.","“You’re seeking death!” Guan Xinghan said with a cold chuckle. These were 20 Six Star Regulations, and their instant burst of power was incredibly terrifying. This could definitely insta-kill Ling Han.","Peng!","Ling Han’s fist had already greeted the Divine Sword of Regulations. However, the scene that Guan Xinghan had imagined of Ling Han’s arm being directly severed did not appear. Instead, the Divine Sword shattered.","What!","Guan Xinghan’s expression was filled with shock. How was this possible?","Twenty Six Star Regulations, how could it possibly shatter?","How many manifestations of Regulations had Ling Han shot out? Thirty?","No, there were still only a mere fifteen flashes. He could count them clearly. As a dignified Golden Generation, how could it be that he would even miscount the number of flashes of Regulations?","However, it was precisely these 15 Regulations that had shattered the Divine Sword that he had formed through 20 Regulations.","This was too illogical!","They were both Six Star Regulations, and neither was weaker than the other. Thus, it would depend on who had condensed more Regulations. This was an irresolvable truth.","But now? The truth had collapsed.","Guan Xinghan already had no time to dodge. Moreover, even if he wanted to flee, how could he possibly be faster than Phoenix Wings Divine Flight?","He could only take it head-on.","With a loud roar, he struck out with both palms, and condensed another sixteen Regulations.","He didn’t believe that he would lose to Ling Han if he still had an advantage in the number of Regulations.","However, reality once again slapped him across the face.","Boom, Ling Han’s fist was like a hot knife through butter. The 16 Regulations that he had condensed were instantly shattered, and his fist shot out directly. It was as if his palms had been forcefully split open by a supreme Divine Sword, broken fingers and blood flying madly.","This punch was like a great mountain bearing down on him, directly blasting into his face.","Right until this moment, Guan Xinghan finally discovered that among these fifteen Regulations, there was actually a Regulation that was even thinner than a single strand of hair.","A sixteenth Regulation!","However, even if there were sixteen Regulations, shouldn’t the two sides be evenly matched? Furthermore, this Regulation was clearly too weak. It was only as thick as a strand of hair, so it should be weaker than him.","No!","His eyes suddenly widened. F***, this was Seven Star Regulation!","In this instant, Guan Xinghan felt his head go numb, and a coldness enshroud his entire body.","‘What kind of f*cking monster are you? A Two Star Sect Master can actually use Seven Star Regulations?","How were the other Sect Masters going to live if he was like this?","A Venerate Tier elite could crush a Sect Master. This was the truth. Thus, even if Ling Han had only grasped a sliver of a Seven Star Regulation, he could use it unexpectedly, and it would have extraordinary effects.","How could he play around with him like that?","Heavenly Dao, you are really too unfair, aren’t you?","A Sect Master has used a Seven Star Regulation, which had completely destroyed the truth of cultivation!","In an instant, countless thoughts flashed through his mind, but he could do nothing. He could only watch helplessly as this punch approached. Boom, black-colored energy pulsated, making him feel a coldness that came from facing death directly.","Previously, though he was stunned, he was still calm, because he had the Substitution Seal.","But now, this kind of chill seeped directly into his bones, causing his pupils to involuntarily constrict."]},{"number":4478,"title":"Chapter 4478: Black Gauze Palace","paragraphs":["Chapter 4478: Black Gauze Palace","Editor: Henyee Translations","Peng!","With a single punch, Guan Xinghan’s mind was shattered. What use could Substitution Seal have against Destructive Energy?","Another Golden Generation died.","Ling Han retracted his fist, neither angry nor happy.","Right now, his target wasn’t a Sect Master like Guan Xinghan anymore. Instead, his target was the remaining two Venerate Tier elites, Imperial Son Ming and Imperial Son Tian.","“If I fight them now, I am still far from being their match, and can only use the Energy Jade to trick them,” Ling Han mumbled to himself. He was only a Two-Star Sect Master, after all. Even if he had formed a sliver of Seven Star Regulation, if he fought with the Golden Generation that had already grasped Seven Star Regulations, that would only be courting death.","“However, among Sect Masters, I should already have no one that is my match.”","Just ask, what Sect Master could withstand the barrage of Seven Star Regulations? Even if it was just a sliver.","Ling Han searched Guan Xinghan’s corpse, but he didn’t find anything valuable. If there were any Celestial medicines, they would definitely have been refined. Otherwise, how could Guan Xinghan have possibly advanced into nine stars?","He returned to the beach, found the rock that he had already confirmed, and stepped on it. Instantly, the rock stretched out its limbs, turning into a sea turtle, and swam towards the deep sea.","This time, there was no return for the stone turtle.","A whole half month later, a coastline appeared ahead of him.","He had finally crossed the great ocean.","Seeing that there were no more light swords shooting out from the sea, Ling Han leaped, and flew towards land.","This was a vast plain that stretched as far as the eye could see.","Which direction should he take?","Ling Han only swept an eye over it, and a smile appeared on his face.","In the distance, there was presently a pillar of light soaring into the skies.","He activated Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, speeding toward that direction.","Half an hour later, Ling Han arrived at the place where the pillar of light had shot out.","Yi, it was another palace.","“Black Gauze Palace.” Ling Han swept an eye over it. There was a plaque hanging on the doors of the palace, and the words were written on it.","“Sigh, Brother Ling, I really don’t want to see you!” Yang Yihuan, He Luo, and Feng Miaoling walked over.","They had set foot on the Imperial Path many times, and would not be delayed on their journey. They knew where they should go, and their goal was also very clear.","But though they had come early, they were unable to enter into the palace hall, because just like before, the resistance here was extraordinarily strong.","Ling Han smiled, “Apologies, I’ll take my leave first.”","He strode forward.","Multiple layers of resistance assaulted him, and as he went deeper and deeper, they rapidly strengthened, causing his steps to slow down very quickly. Ling Han gave a loud shout, and unleashed his battle prowess fully, blasting forwards.","This time, not only did he use the Destructive Energy, he also used that sliver of Seven Star Regulations. However, it was sandwiched between the Regulations, and if one didn’t carefully observe it from a close distance, it would be impossible to discover it.","Thus, Ling Han wasn’t afraid of Yang Yihuan and the others discovering that he had another trump card.","With this forceful push, he charged all the way until he was only ten steps away from the entrance of the palace before stopping.","He really could not advance any further.","He summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and his figure moved again. He walked the last ten steps and stood at the entrance of the palace.","What surprised him was that there was no golden route map here, and the pressure had also disappeared.","Ling Han paused, and stretched out both hands to push open the doors.","With a creak, the doors of the palace opened. Ling Han did not hesitate, and immediately walked in.","Seeing Ling Han disappear into the palace, Yang Yihuan and the others all frowned.","“We can’t go on like this!”","“M-hm, otherwise, we would be unable to obtain another portion of Imperial Origin.”","“We can only break through to Venerate Tier.”","The three of them nodded. Sect Master-level strength was already no longer capable of stopping Ling Han. Thus, they had to return to Venerate Tier-level. Only then would they be able to forcefully detain Ling Han, and wait for the resistance to disappear on its own. In that way, how could Ling Han possibly win over them?","Every time they re-cultivated, it was a rare experience. However, only people with their backgrounds could allow them to repeatedly sever their cultivation level and regain it. If it was another person, their foundations would have long since been damaged. To say nothing of becoming stronger, it would be difficult for them to even return to the peak stage.","The three of them bounced back, each wanting to find a place to quickly break through to Venerate Tier.","For them, this was not a very difficult task.","...","Ling Han walked into the palace hall. The inside wasn’t as dark as it looked from the outside. Multiple pieces of jade were glowing, like bright lamps.","In the depths of the great hall, there was presently a person seated, his back facing him.","“Hehe, in these millions and millions of years, you are the ninth person to be able to walk in and see me,” this person said. His voice rang out directly in Ling Han’s mind.","Only nine?","A thought flashed through Ling Han’s mind. Presumably, when the resistance disappeared on its own, it should be impossible to see this person.","“Who were the eight people before?” Ling Han couldn’t help but feel curious.","“I don’t remember.” This person shook his head. Then, he stood up, turned around, and faced Ling Han.","This was a middle-aged man. He was dressed in a long white robe, and had an otherworldly bearing.","Ling Han pondered for a moment. These eight people were most likely the Great Emperors that had come later. Moreover, they were the extremely fortunate ones. Before becoming Emperor, they had already obtained Origin Gold, or a treasure that could rival it. Otherwise, this place truly wasn’t a place that one could enter with their abilities and natural talent.","Luck has always been a part of strength. Being able to become an elite, at least, there were a great many times when one’s luck was not too bad.","“If you can withstand a hundred moves from me, the Imperial Origin here will belong to you,” the middle-aged man said calmly.","Ling Han hurriedly said, “If I could take 200 moves, or even more, would senior give me some more Imperial Origin?”","The middle-aged man faltered for a moment. He had never seen such a greedy competitor before. You haven’t even exchanged a hundred moves, and you’re already thinking about what to do after two hundred moves?","“Hehe, even if you can defeat me, you won’t be able to obtain much Imperial Origin either,” he said calmly.","Sigh!","Ling Han sighed, and said, “Please provide guidance, senior.”","What kind of expression was that? Could it be that he really thought that he could win?","The middle-aged man shook his head, speechless.","He strode forwards, walking towards Ling Han.","Peng, he stepped down, and the Regulations responded, turning into sharp swords that appeared behind him.","One, two, five, ten, twenty!","He was slowly accumulating Regulations, because even twenty Regulations was not his limit.","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t be careless. He also began to accumulate Regulations, and he also wanted to know where his limits were.","“Go!” The middle-aged man pointed at Ling Han, and instantly, the swords of Regulations behind him appeared at the same time. There were a total of 23 of them.","This was extremely shocking. Even if it had not been formed in an instant, it was still boundlessly powerful.","Ling Han had also accumulated 20 Regulations, and could not take another step further. That would surpass his limits. Either Regulations would disperse, or he himself would explode from the Regulations.","He roared loudly, and charged forwards with these 20 streaks of Regulations.","The middle-aged man shook his head. Ling Han’s confidence was a mystery. He was clearly three Regulations short, yet he still dared to face the attack head-on.","It should be known that in a battle on Sect Master-level, one could not afford the difference of even a single Regulation.","However, reality caused him to gape in shock."]},{"number":4479,"title":"Chapter 4479: Ant nest","paragraphs":["Chapter 4479: Ant nest","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han threw a punch, like a hot knife through butter.","The 25 God Tools instantly crumbled. Meanwhile, Ling Han’s punch continued to fly over.","How, how was this possible!","The middle-aged man also wore an expression of disbelief, just like Guan Xinghan.","‘F*ck! My 25 flashes of Regulations are actually no match for your 20 flashes. Is there any law in this world? Is there any justice in this world?’","That’s not right. I am manifested from Heavenly Dao, so don’t I represent the justice of heaven and earth?","Boom! Ling Han unleashed a powerful punch.","Since the middle-aged man said that he wanted Ling Han to block 100 of his strikes, he naturally couldn’t dodge at this moment. Thus, he threw a punch in response. Because he didn’t have time to accumulate power, this punch was only entwined with 20 Regulations.","That was enough. In a battle of twenty against twenty, he was not at a disadvantage at all.","Er, that was indeed the case normally, but the problem was that Ling Han was not the slightest bit normal.","If this were normal, how could the 25 swords of Regulations belonging to the middle-aged man be shattered?","The two fists collided, and power instantly surged out. Regulations crashed into each other.","The middle-aged man shockingly discovered that Ling Han’s punch had actually broken through his Regulations!","Even if his power was actually stronger than Ling Han’s, and the latter was already beginning to be sent flying backwards from the impact, the Regulations that Ling Han unleashed had turned into a divine blade that was still blasting towards him.","At this moment, he finally discovered the reason.","‘Holy f*ck! Seven Star Regulation!’","No wonder he was no match for the other even though he had the advantage in number of Regulations. As it turned out, this brat could actually channel Seven Star Regulations.","Peng!","A shield immediately materialized in front of him, blocking Ling Han’s divine blade of Regulations.","In this exchange, there was no clear victor.","However, the middle-aged man didn’t attack again. Instead, he sighed and said, “You passed.”","Previously, though he had blocked Ling Han’s attack, he had also used the Seven Star Regulation.","—Ling Han could use the Seven Star Regulation. That was because Ling Han was awesome, capable of doing so at Sect Master-level. He was heaven-defyingly powerful, but it was different in his case. He was a guard, and would definitely follow the rules.","If he used the Seven Star Regulation, that could only be used against Venerate Tier.","Ling Han wasn’t a Venerate Tier elite, yet he had used the Seven Star Regulations. Was there still any need to fight?","The middle-aged man was extremely depressed. It wasn’t easy for him to meet someone. Although he could only play for a hundred moves, it could still relieve his boredom. But now? He had only used one move, and the battle was over.","“If you can become Emperor, who knows, you may be the Number One Emperor of All Eternity,” he said. Then, his figure suddenly disappeared, and there were three Imperial Origins on the ground.","The Number One Emperor of All Eternity?","Ling Han smiled knowingly. He was very fond of this title.","En, when he became Emperor, he would become the Number One Emperor of All Eternity.","He walked over, and with a touch of his hand, three Imperial Origins immediately turned into gas, surging into his body.","Instantly, his mind channelled, and began to predict the path of cultivation on his own, and the secret of Regulations appeared once more in front of him.","Ling Han didn’t hesitate at all. He chose the Seven Star Regulation that he had been cultivating before, and then committed it to memory with all his might.","Previously, he had memorized about a quarter of it, and now, he would try to remember it completely.","In just a single breath, the secret of Regulations disappeared.","More or less, he had just memorized a quarter of it, and added together with what he had previously memorized, he had memorized half of it.","Ling Han began to fully deduce the path of cultivation, and gained endless enlightenment.","Half a day later, this effect also disappeared, which meant that the effects of the Imperial Origin had been completely exhausted.","He stood up and walked out of the palace.","Yi, this time, he didn’t see Yang Yihuan and the other two.","Forget it, let’s continue forward.","Ling Han activated his movement technique and rapidly advanced.","The boundless distance was left behind him, and he was also comprehending the Seven Star Regulation, striving for further improvement.","After about ten days, he broke into a smile, and waved his hand. The Seven Star Regulation appeared once more, but this time, it had reached the width of two hairs.","“More importantly, the speed at which I channel the Seven Star Regulation has also doubled.”","This was the best part.","In a battle at Sect Master-level, there was actually not much difference between one or two shreds of Seven Star Regulations. In any case, they could crush the Six Star Regulations, but if the speed of channelling the Seven Star Regulation was doubled, that would be of great significance.","“If I can fully grasp this Seven Star Regulation, then when I use it, the speed should be the same as the Six Star Regulations.”","In that case, he would really be able to do as he liked among Sect Masters. No one would be able to withstand a single blow from him.","After walking for another two days, a very large mound appeared ahead of him. From afar, it exuded a powerful pressure.","This mound was filled with holes, densely packed, and what was harrowing was the fact that there would be large black ants crawling in and out of the holes from time to time. Every single one of them was the size of a dog.","So, this mound was actually an ant’s nest?","Ling Han hesitated. Should he barge in?","There was no useless place in the Imperial Path. Thus, since there was an ant’s nest here, it either hindered his advance, or contained great fortune.","In that case, Ling Han would have to venture in no matter what.","He strode forwards, heading towards the ant nest.","When he had come close enough, a great many ants immediately stopped, and looked towards him. Their antennas moved rhythmically, as if they were communicating.","Ling Han smiled and said, “Come!”","Instantly, over a hundred giant ants rushed towards him. Hong, hong, hong, hong! They were obviously only the size of dogs, but their bodies were extraordinarily heavy, causing the whole hill to tremble greatly.","Even though these ants were all ferocious beasts, and had not developed intelligence, they were communicating endlessly with each other through the movement of their antennas. They were actually incredibly coordinated. It was as if over a hundred ants were one, and their coordination was incredibly smooth.","Ling Han laughed loudly as he unleashed his murderous aura. Weng! Like a divine blade, his Spiritual Power instantly pierced into the minds of the ants and started to wreak havoc.","Pa, pa, pa! In just an instant, at least 70% of the ants had their stomachs turn over, and died facing the sky.","However, the remaining 20 or so ants were extremely ferocious as they continued to charge at Ling Han.","They were all Eight Stars and Nine Stars Sect Masters, and that was why they could resist the barrage of murderous aura without dying. In fact, they could even continue to launch offensives.","“Come battle!” Ling Han brandished his fists, and charged into the swarm of ants.","With how strong he was now, there was absolutely no need for him to channel the Seven Star Regulations. An ordinary Nine Star Sect Master was no match for him at all. As he shot out punch after punch, the giant ants were all blasted into smithereens.","In just a few minutes, the remaining 20 or so ants were all killed.","However, this pierced a hornet’s nest, and even more ants rushed out of the ant’s nest, charging towards Ling Han.","This wouldn’t be in the hundreds, but in the thousands, or even tens of thousands.","Ling Han was still unafraid. As the barrage of murderous aura blasted out, those below the level of Five Star Sect Master were not even qualified to approach him. They could only be insta-killed on the spot.","However, the swarm of ants were fearless of death, and there were extraordinarily many of them. After battling for a day and a night, Ling Han did not take another step forwards at all. Instead, it was his divine sense that had been expended too much, and was gradually showing signs of exhaustion.","F***, you guys are awesome.","Ling Han turned around, and decided to temporarily avoid this attack. He would first recover, and when he had reached his prime condition, he would come back for another battle."]},{"number":4480,"title":"Chapter 4480: Stealing while you’re at it","paragraphs":["Chapter 4480: Stealing while you’re at it","Editor: Henyee Translations","After the swarm of ants chased for a while, they gave up and turned back.","It couldn’t be helped. With Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, how fast was Ling Han’s speed?","“Since the swarm of ants is so troublesome, there should be treasures in the nest,” Ling Han murmured. “If I had known, I should have used the Strange Shadow Steps to sneak in.”","He found a secluded place to recover.","It was mainly because he had expended a little too much Spiritual Power. He didn’t have to worry about mystical power. With the millions and millions of dimensions in his body as his source, it wouldn’t be a problem for him to battle continuously for a year and a half.","Three days later, he had already recovered to his prime condition.","Fine, he would go to the ant nest again, but this time, he was going to sneak in quietly.","He arrived near the ant’s nest, then switched to channeling the Strange Shadow Steps. Combined with some Regulations, he instantly fled into the shadows. Even if he was walking behind a Sect Master, the latter may not be able to sense his presence.","Yi?","Ling Han was startled. Previously, when he had come here, he could see ants entering and exiting the caves, but now, he did not see even a single one.","“Though I had a great battle here three days ago, I don’t remember that I blasted such a large hole in this place.” Ling Han looked towards a corner of the ant nest, where a large piece had been blasted off.","“Unless... there’s someone before me!”","This wasn’t strange. There were still many people who could reach this level, and in the case of Imperial Son Ming and Imperial Son Tian, they were Venerate Tier elites, and could practically do as they liked in this place.","“I think that there must be Venerate Tier-level existences in the ant nest. They would not allow Imperial Son Ming and the others to succeed so easily.”","He pressed his hand on the ant’s nest, and sensed quietly.","After a while, he broke into a smile.","He could sense the tremors. It should be that there was a battle going on in the depths of the ant nest, and that was why there was such a tremor.","“Since they’re still fighting, no matter what treasures there are in the ant nest, they definitely haven’t been taken yet.”","“I have to hurry.”","Ling Han moved, entering into the ant nest. Then, he advanced rapidly.","The Strange Shadow Steps focused on concealing his tracks, but this did not mean that his progress would slow down. Though it could not compare to Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, it was slightly faster than ordinary Saint-level movement techniques.","This ant nest was very big, really very big. Ling Han had already walked for almost half an hour, yet he still did not see the battle that was taking place ahead of him.","Though the ants were big, they were only the size of ordinary dogs, and were far from reaching the height of humans when they were standing on their hind legs. Thus, the passage here had been forcefully enlarged, and there were corpses of giant ants everywhere.","Ling Han’s eyes swept over them, and he nodded internally. Judging by the injuries on the ants, there were at least thirty people who had barged into the ant’s nest.","It should be the Golden Generation.","These people were all descendants of the Imperial Clans, so it was very easy for them to join forces. Because they all cared about their pride, as well as the honour of the Imperial Clans, it was very unlikely that someone would suddenly change their mind.","Ling Han continued to advance. After walking for another ten minutes, the shockwaves from the battle became incredibly obvious.","He was almost there.","He slowed down a little to avoid being discovered by the ripples caused by his movement.","After a few steps, the path ahead suddenly opened up, revealing a massive underground cave. It was spherical in shape, and had a radius of at least more than 5km.","In the centre of this underground cave lay a colossal white-coloured giant insect. It was surrounded and protected by innumerable black-coloured giant ants, preventing anyone from approaching.","There were about 30 people battling with the ants.","As expected, they were all Imperial Sons, and most of them were Golden Generations. From the Silver Generation, there were only those few that had advanced into Sect Master-level.","The leaders were Imperial Son Ming and Imperial Son Tian. The two Venerable Tier elites were the main force, while the other Sect Masters were responsible for impeding the enemy forces.","The swarm of ants was also very powerful. There were as many as seven Venerate Tier-level male ants, and they were the size of calves, possessing boundless strength. In terms of power, they actually suppressed Imperial Son Ming and Imperial Son Tian.","However, the strength of martial artists was in the fact that they possessed martial arts techniques and divine sense, which allowed them to use Regulations. Moreover, starting from the True Self Tier, divine sense became more and more important, gradually occupying a major position in battle prowess.","Thus, even though it was clearly a two-on-seven battle, and even though they didn’t have an advantage in terms of power, Imperial Son Ming and Imperial Son Tian still managed to hold back the seven Venerate Tier-level male ants.","On the other side, the other Imperial Sons were on a killing spree, endlessly killing the swarm of ants. Though there were still large numbers of giant ants charging out from various passageways, the line of defense was continuously retreating.","This drove the swarm of ants crazy. Their queen was behind this line of defense, and that was the foundation of their entire race. They definitely could not lose her.","Hence, though there were heavy casualties, the retaliation of the swarm of ants was even more intense.","Ling Han’s eyes swept over them. What kind of treasure was there here?","It can’t be this queen ant, right?","En, what was that?","Ling Han glanced over. There was a black-colored blade of grass by the side of the queen ant. It was only as long as a finger, and at its tip, there were multiple grass seeds that were only the size of sesame seeds.","What was that thing?","Ling Han had never seen any illustrated handbook of Celestial medicines before. However, he could vaguely sense a Celestial Qi fluctuation.","These grass seeds actually contained Celestial Qi?","Ling Han was startled. This was really beyond his expectations, because this thing looked too terrible. No matter what, it could not be connected to Celestial medicine, what more being able to nurture Celestial Qi.","However, since he had seen it, what reason was there for him to miss it?","Ling Han moved quietly, snuck through the battle, passed through the line of ants, and approached the queen ant.","During this time, he was almost forced to reveal himself by the shockwaves of the battle. Fortunately, his grasp of the Strange Shadow Steps was probably comparable to the Killing Saint of the Battle God Palace, allowing him to stabilize his movements.","He had already arrived in front of the queen ant. In this place, those black-coloured blades of grass could be plucked.","However, if he made a move to pluck it, he would definitely reveal himself.","Ling Han smiled. He would pluck all the black grass in an instant, and by then, so what if he was discovered? Phoenix Wings Divine Flight would be activated, and he would immediately flee into the distance.","Right at this moment, the queen ant suddenly moved and turned to look in his direction.","What a sensitive guy.","Only now did Ling Han realize that the queen ant was at the Venerate Tier. Because they were too close, even if he was extremely proficient in grasping the Strange Shadow Steps, the queen ant still sensed it.","Instantly, a dozen over large ants rushed towards Ling Han. Though they had not discovered Ling Han, each of them would dutifully carry out the command of the queen ant.","There was no time to waste.","Ling Han hurriedly moved, and with a grab, those black blades of grass all fell into his hands.","Naturally, he also revealed himself.","Yi!","Imperial Son Ming and the other Golden Generations faltered upon this. Why had one of them snuck into the center of the swarm of ants and successfully plucked the Celestial medicine?","Good one!","They were all delighted. There was really not the slightest benefit to be gained from tangling with the swarm of ants. Now that they had gathered the Celestial medicine, they naturally could retreat.","However, they soon revealed furious expressions, all of them almost dying from fury.","This was not one of them at all, but rather Ling Han!","“Ling Han!”","“How dare you!”","“Put down the Celestial medicine!”","These Golden Generations all shouted loudly, wanting nothing more than to tear Ling Han into pieces.","— New chapter is coming soon —"]},{"number":4481,"title":"Chapter 4481: Fury","paragraphs":["Chapter 4481: Fury","Editor: Henyee Translations","The members of the Golden Generation had every reason to be enraged.","They fought to the death, fighting hard for more than two days. How many giant ants had they killed on their way? All of them were drenched in blood and covered with wounds. Just when it looked like they were about to reap the fruits of their labour, Ling Han suddenly charged out, easily taking away what they yearned for.","How could they tolerate this?","“Ling Han, do you really want to die?”","“How detestable!”","“Ah!”","It was as if they had all gone mad, as they charged towards Ling Han.","However, vicious beasts didn’t have much intelligence. In the eyes of the giant ants, Ling Han was clearly in cahoots with these invaders. Seeing the Imperial Sons charge at the front lines, they all resisted with all their might, fearing that they would harm the queen ant.","How could this kind of front line be so easily broken through?","All the Imperial Sons were instantly blocked. Previously, they had not been able to break through the line of defense, and could only advance bit by bit. Now, no matter how furious they were, the battle prowess they could unleash was not enough to destroy the line of defense.","They were mad with fury. It was clearly Ling Han who had snatched what belonged to you, so why are you stupid ants still stopping them?","In truth, Ling Han had also been attacked by the giant ants. After all, he was the closest to the queen ant, so it was absolutely normal for him to be attacked madly by the giant ants. Thus, he immediately retreated, drawing out the distance between himself and the queen ant.","As expected, though there was still a large number of giant ants attacking him, the strength of their attacks had decreased considerably.","After all, he was only one person, so the threat he posed couldn’t be compared to the Golden Generation elites. They had the advantage in numbers, and there were also Venerate Tier elites among them.","Ling Han was very relaxed. On one side, he was only parrying, and did not deliver a fatal strike. He maintained a balance with the giant ants, then looked towards the Imperial Sons, “Everyone, thank you.”","These words were really vexing. The Imperial Sons were already incredibly furious in the first place, and when they heard these words, they naturally wanted even more to tear Ling Han into mush.","“Ling Han, you have offended so many members of the Imperial Clans. Once you leave, you would be hunted down by all the members of the Imperial Clans!”","“This time, it’s useless no matter what background you have!”","“You are already a dead man!”","The Imperial Sons all declared coldly. Ling Han was too freakish, suppressing them to the point that they could barely breathe. How could they possibly contend for the throne with such a person?","Thus, this kind of opponent could only be erased.","After all, Buddha Doga had never said that Ling Han couldn’t be targeted, after all. This gave them an opening.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Come!”","How had he come all the way here?","He had been hunted down and attacked, but when had he ever been overwhelmed?","The more this was the case, the more his fighting spirit soared. By now, he was already a Sect Master, and could be called a great elite. In the whole world, those whose strength were superior to him, how many Venerate Tiers and Saints were there in total?","Let the storm come even fiercer!","The Imperial Sons also calmed down, knowing that a verbal battle could not possibly defeat Ling Han. They merely stared menacingly at Ling Han, killing intent in their eyes.","“Let’s go!”","They stopped fighting. Without the Celestial medicine, what meaning was there left?","The Imperial Sons quickly retreated. They had another idea, and that was to intercept Ling Han and kill him outside the ant nest.","Once they retreated, though a large number of ants pursued them, a Venerate Tier-level giant ant charged towards Ling Han.","He couldn’t win against this.","Ling Han hurriedly broke into a run. At this moment, he exploded with a powerful battle prowess. As he shot out a punch, Regulations and power boiled at the same time, instantly clearing out the area of nearly three hundred meters in front of him.","With a battle cry, he advanced rapidly.","Behind him, the Venerate Tier-level giant ant pursued him relentlessly.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! The giant ant waved its antennas, and endless black light shot out. This was filled with corrosion, and when it hit the walls of the passageway, it forcibly corroded a large hole.","And this was still because everything in the Imperial Path was very special. Otherwise, how could the attack of a Venerate Tier possibly cause such little damage?","This giant ant seemed to have gone mad. As the black light continued to shoot out, even the giant ants that had rushed over to provide reinforcements and stop him were implicated.","Thinking about it, it made sense. Having been invaded, and even the queen ant had almost been destroyed, how could these male ants not go crazy?","Ling Han didn’t even turn his head. Weng! A murderous aura burst forth.","Instantly, a field of giant ants in the surroundings collapsed, and even that Venerate Tier-level giant ant was affected for a moment, which made it even more furious, spewing out black light at a higher frequency.","Ling Han didn’t dare to be careless either. The ant path was too narrow, and he needed to shrink his body, which greatly affected the use of Phoenix Wings Divine Flight. It was impossible for him to escape the pursuit of a Venerate Tier elite.","He unleashed the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, which hovered above his head. This was forged from Origin Gold, and it could be big or small. Everything could be done as he willed.","In this way, he didn’t care anymore. No matter how the black light shot over, there would naturally be a Pseudo-Imperial Weapon blocking it.","As he fled, an exit finally appeared ahead of him.","With a battle cry, Ling Han’s figure sped up, and suddenly shot out. At this time, he used Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and his figure sped up again. Xiu, he quickly drew out the distance between himself and the giant ant.","That Venerate Tier-level giant ant chased a few more steps, yet could only watch helplessly as Ling Han fled into the distance, and finally disappeared.","...","After Ling Han tossed the giant ant aside, he immediately stopped using Phoenix Wings Divine Flight.","This movement technique was indeed awesome, but it was too eye-catching. From afar, one could see the raging flames.","Thus, he immediately switched to channeling the Strange Shadow Steps.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! In just an instant, two figures stepped into the sky and arrived.","Imperial Son Ming and Imperial Son Tian, two Venerate Tier-level Golden Generation elites.","As expected!","Ling Han smirked coldly. There was nothing wrong with his caution. Those Imperial Sons were presently searching madly for him.","However, even if Imperial Son Ming and Imperial Son Tian were Venerate Tiers, under the circumstances that they were not too close, they were still unable to find Ling Han from the shadows.","—Unless Ling Han was especially unlucky, and these two Imperial Sons had just happened to land right next to him, Ling Han would have no choice but to accept it.","Imperial Son Ming and Imperial Son Tian exchanged a glance. They had both noticed the commotion caused by Phoenix Wings Divine Flight, and had thus rushed over. In the end, they had still been a step too slow.","“This boy must be nearby.”","“Find him!”","The two Golden Generations said darkly, each searching a different direction.","F***, you guys are still getting excited?","Ling Han drew out two Energy Jades, one in each hand, and aimed them respectively at Imperial Son Ming and Imperial Son Tian.","‘Throw!’","Xiu, xiu, the two Energy Jades were thrown out at an extraordinarily fast speed.","“Hmm?”","This kind of commotion naturally could not be hidden from the two Imperial Sons. They had both discovered the sneak attack at the first instant, and had naturally seen Ling Han as well.","Imperial Son Ming was just about to parry, but Imperial Son Tian sent a message through divine sense, “Dodge!”","Imperial Son Ming pondered for a moment. Ling Han was a scheming person, and he had clearly not been discovered yet. However, he had actively charged over to attack them, so how could this be an ordinary attack?","With this thought, his heart immediately shivered, and he hurriedly dodged.","The two jade stones didn’t hit anyone, but instead crashed into rocks and tree roots. These things were extremely unstable, and they immediately exploded upon impact.","Boom!","Terrifying energy surged, turning into two mushroom-shaped balls of energy that pushed out in all directions at an astonishing speed.","This was pure energy, without a shred of Regulations, but because it was too strong, it was still boundlessly terrifying, enough to kill Venerate Tier elites.","C"]},{"number":4482,"title":"Chapter 4482: Deterrence","paragraphs":["Chapter 4482: Deterrence","Editor: Henyee Translations","Imperial Son Ming and Imperial Son Tian were both astonished.","It was true that they were Venerate Tier elites, but after all, they had only just stepped into this cultivation level. Even if it was Golden Generation, their battle prowess would only be four or five stars. Among Venerate Tiers, they could only be considered mid-level.","Yet this energy storm was enough to kill peak stage Venerate Tier elites.","Boom!","The energy storm surged violently. Thankfully, they did not directly rush towards the Energy Jade, but rather chose to dodge. As a result, they managed to dodge the front, and were not directly hit by the energy storm.","The two Imperial Sons both retreated, dodging the energy storm. Though they had still been scraped a little, they were completely fine.","Ling Han also retreated to a very far location. He had already used this thing to trick people once, so he naturally knew where the safe zone was.","In the distance, Imperial Son Ming and Imperial Son Tian both revealed baleful killing intent.","This was especially the case for Imperial Son Ming. If it weren’t for Imperial Son Tian’s warning, perhaps he would have directly sent the Energy Jade flying with a palm strike. If that were the case, he would have been in deep trouble. Even if he didn’t die, he would have been severely wounded.","At the Venerate Tier, the Substitution Seal was no longer useful, and this energy storm was comparable to a strike from a Saint. Even if the Substitution Seal could be used by a Venerate Tier, he would still die.","Thus, it could be said that he had just barely escaped death’s door.","“Ling Han!” he spat out word by word, wanting nothing more than to devour Ling Han’s flesh and blood.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and his hands lit up. Shockingly, an Energy Jade appeared in each of his hands.","He had picked up quite a number of these things at the bottom of the dried up lake.","“Want to play?” Ling Han asked with a smile that was filled with provocation.","This enraged Imperial Son Ming and Imperial Son Tian.","By now, they naturally knew how terrifying this seemingly insignificant jade was. They definitely could not allow it to hit them head-on. Otherwise, even they would be severely wounded.","“Humph, this thing is extremely unstable. It will explode if it is the slightest bit shaken!” Imperial Son Ming said calmly, “As long as we draw out the distance, and attack from afar, and detonate the jade in your hand, you would be the first to be unlucky.”","As expected of the Imperial Son, being able to see through the crux of the matter with a single glance.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “That’s right. However, won’t I seize the opportunity to use it?”","Oh, you delivered a strike, and I still foolishly threw it out?","He would definitely take advantage of the time between your attacks to make a move. In that way, even if the two Imperial Sons made another move, their counterattack would definitely be slightly later. The center of that energy storm could possibly be closer to the Imperial Sons.","This caused the two Imperial Sons to frown.","How could a mere Minor Advanced Tier be so difficult to kill?","“I don’t believe that!” Imperial Son Tian sneered. He sent out a palm strike, which turned into a massive dark cloud that enshrouded Ling Han.","The area covered by this attack was too large, and under the shockwave of power, it was enough to detonate the Energy Jade.","Ling Han laughed loudly and put away the Energy Jade. Then, he summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to take this attack head-on.","Peng!","With this strike, Ling Han couldn’t help but flush red, and a mouthful of blood was stuck in his throat.","This was a Venerate Tier elite, after all. Even if he attacked from such a far distance, and Ling Han had also unleashed the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, it still dealt a considerable blow to him.","However, Imperial Son Tian and Imperial Son Ming were even more stunned.","What? If a Venerate Tier elite made a move, shouldn’t he have easily crushed the Sect Master?","But now? Ling Han actually didn’t even spit out a mouthful of blood!","“Die!” Imperial Son Ming also moved. With a punch, his attack turned into a fierce tiger, using power as bones, Regulations as blood and flesh, roaring as it charged towards Ling Han. Its speed was astonishingly fast.","Ling Han didn’t linger in battle. These two people were Venerate Tier elites, and even if he could rival them,he iwould probably have to be a Nine Star Sect Master. In fact, it would have to be after he had broken through the limits of the Minor Advanced Tier.","Now was not the time for battle.","Ling Han released a battle cry, and Phoenix Wings Divine Flight unleashed as he rapidly retreated.","“You want to flee?” Imperial Son Ming and Imperial Son Tian both set off in pursuit.","However, an Energy Jade suddenly smashed over.","The two Imperial Sons had no choice but to dodge.","Boom!","The energy storm surged again, forcing the two Imperial Sons to be unable to pursue him at all.","When the energy storm subsided, where was Ling Han?","The two Imperial Sons exchanged a look, and both felt a strong sense of defeat.","Yet, Ling Han had still managed to escape?","In the future, this brat would only become stronger and stronger, and even if they were Imperial Sons, because they had already reached the level of Venerate Tier, the help that the Imperial Clan could give them would also become lesser and lesser. Their advancement would definitely slow down, or even stagnate for a very long time.","Then, when Ling Han’s cultivation level caught up...","“Not only Ling Han, but also Yang Yihuan, He Luo, and the others!”","“Let’s take advantage of their weak cultivation levels to kill them!”","“En!”","The two Imperial Sons nodded in agreement. This was a rare opportunity, and it was also possible that this was their only chance.","After Ling Han shrugged off the two Imperial Sons, he immediately found a secluded place, and began to study those black grass.","He still didn’t know what this thing was, but it didn’t matter.","Concocting the Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill required only Celestial medicines that contained Celestial Qi. As for what specific type they were, there was no restriction.","“I have the main ingredient, and now it is the supplementary ingredient.”","Ling Han murmured. Though he had obtained a few Six Star Celestial medicines, if they were used to concoct alchemical pills, this was still not enough.","“I wonder if I can find all of them here.”","Ling Han also continued onwards, as he searched. Was it possible that he would discover Celestial medicines on the way?","It had to be said that his luck was not too bad. In the following seven days, he had repeatedly made gains. Though he had not obtained any Celestial medicines that contained Celestial Qi, there was still a considerable number of ordinary Six Star Celestial medicines.","“I’m still missing three.”","A look of delight appeared on Ling Han’s face. He had not thought that everything would progress so smoothly.","With another three Celestial medicines, he would be able to concoct the Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill. Then, once it was concocted, the quality of the Celestial Qi that he would obtain would be greatly improved.","He continued to search, but his luck seemed to have taken a sharp turn for the worse. In the next two days, he actually did not manage to find another Celestial medicine. To say nothing of Six Stars, he would not even be able to find a One Star Celestial medicine.","Yi?","He searched thoroughly, but did not find any Celestial medicine. Instead, another palace appeared ahead of him.","Purple Wind Palace.","Ling Han walked over, only to see a person standing at the door.","Her bearing was captivating, Shui Qingchang.","Although her back was facing Ling Han, her divine sense was extremely sensitive. She immediately turned around and looked at Ling Han.","As the Genesis World’s rulers, the seven of them had an indescribable good impression of each other. Shui Qingchang nodded at Ling Han as a form of greeting.","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head, “Beauty Shui, do you have any Six Star Celestial medicine?”","Shui Qingchang was astonished. “What are you trying to do?”","“If you have these three Celestial medicines, I can give you something good.” Ling Han recited the names of the three Celestial medicines, “It can help you increase your cultivation level.”","“Yes.” Shui Qingchang did not hesitate, and directly threw out three Celestial medicines for Ling Han.","She was very straightforward, and also showed her trust in Ling Han.","“Wait for me for three days.” Ling Han picked up the Celestial medicine, and immediately turned to leave.","He wanted to find a place to concoct alchemical pills."]},{"number":4483,"title":"Chapter 4483: Brother Monkey is the Most Handsome","paragraphs":["Chapter 4483: Brother Monkey is the Most Handsome","Editor: Henyee Translations","Shui Qingchang did not stop him.","Though Ling Han had taken away three precious Six Star Celestial medicines, he had only given her a verbal promise.","Firstly, because they were both masters of Genesis World, she still had some trust in Ling Han. Secondly, though these three Celestial medicines were Six Stars, they didn’t contain Celestial Qi, so she didn’t especially treasure them.","If Ling Han had really screwed her over, then she would not have any further contact with Ling Han in future. That was all.","Ling Han left the palace far away. He was sure that those who came here would definitely go and fight to death over this palace, so he decided not to join in on the excitement first.","He took out the alchemy cauldron and made all the preparations. Then, he replayed the process of the Alchemy Saint concocting the Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill in his mind.","All right, that was enough.","He was filled with confidence. In terms of alchemy, he was even steadier in that than cultivation.","Boom, the cauldron’s fire blazed fiercely. He threw out medicinal ingredients, and truly began concocting.","Everything was as smooth as flowing water. Although this was Ling Han’s first time refining, he had already simulated it many times in his mind. With his strength as the Alchemy Emperor, he was completely capable of succeeding in a single attempt.","It should be known that long ago, he had already been able to concoct a Venerate Tier-level alchemical pill.","Three days later, he successfully finished his work. There were a total of eleven alchemical pills in the cauldron.","It was unknown how much Celestial Qi was contained in each alchemical pill. The quality must have increased greatly, and if it could still be maintained in quantity, that would be amazing.","However, no matter how he thought about it, this was impossible.","Ling Han took one out and consumed it. Instantly, Celestial Qi diffused throughout his body, and the fruit of cultivation rapidly grew.","Wu, what a strong Celestial Qi!","Ling Han was stunned. The quality of this Celestial Qi was really high, causing waves to rise in his mind, as if it was about to explode.","Half a day later, peace returned to his mind.","The fruit of cultivation had enlarged again, and the second golden thread had also become slightly denser.","That’s right. Going by this deduction, these alchemical pills were enough to push him up to Three Stars.","Ling Han did not continue to refine the alchemical pills. Since he had promised Shui Qingchang to wait three day for him, he would definitely have to return once the three days were over.","When he returned once more to the Purple Wind Palace, Shui Qingchang was not the only one here. There was also Jing Haoran, Origin and the other rulers of the Genesis World. He did not see anyone from the Imperial Clans.","Ling Han walked over and handed an alchemical pill to Shui Qingchang. “Here, it’s what I promised you.”","Shui Qingchang didn’t ask what it was, and simply put it away.","“Yi, the two of you?” Jing Haoran began to seek death again. His eyes swept over Ling Han and Shui Qingchang, his expression filled with suspicion, “Is there some kind of adulterous relationship?”","Did you have to say the word ‘adulterous love’?","Shui Qingchang’s eyes instantly became sharp, shooting out a strong killing intent.","Ling Han sighed, “If you don’t seek death, you won’t die. Why can’t you remember the lesson?”","Jing Haoran wore a solemn expression as he pointed at Ling Han and said, “If there’s no problem, why do you have to immediately explain? There’s a saying that an explanation is equivalent to a cover-up!” He pounded his chest and stomped his feet. “My goddess, I finally fell in love with a goddess, yet a good cabbage has been stolen by a pig!1”","These words successfully provoked Ling Han and Shui Qingchang into killing intent.","“What part of me looks like cabbages?” Ling Han questioned.","Shui Qingchang had initially been filled with killing intent, but when she heard these words, she almost stumbled.","F***, you are really too shameless. Could it be that I am the pig here?","In this way, the atmosphere immediately turned awry.","“What is it? Can’t you enter?” Ling Han asked. Three days ago, he had seen Shui Qingchang standing here, and it was still the same now.","“We can’t.” Origin shook his head, “This stage... is too unique.”","“How is it special?” Ling Han asked.","“The main doors of the palace are guarded by an ancient Tool Spirit, and one can only enter the palace through its approval,” Myriad Dao explained. “But the problem is that its approval isn’t targeted at strength, comprehension ability, and so on. Instead, it’s completely because you’re not pleasing to the eye.”","“Yi?” Ling Han gritted his teeth. This was weird.","“Neither of you... passed?” he asked, a smile curling up the corners of his lips.","This caused Ding Shu to grit his teeth, and asked, “What is the meaning of this? Are you complaining that we are ugly?”","Ling Han laughed loudly. That was what he meant. Of course, he was only teasing him.","“If you can, then go ahead!” Ding Shu Ding Shu provoked.","Ling Han strode forwards, and arrived at the entrance of the palace. At this moment, a figure appeared. It was an old geezer who looked to be in his sixties. He had a sharp mouth and monkey-like cheeks, and his appearance could only be described as extraordinary.","“Shoo, shoo, shoo. If you’re too ugly, don’t come and embarrass yourself!” The old geezer waved his hand the moment he saw Ling Han, a look of disdain on his face.","Pu!","Behind him, Ding Shu and the others were already laughing madly.","‘How about it? You’ve also suffered a blow, right?’","Ling Han also mocked internally. Though he could not be considered world-shakingly handsome, he could still be considered a handsome man, no matter what. What kind of f****** eyes did he have?","But to argue with the Tool Spirit?","Hehe, he could sense that this place was densely covered with killing intent. As long as the Tool Spirit moved, it would be able to awaken a certain deadly weapon, and give him a fatal blow.","Yi?","He suddenly realized that the old geezer’s sharp mouth and monkey-like cheeks looked very familiar.","Brother Monkey?","Indeed, though this old man was in human form, from a certain angle, he was more like a monkey. It was just that he did not have any fur or tail.","Ling Han turned around and transformed into Brother Monkey.","Ding Shu and the others all shook their heads and smiled upon seeing this.","How could they not see that the old geezer looked like a monkey? Thus, in order to suit his tastes, they had long since transformed into monkeys, but so what? No matter how much they looked like monkeys, they were all considered ugly by the old geezer.","It was useless!","Ling Han turned around, and said to the old man with a smile, “If that’s the case, then wouldn’t I be handsome?”","“Handsome, you are world-shakingly handsome!” the old man exclaimed, his face filled with stars. “There’s actually such a handsome person in this world. You are practically blessed by the heaven and earth, exuding the beauty of heaven and earth!”","‘Holy f*ck!’","Ding Shu and the others almost collapsed into a heap. They had been laughing just then, but this time, they were shocked.","F***, why was it that Ling Han was handsome when he was pretending to be a monkey, but they were ugly?","This didn’t make sense. This didn’t make sense!","Meanwhile, Ling Han nodded internally. Brother Monkey was a descendant of the Battle Saint Emperor, and in terms of the most handsome monkey, it was definitely the Battle Saint Emperor. Thus, if he imitated Brother Monkey, he had a 90% chance of passing the test.","The truth was indeed so.","‘Brother Monkey, thanks.’","Ling Han smiled faintly, turned around and winked at Ding Shu and the others. Then, he walked into the palace.","Ding Shu and the others were all enraged upon hearing this. Sure enough, ugly people would be blocked from entering.","They were naturally dissatisfied. They also transformed into Brother Monkey and walked forward.","“No, no. Though you all have become handsome now, but since the first person has entered, you all have to wait for a day.” The old man stopped them.","Waiting for a day?","Ding Shu and the others all sighed. No matter how many treasures there were in that palace, Ling Han would definitely have taken all of them."]},{"number":4484,"title":"Chapter 4484: Golden Generation leaves the stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 4484: Golden Generation leaves the stage","Editor: Henyee Translations","Right at this moment, another person came over.","Though Yang Yihuan, Feng Miaoling, and He Luo had come from different directions, they had arrived at practically the same time.","“Yi, where is Ling Han?” Their eyes swept over them, and asked at the first instant.","In their eyes, Ling Han was their strongest competitor. Thus, their hearts jolted when they didn’t see Ling Han at all.","Ding Shu and the others all pointed at the palace.","As expected!","Yang Yihuan and the others all sighed. They had spent some time to break through to the Venerate Tier, but in the end, they still couldn’t catch up to Ling Han even if they tried their best.","‘Hmm?’","In the distant skies, a great many people were presently rushing over.","One, two, three, four... there were about thirty of them.","Imperial Son Ming, Imperial Son Tian, Golden Generations, and a few Silver Generations.","They soon arrived, and as their eyes swept over Yang Yihuan, Ding Shu and the others, killing intent surged from their bodies.","These people were too freakish, posing a serious threat to the Imperial Sons. If they were not killed, then the imperial throne would really have nothing to do with the Imperial Sons.","Just in time. This was a Mystery Realm, and there were really too many people that had died in the Imperial Path, so even if they were killed, so what?","This was a rare opportunity, so they definitely couldn’t miss it.","“Very good, all of you are here,” Imperial Son Ming said balefully, contempt flickering in his eyes.","Even it was suspected that there was a Pseudo-Emperor standing behind Yang Yihuan and the others, they still felt a sense of disdain. This was the feeling of superiority of the Imperial Clans. Otherwise, even if you were a Pseudo-Emperor, so what?","A Pseudo-Emperor could not forge an Imperial Weapon, or create the Imperial Scroll. They could only lead the brilliance for a while. How could they compare to the eternally glorious Imperial Clans?","“So what?” He Luo asked calmly.","“Since you’re together, we can kill all of you in one go, so we can save some effort!” Imperial Son Tian said.","“Oh?” Yang Yihuan couldn’t help but shake his head, saying, “I was just thinking that the Imperial Sons of your generation didn’t have much ability, but from the look of things now, even your minds are so weak! Do you think that the imperial throne could be achieved by cutting out weak opponents? Then you guys are really too naive!”","“Only the strongest clash can establish the position of Emperor!”","Imperial Son Ming smirked coldly, “If you talk too much, I’ll start with you!”","He stretched out a hand to grab Yang Yihuan.","Boom, a large hand stretched out, covering the skies and covering the sun. Regulations appeared, which was incredibly terrifying.","Yang Yihuan was unafraid. His eyes widened slightly, and two God Tools fell out of his hands, slashing towards Imperial Son Ming.","These two God Tools had been forged by the Regulations, and they had been fused with the power of a Venerate Tier elite. In an instant, they had transformed into giant blades. The two swords slashed over, and the massive palm was instantly sliced into three parts. The Regulations had also been forcefully severed.","Yi! En? Ya?","Everyone was shocked, including Ding Shu and the others.","F***, how did Yang Yihuan suddenly become so powerful?","Previously, he was only a Four-Star or Five-Star Sect Master, so why had he suddenly exploded with battle prowess on the level of Venerate Tier?","“Venerate Tier!”","“He is indeed a Venerate Tier elite!”","“In such a short amount of time, how did he become a Venerate Tier elite?”","This caused everyone to be completely stunned. This had completely defied the iron rules of cultivation. No matter how awesome the Celestial medicine was, it should not be as awesome as this.","Only Feng Miaoling and He Luo wore calm expressions. They naturally knew that Yang Yihuan had reached the Venerate Tier countless times. However, he had severed his own cultivation level and started from the beginning again, so it would be extremely easy for him to return to the peak stage now.","It was not just Yang Yihuan. The two of them were the same as well. In fact, they had already returned to Venerate Tier-level.","In reality, the lower one’s cultivation level, the greater their gains would be if they walked the Imperial Path. This was something that they had concluded from their many experiences, but this time, they were really forced into a corner by Ling Han and could only break through ahead of time.","Yang Yihuan smiled faintly and said, “You still want to use your cultivation level to suppress others?”","He charged out, launching a counterattack at Imperial Son Ming.","“Now, I’ll let you suffer the consequences of your own actions!”","Boom, he struck out with both palms, and as the blow was delivered, there were actually nine Seven Star Regulations.","Imperial Son Ming was astonished by this.","This was because he was also a Two Star Venerate Tier elite like Yang Yihuan. However, he could only unleash eight Seven Star Regulations with a single strike.","This was an instant ability, and it depended on the strength of one’s divine sense.","Even though there was only one additional Regulations, that was a difference of a single star!","From the Sect Master-level onwards, the gap of a single star was like a gulf.","Imperial Son Ming shouted loudly as he charged forward.","As the Imperial Son, and as the flag of the Golden Generation, there was naturally no way he would cower from battle.","He had still been dreaming, relying on the Imperial Scroll to compensate for his shortcomings in Regulations. However, the moment they exchanged blows, he discovered that his opponent was stronger than him!","Hiss, could it be that you too have cultivated the Imperial Scroll?","Otherwise, it could not be explained that the other’s power was stronger than his own. That power was incredibly pure, and could only be tempered by the Imperial Scroll.","This Imperial Scroll was the foundation of an Imperial Clan. It was a secret that was not taught to others, because it also involved the control of the Imperial Weapon. What Imperial Clan would dare teach the Imperial Scroll to another? Even among the Imperial Clans, there were very few that could cultivate the Imperial Scroll.","Ling Han had cultivated the Imperial Scroll, and that was because he had obtained the inheritance of the Descending Heaven Holy Emperor. However, what was Yang Yihuanrelying on?","Wasn’t there a Pseudo-Emperor standing behind him?","How could a Pseudo-Emperor create an Imperial Scroll?","That was the Great Emperor’s summary of appreciation of heaven and earth. Only the Great Emperor could create it, and it was passed down through the generations.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them battled fiercely. In just a dozen over moves, it could be clearly seen that Imperial Son Ming was at a disadvantage.","This caused everyone to sigh. The Golden Generation was really about to bow out.","First, it was Brother Monkey that had appeared out of nowhere, battling three great Imperial Sons all by himself. Alright, it could still be claimed that Brother Monkey had the advantage in terms of cultivation level at the time. After all, it was a battle of two Stars against one Star.","But now?","Their cultivation levels were completely the same, yet Yang Yihuan had forcefully suppressed Imperial Son Ming. What else could he say?","The Golden Generation was truly about to dejectedly leave the stage.","“No!” Imperial Son Mingroared. He didn’t accept this!","He was the descendant of Ancestral King Wen Tian, and had grown up with a halo around him. He was called the person closest to Ancestral King Wen Tian. He was defiant, and could not accept defeat in a battle of equal cultivation levels, especially such a terrible defeat.","He used all his ultimate moves, Imperial Techniques activated, Regulations shone brilliantly, and stimulated heaven and earth.","However, in front of Yang Yihuan, this was completely useless.","Suppress, suppress, suppress, suppress... It was only a hundred moves, and Imperial Son Ming had no choice but to accept such a terrible defeat.","In a battle of equal cultivation levels, he was outmatched!","The expressions of the Imperial Sons all changed drastically, and they were rendered speechless. Even the strongest Golden Generation had been defeated, which was equivalent to pushing all of the Imperial Sons off the high altar. All of them had landed solidly on the ground.","Yang Yihuan had initially been calm and composed, as if he didn’t take anything to heart. Now, however, he was showing a baleful killing intent as he chased after Imperial Son Ming and attacked him relentlessly. He was actually trying to kill him.","This stunned everyone. Did Yang Yihuan really dare to kill the Imperial Son?","However, with so many witnesses, could it be that he wanted to kill everyone to keep the secret? Otherwise, even if there was a Pseudo-Emperor standing behind you, how could the Wentian Imperial Clan be willing to give up the matter? They would definitely take out the Imperial Weapon to seek an accounting.","Imperial Son Ming fought back with all his might, yet he was only falling further and further into a disadvantage. If this continued, he would definitely die.","He did not dare continue the battle, and hurriedly turned around to flee for his life."]},{"number":4485,"title":"Chapter 4485: Purple Calamity Grains","paragraphs":["Chapter 4485: Purple Calamity Grains","Editor: Henyee Translations","Speaking of which, after Ling Han entered the palace, he discovered that there were strong winds howling here, and they were tangible at that.","Purple-colored wind.","How could the wind have any color?","Ling Han was surprised. He looked closely. The reason why this wind was purple was because there was a kind of purple substance in the wind.","However, this substance also seemed to be a gas, and when it hit the skin, he did not feel anything at all.","Ling Han activated his eye technique and carefully observed the surroundings.","No, this purple substance was a very small material, and there was an extremely large amount of it. Thus, if it floated in the air, it would form a purple-coloured wind.","When these substances hit the body, they adhered to the skin, and were actually slowly absorbed.","Yi?","Ling Han was surprised. After this purple substance entered his body, it was hidden under his skin, forming a thin film.","It was as if this was a second layer of skin.","Ling Han sensed for a while, and felt that this purple film was extremely sturdy.","“It’ll only shatter if it can withstand the full-power attack of a Sect Master above six stars,” he murmured, his eyes filled with shock.","Most importantly, the purple substance was still endlessly surging into his body, causing that membrane to become thicker and thicker.","Hiss, at this rate, wouldn’t he be able to withstand the attack of a Venerate Tier or even Saint?","Then wouldn’t he be able to do as he liked?","So exaggerated?","Ling Han walked forwards. In any case, the wind was constantly blowing, and he was also constantly absorbing the purple substance.","His speed was extremely fast, and the purple-colored substance continuously surged into his body, causing this film to become thicker and thicker.","No, it wasn’t thick, but concentrated.","For example, if there were 100 purple substances on the fingernail-sized membrane previously, it had now become 120, 150, and it was still continuously increasing.","He walked to the end of the palace hall, and saw that there was a jade board here. It was very thin, and there were some words written on it.","Ling Han studied it carefully. This was the description of the purple substance.","This was called Purple Calamity Grain. When it was fully absorbed, the defense it formed could even block the full-power attack of a Saint below Five Stars.","However, every time it absorbed the impact force, the Purple Calamity Grains would lose a portion of its vitality, and when all its vitality had been lost, this would lose its effects, and would automatically be expelled from the body.","Theoretically speaking, he could withstand five attacks from a Saint. Of course, the upper limit was from a Four-Star Saint to a Five-Star Saint. If he had to sustain an attack from a Nine-Star Saint, then even Purple Calamity Grains would probably not be able to protect Ling Han. He would definitely die.","If it was a Venerate Tier, he could sustain as many as 80 attacks, and the upper limit was Nine-Star Venerate Tier.","“When you don’t need to use it, you can store it in the depths of your body. Otherwise, a portion of your vitality would be expended every time you battle. Even if you battle with a Sect Master, you would still cause the Purple Calamity Grains to completely lose its vitality.”","Ling Han murmured to himself.","Half a day later, the depth of the purple wind in the palace clearly weakened by more than half, and about half of the Purple Calamity Grains had been absorbed by him.","However, this also reached the extreme, and he couldn’t take another step further.","Ling Han felt slightly regretful that he hadn’t been able to absorb all the Purple Calamity Grains, which would have benefited the others. However, he alone had taken more than half of it, and the others could only share the remaining. The gap between them was not just a little bit.","With this in mind, his thoughts cleared up.","Ling Han searched around for a while. There was a Transference Portal here that allowed one to leave.","He was leaving.","Without hesitation, he took a step forward.","Space changed, and the environment immediately changed.","Ling Han looked again, and he had already arrived in a glacier. A chill assaulted him, causing him to shudder.","“F***, why is it so cold?” Ling Han gritted his teeth, the chill seeping into his bones.","He took a step forward, and the moment he moved, the chill became even stronger. It was as if the air had turned into blades that continuously slashed at his body. His clothes did not have the slightest effect of keeping out the cold.","“It can’t be that I have to use Purple Calamity Grains here, right?” Ling Han thought.","With a thought, he drew out the Saint Grade staff, and activated the bead within. Instantly, a shield of light enveloped him.","The wind blew over, but it did not break through.","Haha, this works.","Ling Han nodded, raised the staff in his right hand, and strode forwards.","After walking for half a day, he discovered that the temperature had actually risen again. Though it was still very cold, even without the protection of the natural treasure, he was completely unafraid.","Er, could it be that according to the normal method, he should have waited until now to take action?","Forget it. In any case, I have a treasure to protect me, so why should I follow the rules?","After walking for a while, he smelt a refreshing fragrance.","His nose twitched, and he hurriedly followed the fragrance. Soon, he discovered a cave.","The cave wasn’t deep, and he arrived at the end after taking a few steps. There was a pit on the ground, and it was filled with a milky white liquid. It was this thing that was exuding a refreshing fragrance.","“What Spiritual Milk is this?”","“Uh, I’ll taste it first.”","Ling Han took a small sip, and instantly, his whole body felt warm, his vitality burning fiercely.","“This is... treasure fluid that stimulates and strengthens one’s life force!”","A look of delight appeared on his face.","This was great profit!","Though he was very young now, filled with vigor and vitality, some people had been stuck at a certain cultivation level for innumerable years. They clearly had hopes of breaking through, but because they were not energetic enough, their vitality was deficient, which led to them being unable to break through. Otherwise, their vitality would definitely be burnt to nothing, and they would directly die.","Hence, if this kind of treasure fluid was sold to those old Venerate Tier elites that were stuck at the cultivation level barrier, it was believed that a great many people would be willing to pay a great price in exchange for it.","He carefully stored this treasure fluid into a jade bottle, and just at this moment, a drop of liquid dropped down from the upper wall of the cave.","Ling Han hurriedly stretched out a hand to capture it, and put away this drop of treasure fluid as well.","En, this treasure fluid fluid wasn’t seeping out of an underground spring, but rather dripping from above.","Ling Han looked up, only to see that the cave walls were slightly damp. A drop of treasure fluid was slowly forming.","“By the looks of it, it would take half a day to form a drop.”","He tried to dig, searching for the source of the treasure fluid, but he did not succeed.","The stone wall was too sturdy, and when he used Destructive Energy, he actually felt an extremely dangerous pressure.","Perhaps, when he broke open the rock, there would be great killing intent.","Forget it. His gains were already not small, and he did not have the time to wait slowly here either. Who knows, there may still be some good stuff ahead of him.","He exited the cave, and instantly shivered. It was so cold.","Taking a step back, he returned to the cave, and instantly, the temperature rose rapidly.","Ling Han nodded. Actually, even without that natural pearl, he could still pass through here. He only had to travel when the temperature rose, and find a hole to avoid the cold when the temperature dropped.","Who cares!","Ling Han strode forward. He had a natural treasure, so he could do as he liked.","After walking for another half a day, he discovered a second hole, but there was no refreshing fragrance wafting from here. He could see it directly with the naked eye.","In any case, he would enter the cave to take a look.","Ling Han entered and searched for a while. There was definitely no treasure fluid, and the other items... were also nowhere to be seen.","This was an empty hole that could only be used to avoid the cold.","Ling Han sighed and continued to walk forward."]},{"number":4486,"title":"Chapter 4486: Path of Regulations","paragraphs":["Chapter 4486: Path of Regulations","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han walked all the way. On the way, he discovered a considerable number of caves that he could use to avoid the cold, but whether it was the treasure fluid or Celestial medicine, there wasn’t any, and he did not have the slightest bit of gain.","Thinking about it, it was fine. The treasure fluid was really very precious. If it was used well, it could completely be traded for a large amount of Seven Star Celestial medicine for him.","One should be contented with what one had.","After walking for three days, Ling Han finally walked out of the icy plains, and a canyon appeared ahead of him.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before deciding to refine the Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill first. He would increase his strength as much as possible.","He found a quiet place, took out the alchemical pills and began to refine them.","One pill, two pills, three pills. He had concocted a total of eleven pills. Previously, he had eaten one, and given another to Shui Qingchang. Now, there were still nine pills left.","With each pill, the rich Celestial Qi would strengthen the fruit of cultivation. When he ate the eighth pill, the second golden thread on the fruit of cultivation finally reached the consummate state.","Two-star Sect Master, peak stage.","He spent some time trying to break through to the level of Three Star Sect Master. He was only advancing his minor level, so there was no need for him to accumulate too much energy. He could completely advance his cultivation level first, and then slowly stabilize it.","The Dao Fruit Tree naturally grew as well, swaying in his mind with a strange rhythm.","Ling Han ingested the last Little Nine Emperors Ten Leaves Pill, and the third golden thread of the fruit of cultivation, from lighter, became deeper.","This breakthrough took him about six days.","Ling Han returned to the canyon, only to discover that many people had already arrived.","There were regulars like Yang Yihuan, and Feng Miaoling, as well as rulers of the Genesis World like Ding Shu, Origin, and so on. In addition, Imperial Son Ming, Imperial Son Tian, and the other Golden Generations had also arrived, but these two most powerful Imperial Sons wore expressions of disappointment, as if they had suffered some great blow.","Furthermore, in terms of conduct, the Imperial Sons were also extraordinarily timid, like children that had done something wrong.","He, this was rare.","In addition, Brother Monkey had also arrived. He was presently crossing the canyon.","They were not at the entrance to the canyon, but rather on the cliff on one side. Connecting these two cliffs were threads. Upon a closer look, one would discover that these threads were actually formed from Regulations.","When one walked on it, the threads of Regulations would tremble, and one could be easily overturned. Thus, those walking on it had to resonate with the Regulations, and move with the Regulations, becoming one with the Regulations.","Ling Han saw a Silver Generation elite exclaim in surprise as he walked, falling down from the silk of Regulations. He was like a large rock that had fallen into the water. He didn’t soar up at all, and directly fell to the bottom of the valley.","As expected, flying was not allowed here?","Ling Han walked over. He didn’t greet Brother Monkey. At this moment, Brother Monkey was focused on resonating with the Regulations. He definitely couldn’t distract him.","“Hey, Ling Han!” Ding Shu and the others had not even begun their journey, when they all greeted Ling Han.","Ling Han nodded, and asked them some questions.","Though this was the first time Ding Shu and the others had come here, they had watched for a long time, hadn’t they? Furthermore, Yang Yihuan and the others had already come many times, so they could investigate the situation from them.","The truth was more or less as Ling Han had guessed. One could only pass through here by treading on the threads of Regulations. Flight was not possible, as one would be directly pressed to the bottom of the valley. This had the same result as failing to pass on the threads of Regulations, and that was one would no longer be able to see the threads of Regulations, and would not be able to touch the threads of Regulations.","This meant that the possibility of crossing the canyon had been lost, and they could only wait for Imperial Path to close, and be thrown out of this Mystery Realm.","Hence, for everyone, there was only one chance.","In fact, there were many threads of Regulations here, and there were only about 40 people here. It was completely enough for everyone to try.","“What are you guys waiting for?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“Waiting for you,” Shui Qingchang said.","“Waiting for me?” Ling Han was surprised. Don’t be so ambiguous. There was nothing going on between us.","“We are waiting to compete with you,” Heaven Crushing said. “Let’s see who can pass first.”","“En!” Jing Haoran and the others nodded.","F***, you guys are very free, is that really necessary?","Upon further thought, the extent of his freakish talent was already number one in the world. Thus, every prodigy wanted to defeat him, so that their claim of first place would be justified. Otherwise, they would always feel that something was off.","Ling Han wiped away the cold sweat on his forehead. Everyone was fixated on him now?","“Alright, let’s compete,” he said with a smile. In terms of natural talent and comprehension ability, what did he have to fear?","The seven of them each chose a silk thread, and then stepped out with one foot at the same time.","The threads of Regulations instantly rebounded. This was a manifestation of the willpower of heaven and earth, so how could it be allowed to be touched by others?","Thus, one had to resonate with it.","Now, though everyone’s feet were stepping on the threads of Regulations, they were actually all stepping on empty air. They were completely relying on the other foot that was standing on the cliff to maintain their balance.","The seven Genesis World rulers had all surpassed the Golden Generation. Even such people like Yang Yihuan and Feng Miaoling were slightly inferior. Their divine sense surged, presently rapidly analyzing the Regulations.","It would depend on who would be the first to take the other step. This would allow them to gain the first opportunity.","Merely half a minute later, seven people stepped out with their second foot at practically the same time.","In terms of comprehension ability, none of them was inferior to others.","Ling Han nodded internally. As expected of the Genesis World’s leaders. Being able to stand out from millions and millions of living beings, their comprehension ability was definitely impressive, and there was nothing to say about it.","Thus, it was actually a matter of fate that allowed them to cultivate to a higher level after coming to the new world.","And fateful encounters were also related to luck, personality, and even the way one handled matters. For example, if Ling Han could obtain the Origin Gold, that would be a burst of luck for him. If it really had to be claimed that he was more outstanding than Ding Shu and the others, that might not be the case either.","After taking the second step, their speed became faster, and they quickly took the third and fourth steps.","However, when they had just reached the tenth step, the threads of Regulations began to tremble greatly, causing everyone to stop.","They couldn’t walk any further, or they would definitely fall in.","Yang Yihuan and the others, including the Golden Generations, simply waited. They would wait for the shreds of Regulations to stabilize, and then walk on it.","However, Ling Han and the others didn’t think this way.","If that was the case, how could one possibly emerge victorious?","If one wanted to fight for first place, he would have to do something that others could not.","Thus, the seven of them were all deducing in their minds how they could continue to resonate with the Regulations when the threads of Regulations were trembling violently.","The difficulty level instantly increased by more than a dozen times, or even a hundred times.","After a long time, Ling Han finally took a step forward.","Just as his foot landed, Myriad Dao and the others also raised their feet at almost the same time.","Ling Han was still in the lead!","Ling Han smiled faintly, and took a second step.","This was obviously faster than the others, because though Ding Shu and the others had raised their feet, they were moving very slowly.","The third step, the fourth step, Ling Han’s speed became faster and faster. His divine sense had been tempered too perfectly, and this naturally caused his resonance with Regulations to become even faster.","He left them in the dust, and no one could compare to him.","Sigh!","Ding Shu and the others all saw this. Aside from feeling gloomy, they could only admit defeat."]},{"number":4487,"title":"Chapter 4487: Tomb of the Heavenly Emperor","paragraphs":["Chapter 4487: Tomb of the Heavenly Emperor","Editor: Henyee Translations","One could not help but be dissatisfied. The speed of passing this stage had nothing to do with strength. It was completely based on one’s comprehension of Regulations.","And this was closely related to the strength of one’s divine sense.","In other words, even Ling Han’s divine sense was more perfect than theirs!","This caused a great blow to Ding Shu and the others. Why were they inferior to Ling Han in every aspect?","They were all masters of Genesis World, so why was there such a huge gap between them?","It wasn’t long before Ling Han surpassed the Golden Generations that were walking ahead of him. He then caught up to Brother Monkey, Yang Yihuan and the others.","Even if Yang Yihuan and the others hadn’t walked the threads of Regulations for the first time, the Regulations they walked every time were different. They only knew what to do, and aside from that, they actually didn’t have any other advantage.","Thus, Ling Han surpassed them.","After more than an hour, Ling Han finally arrived at the other side of the canyon.","At this time, Yang Yihuan, who was walking in front, had only walked three-quarters of the way, and was still quite far from the finishing line.","Furthermore, because of his extreme speed, the Imperial Sons’ Dao Hearts became unstable, and they instantly lost the resonance of Regulations, falling directly. Though they would not die, they had also lost the possibility of advancing further.","Ling Han decided to wait for Brother Monkey. The two brothers had lost contact since entering the first palace, and it was only now that they met again. Of course, they had to advance together.","—After ending the Imperial Path adventure, they still had to return to Celestial Sea Planet together to see old acquaintances, family and friends.","The second person to pass was Yang Yihuan, and then the third, fourth, and fifth places were all very close. They were Feng Miaoling, He Luo, and Brother Monkey. In truth, the sixth place had also arrived very quickly. It was Ding Shu and the others that had arrived. Instead, it was those Imperial Sons that had fallen behind.","Yang Yihuan and He Luo stared at Ling Han for a while before saying, “If we can obtain the imperial throne by killing you, then we really won’t be able to resist this kind of temptation.”","“Then you all would have to get through Old Sun!” Brother Monkey slung the staff forged from Saintly Material on his shoulder, looking disdainfully at Yang Yihuan and He Luo, his fighting spirit soaring.","“Hehe, so you’re a descendant of the Battle Saint Emperor!” Yang Yihuan said with a smile. “Apologies! Apologies!”","Brother Monkey ignored him, and only said to Ling Han, “Brother, let’s go!”","“All right.” Ling Han nodded, and waved at Ding Shu and the others, “Everyone, I’ll take my leave first.”","Actually, no one was interested in staying here, and there were no natural treasures or incomparable opportunities, so they naturally left as well.","“Yi, Brother Ling, what a coincidence. We meet again,” Jing Haoran teased Ling Han, with the spirit that it would definitely kill him if he didn’t seek death.","“Brother Jing, how have you lived for so long?” Ling Han asked curiously.","Jing Haoran propped up his chin in thought. After a while, he said, “It’s mainly because of my bearing.”","Ling Han was rendered speechless. He really wanted to kick him over.","Everyone descended from the mountain, and could vaguely see that there was another tall mountain ahead of them.","However, when they passed through a massive plain and arrived at the foot of a high mountain, they shockingly discovered that this was not a high mountain, but rather a large tomb.","—There was a massive stone tablet erected on it, and it was clearly written: Tomb of the Heavenly Emperor.","Everyone inhaled sharply. an Emperor’s tomb!","Was there a Great Emperor buried here?","Furthermore, which Great Emperor actually dared to claim that he was a Heavenly Emperor? This sounded even more awesome than a Great Emperor.","Yang Yihuan, Feng Miaoling, and He Luo exchanged a glance. Their pupils contracted, and this was a sign that they felt an indescribable shock.","“Brother Yang, do you guys know the origins of the tomb of the Heavenly Emperor?” Jing Haoran couldn’t help but ask.","Aside from courting death, his curiosity was also overwhelmingly great.","Yang Yihuan was still relatively amiable. He pondered for a moment before saying, “The last time I came, there was no Heavenly Emperor’s tomb here.”","What!","“Neither have I seen it before,” He Luo replied with a shake of his head.","Although Feng Miaoling didn’t speak, she also shook her head.","These three people had all come to the Imperial Path many times, and could be considered regulars, but there was actually a change in the Imperial Path, and even they were not sure about it. How could this not be shocking?","The willpower of heaven and earth created Imperial Path, and it could evolve continuously?","True, if that was not the case, how could the stone carvings of the past Great Emperors have appeared on that door on the sea?","Because there were a great many Great Emperors that had only achieved Dao after walking through Imperial Path. This was contrary to the flow of time. Thus, the only explanation was that Imperial Path itself had evolved.","“So, we have to enter and explore by ourselves,” Origin said after a moment of thought.","“Haha, since we are already here, we will take things as they come. What would we need to fear?” Jing Haoran appeared very heroic.","Brother Monkey was the most decisive. He directly set off, “Let’s go!”","Ling Han nodded, and walked side by side with Brother Monkey.","During this process, none of the Imperial Sons said a word. Even Imperial Son Ming and Imperial Son Tian were like roosters that had lost a cockfight, completely losing their temper.","It could not be helped. Previously, Imperial Son Ming had been horribly defeated by Yang Yihuan, and been pursued by Yang Yihuan for countless miles. In the end, he managed to fortunately escape with his life. The shadow in his heart was indescribably heavy, so how could he still dare to seek his own humiliation?","However, they all thought to themselves that once they left the Imperial Path, they would definitely ask the Saints of their clans to move, and kill all these people. Otherwise, the position of Emperor would definitely have nothing to do with them.","Brother Monkey’s race all had a firm and domineering personality. They would rather break than bend. Even if they encountered danger, they would only face it head-on. He walked into a dark passageway ahead of him, and strode forwards, unafraid.","Ling Han followed closely behind. Meanwhile, he spread out his divine sense, and sensed everything in his surroundings. He was extremely careful.","If both of them forged ahead stubbornly, that was definitely not a good thing.","After walking for a while in the passageway, the path ahead suddenly opened up.","The entire mountainside had been hollowed out, and the space was huge. There were seven-coloured flames rising, waterfalls soaring into the skies, and magnificent Divine Metal was glowing, making it seem a strange and peculiar scene.","“Be careful!” Brother Monkey suddenly said. Then, he suddenly raised his staff and pointed it straight ahead. “Who goest there? Show yourself!”","Ling Han focused his gaze, and saw a hazy shadow ahead of him. However, he couldn’t see clearly whether it was a human or a demon at all.","“Little monkey, you are quite hot-tempered.” An old voice rang out, and that shadow also walked out. When it came close enough, that layer of haziness gradually faded, revealing an old man.","Ling Han couldn’t help but give a ‘yi’, and said, “Senior, it’s you!”","It was the old man who had given him the Time Wine at the cemetery. When he woke up, there was no sign of the old man. He had not thought that he would appear here again.","The elder chuckled, and said, “Young man, you’re truly fortunate!”","Brother Monkey scratched his head, then shouted again, “Hey, who exactly are you?”","“As for me...” A look of reminiscence appeared on the elder’s face, and he said, “My name is Han Yun, the tomb keeper.”","It really was him. Previously, they had seen him in the Tomb of Time, and now it was the tomb of the Heavenly Emperor.","“Senior Han.” Ling Han clasped his hands in greeting, “You should have come here long ago. May I know what you can teach us?”","At this moment, Ding Shu, Origin, and the others also walked over from behind. When they discovered that there was actually an elder here, they were all shocked."]},{"number":4488,"title":"Chapter 4488: Summoned","paragraphs":["Chapter 4488: Summoned","Editor: Henyee Translations","It should be known that there was a relative age limit for entering into the Imperial Path. It was not just anyone that could enter.","Thus, this old geezer looked to be quite old, and whether it was in absolute or relative terms of age, how could he possibly appear in this space?","Could it be that this was a native?","Han Yun smiled, and said, “Don’t worry, don’t worry. I do not belong here. I can only see everything, and cannot take anything. Otherwise, the heavens would not spare me!”","Hiss!","What did that mean?","Could it be that he was not a native of this place, but rather an outsider? However, he did not conform to the rules of entry into the Imperial Path for relatively young people. Instead, he had used some unknown method to enter. Thus, he could not break the rules, and snatch the fated opportunity from the “young people”.","“Senior, is there really a Great Emperor buried here?” Ling Han asked.","Han Yun shook his head, “There is no corpse of a Great Emperor here. However, there really is an opportunity related to the Great Emperor here. I just don’t know which of you would be able to obtain it.”","His words sent a wave of commotion through the masses.","As long as it was related to the Great Emperor, then no matter what kind of great opportunity it was, it was still astonishing.","“Go on, I’m also waiting for you guys to open the Imperial Path to follow youout,” Han Yun said with a smile. “After all, I’ve deceived the damn heavens for so long. If I break the rules again, it’s really possible that I will be struck to death.”","These words sounded frightening, because how many people were qualified to be struck to death by the heavens?","Even if he broke through to become a Saint, the heaven and earth would only cause internal demons to descend on him!","Unless he had done something unforgivable, then only would Heavenly Dao send down a lightning punishment to erase him.","Thus, a person that could be erased by Heavenly Dao must be overwhelmingly powerful.","Han Yun fell silent after saying this, and his figure became hazy again. No one could see through him.","Even Venerate Tier elites couldn’t see through, so just how powerful was the old geezer?","A Saint?","No one dared to disturb him. In an era when there was no Emperor in the world, Saints were naturally respected. Who dared to disrespect them?","They circled around Han Yun, one after another, and continued onwards.","There were no mechanisms or restrictions here. Everything was very calm, as if it was just an ordinary cave.","However, after walking for a while, the situation changed.","The resistance came again.","This resistance was not absolute, but rather differed based on cultivation level. For example, though Brother Monkey was a Venerate Tier, he did not have an easier time compared to Ling Han. The pressure he endured was a hundred times stronger, or even a thousand times stronger.","However, after advancing 300 meters, even someone as strong as Brother Monkey had no choice but to stop.","This resistance was already so strong that even he could not advance any further. However, with Brother Monkey’s domineering nature, how could he be willing to stop just like that?","He gave a loud shout, and channelled the metal rod in his hand, forcibly slicing through the obstructive force, and advanced once more.","His ferocity was unreasonable, and he actually forcibly advanced another 30 meters. However, this time, he had really reached his limit. No matter how fast Brother Monkey brandished the metal rod, he could not advance the slightest bit further.","This made Brother Monkey cry out in anger. He opened his mouth and bared his sharp teeth, as if he wanted to bite an invisible opponent to death.","With a thought, Ling Han summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, planning to protect him and Brother Monkey as they continued to advance.","However, this time, even the Pseudo Imperial Weapon was useless. It was not effective against the resistance at all.","Yi, then what should he do?","Ling Han hurriedly shook his hands. Boom! Destructive Energy surged, and the obstructive force instantly disappeared.","He couldn’t help but feel surprised. He had only channeled the Destructive Energy in a gamble, but the effects were far better than he had imagined. He had actually pushed back all the resistance.","Unfortunately, this Destructive Energy could only protect him. It itself was a deadly weapon, and could not possibly protect Brother Monkey as well.","Seeing that Ling Han was advancing without any hindrance, Brother Monkey nodded, “Brother, you go first.”","Ling Han hesitated for a moment, then replied, “All right!”","No matter what he gained, he would share it with Brother Monkey.","He strode forwards, and behind him, Ding Shu, Heaven Crushing, and the others also channelled the Destructive Energy, moving freely under this resistance. On the other hand, Myriad Dao, Origin, and the others, though they too were masters of the Genesis World, but because they had not cultivated the Destructive Energy, they could only sigh helplessly.","After walking for over ten minutes, the obstructive force suddenly disappeared.","A forest of stone pillars appeared ahead of them. They were densely packed together, and there were indescribably many of them. Furthermore, every single stone pillar was still glowing, and their colour varied.","Where exactly was the great opportunity that Han Yun spoke of that was related to the Great Emperor?","Yi?","Ling Han suddenly faltered. He had a feeling that something was summoning him.","It was hard to say whether this was a human or something else. In short, he had established a connection with him, which also provided him with a vague direction.","He looked towards Ding Shu, and the others, and saw that these four people were also looking towards the others.","By the looks of it, everyone was being summoned by that being.","A treasure left behind by a Great Emperor?","But why them?","It should be known that this tomb of the Heavenly Emperor had not even existed the last time it was opened. This was proven by Yang Yihuan and the others. Then, from this deduction, it was very possible that this so-called Heavenly Emperor was referring to the previous Great Emperor.","Who was this Great Emperor? There were no historical records, and they only knew that there was indeed such an existence.","The problem was, what relation did this Great Emperor have with the Destructive Energy?","What did this have to do with the Genesis World?","If it was unrelated, then why was it that only the Genesis World’s Masters could cultivate Destructive Energy, and only they could walk here?","If they found the treasures left behind by this Great Emperor, would they be able to unravel all the secrets?","Everyone moved, heading towards the depths of the stone forest.","After walking for a while, they gradually stopped.","That was because that kind of feeling was intermittent, and incredibly weak.","During this process, Ling Han discovered that everyone’s perception of that unknown existence was different. He should be the strongest, because that connection had not been severed all this while, and the next strongest was Ding Shu.","Was this determined by the strength of the Destructive Energy that one had mastered?","See, Ling Han had mastered eight corners of the Destructive Energy Spirit Diagram, and next was Ding Shu. This sensitivity was completely proportional to this.","A smile spread across Ling Han’s face. By the looks of it, this treasure left behind by the Great Emperor was most likely his.","He sped up, shuttling through the stone forest. After turning left and right, he soon threw everyone off his tail.","In this place, the stone forest was densely packed, which greatly affected visibility. One couldn’t see very far at all, and the light rays they emitted had the effect of obstructing divine sense. Thus, one could throw others off their tail with a few steps.","Ling Han walked faster and faster. His position in the lead might not be secure, so he had to hurry.","He walked here and there, circled here and there. This stone forest was astonishingly huge. Furthermore, though Ling Han’s sense of that mysterious existence was slightly stronger, that was only in relative terms. There were a great many times that he still had to stop, and distinguish the direction.","Hence, his speed actually could not be considered very fast, but he was definitely ahead of the others.","Three days later, Ling Han discovered that the feeling of connection was strengthening.","Did this mean that he was already very close to the treasure that the Great Emperor had left behind?","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel excited, and sped up.","After about half a day, he walked out of the stone forest. In front of him stood a massive stone tablet."]},{"number":4489,"title":"Chapter 4489: Complete Destructive Energy","paragraphs":["Chapter 4489: Complete Destructive Energy","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han swept his gaze over the surroundings, and only then did he discover that he hadn’t actually walked out of the stone forest. The only reason for this misconception was because the area around the stone tablet had become empty.","In truth, he was still inside the stone forest, but in some unknown corner.","This stone tablet was extraordinary?","Ling Han walked over. His eyes swept over the surroundings, and his heart suddenly beat wildly.","This was actually the ninth corner of the Destructive Energy Spirit Diagram!","It should be known that the eight corners of the Spirit Diagram had been written on some unknown beast hide, but now? The ninth corner of the Destructive Energy Spirit Diagram had been inscribed on the stone tablet!","No wonder he felt a resonance. So that was the case.","Hiss, could it be that the Destructive Energy was created by the Great Emperor of the last era?","This was too shocking.","Destructive Energy had surpassed nine stars, and even the Great Emperors of the past had never come into contact with it before.","No wonder this place could be called the tomb of the Heavenly Emperor. The previous Great Emperor was indeed awesome, stunning all eternity!","The problem was, what did this have to do with him?","There was definitely a link between the Genesis World and the Great Emperor of the last era, but what exactly was it?","Ling Han was curious, but he couldn’t figure it out.","However, he immediately pushed this question back into his mind. The most important thing now was not to know the reason, but rather to cultivate this ninth corner of the Destructive Energy Spirit Diagram, reaching consummate level.","He immediately began to read.","Weng, the millions and millions of dimensions in his body immediately vibrated as well, as if they were resonating, but also seemed to be cheering. Something that he clearly could not understand was forcefully absorbed by him, and he actually knew what to do.","This feeling was really strange.","However, he had already experienced it eight times, so it didn’t matter if he experienced it again.","In just half a day, Ling Han had already mastered this ninth corner of the Spirit Diagram.","Hong, Destructive Energy surged, burning all over Ling Han’s body. Energy that was even denser than darkness exuded an indescribable pressure.","Kuang!","A sudden clap of thunder rang out in the heaven and earth. Endless tribulation clouds appeared above Ling Han’s head, layering on top of each other.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel his scalp go numb. Previously, the heaven’s calamity had only caused an internal demon to descend, but now, it seemed like there really was divine lightning that was about to strike down.","This was no joke.","If Heavenly Dao was going to kill, even a Saint’s only path would be death.","The problem was that Heavenly Dao had its own rules to play by, so it definitely couldn’t act recklessly—unless one did something super great that destroyed the Regulations of heaven and earth.","‘I’ve only mastered the complete Destructive Energy. Is there any need for you to be so furious?’","Er, Destructive Energy was really no joke. This was an existence that surpassed all high-level energies!","However, he was actually going to be struck by lightning?","This was too much, wasn’t it!","Kuang, a bolt of lightning struck down, indescribably fast.","So what if it was Ling Han? He was completely unable to dodge.","This was comparable to the attack of a Saint, or perhaps even stronger!","However, Ling Han discovered that he wasn’t injured at all.","Yi, Heavenly Dao would also mess around with people, playing around?","Kuang, kuang, kuang! One bolt of lightning followed another, striking madly at Ling Han.","No, it wasn’t just Ling Han. Even the stone tablet was targeted, forcibly disintegrating and vanishing without a trace.","Ling Han was curious. Why was it that when it struck a rock, the rock would suffer a destructive blow, but when it struck him, he was completely unscathed?","Furthermore, wasn’t Imperial Path formed by heaven and earth? Since you don’t want others to cultivate Destructive Energy, why have you left it here?","It had established the tomb of the Heavenly Emperor, and now it was sending down a heaven’s calamity to destroy it. Wasn’t that an unnecessary action?","Hong, hong, hong! The divine lightning struck madly. It came and went quickly, and in less than two minutes, the lightning had stopped striking down, and the thunderclouds had also dispersed.","Er, was it just destroying the stone tablet to destroy evidence?","Ling Han looked inside himself. After being struck so many times by the heaven’s calamity, though he was unscathed, he kept feeling that something was strange.","This investigation gave him a shock, and his expression also became strange.","He really hadn’t suffered any injuries, but it didn’t mean that nothing had changed.","That was because on the fruit of cultivation in his mind, there shockingly appeared multiple black chains.","F***, what the hell was this?","Ling Han waved his hands and feet, and a terrifying power surged. Regulations surged, and his battle prowess was not affected in the slightest.","Yi, what exactly was the use of these black chains?","This was caused by the heaven’s calamity striking him. Ling Han didn’t think that it was just for show.","“It must have some use that I don’t know about. It’s just that it hasn’t been shown yet.”","“However, the Heavenly Dao was angered because of this, and sent down lightning to strike me. From this, it is clear that this should not be anything good, right?”","Ling Han rubbed his nose. Cultivating Destructive Energy to its full state was a great thing, but it also seemed to have planted a hidden danger for him.","“Whatever, I’ll cross that bridge when I get there. It’s useless even if I think about it now.”","He stood up, and just as he was about to leave, he felt the ground beneath his feet tremble loudly.","What was going on?","With a loud bang, the whole space cracked open. Ling Han was instantly swept out by an irresistible force, and in this process, he even saw others.","For example, Ding Shu, Brother Monkey, the Golden Generation, and even Song Lan, who had stayed in North Prosperity City.","Could it be that Imperial Path had already ended?","Ling Han saw that Yang Yihuan, He Luo, and Feng Miaoling all looked confused. From this, it could be seen that Imperial Path definitely did not end here in the past, but now, some kind of change had taken place, and it had come to an abrupt stop.","Space split apart again, and everyone fell out, one after another.","This place... was the Same Moon Planet.","That massive stone door was slowly closing. It was too eye-catching, and no one would be able to see wrongly.","All of a sudden, the Saints and Venerate Tiers that had stayed behind all moved, searching for their descendants and heirs.","Now that he was here, Ling Han could control the ley lines again. He used the Earth Qi as his eyes and ears, and after sensing for a while, he discovered that the Nine Mountains Saint wasn’t here.","True, the old man didn’t know that he had entered the Imperial Path from the Netherworld. This passageway was too hidden, and there should be very few people who knew about it.","Hence, it was really normal that the old man did not wait for him here.","“Ling Han!” An earth-shattering voice rang out. A Saint flew into a rage, and directly turned into a giant that was millions and millions of meters tall. His head was the size of a planet, and looked directly at Ling Han.","“Damn it!” Another Saint manifested a projection, which also transformed into an indomitable giant.","There was also a third, a fourth, and one after another, the Saints used their great power to turn into beings millions and millions of meters tall. In this way, no matter which corner of Same Moon Planet Ling Han was hiding in, they would be able to kill him with a light grab.","These were all Saints of the Imperial Clans. They had already found out through the divine sense transmission of their Imperial Sons that Ling Han had killed a few more Imperial Sons. Furthermore, his freakishness was enough to threaten the Golden Generation.","This boy definitely could not be allowed to live!","Boom! A Saint was far too domineering, and they didn’t even give Ling Han a chance to defend himself. A large hand descended from the sky, slamming down at Ling Han.","When the Saint moved, the Venerate Tier could only dodge. Furthermore, he had to tear a rip into space and flee at the first instant. If he was slightly slower, the Void would also be implicated, and he would still die.","The Saint was the embodiment of the Regulations of heaven and earth. He was indescribably powerful.","Ling Han was only a Three Star Sect Master, and didn’t even have the chance to dodge.","He delivered a palm strike, and the entire Same Moon Planet trembled violently. One third of the planet caved in."]},{"number":4490,"title":"Chapter 4490: Deception","paragraphs":["Chapter 4490: Deception","Editor: Henyee Translations","Had Ling Han died?","He had definitely died. A Saint had moved, and directly hit him. If he still did not die, what justice was there left in this world?","This scene caused a great many Imperial Sons, including Ding Shu, Yang Yihuan and the others, to be extremely surprised.","That incredibly freakish prodigy, who was aiming straight for the throne, actually died just like that?","So calm? Such a worthless death? So simple?","But upon further thought, a Saint had already moved, so what Sect Master would be spared?","However, they were still slightly unable to accept this. On their way here, Ling Han had created far too many miracles. Thus, even though it was a Saint that had done this, they still felt a little uncertain.","They wanted to search for Ling Han’s corpse for further confirmation.","But with a single strike from a Saint, everything was shattered, and only the powerful martial intent of the Saint was boiling. Even if Ling Han had left behind slivers of his remnant soul, they would still be completely destroyed by the martial intent of the Saint.","Why did he have to kill so thoroughly? Couldn’t he leave behind some remnant soul to extract Ling Han’s memories?","In that case, it would be clear why Ling Han was so powerful.","But when they saw who the Saint that had moved was, everyone understood why he had done so.","That was the Fire Leaving Saint of the Fire Cloud Imperial Clan.","—The Golden Generation of their clan had died, the Silver Generation had died, and the ordinary Imperial Sons had died even earlier. It could be said that there was completely no possibility for their clan to produce another Great Emperor.","Thus, since they could not produce an Emperor, they naturally did not want the other Imperial Clans to take advantage of them either. They would directly kill Ling Han, and destroy everyone’s hopes of obtaining the secret to Ling Han’s strength.","‘Holy f*ck!’","A great many Saints were cursing internally. With how murderous they were, it was naturally necessary for them to kill Ling Han, but at the same time, they too wanted to obtain Ling Han’s secret.","However, this didn’t matter.","Aside from Ling Han, there was also Ding Shu, Yang Yihuan, and the others.","“You guys—” These Saints looked towards Ding Shu, and the others, their eyes baleful and menacing.","“Hehe, what do you guys want to do?” One after another, Saints appeared, similarly turning into giants that were millions and millions of meters tall, protecting Ding Shu, Yang Yihuan and the others.","“If you don’t want your clan to be exterminated, you had best behave,” the old Saint who had escorted He Luo over said. The blood parasol above his head trembled slightly, exuding an incredibly terrifying aura.","“Let’s go.”","These Saints tore a rip into space, one after another, and left with Ding Shu and the others.","“Hey, give me back my brother’s life!” Brother Monkey shouted loudly. His right hand held the Saint-level metal rod, while his left hand held the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. His face was filled with fury.","He was completely unafraid of the Saint, and directly charged over.","None of the Saints made a move. Instead, they dodged.","“For the sake of the Battle Saint Emperor, I won’t lower myself to your level.” These Saints tore open space one after another, then grabbed their juniors and left. They didn’t seize even the Pseudo-Imperial Weapon.","For the sake of the Battle Saint Emperor, the so-called reason was only superficial. The real reason was naturally fearing that the Battle Saint Emperor had not died. Then, if his only descendant, Brother Monkey was killed, wouldn’t the Battle Saint Emperor go crazy?","In the past, this Great Emperor was renowned for his toughness and ferocity. He had a hot-tempered personality, and if he could resolve things through battle, he would definitely not waste time on words.","Though innumerable years had passed since the era of the Battle Saint Emperor, the Great Emperor had gone to the edge of the universe to seek immortality, and no one knew whether he had died or not.","That was the Great Emperor! He had ruled a whole era, and he was so powerful that even Saints couldn’t imagine it. It was extremely likely that he could perform a miracle!","Thus, even if there was only a sliver of a chance, these Saints would not dare to do anything to Brother Monkey.","Brother Monkey did not pursue. Instead, he immediately calmed down.","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower in his hands was naturally given to him by Ling Han. He didn’t flip out at the first instant because he received Ling Han’s divine sense transmission.","Xiu, he streaked through the universe, and very soon, grabbed a broken piece of stone. This was a piece of the same planet that had been shattered by the Fire Leaving Saint. He immediately put it away, then tore a rip into space and quickly left.","After traveling through a considerable number of galaxies, Brother Monkey finally stopped.","Xiu, Ling Han’s figure appeared.","Previously, he had shrunk his body and adhered it to that rock.","—Before the Saint had made his move, Ling Han had already done a few things, because he knew that he had killed a great many Imperial Sons. The moment he exited the Imperial Path, he would be bombarded by the Saints of the Imperial Clans.","Firstly, he handed the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower over to Brother Monkey, and quickly related his thoughts through divine sense.","Secondly, he channelled the Purple Calamity Grains in his body, forming a protective layer.","In this manner, the Saint’s attack was completely dispersed by the Purple Calamity Grains. Meanwhile, Ling Han took advantage of the opening to shrink his body, and attach himself onto a rock. With the shockwave created the remaining power of the Saint’s attack, he rushed into space.","He tried his best to suppress his life force, and added with the fact that the martial intent of a Saint was spreading everywhere in space, there was no way to detect his aura at all.","Hence, going by his inherent thinking, if he was struck by the Saint’s attack, he would definitely be deader than dead, and not even his soul fragment would be found.","As for why the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower had to be given to Brother Monkey, it was forged from Origin Gold, so it couldn’t possibly be damaged by a Saint. Thus, if he disappeared, and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower also disappeared, that would be a flaw in the deception.","Thus, he needed Brother Monkey’s cooperation.","In this way, everyone would think that Ling Han had died.","“These b*stards!” Brother Monkey was still extremely furious. “If it weren’t for the Saint’s suppression, Old Sun would have gone to their lair and turned them upside down.”","Ling Han smiled faintly, “When we are a little stronger, we will go and take a look at the Imperial Clan.”","“Haha, just what Old Sun wants,” Brother Monkey said with a smile. He loved battle the most.","Er, have you misunderstood something?","Ling Han suddenly thought of something. When he said he was going to visit the Imperial Clans, he meant something like ambushing them secretly, robbing, and so on. He had no intention to barge in forcefully.","After all, they were all protected by the Imperial Weapon and the Great Emperor-level formation. If they didn’t become Emperor, then even Saints wouldn’t dare to barge in with the Imperial Weapon.","Brother Monkey, you have to take it easy. If you want to forcibly break through to the Imperial Clan, that really could only be done after becoming Emperor.","They first managed to contact the Nine Mountains Saint and informed him that Ling Han wasn’t dead. Then, they headed toward Celestial Sea Planet.","In the meantime, Ling Han taught Phoenix Wings Divine Flight to Brother Monkey.","If there was fortune, they would naturally enjoy it together.","Even with a Venerate Tier to lead the way, because the distance was too far, it still took them more than two months to finally arrive at Celestial Sea Planet.","At this moment, the Dark North Nation’s name was known throughout the world.","There was no other reason for this. After cultivating in seclusion for many years, Chen Fengyan had finally broken through to Sect Master-level.","“Yo, brat Yan has finally become a Sect Master.” Brother Monkey sighed. “More than 2000 years ago, this brat was still following Old Sun around, half-naked.1”","They directly headed to the Imperial Palace, but they both disguised themselves.","This was especially the case for Ling Han. He had successfully disguised himself as having died, so he could take advantage of this opportunity to secretly grow stronger. He naturally didn’t want to expose his identity.","They did not go through the main doors. If they did, they would still have to ask someone to announce their arrival. How troublesome would that be?","The two of them directly flew above the Imperial Palace, then searched for the strongest aura.","It wasn’t long before they found the location of Chen Fengyan. With a whoosh, they descended from the sky.","Chen Fengyan’s expression changed drastically. This was because he hadn’t noticed how the two of them had arrived before him.","A great enemy!"]},{"number":4491,"title":"Chapter 4491: Gloomy Chen Fengyan","paragraphs":["Chapter 4491: Gloomy Chen Fengyan","Editor: Henyee Translations","Chen Fengyan was presently a Sect Master. Even if he had just broken through not too long ago, he could still be considered a great elite.","Yet now, two strangers had appeared soundlessly in front of him. Just how terrifying was this?","And there were two of them at that!","He did not say another word, and moved directly. As the saying goes, the one to make the first move wins.","“Brat Yan, are you disrespecting your elders?” Brother Monkey said with a humph. He reached over and grabbed Chen Fengyan’s wrist, rendering him immobile.","Yi?","Chen Fengyan was instantly startled. There was only one person in this world who would call him brat Yan.","“Uncle, Uncle Monkey?” He looked at Brother Monkey, both shocked and delighted.","“It is your Grandpa Sun!” Brother Monkey nodded.","F***.","Chen Fengyan couldn’t help but curse in his mind. ‘You’re my uncle, not my grandfather!’","Brother Monkey’s catchphrase was very aggravating.","“And this is?” Chen Fengyan looked towards Ling Han. He could sense that the aura that was vaguely exuding from Ling Han was also the aura of a Sect Master, and was even stronger than him.","Thus, even in his wildest dreams, he would not link this to Ling Han.","What a joke, it was absolutely impossible, all right?","“This is your Uncle Ling!” Brother Monkey said with a glare. His teeth bared, revealing his ferocious nature.","Ling, Uncle Ling?","Chen Fengyan was confused. Why was there another uncle?","Ling Han cracked a smile, “Brat Yan, you have forgotten me so quickly?”","This voice... was Ling Han!","Chen Fengyan was instantly dumbfounded, his mouth wide open. How was this possible?","He could think of anyone, but definitely wouldn’t think of Ling Han.","At that time, he was already a Spirit Transformation True Lord, but what about Ling Han? He hadn’t even stepped into Celestial Path, and the gap between them could be said to be endless.","Now, he had advanced into Sect Master-level. In terms of time, it was already very fast, less than a hundred years, but in comparison, Ling Han had taken six consecutive steps on the Celestial Path. Wasn’t that a joke?","He could already be considered a prodigy, then what was Ling Han?","Pa!","Brother Monkey gave Chen Fengyan a smack on the back of the head, and said, “What are you standing there for? Hurry up and greet him. Don’t you know how to respect seniority?”","Chen Fengyan was extremely depressed. At first, he had thought that after he had advanced into the level of Sect Master, he could be awesome for a while. Who would have thought that Brother Monkey had also advanced further, and was still completely suppressing him? Furthermore, Ling Han had also advanced to the level of being his equal.","Even if he had experienced great ups and downs in his life, his heart was still slightly unable to accept it.","“Are you really Ling Han?” he asked.","“As true as I can be,” Ling Han said with a nod and a smile.","He could understand Chen Fengyan’s astonishment. According to the cultivation progress of most people, even if they could advance to the level of Sect Master, they would all be in their twilight years. Meanwhile, those like Chen Fengyan were definitely prodigies who had broken through in their prime.","But compared to him, that was practically the speed of a snail.","It could not be helped. Who was Ling Han competing with?","The Golden Generation, as well as Yang Yihuan, and other old prodigies from who knew how many years ago, as well as the Genesis World’s rulers!","This forced him to only have the choice of advancing bravely, and he could not stop for even a moment.","“Are you really a Sect Master?” Chen Fengyan asked dumbly.","Actually, he could sense Ling Han’s aura, but it was really too shocking. He had to confirm it again.","“That’s right.” Ling Han nodded again.","Chen Fengyan sighed and said, “I cultivated for so many years before finally breaking through to the level of Sect Master. You haven’t even reached the level of 100 years, and you’re already on par with me!”","This was really a blow to his pride.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “Wrong. We’re not neck and neck. I’m a Three Star Sect Master. I’m more powerful than you.”","Pu!","Chen Fengyan felt as if his heart had been stabbed a few more times, causing him to feel even worse.","Is it really good for you to bully me like this?","“Hahaha!” Brother Monkey laughed loudly, then said, “Brat Yan, is there anything that you need Old Sun’s help for?”","“Not for the moment,” Chen Fengyan said with a shake of his head. “I’m still accumulating power. When the time is ripe, I’ll lead the Celestial Sea Planet to become independent and rebuild the Chen Clan’s Majestic Empire!”","“Alright.” Brother Monkey nodded, and said to Ling Han, “Brother, let’s go.”","“Uncle Monkey!” Chen Fengyan hurriedly shouted. “You’re leaving just like that?”","“What else?” Brother Monkey turned around and asked. He was the most straightforward in his actions, and hated being sloppy.","“Can’t you be a little more polite?” Chen Fengyan asked in frustration. This Uncle Monkey was far too straightforward. Thankfully, he hadn’t been pretending to be polite just then. Otherwise, he would have definitely been angered to death.","Brother Monkey rolled his eyes, and directly strode away.","Ling Han didn’t leave. Instead, he asked with a serious expression, “How are my descendants and friends?”","“Very good,” Chen Fengyan said with a nod. He didn’t put on any airs. Firstly, Ling Han was his senior, so he had to admit this fact no matter what. Secondly, Ling Han’s cultivation level was actually higher than his, so he also had to maintain his respect for him.","“However, your daughter and son-in-law seem to have left Celestial Sea Planet and gone to some academy on Moonlight Planet,” he added.","Yi, Ling Xi had gone to the Moonlight Planet?","The current Moonlight Planet was no longer the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire’s territory, but a subsidiary planet under the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire’s rule. However, it was once the center of a Majestic Empire, after all, so the Moonlight Planet’s martial arts level was still one of the top few in the nearby galaxies.","It was normal for Ling Xi and Fu Tianxing to go to the Moonlight Planet to cultivate martial arts. After all, the cultivation conditions there were definitely much better than here.","Ling Han nodded before waving at Chen Fengyan and leaving.","Chen Fengyan: “...”","‘Are you guys here just to strike a blow to my pride?’","‘It wasn’t easy for me to advance to the rank of Sect Master, and I thought that I would be able to show off my potential. Now, however, Brother Monkey has advanced to the rank of Venerate Tier, and he’s still superior to me. Moreover, Ling Han is even more exaggerated. He has surpassed him, though he had a late start, and he’s now a Three Star Sect Master.","He was a negative example of failure!","This was too sad.","...","Ling Han first returned to his hometown to visit his old friends that he had brought out of the Genesis World. Meanwhile, descendants like Ling Jianxue and others had stayed on Celestial Sea Planet. With Chen Fengyan taking care of them, he was very at ease.","Seeing Ling Han return, everyone in the Ling Clan, including Karmic Life Heavenly Venerable, Heavenly Venerate Wu Le and so on, were all overjoyed.","Ling Han introduced Brother Monkey to everyone, and briefly related his experiences over the years.","Then, he took out a large amount of alchemical pills and natural treasures, and distributed them to everyone. For him, this was already completely useless, but for Ling Jianxue and the others, it was incredibly precious.","—The fact that these people could come to the new world meant that they had at least cultivated to First Tier Heavenly Venerate in the Genesis World. They had already proven their talent. Thus, after coming to the new world, their cultivation progress was also very rapid.","The one who had improved the fastest was Ji Wuming, and he was already in Cauldron Forging Tier.","However, in the past, Ji Wuming was still Ling Han’s strongest competitor, and now this gap was already extremely wide.","Ling Han made some queries. Ling Xi and Fu Tianxing entered the Silver Moon Academy on Moonlight Planet. They had only gone there three years ago.","His daughter was dear to him, so Ling Han decided go alone to visit his daughter on Moonlight Planet. He would then plan his next course of action."]},{"number":4492,"title":"Chapter 4492: Silver Moon Academy","paragraphs":["Chapter 4492: Silver Moon Academy","Editor: Henyee Translations","There was naturally no need for Brother Monkey to accompany him to visit his daughter.","Ling Han tore open a rip into the Void, and headed towards the Moonlight Planet. After reaching the level of Sect Master, he possessed the ability to tear open the Void.","However, he discovered that this was not as fast as Transfer Formation.","It couldn’t be helped. He was only a Sect Master. After reaching the Venerate Tier, his speed of traversing through the Void would definitely be faster than the Transfer Formation.","However, he had already entered into the Void, so he couldn’t retreat. If he came out halfway, it would be even more impossible. How could there be a Transfer Formation for him to use?","Thus, after spending half a month’s time, Ling Han finally arrived at Moonlight Planet.","...","Things had changed.","Ling Han stood in front of a large city, raising his eyes to look at the city wall. A strong feeling of emotion rose up in his heart.","The first time he came here, he hadn’t even stepped into Celestial Path, but now? He was already Sect Master-level, enough to sweep aside all opposition in the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire.","—This Majestic Empire didn’t have a Venerate Tier elite on standby. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have gone to so much trouble to draw out the old Venerate Tier elite from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire with formations and killing weapons.","Even so, the Venerate Tier elite still managed to escape, leaving a hidden danger.","In the blink of an eye, almost a hundred years had passed. Ordinary people should have almost forgotten about the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire.","Ling Han sighed ruefully for a while, and then entered into the city.","He naturally changed his appearance, and even retracted his aura. With the help of the Soul Forming Technique, even Venerate Tier elites might not be able to recognize him.","What more when it was this kind of remote little planet, where not many people might know who he was.","Ling Han asked around for the location of the Silver Moon Academy, then used the Star Steps. When he reappeared, he had already arrived in another city.","He slowed down. He was only going to visit his daughter. There was no need for him to engage in battle.","As he strolled, he arrived at the Silver Moon Academy.","Yi, there were so many people.","He was just about to ask, when he was forced forward by the people behind him.","“Hurry up, hurry up, the registration deadline is today, hurry up!” The people behind shouted as they pushed and shoved.","The registration was over?","Ling Han followed the crowd and entered the academy.","As it turned out, the Silver Moon Academy was recruiting students recently, and today was the deadline. Thus, those who had come from far away were naturally anxious. No matter what, they had to first register themselves, and as for whether they could pass or not, that would be a matter for the future.","A thought flashed through Ling Han’s mind, and he couldn’t help but smile. Fine, then he would “test” himself into the academy and be classmates with his daughter for a few days.","He obediently followed the others to register. In terms of information, he naturally filled in the words “Han Lin”.","That night, they all made do in the plaza of the academy.","Cultivators were cultivators, after all. If they couldn’t even endure this little bit of hardship, then what was the point of cultivating?","On the morning of the second day, everyone who had registered had gathered. They had registered, and next, it was the academy’s turn to choose from them.","The academy recruited disciples based on natural talent and character.","If one’s natural talent in martial arts was inferior, that would be a waste of resources and time, and if one’s character was inferior, that would be nurturing a future disaster.","However, it was very difficult to judge one’s character with one’s eyes. Furthermore, one could also disguise one’s character. As the saying goes, time reveals one’s true character. It was definitely not something that could be determined in a few days.","“I heard that the quota for recruitment this time is extremely limited, only a hundred.”","“Only a hundred?”","“Sigh, then I definitely have no chance!”","Those who were well-informed were whispering the information they had found out, which caused a heated discussion.","However, no one gave up.","They had come filled with hope, so it was naturally impossible that they would run away with their tails between their legs without even competing.","And what if?","“This time, a few super geniuses will also be coming, such as Ding Liang, Yi Zimo, and Fang Feibai. They are all famous!”","“What, even these people are here?”","“Hey, hey, hey. Why are they joining us? Shouldn’t they have been specially recruited by the academy?”","“Hehe, I heard that it was Ding Liang that insisted on participating in the fair selection to prove his own strength. With his actions, Yi Zimo and Fang Feibai also gave up the spots for special recruitment, and insisted on participating in the selection together.”","“Oh no, there were only a hundred spots in the first place, and now there are three less spots!”","Everyone sighed. They knew themselves well. No matter what, they could not possibly be a match for the three of them.","“Let’s just look at the divisions. As long as we’re not in the same division as them, we still have a chance of qualifying.”","It wasn’t long before a teacher from the academy came over to announce the rules of the tournament. The registrants were divided into 10 divisions, and 20 people would qualify from each division. The top five from each division would be directly accepted into the academy, while the remaining would compete for the remaining half of the spots.","Next, it was time for the divisions.","Ding Liang, Yi Zimo, and Fang Feibai had all become seeded competitors without any doubt, and would definitely not be assigned to the same area. Furthermore, there were also some other young prodigies that were well-known, and they were evenly distributed among the divisions.","After others were announced to be in the same division as Ding Liang and the others, they all wore distressed expressions. This meant that there would be one less spot for them to enter directly into the academy.","It wasn’t long before everyone finished splitting up.","Ling Han was relatively “lucky”. He didn’t have any particularly famous people in his division, so about 400 people in this group were all rubbing their hands in anticipation, preparing to go all out and fight for the top five spots.","“Hehe, I, Qian Bing, have reserved a place!” A young man laughed loudly.","“Qian Bing?”","“Who is it?”","“Ah, it seems to be a very famous prodigy from Pu’an Town.”","“He’s just from a small town, so what’s so impressive about him!”","Everyone was discussing spiritedly, and Qian Bing was proud. He provoked everyone, and said, “If anyone is dissatisfied, I will beat him into submission now!”","“I’m not convinced!” Immediately, someone rushed up, but Qian Bing only used one move, and that person was knocked down onto the ground.","Hiss, everyone was stunned. Whether this was an elite or not, they would know once they made their move.","This Qian Bing could not be underestimated.","Seeing that he had intimidated everyone, Qian Bing couldn’t help but feel proud of himself. Previously, he had been hiding all this while, and that was why he had gained some fame. His aim was to amaze the world with a single feat. Otherwise, he was sure that his fame would definitely not be inferior to Yi Zimo and the others.","‘Hmm?’","He looked towards Ling Han, and saw that this person was completely unperturbed, as if he had not taken that stunning feat from him to heart at all.","Qian Bing was instantly displeased, but before he could fly into a rage, the teachers of the Academy came over, warning them not to make a move in private. Otherwise, they would all be disqualified from the tournament.","This caused Qian Bing to not dare to act recklessly, but the gaze he directed at Ling Han was already filled with animosity.","Everyone saw this, and all sighed ruefully for Ling Han, thinking that this was really an undeserved calamity, and Qian Bing was really too petty.","Next, it was time to test natural talent, which would be carried out division by division.","Ling Han casually dealt with this. His aptitude wasn’t too bad, nor was it too good. It was quite standard, and in Qian Bing’s case, his natural talent in martial arts was actually the highest grade of A!","Of course, this was only the judgement standard of the Silver Moon Academy. If it was Ling Han, this kind of aptitude would just barely qualify him to enter Spirit Transformation True Lord-level.","After Qian Bing’s test was over, he showed Ling Han an arrogant smile.","“Humph!”"]},{"number":4493,"title":"Chapter 4493: It’s raining, so it is time to spank the child","paragraphs":["Chapter 4493: It’s raining, so it is time to spank the child","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han merely smiled faintly. With his present height, would he take a minor cultivator that had just stepped into Celestial Path to heart?","If he was displeased, he could just crush him to death with a single finger.","After the first round of the test, everyone was given a mark. Qian Bing took first place, while Ling Han was stuck in the twenties. If he was not careful, he would be eliminated, but if he improved any further, he would be able to pass.","The second test was comprehension.","The teacher from the academy was teaching a sword technique on the spot. Whoever could accurately repeat the performance would be able to pass, so the shorter the time, the better.","With Ling Han’s strength and comprehension ability, he could use this kind of sword technique after seeing it once. However, he didn’t want to show off, and only deduced his path of martial arts in his mind.","...","In a short while, Qian Bing stepped forward to practice. Though there was a slight error, he still passed the test.","He was extremely pleased with himself. He had gotten first place in two consecutive rounds, so he should be the undisputed number one in this division.","When he looked at Ling Han again, a cold smile curled up the corners of his lips. Whether Ling Han would be chosen by the academy or not, he would make him suffer greatly.","The second, the third... people gradually learnt the sword technique, and passed.","When about twenty people had passed the test, Ling Han also walked forwards. Using his foot to raise his sword, he very casually cast the sword technique.","This naturally meant that he had successfully passed the test.","He did it casually, but that teacher from the Academy was shocked.","That was because he discovered that Ling Han’s use of this sword technique was really too proficient. He was even more proficient than he was. Furthermore, there was a small weakness in the sword technique. That was caused by his habit, and could not be changed no matter what.","The others also copied this shortcoming, and only Ling Han was an exception. He had corrected this shortcoming.","Yi?","Was this a coincidence, or was it that this boy’s natural talent in cultivation was astonishing, and he had taken the initiative to make up for it?","He couldn’t help but take a second look at Ling Han.","Qian Bing also discovered this, and couldn’t help but feel angry.","He was the first to pass, and he didn’t see how much attention this teacher had to him. Why would he focus his attention on an insignificant person?","Qian Bing naturally did not dare to resent the teacher of the Academy, and this debt was once again placed on Ling Han’s tab.","After two rounds, a considerable number of people were sighing. They had fallen behind the top thirty, so even if they achieved a very good result in the last round, it would be useless. They would not be able to improve their ranking at all.","The third round, and also the last round, was actual battle.","“You guys can choose your opponents, and then battle. I will grade you based on your performance,” the teacher from the academy said.","Everyone hurriedly went to form their own teams, looking for those that were evenly matched. Otherwise, they would definitely be asking for trouble.","“You!” Qian Bing pointed at Ling Han, “Be my opponent.”","This was really a good opportunity.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Sure.”","This was a rainy day, so there was nothing better to do1.","“Those who have found a good opponent can come over now and start first,” the teacher from the academy said.","“I’ll go first!” Qian Bing called out loudly, and walked out.","Ling Han was very casual as he walked out as well.","“He’s done for!”","“In the first place, this guy was only ranked around twentieth. At first, he had a chance of qualifying, but he would definitely be no match for Qian Bing. If he was horribly defeated, how many points would he get?”","“What an undeserved calamity!”","“Shh, lower your voice.”","No one was optimistic about Ling Han, because Qian Bing had already displayed his strength in the previous two tests.","“Brat, do you regret it now?” Qian Bing smirked coldly.","Ling Han shook his head and said, “If you can fight, then stop blabbering.”","W-where did you get such courage from?","Qian Bing faltered for a moment, then burst out laughing balefully, “Brat, though you are pitifully stupid, I still have to admire your courage.”","He strode towards Ling Han, raising his right hand high. He would definitely let Ling Han know what pain and regret was.","He stretched out his right palm, and delivered a harsh slap at Ling Han.","Ling Han also shot out a palm strike. It was light, and it looked like he didn’t have any power at all.","Pa! However, his palm strike arrived first even though he had acted later. It landed crisply on Qian Bing’s face.","As expected, this palm strike really did not have much power. It only caused Qian Bing to sway slightly, but it was this sway that caused Qian Bing’s attack to miss its target.","Hiss!","Those who were watching the battle were all astounded. In fact, they actually felt that it was terrifying.","If it had to be said that Ling Han possessed boundless strength, and sent Qian Bing flying with a single slap, everyone could still accept that. After all, it was because Ling Han had an advantage in cultivation level. In the cultivation world, a higher cultivation level being superior to a lower cultivation level was absolutely normal.","However, the problem was that the force behind Ling Han’s palm strike was too small. It was so small that it only caused Qian Bing to sway slightly.","What was even more terrifying was that with just a sway, Qian Bing’s attack missed its target.","Was this a coincidence?","If that wasn’t the case, then just how skilled was Ling Han’s control over his power?","Their scalps went numb. The more they thought about it, the more terrifying it was.","Meanwhile, Qian Bing was furious. This slap was completely harmless to him, but being slapped in the face in full public, how could he swallow this kind of humiliation?","“You deserve to die!” It was as if he had gone mad, as he attacked Ling Han with all his might.","However, to say nothing of the fact that he had just stepped onto the Celestial Path, even if he was also a Sect Master like Ling Han, Ling Han could still deal with him however he wanted. There was no difficulty at all, all right?","Pa! Pa! Pa!","Ling Han casually waved his palm, but the crisp sound of slaps rang out repeatedly, endlessly.","In everyone’s eyes, Ling Han was really too relaxed. It was clearly just a casual palm strike, and should have been very easy to dodge, but it was as if Qian Bing was retarded, and actually took the initiative to lean forwards.","This was too strange. While everyone was stunned by the sight, they couldn’t help but feel their hair stand on end.","Qian Bing was defiant. As he saw it, both Ling Han’s power and speed were inferior to his, but it just so happened that Ling Han seemed to possess some kind of evil technique, and he could not hit him no matter what.","Hence, he gritted his teeth tightly, and thought that as long as he could seize a chance, and successfully counterattack, Ling Han would become a piece of meat on the chopping block, at his mercy.","Unfortunately, this kind of scene would never happen.","“Alright, stop.” In the end, the teacher could no longer bear to watch, and called a halt to the battle.","Though Ling Han’s slaps were not heavy every time, they still had some weight, after all. After several dozen to several hundred palm strikes, both sides of Qian Bing’s face were already very swollen, and it was a tragic sight.","Qian Bing had no choice but to stop. He stared at Ling Han, his eyes burning with fire, as if he wanted to devour him.","Even now, he still did not think that he was weaker than Ling Han, but rather that the latter had mastered some kind of evil technique.","“Next pair,” the teacher of the Academy called out.","After spending half a day’s time, the actual combat test finally ended, and after three rounds, the top twenty of each division had also been decided.","In Ling Han’s division, Qian Bing did not manage to get first place.","The battle that he had lost to Ling Han was really too humiliating, but thankfully, it was not because he was weak, but rather because Ling Han was too strong. Thus, he was still ranked in the top five.","It was the same for Ling Han. With his performance in the last round, he managed to squeeze into the top five, and was directly selected into the academy. There was no further need for him to participate in the semi-finals.","C"]},{"number":4494,"title":"Chapter 4494: Bullying My Daughter?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4494: Bullying My Daughter?","Editor: Henyee Translations","The top fifty were brought to the dormitory area of the academy by a teacher. They were all relatively good seedlings, and would be heavily nurtured in future.","Ling Han walked out slowly in the Academy, searching for his beloved daughter.","Behind him, Qian Bing followed quietly.","He was dissatisfied. Originally, he should have been first place, but now, he had not managed to amaze the world with a single brilliant feat like he had planned. Thus, he hated Ling Han very much.","He was naturally tailing Ling Han secretly because he wanted to wait for Ling Han to walk to some secluded corner, and then take advantage of the opportunity to beat Ling Han up.","Otherwise, how could he swallow this injustice?","...","The other’s strength was definitely not as strong as his. He was just relying on his evil arts. Thus, if he attacked from behind, he would definitely be able to make Ling Han have no time to cast his evil arts.","The academy was very big. Ling Han slightly stimulated his divine sense, and soon located Ling Xi.","A smile curled up the corners of his lips. Then, he headed in that direction.","Not long after, he arrived in front of a dense forest.","Ling Xi was here.","‘Hmm?’","He faltered slightly, and saw a figure fly past in the skies, also falling into the dense forest.","Those who could fly with their physical bodies were at least at the Core Formation Tier.","With a thought from Ling Han, he spread out his divine sense, and had a panoramic view of everything in the dense forest.","‘F*ck! Why aren’t you going in?’","Behind him, Qian Bing was scratching his head. If Ling Han entered into the dense forest, he would immediately sneak over and launch a sneak attack, giving Ling Han a harsh beating.","But now, though there were few people in the surroundings, there were still people who could see him. He had no wish to leave behind any witnesses.","—If it was only him and Ling Han, then it would only be their one-sided retelling of events.","It couldn’t be helped. He couldn’t rush Ling Han, so he could only hope in his heart that this guy would quickly enter the forest.","In the dense forest.","Ling Xi was practicing her sword techniques. She had already advanced into the Core Formation Tier, and it hadn’t even been a hundred years, yet she had already advanced from a mortal to the third level of the Celestial Path. The speed of her advancement could only be described as rapid.","As expected of Ling Han’s daughter!","Xiu, a figure descended. It was a man dressed in a tight-fitting suit of treasured blue, carrying a treasured sword on his back. His black hair draped over his shoulders, and the contours of his face were as if they had been sliced by a saber, appearing to be filled with heroic spirit.","When Ling Xi saw this, she immediately put away her sword, clasped her hands and said, “Senior Brother Qi.”","This man in the treasured blue outfit had the surname of Qi, and his given name was Wuwei. He was a prodigy in the Silver Moon Academy.","He looked at Ling Xi, smiled, and said, “Junior Sister is practicing her sword technique.”","Wasn’t that nonsense?","Ling Xi merely smiled faintly, and did not continue the conversation. Her meaning was very clear. If there was nothing else, you may leave.","Yet Qi Wuwei did not have that kind of awareness. He stared at Ling Xi, his eyes filled with undisguised adoration, “Junior Sister, your natural talent in cultivation is truly amazing. I remember that when you first entered into the academy, you were only a Second Cauldron, but now, you have already advanced into the level of the Core Formation Tier. This advancement is truly amazing.”","Yet Ling Xi looked impatient, “If there is nothing else, Senior Brother Qi, then I have to concentrate on my sword training!”","Qi Wuwei didn’t show any displeasure even though he had been given a cold shoulder. He was naturally aware of Ling Xi’s personality. He smiled slightly, and said, “Junior Sister, have you considered the matter I told you about last time?”","Killing intent instantly appeared in Ling Xi’s beautiful eyes. She had always been gentle and kind to others, but if anyone thought that she really did not have a temper, that would be a great mistake.","Because she was Ling Han’s daughter!","“Senior Brother Qi, I’ve already explained everything clearly to you last time. Very clearly!” Her attitude turned cold. “I’m a married woman. Please watch your words and conduct yourself with honour, Senior Brother Qi!”","“Junior Sister, I really like you!” Qi Wuwei hurriedly said. “I don’t mind that you’re already married. Really, I don’t mind at all!”","With how beautiful she was, and how astonishing her natural talent in cultivation was, he naturally wouldn’t mind.","“I mind!” Ling Xi said coldly, “Now, you can leave!”","She didn’t say scram, so she was already being polite enough.","Qi Wuwei also showed a cold expression. After being repeatedly rejected, he had already lost his patience.","“Ling Xi,don’t be ungrateful!” he said balefully. “Who am I? The son of Great General Hengtian, Qi Longtu, under the Ninth King, stationed on Moonlight Planet of Shadow Moon Majestic Empire! The fact that I favor you is something that is due to the fortune that your ancestors have accumulated over eight lifetimes!”","“Get lost!” Ling Xi pointed outside the dense forest. She was also completely enraged.","“Humph, if you still don’t obey me this time, I’ll kill your man!” Qi Wuwei said. “He’s nothing but a Core Formation Tier cultivator. With the strength of our General’s Residence, it’ll be as easy as blowing off dust!”","“You!” Ling Xi was both furious and irritated. She had not thought that Qi Wuwei would actually use such a shameless underhanded move.","“How about it?” Qi Wuwei didn’t want to use this move either. This way, he would only be able to obtain Ling Xi’s body and temporary obedience, and he was greedy, so he wanted even more.","However, if he couldn’t obtain even her body, how could he obtain her heart?","Ling Xi remained silent. She naturally couldn’t agree. However, what could be done to help her and Fu Tianxing successfully escape from the Moonlight Planet?","“You don’t have much time, and my patience is also limited,” Qi Wuwei pressed further.","“Hehe, I have not managed to accumulate such good fortune in these seven lifetimes!” Ling Han moved, and had already appeared in the dense forest, as he said calmly.","Yi?","Qian Bing was stunned. Why had Ling Han disappeared?","He hurriedly set off in pursuit, arriving at the edge of the dense forest. Then, he carefully entered.","And in the dense forest, after hearing Ling Han’s voice, Ling Xi immediately looked excited.","How could she not recognize her father’s voice?","Now was the time when she was the most helpless, but her father appeared at the right time, making her feel warm and instantly have someone to lean on.","All this while, she had been filled with confidence in her father. As long as Ling Han appeared, there was nothing that could not be resolved!","This was the truth, and also a daughter’s admiration for her father.","“Who are you?” Qi Wuwei was taken aback. Why had someone suddenly barged in?","Seven lifetimes?","‘You’re not Ling Xi’s senior, are you? Oh, he said eight lifetimes just now, and now you’ve subtracted one generation?’","He said impatiently, “Before I lose my temper, get lost immediately!”","However, the scene that followed caused his face to turn livid.","Ling Xi pounced out like birds flying into the forest, falling into Ling Han’s arms, still hugging him tightly.","F***!","Qi Wuwei flew into a thunderous rage, and felt an indescribable disappointment.","He had always thought that Ling Xi was a chaste woman. No matter how much he tempted her, she would not fall for him at all. But now? She was actually throwing herself into the arms of an unfamiliar man!","This was definitely not Fu Tianxing!","F***, so you are this kind of slut. You actually still dare to pretend to be aloof in front of him. How shameless.","Ling Han patted his daughter’s shoulder before turning to Qi Wuwei and saying, “Commit suicide!”","To actually dare threaten his daughter, that was naturally a suicidal action.","At this time, Qian Bing had also sneaked in. He looked over through the closely packed leaves, and couldn’t help but inhale sharply.","That was Qi Wuwei! How could he not recognize him? He was a true prodigy!","Ling Han... actually dared to oppose Qi Wuwei?"]},{"number":4495,"title":"Chapter 4495: Calling me a hero","paragraphs":["Chapter 4495: Calling me a hero","Editor: Henyee Translations","Qi Wuwei couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself.","“Where does your confidence come from?” He shook his head, “Do you know who I am?”","“You’re a corpse,” Ling Han said calmly. “No matter who you were when you were alive, you’re a corpse after death. No one will care who you are!”","“Impudence!” Qi Wuwei humphed. Looking at the clothes that Ling Han was wearing, he came to a sudden realization, and said, “I know. Today is the day that the academy is recruiting new students, and you’re not wearing the same attire, which means that you’ve just entered the academy.”","He came to his senses. No wonder Ling Han was so arrogant, and did not take him seriously at all. As it turned out, he was a pure rookie.","However, this made him even angrier.","...","He was clearly just a rookie, yet Ling Xi Xi had thrown herself into his arms. In comparison, what was he worth? He couldn’t even compare to a rookie?","How could he not explode in fury?","‘You b*tch, even if you want to find a man, you should find someone higher-level!’","“You’re truly seeking death!” Qi Wuwei said balefully, his killing intent intertwining.","As he spoke, he even glanced in Qian Bing’s direction. Did he think that he had not noticed?","How naive!","This glance caused Qian Bing’s heart to beat wildly. Though he was conceited, he had self-awareness. There was absolutely no way he could compare to Qi Wuwei, whether it was in terms of himself or his background.","It was clear that he thought that he was allies with Ling Han.","He had been wronged. If he was killed by Qi Wuwei because of this, he would really not be able to rest in peace even if he died.","However, being swept by the eyes of a Core Formation Tier cultivator, his heart shivered, and he couldn’t move a single finger, let alone turn around and flee.","Oh no, he was done for, he screamed in his heart.","At first, he had only wanted to teach Ling Han a lesson, but now? It seemed like he was about to suffer great misfortune.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “You’re not going to choose, right? Then I can only help you make your decision.”","“You’re seeking death!” Qi Wuwei roared as he charged at Ling Han. He launched a palm strike, not minding killing Ling Han at all. With his background, he could easily deal with the aftermath.","Boom, he sent out a palm strike, and the battle prowess of the Core Formation Tier was unleashed.","Ling Han extended a finger, and with a light flick, peng, a force instantly pierced through Qi Wuwei’s forehead, penetrating out from behind, bringing with it a fountain of blood.","Qi Wuwei’s eyes widened. He could not believe it at all. He was actually no match for Ling Han.","A mere new student, you are just a new student!","With this kind of unwillingness, he collapsed loudly, his vitality completely extinguished.","‘F*ck!’","Not far away, Qian Bing was almost scared out of his wits.","What had he seen?","Qi Wuwei had actually been killed in a single move by Ling Han!","Gods, what abilities did this guy have that a Core Formation Tier couldn’t even withstand a single blow from him?","Furthermore, he was done for!","Qi Wuwei had died, so he should have been happy. He wouldn’t be dragged into this mess, but would Ling Han spare him?","He would definitely be killed to keep the secret.","Yet Ling Han did not take Qi Wuwei to heart at all. He smiled brightly at Ling Xi and asked, “Have you suffered any grievances?”","“I’m fine.” Ling Xi shook her head. Since she and Fu Tianxing came out to roam the world, they were prepared to face difficulties. However, Qi Wuwei was too despicable, so she didn’t know how to deal with him at this moment.","“Let’s go.” Ling Han patted his daughter’s shoulder. It had to be said that he was prejudiced. Among all his children, he doted on this daughter the most.","“En.” Ling Xi nodded.","The father and daughter duo strode off, neither taking Qi Wuwei’s death seriously, and simply allowed the other’s corpse to lie there.","After a long while, Qian Bing finally collapsed onto the ground.","“I, I’m actually still alive?” He breathed heavily, feeling that his whole body was completely drenched.","How could Ling Han not have discovered him?","Impossible!","Even Qi Wuwei had discovered traces of him, so how could Ling Han, who was even stronger than Qi Wuwei, not have noticed?","Yet the other had not killed him. This was blatant contempt.","At first, Qian Bing was still feeling a little fortunate, but now, his expression was twisted.","He was completely ignored.","This kind of disregard was the greatest humiliation to him. The other party did not mind his existence at all, and disdained from killing him to keep him quiet.","“Damn it! Damn it!” He clenched his fists, the veins on his neck popping, “You will definitely regret this! Not killing me is the greatest mistake of your life!”","He strode toward where the higher-ups of the academy were.","He was going to tell on him. Humph, if he killed Qi Wuwei, could it be that he could stay out of it and just leave?","‘Die.’","...","“Father, is it all right?” After walking for a while, Ling Xi suddenly asked.","“It’s fine.” Ling Han shook his head.","“What if the Qi Clan comes looking for us?” she asked again.","“Then I’ll kill them all,” Ling Han said calmly. “The reason why that criminal dared to threaten you is because of his background. So be it if I didn’t take the initiative to seek them out for an accounting. If they continue to pester me, then don’t blame me for being ruthless!”","How protective he was of his own people, and this was more so his beloved daughter. Now, someone was using underhanded means to coerce his beloved daughter, so how could he not be furious?","However, he wasn’t a god of death, after all, so he wouldn’t do such a thing. However, if the Qi Clan insisted on not knowing what was good for them, that would be exactly what he wanted.","When they returned to Ling Xi’s quarters, Fu Tianxing just happened to walk out. Seeing Ling Xi holding the arm of an unfamiliar man so cordially, he faltered for a moment, then revealed a joyful expression, “Father-in-law!”","He had absolute trust in Ling Xi. Thus, to be able to make Ling Xi hold onto his arm without any reservations, who else could it be but Ling Han?","It was not a problem at all for the appearance to not match. Those above Celestial Path could easily change their appearance.","Ling Han nodded. This Fu Tianxing had also advanced into the Core Formation Tier, and his abilities were no weaker than Ling Xi.","He had always had a high opinion of this disciple of his, and Fu Tianxing had not disappointed his expectations either.","After entering the room, Ling Xi couldn’t help but ask Ling Han about his experiences over the years.","Ling Han related some important experiences, then took out a large amount of natural treasures and stuffed them towards the two of them. It was enough to help Ling Xi and her husband charge up to the True Self Tier.","Right at this moment, a commotion was heard from outside.","“The people inside, come out quickly!” someone shouted loudly.","Fu Tianxing faltered for a moment. After entering the Silver Moon Academy with Ling Xi, he had always kept a low profile. Why were they suddenly provoked?","What was going on?","Meanwhile, Ling Xi explained, “Father killed Qi Wuwei!”","“Good kill!” Fu Tianxing immediately clapped his hands, “That b@stard keeps looking at you strangely. Could it be that he wanted to do something to you this time, and Father-in-law just happened to see him?”","His guess was really accurate.","Ling Han stood up, pushed open the doors and walked out.","“You’re the murderer who killed Qi Wuwei?” There were about a dozen over people at the entrance, and the person in the lead was about forty years old. When he saw Ling Han walk out, he immediately shouted.","“Murderer?” Ling Han shook his head, “You have used the wrong word. I am not the murderer.”","En, who else could it be but you?","“That’s him!” Qian Bing hurriedly jumped out, and pointed at Ling Han with his right hand. He emphasized this to the middle-aged man, looking like he was afraid that Ling Han would deny it.","Ling Han smiled, and said, “Don’t be excited, don’t be excited. I was indeed the one who killed him, but you should call me the hero who eliminated evil for the people!”"]},{"number":4496,"title":"Chapter 4496: Rebels?","paragraphs":["Chapter 4496: Rebels?","Editor: Henyee Translations","Hero?","The middle-aged man was furious. Pointing at Ling Han, he asked, “Do you know who Qi Wuwei is?”","“I don’t know,” Ling Han replied with a shake of his head. “I’m not interested either.”","He had killed even the Golden Generation just like that, so who else in the world would he not dare to kill?","Furthermore, to dare covet and threaten his daughter, that was definitely seeking death.","“Qi Wuwei is the only son of Great General Hengtian, Qi Longtu!” the middle-aged man said loudly. “The Great General Hengtian is the strongest general under the Ninth King. You killed Qi Wuwei, and this is a great calamity that you have brought onto yourself!”","...","At this moment, Qian Bing leaned over and muttered softly.","Hearing these words, the middle-aged man’s expression changed drastically again.","“You’re actually a new student that was only recruited by the academy today?” He was stunned. Being able to insta-kill Qi Wuwei, what need was there for him to be tested? He would definitely be directly recruited.","So, why did he hide his cultivation level when he clearly had such powerful strength? What was his purpose?","Was he deliberately targeting Qi Wuwei?","Or... was he trying to use Qi Wuwei to attack Great General Hengtian, and directly target the Ninth King?","It should be known that though the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire had been destroyed for close to a hundred years, there were still some people who had not given up on their evil intentions, and wanted to rebuild it.","“You’re a rebel!” The middle-aged man was certain of Ling Han’s identity. This shocked him greatly, and he hurriedly used Galaxy Network to contact the other leaders of the academy. Perhaps, the person in front of him wasn’t someone he could deal with.","Although he was at the True Self Tier, it was said that there was no shortage of Spiritual Infant Tier cultivators among the rebels. Moreover, Ling Han dared to come alone, and he even dared to publicly commit murder, which proved that he was confident in his own strength.","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself. “When did I become a rebel? You’re really funny!”","He paused for a moment, then continued, “If there’s nothing important, then kneel down.”","Kneel your sister!","The middle-aged man naturally couldn’t kneel. He was a leader of the academy, and from a certain aspect, he also represented the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire. How could he kneel in front of rebels?","“Don’t be arrogant. The Great General Hengtian has already received the news, and will arrive soon,” he said darkly.","“Oh.” Ling Han nodded, killing intent flashing through his eyes.","If this Great General Hengtian also shouted about killing and fighting as soon as he arrived, then he would just kill one more person.","Right at this moment, a dozen over people were seen rapidly approaching from afar.","“Who killed my cousin!” Among these people, the leader was a man in embroidered robes. He was dignified and authoritative, and also had an indescribable murderous aura, intimidating people just by looking at him. However, a young man rushed out and shouted at Ling Han.","The middle-aged man from the academy turned around to glance at him. He hurriedly clasped his hands and said, “Greetings, General Liu.”","The leading man in fine clothes was a fierce general under the command of the Great General Hengtian. His surname was Liu, and his name was Luo. Though they were both in the True Self Tier, he had battled his whole life, and his battle prowess had been adequately tempered through actual battle. If the two of them were to exchange blows, he would probably be killed within ten moves.","Moreover, his status was higher than his, so even if their cultivation levels were similar, he still appeared very respectful.","Liu Luo nodded, and his eyes fell on Ling Han. As a general who had experienced hundreds of battles, his insight was naturally good. With a single glance, he had set his eyes on Ling Han.","However, he frowned. He actually couldn’t see through Ling Han’s cultivation level.","Could it be that this brat’s cultivation level was superior to his?","Impossible!","How old was this boy? No matter how talented he was, how could he have advanced to the level of Spirit Transformation True Lord at such a young age?","Thus, he immediately suppressed the little bit of unease in his heart.","The young man from before was extremely lively. In any case, there were several True Self Tier elites here, so what did he have to fear?","“You’re dead! You’re dead!” He pointed at Ling Han, and said, “You actually dared to kill my cousin! Humph! How audacious!”","Though he was rebuking angrily, there was an indescribable joy in his heart.","Because there were very few members of the Qi Clan, aside from Qi Wuwei, he was the only other member of this generation. Now that Qi Wuwei was dead, wouldn’t he become the focused target of nurturing?","For a long time, he wanted nothing more than for something to happen to Qi Wuwei. He wanted nothing more than for Qi Wuwei to die young, but he could only dream about it. He did not dare make any move at all.","Unexpectedly, his daydream had actually come true.","So how could he not be overjoyed?","How could he not be elated?","Ling Han glanced at him, and said with a smile, “Looking at your secretly pleased expression, you’ve long since wanted Qi Wuwei to die, right?”","F***, how could you tell?","The young man was shocked, but it was naturally impossible for him to admit it. Hurriedly, he said, “Nonsense! I have a close brotherhood with Wuwei, and want nothing more than to die on his behalf!”","Ling Han smiled, and said, “It’s impossible for you to die in his place. However, I can do you a good deed, and send you to the underworld to accompany this cousin of yours.”","This, you are too arrogant, aren’t you? There are so many elites here!","Liu Luo’s expression was also cold, as he said, “Young man, you are too arrogant! With me here, aside from kneeling down to accept your death, there is nothing else you can do!”","He was about to make a move!","Qian Bing was extremely expectant. Though Qi Wuwei had been insta-killed by Ling Han with a single move from Ling Han, this General Liu was a True Self Tier elite, and that was definitely different.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and said, “I’ll kill him, and you can try and stop me.”","The young man from the Qi Clan was truly arrogant. He placed his hands on his hips and said, “I’ll stand here and not move. Let’s see how you’ll kill me!”","With several elites standing guard, how could it be that they would just sit by and watch?","Ling Han stretched out a finger, and very casually flicked his finger. A strong force shot towards that young man from the Qi Clan.","“How dare you!” Liu Luo was furious, and sent out a palm strike, intending to destroy this force.","However, when the palm swept past, that force was completely unaffected.","What!","With a ‘pu’, the strong force had already penetrated through the head of the young man from the Qi Clan.","The young man looked at Ling Han in disbelief. Even now, he still couldn’t believe that he was really going to die.","How was this possible? Impossible!","If he had known... he wouldn’t have put on such airs.","The last thought flashed through his mind. Then, he collapsed to the ground, dead.","Seeing this scene, a great many people inhaled sharply.","Hiss, just how strong was this guy?","If he wanted to kill someone, even True Self Tier elites wouldn’t be able to stop him?","Qian Bing’s legs were trembling, and he was sweating profusely.","He was scared to death.","Even True Self Tier elites couldn’t stop Ling Han; just how strong was this guy?","He actually dared to tattletale and report the news, and was even jumping around happily in front of Ling Han. He was really tired of living.","He was about to cry. ‘You’re so awesome, so why do you have to impersonate some new student?’","After a long while, Liu Luo finally recovered. He stared at Ling Han, and asked, “Who exactly are you, sir?”","This was very likely a Spirit Transformation True Lord!","Though it was practically unimaginable that there was such a young Spirit Transformation True Lord would, this was the only possibility. Otherwise, his attack just now would have affected the force he delivered, and not be completely ineffective."]},{"number":4497,"title":"Chapter 4497: This is what killing intent is","paragraphs":["Chapter 4497: This is what killing intent is","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han still hadn’t answered, and he raised his head to look at the sky.","Xiu, a figure tore through the air and arrived, then suddenly landed on the ground.","A frightening killing intent boiled, as if it was solid, causing one’s heart to tremble in fear.","This was a middle-aged man who was fully dressed in armor. There was also a scar from his left eye to the corner of his lips on his face, which added a hint of toughness to his appearance.","He wore a bright red cloak that billowed in the night wind, his divine might awe-inspiring.","Great General Hengtian, Qi Longtu.","...","“Greetings, Great General!” Instantly, those people from the academy, including Liu Luo, all knelt down in front of Qi Longtu.","This was... a Spirit Transformation True Lord!","Spirit Transformation Tier—no matter where they were, they were qualified to be called elites and have respected status.","Qi Longtu raised his hand, indicating for everyone to stand up. His eyes were fixed on Ling Han.","What he saw gave him a shock.","He actually couldn’t see through Ling Han.","How was this possible?","This young man’s vitality was exuberant, and his life force was astonishing. He was truly young, and could only be a few hundred years old.","However, he was only a few hundred years old, yet he was already able to cultivate to the Spiritual Transformation Tier and become his equal?","If Chen Fengyan were to find out about this, he would definitely say in a leisurely manner that it was impossible for them to be on equal footing. In fact, it would be impossible for them to be on equal footing in this lifetime.","“Who would’ve thought? You’re so young, yet you’ve already reached the Spiritual Transformation Tier!” Qi Longtu said in a dignified voice.","Everyone was shocked. What? Ling Han was actually a Spiritual Transformation Tier elite!","Others might have seen wrongly, but how could the Great General Hengtian have seen wrongly?","Heavens, such a young Spiritual Transformation Tier elite?","“However, do you think that just because you have cultivated to the Spiritual Transformation Tier, you can strut around in our Empire?” Qi Longtu couldn’t help but laugh coldly, “Too naive!”","Though this was a subsidiary planet of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire, it was a very important subsidiary planet. That was why they had sent the Ninth King to stand guard here. That was a Sect Master-level elite, and Six Stars at that!","With the Ninth King keeping watch, all demons and monsters would have to retreat.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “Since the main culprit is here, let’s have a chat! Your son does evil, and I’m exterminating evil for the people. How do you plan to thank me?”","W-what?","Everyone was dumbfounded, and couldn’t help but grin.","What kind of joke was this?","You killed his son, and still want him to thank you?","Crazy, he must have gone crazy!","Qi Longtu sneered repeatedly, “Young man, I admit that your natural talent in martial arts is astonishing. You have cultivated to the Spiritual Transformation Tier at such a young age. However, the result of rapid cultivation would definitely be an unstable foundation!”","“I’ve killed tens of thousands of people, and all of them are elites. Can you block such killing intent alone?”","His expression suddenly became stern. Boom, a surging killing intent surged out, instantly causing the knees of the people in the surroundings to go weak, and they all collapsed onto the ground.","This was too terrifying; this was the God of Slaughter!","However, this killing intent was negligible to Ling Han. He shook his head, and said with a smile, “Is this your killing intent?”","Qi Longtu was startled. Yi, why was it completely ineffective against Ling Han?","He was experienced on the battlefield, and his killing intent was almost tangible. Under his barrage, cultivators at the same cultivation level would definitely be affected.","“You!” He stared at Ling Han, and a coldness suddenly rose up in his heart.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Then you can also test out my killing intent.”","Weng, the barrage of murderous aura shot out.","Qi Longtu’s mind was instantly destroyed, and his eyes also dilated in an instant. There was no longer any spirit left in them.","Peng, he fell headfirst onto the ground. His blood-red cloak was still fluttering slightly, but it was difficult to show his heroic bearing on the battlefield again.","A dead silence fell.","The Great General Hengtian, the strongest general under the Ninth King, died just like that?","It was so easy, and there was no intense battle at all. He had died without a sound?","This! This, this, this, this!","Everyone was scared out of their wits, especially Qian Bing. Not only did his legs go weak, he even lost control of his bladder, and his eyes had also become clouded.","“Hahaha!” He suddenly laughed loudly, “I am invincible in this world! I am the Great Emperor Peerless!”","He suddenly got to his feet, and as he danced, he continued to run madly.","Crazy, he had actually gone mad from fear.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Everyone, the show is over, so what are you still gathered here for? Do you want me to treat you guys to supper?”","Subconsciously, everyone shook their heads.","What supper? At present, they only wanted to get as far away from this bringer of calamity as possible.","They hadn’t left before, firstly, because it had been too sudden, and have still yet to recover from their shock. Secondly, they didn’t dare to leave. Ling Han could insta-kill a Spirit Transformation True Lord, and if he didn’t say a word, who would dare to leave?","Now that Ling Han had spoken up to let them go, they naturally all hurriedly stood up and broke into a run.","Ling Han shot out a few streaks of flames, burning the corpses on the ground completely. What treasures could these people have on them? He couldn’t even be bothered to collect them.","After returning to his room, he began to teach his daughter and son-in-law various Imperial Techniques.","He had clearly done something huge, but the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire actually didn’t react at all. In the following three days, everything was calm and undisturbed. Not a single person came.","The Shadow Moon Majestic Empire obviously wouldn’t cower just like that. Instead, Ling Han was too strong, making them feel like they needed to make full preparations before making a move and killing him with a single strike.","Right now, a storm was brewing.","The academy gates of the Silver Moon Academy had already closed, and all the students had evacuated, to prevent them from becoming cannon fodder in future great battles.","Yet Ling Han was happy with the peace and quiet, and did not care at all.","Even if the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire’s elites ganged up on him, he was still unafraid. This was because his abilities were strong enough, and that was why he was so confident.","Of course, the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire was actually a puppet, while the true ruler was actually the Buddhist Race. Thus, what Ling Han needed to be concerned about was only the Buddhist Race. If they really did indeed mobilized a great elite of Venerate Tier-level, then even he could only flee.","However, this was only the beginning. The Shadow Moon Majestic Empire couldn’t possibly send a Buddhist Race’s big shot so quickly. It should be known that when they ambushed the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire’s old Venerate Tier, the Buddhist Race didn’t send out a Venerate Tier elite.","—If the Buddhist Race’s great elites attacked at the drop of a hat, then with so many territories under their control, wouldn’t they be busy to death?","Soon, it was the eighth day.","Ling Han was just predicting his own path of cultivation with eyes closed, when his eyes suddenly snapped open.","‘Finally here.’","He pushed open the doors and walked out.","There was a man in embroidered robes standing in front of him, wearing a flat crown on his head. He was tall and slender, and had an air of dominance.","Behind him, there were nine people dressed in monk robes. There were both men and women, and they had all shaved their heads. There were nine brands on each of their heads.","Oh, the Buddhist Racehad also moved.","“I am the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire’s Ninth King!” The man in embroidered robes spoke up, his voice resounding loudly, “Who are you?”","Ling Han sighed, “Don’t you know how to talk nicely?1”","F***.","The Ninth King’s aura was instantly stifled. ‘What kind of person are you? I’m asking you in the most formal manner.’","“Who is the mastermind behind you?” He suppressed his anger, and switched to a different tone of voice.","Ling Han was too young, so there was definitely someone backing him up. This was what made him wary."]},{"number":4498,"title":"Chapter 4498: Venerate Tier Killing Formation","paragraphs":["Chapter 4498: Venerate Tier Killing Formation","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han nodded, “You see, talking like this doesn’t sound like much effort. So, you obviously know how to talk nicely, so why do you have to be so pretentious?”","The Ninth King began to grind hisr teeth again. ‘You mock me when I’m talking formally, but when I’m talking normally, you still mock me.’","What exactly do you want?","Yi, the other was deliberately diverting the topic!","The Ninth King immediately tensed; he almost fell for Ling Han’s trick.","Hiss, this brat looked young, but his ways were really too shrewd. He had quietly changed the topic.","...","“Looks like you are determined to force me to make a move!” the Ninth King said calmly.","Ling Han spread out his hands, “If I told you that I have actually come in peace, would you believe me?”","“Haha!” The Ninth King simply laughed coldly.","Would he believe it? How could he possibly believe it!","Ling Han laughed loudly, “If you don’t believe me, then forget it. Since you have even invited the members of the Buddhist Race, it is clear that there is no way that things would be settled peacefully. Then what is the point of continuing the pointless nonsense? Hurry up and make your move.”","“You really won’t give up until you’re faced with the grim reality!” The Ninth King sneered. With a wave of his hand, those monks behind him stepped into the sky one after another, each standing in nine corners. Then, they began to recite.","Instantly, a pillar of light rose from the Ninth King’s body, soaring into the skies. His aura had actually increased greatly.","The secret technique of the Buddhist Race, praying which could greatly increase the strength of the recipient.","The Ninth King was originally a six-star Sect Master, and after receiving such a boost, his aura actually increased to eight stars inconceivably!","A whopping two stars; this was far too astonishing.","The Ninth King moved, and shot out a palm strike. True enough, Eight Star power was boiling, but the Regulations that he shot out were only six streaks.","Ling Han nodded. This was more like it. If the secret technique of the Buddhist Racee could allow the Ninth King to blast out seven flashes of Regulations, that would really be too amazing.","At the level of Sect Master, power was far inferior to Regulations.","Thus, while the Ninth King looked to have reached eight stars in battle prowess, in truth, he only had power. In terms of true battle prowess, it could only increase his battle prowess by half a star, at most, and not even reach seven stars.","Ling Han shook his head. At first, he had thought that the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire’ had prepared for so long, and would come up with some kind of great trick, but from the look of things now, it really disappointed him.","“You’ve put on an act for so many days, and you’re only going to show me this?” Ling Han shook his head, and his aura fluctuated slightly. Pa, pa, pa! In the sky, the nine monks instantly fell down like kites with their strings cut.","The Ninth King paled in shock. What was going on?","He hurriedly attacked Ling Han, giving the nine monks time to recover, so they could pull themselves together and once again boost his power.","Ling Han casually parried. The Ninth King was only a six-star Sect Master, so even if he reduced his abilities by a hundred times, he probably wouldn’t be weaker than him.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The battle between the two of them seemed to be very intense, but it was only the Ninth King that thought so himself. He wasn’t even qualified to make Ling Han take it seriously.","However, after battling for a short while, the Ninth King feinted and left the battle area, retreating far away.","“Activate the formation!” he called out loudly, his expression livid.","This was the last move, and it was one that he very much did not want to use. This meant that he was inferior to Ling Han.","However, there was nothing he could do. He couldn’t keep fighting like this, after all.","Boom! Multiple streaks of light soared into the sky, intertwining to form an Inescapable Net.","“Haha, you’re surrounded now, so let’s see how you’re going to escape!” the Ninth King said coldly.","This was the Trapped Heaven Formation, which could kill a Sect Master great elite.","There was too little time, and furthermore, there was only the little bit of resources that the Moonlight Planet had, which was not enough to set up a killing formation to snipe a Venerate Tier elite.","Ling Han crossed his arms behind his back, and merely smiled. To fiddle with formations in front of a formation grandmaster like him, wasn’t that just making him laugh his head off?","He only had to step lightly with his foot, and he would be able to change the Earth Qi, rendering this great formation ineffective. In fact, he could even seize control of the great formation, and turn it around to attack the Ninth King.","Ai, just think, the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire’s elite was only a Sect Master, so what could they offer that would make his eyes light up?","‘Boring!’","He threw a punch. Boom! The ground trembled violently, and endless sand and rocks flew into the sky. Instantly, the brilliance that soared into the sky dimmed.","The Ninth King couldn’t help but stare with bulging eyes. F***, he had shattered the great formation with a single punch!","Heavens, what kind of monster was this?","He could clearly sense that Ling Han’s aura was also Sect Master-level, but as a fellow Sect Master, to say nothing of destroying the great formation with a single strike, even being able to last over a hundred moves under the great formation was already quite impressive.","In comparison, the gap was really too wide.","This guy could not be judged on the level of an ordinary Sect Master. He could only be treated like a Pseudo Venerate Tier.","En, just like that old Venerate Tier from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire.","“Retreat!” he shouted lightly, and led the others away.","Ling Han didn’t give chase. He wanted to do Chen Fengyan a favor, and defeat a few more elites from the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire. In this way, when Chen Fengyan led the Celestial Sea Planet to become independent, they wouldn’t be able to do much either.","No matter what, Chen Fengyan had helped him quite a bit in the past. Moreover, he was his junior now, so he naturally had to take care of him.","He continued to guide Ling Xi and Fu Tianxing in their cultivation. It could be imagined that he would definitely have to run all over the universe next, and would not have the time to guide his children in their cultivation. Thus, he had to make the most of every minute and second he had now.","He stuffed as much as he could, not caring about their cultivation level at all.","A dozen over days later, the elites of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire quietly arrived at the Moonlight Planet.","There were a total of nine Sect Master elites, and added with the Buddhist Race having also mobilized five elites, there were a total of fourteen Sect Masters, and the true killing move was the formation that they had brought, which could form a great killing formation to snipe a Venerate Tier!","Ling Han grasped everything through the ley lines. He was still unafraid.","Indeed, he was no match for the battle prowess of a Venerate Tier elite. However, in terms of formation masters, how could Shadow Moon Majestic Empire’s people compare to him, a formation grandmaster?","Just how powerful was his divine sense now? With a single thought, he could affect the ley lines. And they wanted set up a formation in front of him?","Hehe, unless it was a Saint-level formation, they would only be a joke in front of him.","Thus, Ling Han was completely unconcerned.","The Sect Master elites began to set up formations. Every day, they would wander around the surroundings of the Silver Moon Academy.","Though Ling Xi and Fu Tianxing were a little worried, they believed Ling Han even more. Since Ling Han didn’t take this seriously at all, he must be confident in himself. Could it be that he would still screw over his daughter and son-in-law?","Seven days later, the formation was completed!","At this time, the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire’s elites finally strutted out.","“Young man, you are indeed courageous beyond measure.” The Ninth King appeared once more. His status was very high, and even if fourteen more Sect Masters came, they still treated him as their leader, “However, it is precisely this kind of conceit that will endanger your life!”","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “We haven’t even fought yet, and you’re already so sure?”","“Humph, though this formation is not a complete Venerate Tier-level killing formation, killing a Pseudo Venerate is no issue.” The Ninth King declared proudly, “Don’t tell me, your strength has already surpassed Sect Master-level!”","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “Not to that extent. I am still a little far from even Pseudo Venerate Tier.”","“Thus, if you bow your head now, I can still spare your life. Otherwise... no matter how prodigious you are, so what? The name of a dead person will not be passed down through the ages!” the Ninth King stated calmly.","Boom!","Right at this moment, the great formation suddenly trembled."]},{"number":4499,"title":"Chapter 4499: The old Venerate Tier elite appears","paragraphs":["Chapter 4499: The old Venerate Tier elite appears","Editor: Henyee Translations","The ground trembled, and the formation swayed, as if it had suffered a heavy blow.","This not only stunned the Ninth King and the others, even Ling Han was slightly surprised.","What was going on? He clearly hadn’t made a move.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The terrifying blasts came one after another, and they were getting closer and closer. It was as if someone had forcefully charged in.","This wasn’t an illusion. It was only an instant. Peng! The last layer of light that enshrouded them shattered, and an old man with white brows and a white beard charged over.","...","“Gagaga, Shadow Moon Majestic Empire’s brats, never thought I’d return!” The old man laughed loudly, showing a kind of arrogance.","This!","Seeing this old man, the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire’s elites all wore expressions of shock.","Heavens, this was the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire’s old Venerate Tier elite!","Ling Han was also very surprised. He had not thought that this old Venerate would actually dare make a comeback.","He could clearly sense that this Venerate Tier elite hadn’t fully recovered yet. It was just that his injuries had been suppressed.","Who was helping him?","Ling Han didn’t think that this Venerate Tier elite could do it himself. He hadn’t been able to do it in the past tens of thousands of years, so what allowed him to do it after fleeing for just a short while?","Thus, he must have obtained the help of someone, or some force.","“You actually aren’t dead yet!” the Ninth King said through gritted teeth. There was a look of intense fear on his face.","At the time, they had taken advantage of the fact that the old Venerate Tier was heavily injured, and laid out an inescapable net, which was why they had been fortunate enough to attack this old Venerate Tier to the point that his injuries would be compounded.","At first, he had thought that even if this old Venerate Tier elite had not died from serious injuries, he should still be licking his wounds in some corner of the universe. However, he had not thought that this old Venerate Tier elite would suddenly charge right up to his doorstep.","It was as if he had completely recovered his abilities.","This was a Venerate Tier elite, completely suppressinga Sect Master, so how were they supposed to resist?","“How is this possible?!”","The old Venerate Tier elite laughed loudly, “Nothing is impossible! Now that I’m back, you guys can also go die!”","He was very proud. At first, he had thought that there would be no hope of revenge in this lifetime, but now, he had returned here, looking down on all life with overwhelming strength.","“Let’s go! Let’s go! Let’s go!” the Ninth King called out loudly. To say nothing of the fact that they only had fifteen Sect Masters, even if their numbers were ten times more, they would still be no match for a Venerate Tier.","Venerate Tier could crush Sect Master; this was the truth of martial arts.","“Want to run?” The old Venerate Tier smirked coldly. Since he had appeared, how could he allow the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire’s people to flee?","He moved, and grabbed out at the Ninth King and the others.","Boom, his palm blotted out the sky and covered the earth, as far as the eye could see.","He was a Venerate Tier elite!","However, as soon as he made his move, Ling Han discovered that not only had this old Venerate Tier not recovered from his injuries, his strength was also far from recovering. Now, this old Venerate Tier only had Pseudo Venerate Tier-level battle prowess.","However, to suppress a Sect Master, the battle prowess of a Pseudo Venerate Tier was more than enough. In fact, no matter how heaven-defying Ling Han was, his current was no match for his current battle prowess was still not enough to compare to this.","The old Venerate Tier elite attacked aggressively. Pa, pa, pa! He moved with hatred, and killed a Sect Master with a single strike. In just a few minutes, including the Ninth King, the 15 Sect Masters were all killed.","“Hahaha!” The old Venerate was extremely pleased with himself. He had finally gotten his revenge!","Now, he only had to kill the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire’s old emperor, and he would have avenged himself completely.","“En?” He looked towards Ling Han, an abnormally young Sect Master.","He was really too young. His flame of life was blazing fiercely; at most, he was only a few hundred years old.","What cultivation level had he reached when he was a few hundred years old?","Cauldron Forging Tier? Or Core Formation Tier?","He couldn’t help but be filled with jealousy. Though he was fortunate enough not to die, his vitality was too poor. Even if his injuries were healed, there was no hope for him to reach Saint Tier in this lifetime.","But this brat in front of him was filled with unlimited possibilities.","“Brat, who are you?” he asked, his tone filled with command.","It could not be helped. He was a Venerate Tier elite.","Ling Han smiled calmly, “None of your business.”","Yi, so aggressive!","The old Venerate Tier was astonished. This brat actually dared to speak to him like this?","This was natural. He was the one who had suppressed Brother Monkey, so how could Ling Han possibly show him goodwill?","“You’re truly seeking death!” The old Venerate Tier elite humphed, and immediately moved, pressing down on Ling Han.","Xiu, Ling Han used the Star Steps, bringing Ling Xi and Fu Tianxing with him. In an instant, they had arrived at the other side of the Moonlight Planet. Then, he had them directly use the Transfer Formation to return to Celestial Sea Planet.","After doing all this, he used the Star Steps and returned to the Silver Moon Academy.","The old Venerate Tier frowned upon seeing this. Ling Han appeared and disappeared in quick succession, and even he couldn’t detect his movements.","What kind of movement technique was this? It was too strange.","“So you have grasped a strange movement technique. No wonder you dare to be disrespectful in front of me.” He humphed, “But if I really wanted to kill you, where would you be able to escape to?”","He moved again.","This time, the large hand covered a wider area.","Ling Han brandished his fists in response, “Old b@stard, do you really think I’m afraid of you?”","Just now, he only did not want his daughter and son-in-law to be implicated; it was not that he was afraid of battle.","Seeing that Ling Han actually dared to face him head-on, the old Venerate Tier couldn’t help but feel angry. This was a great disrespect to him!","“Die!” he humphed lightly. A mere Sect Master, have you gone blind? You actually dare to confront him head-on.","Boom!","The fist landed on the large hand, but was unable to break through the large hand. Instead, it was suppressed.","The giant palm slammed into the ground, causing the ground to tremble like a carpet. Peng, peng, peng! Underground flames gushed out, leaking energy.","This was only an ordinary planet, so how could it withstand the havoc caused by the battle prowess of a Pseudo Venerate Tier elite?","The old Venerate Tier couldn’t help but reveal a hint of surprise, because he could sense that Ling Han wasn’t dead.","He retracted his palm. True enough, though he had created a massive pit in the ground, Ling Han was still standing proudly in the pit.","Hiss, this was too shocking.","Though his abilities had fallen below the level of Venerate Tier, it was still a piece of cake for him to kill any Sect Master, so how had Ling Han managed to withstand it?","“Old b@stard, you’re nothing more than this!” Ling Han said calmly. With a battle cry, he launched a counterattack.","Weng, the barrage of murderous aura surged out, ruthlessly blasting outwards.","That old Venerate Tier couldn’t help but let out a muffled groan. He felt as if an awl had been stabbed into his head, and it was extremely painful.","What a terrifying young man. The divine sense attack was actually effective on him!","He hurriedly spread out his divine sense to stabilize his mind. Then, he raised an attack to counter Ling Han’s attack.","However, in this manner, his battle prowess was naturally greatly affected.","Boom!","The two of them exchanged a blow, and Ling Han was once again sent flying, but his disadvantage was no longer very obvious.","“You’re truly astonishing!” the old Venerate Tier elite said balefully. He launched a flurry of attacks at Ling Han. His palms were like axes, and it was as if he wanted to split heaven and earth apart with each strike.","In truth, his attack had indeed had a very great effect on the Moonlight Planet. A Pseudo Venerate was really too powerful.","However, Ling Han was still unafraid. That old Venerate could only use 20 Six Star Regulations, which was stronger than him, but it was still not enough to make him not dare to even battle.","Moreover, he had countless trump cards, so he was naturally unafraid.","This was just right. He could use the other party to temper his own path of cultivation.","Ling Han used the Han Fists. Fist intent blazed, each punch incredibly domineering."]},{"number":4500,"title":"Chapter 4500: Participation of the Imperial Clan","paragraphs":["Chapter 4500: Participation of the Imperial Clan","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han was very strong, but the Venerate Tier was even stronger.","He was a Venerate Tier elite, so even if he only had Pseudo Venerate Tier-level strength, that wasn’t just empty boasting.","However, the old Venerate Tier elite was merely dreaming if he wanted to kill Ling Han. Merely in terms of abilities, there wasn’t much of a gap between the two of them, what more when Ling Han had countless trump cards. In fact, if he took out the Energy Jade, he was completely capable of screwing him over.","The old Venerate Tier became more and more astonished as he fought. How could there be such a Minor Advanced Tier?","This was too strong, wasn’t it?","“Tsk, Old Sun is here!” With a harsh exclamation, a staff shadow descended from the skies, smashing towards the old Venerate Tier’s head.","...","Brother Monkey was here.","The old Venerate Tier’s expression changed drastically. How was this possible? The Moonlight Planet actually had a Fourth Extreme elite?","Shouldn’t he be the only one?","How could he still bother about Ling Han? He hurriedly retreated, not daring to face his attack head-on.","To say nothing of the fact that his current strength had dropped from the level of Venerate Tier, even if he was still maintained at his prime condition, there was still no way that he would be a match for Brother Monkey.","Who was Brother Monkey?","He had aptitude comparable to the Golden Generation, as well as a Saintly Material weapon. Even nine-star Venerate Tiers wouldn’t dare to face this strike head-on, let alone him, whose strength had already retreated to Pseudo Venerate Tier-level.","Brother Monkey attacked repeatedly, and the old Venerate Tier elite retreated continuously. There was no doubt about this at all. He was completely suppressed.","“It’s you!” The old Venerate Tier elite revealed a shocked expression. He recognized Brother Monkey.","This wasn’t difficult at all. Brother Monkey’s appearance hadn’t changed much since 2000 to 3000 years ago. Moreover, his sharp mouth, monkey-like cheeks, and fiery temper left a deep impression on everyone.","However, what surprised the old Venerate was the fact that Brother Monkey had actually become a Venerate after only so many years!","‘F*ck! Where’s the barrier to the cultivation level?’","‘Do you really think that the barrier to the cultivation level is just a joke and non-existent? Do you think you can break through just because you want to?’","Just think, how old had he been when he had reached the level of Nine Star Sect Master?","Twenty thousand years old.","He was only 20,000 years old, yet he had spent a whopping 17,000 years to finally break through to the Venerate Tier. Moreover, because he was too old, and his vitality was waning, he had clearly attained complete comprehension, yet still almost failed.","It was also because of this that he had been unable to unleash his full battle prowess. It was because of this that he had suffered hidden wounds in the subsequent battle. This had caused a huge disaster.","But what about Brother Monkey?","He couldn’t compare; he didn’t dare to.","Looking at Ling Han beside him, that was even more infuriating. He was only a few hundred years old, at most.","Shua, the staff swept out, terrifying without bounds.","The old Venerate Tier hurriedly came back to his senses, dodging with all his might, not daring to take a blow head-on at all.","In truth, even if Brother Monkey did not use a Saintly Material weapon, he would not dare to take it head-on either, because the gap in battle prowess was too wide. If he took it head-on, he would definitely die.","However, at present, he was only struggling at death’s door, and would not be able to last a few moves.","The Venerate Tier elite truly wanted to cry.","Was it easy for him?","In the past, he had fled like a stray dog. Now that he had finally made a comeback, he should have been able to enjoy a glorious life, but who would have expected that he would suffer another terrible defeat?","He said harshly, “Monkey, do you know whose orders I have come under?”","Ling Han immediately smiled internally. As expected, this old geezer had gotten help from someone.","“Who cares who he is? I, Old Sun, will knock them all down with a single strike!” Brother Monkey ignored him completely. With a wave of his staff, it was as if he wanted to destroy the heavens and earth.","“That’s the Ziwei Imperial Clan!” the old Venerate said. “I received the help of the Ziwei Imperial Clan and healed my injuries. Now, under the command of the Ziwei Imperial Clan, I’ve come to reclaim the Moonlight Planet and expand my territory!”","Heh, using the Imperial Clan to intimidate them?","Didn’t he know that they had even killed a considerable number of Imperial Sons?","“Oh, what benefits would the Ziwei Imperial Clan gain from doing this?” Ling Han asked. What didn’t the Ziwei Imperial Clan have? To the point that they needed to specially help such an outdated Venerate?","“Humph, what do you know!” The old Venerate Tier revealed a bit of pride, but after being struck a few times by Brother Monkey, he immediately shrunk back, “The Ziwei Imperial Clan has a Venerate Tier that is about to become a Saint, so you have to collect the power of belief to light up the holy flame!”","With these words, Ling Han finally understood.","The Venerate Tier was at the fourth pinnacle level, and four pinnacle pillars were propped up in his mind, connecting heaven and earth. And if he wanted to become a Saint, he would have to light up the holy flame on the pillars of the fourth pinnacle. This way, he would be able to illuminate the Regulations, and obtain them from all sources.","There were two ways to ignite the holy flame. The first was to use one’s own flame of martial arts to ignite it, and the second was to gather power of belief, which could nurture it into being.","It was obvious that igniting the holy flame with one’s own power was more powerful. This was completely without external help.","However, there would always be someone who was just that little bit away from being able to ignite the holy flame with their own power, so they could only depend on the power of belief.","In truth, those that could completely ignite the holy flame on their own, and through history, aside from the Great Emperors, there were only a few powerful Saints, such as the Nine Suns Saint.","Though the Imperial Clan had vast territories, and ruled over countless people, the Imperial Clan did not just have a single Saint. Every time they ascended to the next level, they would need a great amount of power of belief. Furthermore, something like faith could not be changed so easily. Today, I would believe this, and tomorrow, I would believe that.","This was called faith?","The power of belief was definitely pure and unadulterated.","Furthermore, after having boosted and ignited the holy flame once, this power of belief would be bound to this Saint, and could no longer be used by other Venerate Tiers or Saints.","Thus, in the territory of the Imperial Clan, the power of belief was more or less allocated, so they could only set their sights outside the territory.","—The Buddhist Race was promoting themselves everywhere, and in truth, it was also to collect the power of belief.","Of course, this was only a measly Moonlight Planet, and was still very far from the Ziwei Imperial Clan. They naturally wouldn’t exert too much effort, and this was just right. They could rescue the old Venerate and let him recover the lost territory, providing power of belief for the Imperial Clan.","In any case, there was no need for the Imperial Clan to exert any effort. Furthermore, they had only helped the old Venerate suppress his injuries, and had not expended much.","“Y-you’re not afraid of the Imperial Clan being infuriated?” The old Venerate Tier elite was both anxious and furious. He had clearly mentioned the Imperial Clan, so why hadn’t Brother Monkey stopped? And Ling Han hadn’t tried to persuade him in the slightest either?","“Why should I be afraid?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","This kind of rhetorical question made the old Venerate feel like he didn’t know how to respond.","Are you both idiots?","That was the Imperial Clan, a clan that the whole world revered, so who would not be afraid?","Aren’t you guys afraid of death?","However, it was as if Brother Monkey’s violent attacks were emphasizing his fearlessness. One staff strike after another, aiming to beat him to death.","Pu! Pu! Pu!","The old Venerate Tier elite kept throwing up blood. To save his life, he was willing to combust his life force to forcefully increase his battle prowess. However, even so, he was still no match for Brother Monkey, and was beaten to a tragic state.","“The Ziwei Imperial Clan is about to arrive, and all of you will die!” The old Venerate Tier released a roar of defiance.","He had come back to take revenge. Now, he had already taken more than half of his revenge, but he was going to lose his life. This was something that he was unwilling to accept.","He didn’t want to die!","“Tsk!” Brother Monkey roared loudly, and swept out with his staff. He had activated some of the might of the Saintly Material. Endless light flashed past, and the Regulations that filled the skies seemed to be responding.","Peng!","The old Venerate Tier elite couldn’t block this strike at all, and he was smashed into pulp."]}]);
